		describe_vn = 'Hạt giống kỳ diệu siêu cấp tụ tập phấn hoa độc tấn công mục tiêu đơn lẻ của đối phương, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#160% Sát Thương Phép Thuật #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Phép Thuật #C0x5B545B#, khiến mục tiêu rơi vào trạng thái [độc] trong 3 lượt (độc: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, trong thời gian bị độc mỗi lượt có 20% xác suất không thể hành động, và mất thêm 5% máu hiện tại của mục tiêu, tối đa không vượt quá 300% Sát Thương Phép Thuật của hạt giống kỳ diệu siêu cấp, giới hạn 5 lớp)',
		describe_en = 'Super magical seed gathers poisonous pollen to attack a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#160% Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, causing the target to enter a [poisoned] state for 3 turns (poisoned: a negative effect, during which each turn there is a 20% chance the target cannot act and loses an additional 5% of their current HP, capped at 300% Magical Damage of the super magical seed, with a limit of 5 stacks).',
		describe_th = 'เมล็ดวิเศษขั้นสุดยอดรวบรวมละอองพิษโจมตีเป้าหมายเดียวของศัตรู สร้างความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x3D8A99#160% #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x5B545B# ทำให้เป้าหมายติดสถานะ [พิษ] เป็นเวลา 3 ตา (พิษ: ผลกระทบลบ ซึ่งในแต่ละตาจะมีโอกาส 20% ที่เป้าหมายจะไม่สามารถทำการกระทำได้ และสูญเสียพลังชีวิตปัจจุบันเพิ่มอีก 5% สูงสุดไม่เกิน 300% ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ของเมล็ดวิเศษขั้นสุดยอด จำกัดสูงสุด 5 ชั้น)',
		describe_in = 'Benih ajaib super mengumpulkan serbuk sari racun menyerang satu target musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#160% Kerusakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, membuat target terkena status [racun] selama 3 giliran (racun: efek negatif, setiap giliran ada peluang 20% target tidak bisa bertindak dan kehilangan tambahan 5% HP saat ini, maksimum tidak melebihi 300% Kerusakan Sihir benih ajaib super dengan batas maksimal 5 lapisan).',
		describe_ph = 'Ang super magical seed ay nagtitipon ng nakalalasong pollen upang atakihin ang isang solong target na kaaway, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#160% Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, na nagdudulot sa target ng [poisoned] na estado sa loob ng 3 na turn (poisoned: negatibong epekto, sa bawat turn may 20% na tsansa na hindi makakilos ang target at nawawala ng dagdag na 5% ng kasalukuyang HP, hanggang sa maximum na 300% Magical Damage ng super magical seed, limitadong hanggang 5 stack).',
		describe_ma = 'Benih ajaib super mengumpulkan debunga beracun menyerang sasaran tunggal musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#160% Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, menyebabkan sasaran memasuki keadaan [beracun] selama 3 giliran (beracun: kesan negatif, setiap giliran terdapat peluang 20% sasaran tidak dapat bertindak dan kehilangan tambahan 5% HP semasa, maksimum tidak melebihi 300% Kerosakan Sihir benih ajaib super dengan had 5 tumpukan).',
		describe = 'Super magical seed gathers poisonous pollen to attack a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#160% Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, causing the target to enter a [poisoned] state for 3 turns (poisoned: a negative effect, during which each turn there is a 20% chance the target cannot act and loses an additional 5% of their current HP, capped at 300% Magical Damage of the super magical seed, with a limit of 5 stacks).',
