		describe_en = 'The Water Spewing Turtle shoots a giant water jet to attack the enemy\'s top target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#180% magic attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$#C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, then grants a shield to all allies that absorbs damage equal to 160% of the Water Turtle\'s magic defense, lasting for 2 turns.',
