		describe_en = 'Daddy Zombie fires a bait shot and uses poison to critically strike an enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$#C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, with a 100% chance to inflict [Poison] for 3 turns and reduce the target\'s Physical Damage. Healing effects are increased by 40% for 2 turns.',
