		describe = 'Kid Rada uses his front teeth to deliver a critical hit to a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#400% Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*50)$#C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, reducing critical damage by 30%. This attack is guaranteed to be a critical hit.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Ratta sẽ cắn nếu bị kích thích, dùng răng tấn công mục tiêu đơn lẻ của đối phương với đòn chí mạng, làm giảm một phần sát thương chí mạng, và sát thương này chắc chắn sẽ chí mạng.',
		simDesc_en = 'Ratta will bite if provoked, using its teeth to attack a single enemy target with a critical strike, reducing some critical damage, and this damage will definitely critical hit.',
		simDesc_th = 'รัตตาจะกัดถ้าโดนกระตุ้น ใช้ฟันโจมตีเป้าหมายเดี่ยวของฝ่ายตรงข้ามด้วยหมัดวิกฤติ ลดความเสียหายวิกฤติบางส่วน และความเสียหายนี้จะเป็นการโจมตีวิกฤติอย่างแน่นอน',
		simDesc_in = 'Ratta akan menggigit jika terprovokasi, menggunakan giginya untuk menyerang satu target musuh dengan serangan kritis, mengurangi sebagian kerusakan kritis, dan kerusakan ini pasti akan menjadi serangan kritis.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Si Ratta ay kikilitiin kung ma-stimulate, gagamitin ang kanyang mga ngipin para atakihin ang iisang target ng kalaban gamit ang critical strike, babawasan ang ilang critical damage, at ang damage na ito ay siguradong magiging critical.',
		simDesc_ma = 'Ratta akan menggigit jika diganggu, menggunakan giginya untuk menyerang satu sasaran musuh dengan serangan kritikal, mengurangkan sebahagian kerosakan kritikal, dan kerosakan ini pasti akan menjadi serangan kritikal.',
		simDesc = 'Ratta will bite if provoked, using its teeth to attack a single enemy target with a critical strike, reducing some critical damage, and this damage will definitely critical hit.',
