		describe_en = 'Nidorino charges forward fiercely, attacking a row of enemy targets, dealing #C0xE69900#250% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increasing own Physical Damage and Physical Defense by 10% for 2 turns. If the target is poisoned, this attack deals an additional 30% damage.',
