		skillName_in = 'Kekuatan tanah',
		skillName_ph = 'Kapangyarihan ng lupain',
		skillName_ma = 'Kuasa tanah',
		skillName = 'Power of the land',
		describe_vn = 'Nidoking nhanh chóng tấn công mục tiêu hàng ngang của kẻ địch, sau đó giải phóng sức mạnh mặt đất dưới chân, gây ra #C0xE69900#260% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, tăng 10% Công Vật Lý và phòng vật lý của bản thân trong 2 lượt. Nếu mục tiêu đang bị trúng độc, sát thương lần này tăng thêm 30%.',
		describe_en = 'Nidoking quickly attacks the enemy\'s horizontal line target, then releases earth power beneath its feet, dealing #C0xE69900#260% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increases own Physical Attack and Physical Defense by 10% for 2 turns. If the target is poisoned, this damage increases by an additional 30%.',
		describe_th = 'นิโดคิงโจมตีรวดเร็วไปยังเป้าหมายในแถวแนวนอนของศัตรู จากนั้นปลดปล่อยพลังแผ่นดินใต้เท้า สร้างความเสียหาย #C0xE69900#260% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# เพิ่มพลังโจมตีทางกายภาพและการป้องกันกายภาพของตนเองขึ้น 10% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น หากเป้าหมายถูกพิษ ความเสียหายครั้งนี้จะเพิ่มขึ้นอีก 30%',
		describe_in = 'Nidoking dengan cepat menyerang target barisan horizontal musuh, kemudian melepaskan kekuatan bumi di bawah kakinya, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#260% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, meningkatkan Serangan Fisik dan Pertahanan Fisik dirinya sendiri sebesar 10% selama 2 giliran. Jika target sedang terkena racun, kerusakan ini bertambah 30%.',
		describe_ph = 'Agad na inaatake ni Nidoking ang horizontal na target ng kalaban, pagkatapos ay nagpapalabas ng lakas ng lupa sa ilalim ng paa, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#260% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, tumataas ang sariling Physical Attack at Physical Defense ng 10% sa loob ng 2 turn. Kung ang target ay may lason, tataas pa ang pinsalang ito ng 30%.',
