		describe = 'Nidoking quickly attacks the enemy\'s horizontal line target, then releases earth power beneath its feet, dealing #C0xE69900#260% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increases own Physical Attack and Physical Defense by 10% for 2 turns. If the target is poisoned, this damage increases by an additional 30%.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Nido King lao nhanh vào mục tiêu hàng ngang của đối phương, rồi dưới chân giải phóng sức mạnh của đất, tăng cường sức tấn công và phòng thủ vật lý của bản thân, đồng thời tăng sát thương cho trạng thái trúng độc.',
		simDesc_en = 'Nido King swiftly charges into the opponent\'s horizontal line, then releases the power of the earth beneath its feet, enhancing its physical attack and defense while also increasing damage for the poisoned status.',
		simDesc_th = 'นิโดคิงพุ่งเข้าไปในแนวแถวของฝ่ายตรงข้ามอย่างรวดเร็ว จากนั้นปลดปล่อยพลังของดินใต้เท้า เพิ่มพลังการโจมตีและการป้องกันทางกายภาพของตัวเอง พร้อมทั้งเพิ่มความเสียหายจากสถานะพิษ',
		simDesc_in = 'Nido King dengan cepat menyerang ke baris horizontal lawan, kemudian melepaskan kekuatan tanah di bawah kakinya, meningkatkan serangan dan pertahanan fisik dirinya, serta menambah kerusakan pada efek racun.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Mabilis na sumugod si Nido King sa pahalang na hanay ng kalaban, saka pinapalaya ang kapangyarihan ng lupa sa ilalim ng mga paa nito, pinapalakas ang pisikal na atake at depensa nito, at pinapataas ang pinsala para sa kondisyon ng pagkakalason.',
