		zawakeEffectDesc = 'The Demon Bat opens its mouth as wide as possible and breathes wildly, then spits out a toxin-containing orb into the crowd. The orb explodes and splits into smaller orbs, which explode again, dealing Physical Damage #C0xE69900#210% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# to the main target and enemies within the cross area, adding 3 stacks of <Poison> to the main target and 2 stacks to other cross targets, lasting 3 turns (Poison: negative effect, target loses true damage equal to 40% of the Demon Bat\'s Physical Attack each turn, stacking up to 5 layers).',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'The Demon Bat opens its mouth as wide as possible and breathes wildly, then spits out a toxin-containing orb into the crowd. The orb explodes and splits into smaller orbs, which explode again, dealing Physical Damage #C0xE69900#210% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# to the main target and enemies within the cross area, adding 3 stacks of <Poison> to the main target and 2 stacks to other cross targets, lasting 3 turns (Poison: negative effect, target loses true damage equal to 40% of the Demon Bat\'s Physical Attack each turn, stacking up to 5 layers).',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'ค้างคาวปีศาจเปิดปากกว้างที่สุดแล้วหายใจอย่างบ้าคลั่ง จากนั้นพ่นลูกบอลที่มีพิษเข้าไปในฝูงชน ลูกบอลระเบิดและแตกออกเป็นลูกบอลขนาดเล็กกว่า ซึ่งระเบิดอีกครั้ง สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#210% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# แก่เป้าหมายหลักและศัตรูในบริเวณรูปกากบาท เพิ่ม 3 ชั้น <พิษ> ให้เป้าหมายหลักและ 2 ชั้นแก่เป้าหมายรูปกากบาทอื่นๆ ต่อเนื่อง 3 เทิร์น (พิษ: ผลเสีย เป้าหมายเสียความเสียหายจริงเท่ากับ 40% ของพลังโจมตีทางกายภาพของค้างคาวปีศาจในแต่ละเทิร์น สามารถสะสมได้สูงสุด 5 ชั้น)',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Kelelawar Iblis membuka mulut selebar mungkin dan bernafas dengan liar, kemudian meludahkan bola yang mengandung racun ke kerumunan. Bola itu meledak dan membelah menjadi bola-bola kecil yang kemudian meledak lagi, menyebabkan Kerusakan Fisik #C0xE69900#210% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B# pada target utama dan musuh dalam area silang, menambahkan 3 tumpukan <Racun> pada target utama dan 2 tumpukan pada target silang lainnya, berlangsung selama 3 giliran (Racun: efek negatif, target kehilangan damage nyata sebesar 40% Serangan Fisik Kelelawar Iblis setiap giliran, bertumpuk hingga 5 lapisan).',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Ang Demon Bat ay bumuka nang malapad ng kanyang bibig at huminga nang mabangis, pagkatapos ay umbug ng isang bola na may lason sa karamihan. Ang bola ay sumabog at nahati sa maliliit na bola na muling sumabog, na nagdudulot ng Physical Damage #C0xE69900#210% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# sa pangunahing target at mga kaaway sa loob ng cross area, nagdadagdag ng 3 stacks ng <Poison> sa pangunahing target at 2 stacks sa iba pang cross targets, tumatagal ng 3 turns (Poison: negatibong epekto, nawawala ang totoong pinsala ng target na katumbas ng 40% ng Physical Attack ng Demon Bat bawat turn, umaabot hanggang 5 layers).',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Kelelawar Iblis membuka mulut sebesar mungkin dan bernafas dengan liar, kemudian menyemburkan bola yang mengandungi racun ke dalam kumpulan orang ramai. Bola itu meletup dan terbahagi kepada bola-bola kecil yang lebih kecil, kemudian meletup lagi, menyebabkan Kerosakan Fizikal #C0xE69900#210% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# kepada sasaran utama dan musuh di dalam kawasan silang, menambah 3 lapisan <Racun> kepada sasaran utama dan 2 lapisan kepada sasaran silang lain, berlangsung selama 3 pusingan (Racun: kesan negatif, sasaran kehilangan kerosakan sebenar sebanyak 40% Serangan Fizikal Kelelawar Iblis setiap pusingan, bertindan sehingga 5 lapisan).',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Dơi Quỷ mở miệng to nhất có thể và hít thở điên cuồng, sau đó phun ra một quả cầu chứa độc tố vào đám đông, quả cầu phát nổ và phân tách thành nhiều quả cầu nhỏ hơn và phát nổ lần nữa, gây Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0xE69900#210% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B# lên mục tiêu chính và kẻ địch trong phạm vi chữ thập, thêm 3 tầng <Độc> lên mục tiêu chính và 2 tầng lên các mục tiêu chữ thập khác, kéo dài 3 lượt (Độc: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, mục tiêu mất sát thương thực bằng 40% Công Vật Lý của Dơi Quỷ mỗi lượt, tối đa cộng dồn 5 tầng)',
		zawakeSimpleType = 2,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'Add 2 stacks of <Poison> to cross-shaped targets\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Add 3 stacks to the main target, and 2 stacks to other cross-shaped targets <Poison>  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'Add 2 stacks of <Poison> to cross-shaped targets\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Add 3 stacks to the main target, and 2 stacks to other cross-shaped targets <Poison>  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'เพิ่ม <พิษ> 2 ชั้นให้กับเป้าหมายในรูปกากบาท\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ เพิ่ม 3 ชั้นให้กับเป้าหมายหลัก, 2 ชั้นให้เป้าหมายอื่นในรูปกากบาท <พิษ>  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Memberikan 2 lapisan <Racun> ke target berbentuk silang\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Memberikan 3 lapisan ke target utama, dan 2 lapisan ke target berbentuk silang lainnya <Racun>  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'Nagdadagdag ng 2 stack ng <Lason> sa mga target na nasa posisyon ng krus\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Nagdadagdag ng 3 stack sa pangunahing target, at 2 stack sa iba pang target na nasa krus <Lason>  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = 'Menambah 2 lapisan <Racun> kepada sasaran dalam bentuk salib\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Menambah 3 lapisan kepada sasaran utama, dan 2 lapisan kepada sasaran salib lain <Racun>  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = 'Thêm 2 lớp <Độc> vào mục tiêu hình chữ thập\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Thêm 3 lớp vào mục tiêu chính, thêm 2 lớp vào các mục tiêu hình chữ thập khác <Độc>',
