		skillName = 'Poisonous powder',
		describe_vn = 'Bướm đêm Moru vỗ cánh rải bột độc, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#140% Công Phép#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Phép Thuật #C0x5B545B#, có 50% xác suất khiến mục tiêu [Trúng độc] trong 3 lượt (Trúng độc: Hiệu ứng tiêu cực, mục tiêu mất 10% Công Phép của Bướm đêm Moru mỗi lượt trước khi hành động, tối đa cộng dồn 5 tầng)',
		describe_en = 'Moru the moth flaps its wings, scattering poisonous powder, dealing #C0x3D8A99#140% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, with a 50% chance to cause the target to be [Poisoned] for 3 turns (Poisoned: a negative effect that causes the target to lose 10% of Moru the moth\'s Magic Power each turn before acting, stacking up to 5 layers).',
		describe_th = 'มอรู จอมผีเสื้อกลางคืน โบกปีกเพื่อโปรยผงพิษ สร้างความเสียหายเวทย์ #C0x3D8A99#140% พลังเวทย์#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายเวทย์ #C0x5B545B# พร้อมโอกาส 50% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมาย [ถูกพิษ] เป็นเวลา 3 ตา (ถูกพิษ: ผลเสีย เป้าหมายเสียพลังเวทย์ของมอรู 10% ทุกตาก่อนทำการ กระทำ สะสมได้สูงสุด 5 ชั้น)',
		describe_in = 'Kupu-kupu malam Moru mengepakkan sayapnya menyebarkan bubuk racun, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#140% Kekuatan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 50% untuk membuat target [Teracuni] selama 3 giliran (Teracuni: efek negatif, target kehilangan 10% Kekuatan Sihir Moru setiap giliran sebelum bertindak, menumpuk hingga 5 lapis).',
		describe_ph = 'Si gamugamoang Moru ay kumakaway ng pakpak, nagpapalaganap ng nakalalasong alikabok, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#140% Lakas ng Mahika#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Pinsala ng Mahika #C0x5B545B#, may 50% tsansa na magdulot sa target ng [Pinusukan] sa loob ng 3 turn (Pinusukan: negatibong epekto, nawawala sa target ang 10% ng Lakas ng Mahika ni Moru bawat turn bago kumilos, maximum na maaaring tumambak ng 5 layers).',
		describe_ma = 'Kupu malam Moru mengepakkan sayapnya menyebarkan serbuk racun, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#140% Kuasa Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 50% menyebabkan sasaran [Teracuni] selama 3 pusingan (Teracuni: kesan negatif, sasaran kehilangan 10% Kuasa Sihir Moru setiap pusingan sebelum bertindak, maksimum bertimbun 5 lapisan).',
		describe = 'Moru the moth flaps its wings, scattering poisonous powder, dealing #C0x3D8A99#140% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, with a 50% chance to cause the target to be [Poisoned] for 3 turns (Poisoned: a negative effect that causes the target to lose 10% of Moru the moth\'s Magic Power each turn before acting, stacking up to 5 layers).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Mothim khẽ vẩy cánh phát tán bột độc.',
