		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng bổ sung: Khi bắt đầu trận đấu, giảm phòng thủ vật lý của bản thân xuống 0 trong 2 lượt, tăng tốc độ của bản thân lên 20% trong 1 lượt và nhận 350 điểm giận dữ.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Additional effect: At the start of the battle, reduce own physical defense to 0 for 2 turns, increase own speed by 20% for 1 turn, and gain 350 rage points.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Additional effect: At the start of the battle, reduce own physical defense to 0 for 2 turns, increase own speed by 20% for 1 turn, and gain 350 rage points.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์เพิ่มเติม: เมื่อเริ่มการต่อสู้ ลดการป้องกันทางกายภาพของตัวเองลงเป็น 0 เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น เพิ่มความเร็วของตัวเองขึ้น 20% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น และได้รับ 350 แต้มความโกรธ',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Efek tambahan: Saat memulai pertarungan, kurangi pertahanan fisik sendiri menjadi 0 selama 2 giliran, tingkatkan kecepatan sendiri sebesar 20% selama 1 giliran, dan dapatkan 350 poin amarah.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Karagdagang epekto: Sa simula ng laban, bawasan ang sariling pisikal na depensa sa 0 sa loob ng 2 turn, dagdagan ang sariling bilis ng 20% sa loob ng 1 turn, at tumanggap ng 350 puntos ng galit.',
