		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Handang gamitin ang Wave Fist para atakihin ang isang kalaban, nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#150% Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ ng #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, habang pinapataas ang hit rate at Physical Damage ng 10% at 20% para sa aming yunit na may pinakamataas na Physical Damage attack. Kung ito ay battle system, ang epekto ay dodoblehin.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Bersedia menggunakan Wave Fist untuk menyerang sasaran musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#150% Kerosakan Fizikal #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ daripada #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, sambil meningkatkan kadar tepat dan Kerosakan Fizikal sebanyak 10% dan 20% untuk unit kami yang mempunyai serangan Kerosakan Fizikal tertinggi. Jika ia adalah sistem pertarungan, kesannya akan berganda.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Sẵn sàng sử dụng Wave Fist để tấn công một mục tiêu kẻ thù, gây ra #C0xE69900#150% Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ của #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, đồng thời tăng tỷ lệ trúng đích và Sát Thương Vật Lý lên 10% và 20% cho đơn vị của chúng tôi có đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý cao nhất. Nếu là hệ thống chiến đấu thì hiệu quả sẽ tăng gấp đôi.',
		zawakeSimpleType = 2,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'And increase accuracy rate by 10% for the ally with the highest Physical ATK, if it is a Fighter-type, increase by another 10%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→And increase accuracy rate by 10% and Physical ATK by 20% for the ally with the highest Physical ATK, if it is a Fighter-type, the effect is doubled',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'And increase accuracy rate by 10% for the ally with the highest Physical ATK, if it is a Fighter-type, increase by another 10%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→And increase accuracy rate by 10% and Physical ATK by 20% for the ally with the highest Physical ATK, if it is a Fighter-type, the effect is doubled',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'และเพิ่มอัตราความแม่นยำ 10% ให้กับหน่วยที่มีพลังโจมตีกายภาพสูงสุดในทีม หากเป็นสายไฟท์เตอร์จะเพิ่มอีก 10%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→และเพิ่มอัตราความแม่นยำ 10% และพลังโจมตีกายภาพ 20% ให้กับหน่วยที่มีพลังโจมตีกายภาพสูงสุดในทีม หากเป็นสายไฟท์เตอร์ เอฟเฟกต์จะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Dan meningkatkan akurasi sebesar 10% untuk unit dengan Physical ATK tertinggi di tim, jika bertipe Petarung maka ditambah 10%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Dan meningkatkan akurasi sebesar 10% dan Physical ATK sebesar 20% untuk unit dengan Physical ATK tertinggi di tim, jika bertipe Petarung maka efeknya dua kali lipat',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'At dagdagan ng 10% accuracy para sa yunit na may pinakamataas na Physical ATK sa team, kung ito ay Fighter-type, dagdag pa ng 10%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→At dagdagan ng 10% accuracy at 20% Physical ATK ng yunit na may pinakamataas na Physical ATK sa team, kung ito ay Fighter-type, doble ang epekto',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = 'Dan tingkatkan 10% kadar ketepatan kepada unit dengan ATK Fizikal tertinggi dalam pasukan, jika jenis Pejuang akan ditambah 10%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Dan tingkatkan 10% kadar ketepatan dan 20% ATK Fizikal kepada unit dengan ATK Fizikal tertinggi dalam pasukan, jika jenis Pejuang, kesannya berganda',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = 'Và tăng 10% tỷ lệ chính xác cho đơn vị có vật công cao nhất phe ta, nếu là hệ đấu sĩ thì tăng thêm 10%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Và tăng 10% tỷ lệ chính xác và 20% vật công cho đơn vị có vật công cao nhất phe ta, nếu là hệ đấu sĩ thì hiệu quả gấp đôi',
