		describe_en = 'Magnolia Devourer swallows the entire enemy row target into its belly, then spits out with poison, causing #C0xE69900#250% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, stealing 20% of the enemy row\'s Physical Attack to use (each steal cannot exceed 40% of own attributes), lasting 2 turns.',
