		describe = 'Geodude throws two quick punches at a single enemy target, then delivers a surprise punch when retracting, dealing #C0xE69900#130% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, and increases its own Physical Attack and Physical Defense by 15% for 2 turns.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Geodude sử dụng hai tay tấn công nhanh chóng vào mục tiêu đơn lẻ của đối phương, và khi thu tay lại, thực hiện một cú đấm mạnh bất ngờ.',
		simDesc_en = 'Geodude uses both hands to quickly attack a single target opponent, and when retracting its hands, delivers a powerful sudden punch.',
		simDesc_th = 'Geodude ใช้มือทั้งสองข้างโจมตีอย่างรวดเร็วไปยังเป้าหมายเดี่ยวของฝ่ายตรงข้าม และเมื่อเก็บมือกลับ จะโจมตีกระหน่ำอย่างแรงแบบกะทันหัน',
		simDesc_in = 'Geodude menggunakan kedua tangannya untuk menyerang dengan cepat ke satu target lawan, dan saat menarik tangannya kembali, melakukan pukulan kuat yang tiba-tiba.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Ginagamit ni Geodude ang parehong mga kamay upang mabilis na atakihin ang iisang target na kalaban, at kapag inurong ang mga kamay, magsasagawa ito ng malakas at biglaang suntok.',
