		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Geodude uses two fists to quickly attack a single enemy target, and when gathering its fists, it unleashes a surprise strike, dealing #C0xE69900#130% Physical Attack #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ Physical Damage #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B#, increasing its Physical Attack and physical defense by 15% for 2 turns, while also increasing its own rage recovery speed by 40% for 2 turns',
