		-- {79002}
		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Scallion Duck slams the scallion onto a single enemy target, dealing Physical Damage #C0xE69900#130% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$#C0xF13B54#. If the target\'s Physical Attack is lower than user, there is an 80% chance to <Stun> for 1 turn (Stun: control effect, unable to act). If the target\'s Physical Attack is not lower than user, there is also a 20% chance to <Stun> for 1 turn.',
