		skillName = 'Double attack',
		describe_vn = 'Hai đầu của Dudu có cùng một bộ não, liên tục tấn công mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch, gây ra #C0xE69900#230% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, đòn tấn công này sẽ rơi vào một trong ba trạng thái ngẫu nhiên: Tâm đầu ý hợp, đòn tấn công này tăng 80% sát thương; Không hòa hợp, đòn tấn công này giảm 50% sát thương; Bình thường, sát thương đòn tấn công không thay đổi',
		describe_en = 'Both heads of Dudu share one brain, continuously attacking the enemy\'s frontline target, dealing #C0xE69900#230% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. This attack will randomly fall into one of three states: Harmonized, this attack deals 80% increased damage; Disharmonized, this attack deals 50% reduced damage; Normal, damage remains unchanged.',
		describe_th = 'ทั้งสองหัวของดูดูใช้สมองร่วมกัน โจมตีเป้าหมายแนวหน้าของศัตรูอย่างต่อเนื่อง สร้าง #C0xE69900#230% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# การโจมตีนี้จะเข้าสู่สถานะใดสถานะหนึ่งแบบสุ่มสามสถานะ: ประสานใจ การโจมตีนี้เพิ่มความเสียหาย 80%; ไม่ประสานใจ การโจมตีนี้ลดความเสียหายลง 50%; ปกติ ความเสียหายไม่เปลี่ยนแปลง',
		describe_in = 'Kedua kepala Dudu berbagi satu otak, terus menyerang target garis depan musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#230% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#. Serangan ini akan secara acak berada dalam salah satu dari tiga status: Sinkron, serangan ini meningkatkan 80% kerusakan; Tidak Sinkron, serangan ini mengurangi 50% kerusakan; Normal, kerusakan serangan tetap sama.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang dalawang ulo ni Dudu ay may iisang utak, patuloy na inaatake ang unang hanay ng kalaban, nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#230% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. Ang atakeng ito ay haharap sa isa sa tatlong random na estado: Harmonized, tumataas ng 80% ang damage ng atake; Disharmonized, bumababa ng 50% ang damage ng atake; Normal, hindi nagbabago ang damage ng atake.',
		describe_ma = 'Kedua kepala Dudu berkongsi satu otak, sentiasa menyerang sasaran barisan hadapan musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#230% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#. Serangan ini akan secara rawak memasuki salah satu daripada tiga keadaan: Harmoni, serangan ini meningkatkan kerosakan sebanyak 80%; Tidak Harmoni, serangan ini mengurangkan kerosakan sebanyak 50%; Normal, kerosakan serangan tidak berubah.',
		describe = 'Both heads of Dudu share one brain, continuously attacking the enemy\'s frontline target, dealing #C0xE69900#230% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. This attack will randomly fall into one of three states: Harmonized, this attack deals 80% increased damage; Disharmonized, this attack deals 50% reduced damage; Normal, damage remains unchanged.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Dodu hai cái đầu có cùng một bộ não, liên tục tấn công mục tiêu hàng đầu của đối phương, lần tấn công này có khả năng tăng hoặc giảm sát thương.',
		simDesc_en = 'Dodu has two heads sharing one brain, continuously attacking the opponent\'s top target. This attack can potentially increase or decrease damage.',
		simDesc_th = 'โดดูมีสองหัวที่ใช้สมองเดียวกัน โจมตีเป้าหมายอันดับหนึ่งของศัตรูอย่างต่อเนื่อง การโจมตีครั้งนี้อาจเพิ่มหรือลดความเสียหายได้',
		simDesc_in = 'Dodu memiliki dua kepala dengan satu otak yang sama, terus menyerang target utama lawan. Serangan ini dapat meningkatkan atau mengurangi kerusakan.',
