		skillName_ph = 'Tatakbong tatlo',
		skillName_ma = 'Serangan tiga kali',
		skillName = 'Triple attack',
		describe_vn = 'Ba cái đầu của Dudu có cùng một bộ não, tấn công liên tiếp vào mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch, gây ra #C0xE69900#240% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, đòn tấn công này sẽ rơi vào một trong ba trạng thái ngẫu nhiên: Đồng tâm hiệp lực, tăng 80% sát thương cho đòn tấn công này; Không hòa hợp, giảm 50% sát thương cho đòn tấn công này; Bình thường, sát thương của đòn tấn công không thay đổi',
		describe_en = 'Dudu\'s three heads share one brain, consecutively attacking the enemy\'s front-line target, dealing #C0xE69900#240% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. This attack will randomly fall into one of three states: Concentric Synergy, increasing damage of this attack by 80%; Discord, reducing damage of this attack by 50%; Normal, damage of this attack remains unchanged.',
		describe_th = 'หัวทั้งสามของดูดูใช้สมองร่วมกัน โจมตีเป้าหมายแถวหน้าของศัตรูอย่างต่อเนื่อง สร้างความเสียหาย #C0xE69900#240% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# การโจมตีนี้จะอยู่ในหนึ่งในสามสถานะสุ่ม: ซินเนอร์จีร่วมจุดศูนย์กลาง เพิ่มความเสียหายของการโจมตีนี้ 80%; ไม่สอดคล้อง ลดความเสียหายของการโจมตีนี้ 50%; ปกติ ความเสียหายของการโจมตีไม่เปลี่ยนแปลง',
		describe_in = 'Tiga kepala Dudu berbagi satu otak, menyerang secara berturut-turut ke target barisan depan musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#240% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#. Serangan ini akan jatuh dalam salah satu dari tiga keadaan secara acak: Sinergi Konsentris, meningkatkan 80% kerusakan serangan ini; Diskordansi, mengurangi 50% kerusakan serangan ini; Normal, kerusakan serangan ini tidak berubah.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang tatlong ulo ni Dudu ay may iisang utak, sunud-sunod na umaatak sa unahang hanay ng kalaban, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#240% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#. Ang atakeng ito ay papasok sa isa sa tatlong mga estado nang random: Concentric Synergy, nagpapataas ng 80% pinsala ng atakeng ito; Discord, nagpapababa ng 50% pinsala ng atakeng ito; Normal, hindi nagbabago ang pinsala ng atakeng ito.',
		describe_ma = 'Tiga kepala Dudu berkongsi satu otak, menyerang berturut-turut ke sasaran barisan hadapan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#240% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Kecederaan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#. Serangan ini akan jatuh ke dalam salah satu daripada tiga keadaan secara rawak: Sinergi Sentrik, meningkatkan 80% kerosakan serangan ini; Tidak Harmoni, mengurangkan 50% kerosakan serangan ini; Normal, kerosakan serangan ini tidak berubah.',
		describe = 'Dudu\'s three heads share one brain, consecutively attacking the enemy\'s front-line target, dealing #C0xE69900#240% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*26)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. This attack will randomly fall into one of three states: Concentric Synergy, increasing damage of this attack by 80%; Discord, reducing damage of this attack by 50%; Normal, damage of this attack remains unchanged.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Dodrio ba cái đầu có cùng một bộ não, liên tục tấn công mục tiêu hàng đầu của đối phương, lần tấn công này có khả năng tăng hoặc giảm sát thương.',
		simDesc_en = 'Dodrio, a three-headed Pokémon sharing one brain, continuously attacks the opponent\'s primary target. This attack can either increase or decrease damage.',
		simDesc_th = 'Dodrio นกสามหัวที่มีสมองร่วมกัน โจมตีเป้าหมายหลักของฝ่ายตรงข้ามอย่างต่อเนื่อง การโจมตีนี้อาจเพิ่มหรือลดความเสียหายได้',
		simDesc_in = 'Dodrio, tiga kepala dengan satu otak bersama, terus menyerang target utama lawan. Serangan ini dapat meningkatkan atau mengurangi kerusakan.',
