		describe_vn = 'Chouni lấy ra một lượng lớn bùn từ cơ thể mình và ném vào tất cả mục tiêu của kẻ địch, gây ra #C0xE69900#120% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, kèm theo hiệu ứng [độc] trong 3 lượt (độc: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, mục tiêu mất 20% Công Vật Lý của Chouni mỗi lượt trước khi hành động, có thể cộng dồn tối đa 5 tầng)',
		describe_en = 'Chouni releases a large amount of mud from their body and throws it at all enemy targets, dealing #C0xE69900#120% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, accompanied by [Poison] effect for 3 turns (Poison: a debuff that causes targets to lose 20% of Chouni\'s Physical Attack each turn before acting, stacking up to 5 layers).',
		describe_th = 'โชวนิ ปล่อยโคลนจำนวนมากจากร่างกายและขว้างใส่เป้าหมายศัตรูทั้งหมด สร้างความเสียหาย #C0xE69900#120% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# พร้อมกับเอฟเฟกต์ [พิษ] เป็นเวลา 3 รอบ (พิษ: เป็นสถานะลบ ทำให้เป้าหมายสูญเสียพลังโจมตีทางกายภาพของโชวนิ 20% ทุกรอบก่อนเริ่มการกระทำ ซ้อนกันได้สูงสุด 5 ชั้น)',
		describe_in = 'Chouni mengeluarkan sejumlah besar lumpur dari tubuhnya dan melemparkannya ke semua target musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#120% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, disertai efek [Racun] selama 3 giliran (Racun: efek negatif yang menyebabkan target kehilangan 20% Serangan Fisik Chouni setiap giliran sebelum bertindak, dapat menumpuk hingga 5 lapisan).',
		describe_ph = 'Si Chouni ay naglabas ng malaking dami ng putik mula sa kanyang katawan at tinapon ito sa lahat ng kalaban na mga target, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#120% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, kasabay ng [Poison] effect sa loob ng 3 turn (Poison: isang negatibong epekto na nagiging dahilan para mawalan ang mga target ng 20% ng Physical Attack ni Chouni bawat turn bago kumilos, maaaring mag-stack hanggang 5 layers).',
		describe_ma = 'Chouni mengeluarkan sejumlah besar lumpur dari tubuhnya dan membalingnya ke semua sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#120% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, disertai kesan [Racun] selama 3 pusingan (Racun: kesan negatif yang menyebabkan sasaran kehilangan 20% Serangan Fizikal Chouni setiap pusingan sebelum bertindak, boleh bertindan sehingga 5 peringkat).',
		describe = 'Chouni releases a large amount of mud from their body and throws it at all enemy targets, dealing #C0xE69900#120% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, accompanied by [Poison] effect for 3 turns (Poison: a debuff that causes targets to lose 20% of Chouni\'s Physical Attack each turn before acting, stacking up to 5 layers).',
