		describe_en = 'Shellder uses its tongue to spray a pool of saliva, attacking a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#90% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, and increases its own physical defense by 50% for 2 turns.',
