		zawakeEffectDesc = 'When attacked, counterattack the attacker, dealing normal damage #C0x5c9970#$(120+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B#, reduce the target\'s Physical Attack by 10% and increase own Physical Defense by 60% for 2 turns (stackable up to 3 layers).',
