		describe = 'In battle, increase physical defense by #C0x5c9970#$(40+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# and reduce damage taken by 10%. Each time attacked, increase physical defense by an additional 10%. Cannot be removed, lasts up to 5 stacks and lasts for 3 turns.',
