		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Harry Zombie casts the Avada Kedavra spell to attack the front line of enemies, dealing #C0x3D8A99#230% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$#C0xF13B54#spell damage#C0x5B545B# and dispelling negative or control effects randomly on all friendly heroes. When the dispel is successful, their 10% control resistance increases for 1 turn.',
