		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Karagdagang epekto: Kung ang espesyal na kasanayan ay hindi nakakapatay ng target, maaari kang kumilos ng isang beses pa at dagdagan ang 30% na tsansa ng kritikal sa loob ng 1 turn',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Kesan tambahan: Jika kemahiran khas tidak membunuh sasaran, boleh bertindak sekali lagi dan meningkatkan kadar serangan kritikal sebanyak 30% selama 1 pusingan',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng bổ sung: Nếu kỹ năng đặc biệt không giết chết mục tiêu thì có thể hành động thêm một lần và tăng 30% tỷ lệ chí mạng trong 1 lượt',
		zawakeSimpleType = 2,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'If a critical skill does not kill the target, can act once more and increase Critical Rate by 30% for 1 turn\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→If a critical skill does not kill the target, can act once more and increase Critical Rate by 30% for 1 turn  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'If a critical skill does not kill the target, can act once more and increase Critical Rate by 30% for 1 turn\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→If a critical skill does not kill the target, can act once more and increase Critical Rate by 30% for 1 turn  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'ถ้าทักษะคริติคอลไม่ฆ่าเป้าหมาย สามารถทำการโจมตีเพิ่มอีกครั้งและเพิ่มอัตราคริติคอล 30% ใน 1 เทิร์น\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ถ้าทักษะคริติคอลไม่ฆ่าเป้าหมาย สามารถทำการโจมตีเพิ่มอีกครั้งและเพิ่มอัตราคริติคอล 30% ใน 1 เทิร์น',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Jika skill kritikal tidak membunuh target, dapat bertindak sekali lagi dan meningkatkan Rasio Kritikal sebesar 30% selama 1 giliran\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Jika skill kritikal tidak membunuh target, dapat bertindak sekali lagi dan meningkatkan Rasio Kritikal sebesar 30% selama 1 giliran  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'Kung ang kritikal na skill ay hindi nakakapatay sa target, maaaring kumilos muli at dagdagan ang Crit Rate ng 30% sa loob ng 1 turn\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Kung ang kritikal na skill ay hindi nakakapatay sa target, maaaring kumilos muli at dagdagan ang Crit Rate ng 30% sa loob ng 1 turn  ',
