		describe = 'Blood Slayer Akame unleashes a continuous slashing attack, targeting the enemy soldier positioned at the back with the lowest HP, dealing #C0xE69900#220% Physical Attack #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#, while increasing her own Critical Rate by 20% and Critical Damage by 20% for 2 turns.',
