		zawakeEffectDesc = 'The fire duck uses its fire tail to attack a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#90% Magical Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ Magical Damage#C0xF13B54#,#C0x5B545B# causing the target to <burn> for 3 turns (burn: a negative effect, the target takes true damage each turn equal to #C0xE69900#40% Magical Power#C0x5B545B#, stacking up to 5 layers)',
