		describe_ph = 'Bumagsak si Mikasa sa harap ng isang target na kalaban at inilabas ang Guardian Sword, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#220% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, nagtataas ng 40% Physical Damage Reduction ng sarili sa loob ng 2 turn, kasabay ng 80% tsansa na mapasailalim ang target sa [Galit] status sa loob ng 2 turn (Galit: kontrol na epekto na nagpapataas ng dagdag na 20% na pinsala at 30% na bilis; sa panahong ito ay kailangang i-normal attack ng target ang pinanggagalingan ng Galit).',
		describe_ma = 'Mikasa meluru ke hadapan sasaran musuh tunggal dan melancarkan Pedang Pelindung, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#220% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, meningkatkan pengurangan Kerosakan Fizikal diri sendiri sebanyak 40% selama 2 pusingan, serta mempunyai peluang 80% untuk menyebabkan sasaran mengalami status [Amarah] selama 2 pusingan (Amarah: kesan kawalan yang meningkatkan 20% kerosakan tambahan dan 30% kelajuan, dalam tempoh ini terpaksa menyerang secara biasa ke sumber Amarah).',
		describe = 'Mikasa dashes towards a single enemy target and unleashes Guardian Sword, dealing #C0xE69900#220% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increases her own Physical Damage Reduction by 40% for 2 turns, and has an 80% chance to inflict the [Rage] status on the target for 2 turns (Rage: control effect that increases additional damage by 20% and speed by 30%; during this time, the target is forced to perform normal attacks on the source of Rage).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Mikasa lao tới trước mặt mục tiêu đơn lẻ của đối phương và sử dụng "Bảo Vệ Kiếm".',
		simDesc_en = 'Mikasa lunged at the enemy\'s single target and used "Protective Sword".',
		simDesc_th = 'มิคาสะพุ่งไปยังเป้าหมายเดียวของศัตรูและใช้ "ดาบป้องกัน"',
