		describe = 'Kamado Tanjirou shoots a sword spirit to attack a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#220% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, ignoring 30% physical defense, causing the target to fall into the [Vulnerable] state for 2 turns ([Vulnerable]: a debuff that increases damage taken by 20%). After attacking, self also enters the [Vulnerable] state with 20% increase in damage taken for 1 turn.',
