		describe_vn = 'Khi máu bản thân lần đầu tiên dưới 20%, sẽ vào trạng thái [tự ngủ] 1 lượt, [tự ngủ] (hiệu ứng đặc biệt, không thể bị đánh thức, sát thương nhận được trở thành #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# lượng máu hồi phục của bản thân)',
		describe_en = 'When your own HP first falls below 20%, enter [auto-sleep] state for 1 turn, [auto-sleep] (special effect, cannot be awakened, damage received is converted to #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# of your own HP recovered)',
		describe_th = 'เมื่อเลือดของตัวเองลดลงต่ำกว่า 20% เป็นครั้งแรก จะเข้าสู่สถานะ [หลับอัตโนมัติ] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น, [หลับอัตโนมัติ] (เอฟเฟกต์พิเศษ ไม่สามารถตื่นได้ ความเสียหายที่ได้รับจะกลายเป็นการฟื้นฟูเลือดของตัวเอง #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B#)',
		describe_in = 'Saat HP sendiri pertama kali turun di bawah 20%, akan memasuki status [tidur otomatis] selama 1 giliran, [tidur otomatis] (efek khusus, tidak bisa dibangunkan, damage yang diterima berubah menjadi #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# HP yang dipulihkan oleh diri sendiri)',
		describe_ph = 'Kapag ang sariling HP ay unang bumaba sa ilalim ng 20%, papasok sa [auto-sleep] na estado ng 1 turn, [auto-sleep] (espesyal na epekto, hindi maaaring gisingin, ang natanggap na pinsala ay nagiging #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# ng sariling HP na naibalik)',
