		skillName_ma = 'Bintang Tempatan Bumi',
		skillName = 'Earth Local Star',
		describe_vn = 'Rin Tosaka thi triển bùa chú, triệu hồi các thiên thạch băng giá tấn công mục tiêu ở hàng đầu của kẻ địch. Đầu tiên, nó giảm 40% khả năng phòng thủ phép thuật của mục tiêu ở hàng đầu trong 1 lượt, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#330% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$% #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Phép Thuật #C0x5B545B#, 40% cơ hội [đóng băng] mục tiêu trong 2 lượt (đóng băng: hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể di chuyển, sẽ được dỡ bỏ sau khi nhận được mạng sống tích lũy vượt quá 30% mục tiêu)',
		describe_en = 'Rin Tosaka casts a spell, summoning icy meteors to attack the front-row enemy targets. First, it reduces the magic defense of the front-row targets by 40% for 1 turn, deals #C0x3D8A99#330% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$% #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, and has a 40% chance to [freeze] the target for 2 turns (freeze: a control effect that prevents movement and will be removed when the target receives accumulated healing exceeding 30% of their max HP).',
		describe_th = 'Rin Tosaka ร่ายเวทมนตร์ เรียกอุกกาบาตน้ำแข็งโจมตีเป้าหมายแถวหน้าเป็นหลัก ก่อนอื่น จะลดการป้องกันเวทมนตร์ของเป้าหมายแถวหน้าลง 40% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น ก่อให้เกิด #C0x3D8A99#ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ 330%#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$% #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x5B545B# มีโอกาส 40% ที่จะ [แช่แข็ง] เป้าหมายเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (แช่แข็ง: เอฟเฟกต์ควบคุม ไม่สามารถเคลื่อนที่ได้ จะถูกปลดเมื่อได้รับการฟื้นฟูชีวิตสะสมเกิน 30% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุด)',
		describe_in = 'Rin Tosaka mengeluarkan mantra, memanggil meteorit es untuk menyerang target di barisan depan musuh. Pertama, mengurangi pertahanan sihir target di barisan depan sebesar 40% selama 1 giliran, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#330% Kerusakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$% #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 40% untuk [membekukan] target selama 2 giliran (membekukan: efek kendali, tidak dapat bergerak, akan dihapus setelah menerima penyembuhan kumulatif lebih dari 30% dari HP maksimum target).',
		describe_ph = 'Si Rin Tosaka ay nagkakast ng spell, tumatawag ng mga icy meteor upang atakihin ang mga target sa front row ng kalaban. Una, binabawasan nito ang magic defense ng mga target sa front row ng 40% sa loob ng 1 turn, nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#330% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$% #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, at may 40% na tsansa na [ma-freeze] ang target sa loob ng 2 turn (freeze: isang control effect na pumipigil sa paggalaw at matatanggal kapag nakatanggap ang target ng accumulated healing na lampas sa 30% ng maximum niyang HP).',
		describe_ma = 'Rin Tosaka melancarkan jampi, memanggil meteorit ais untuk menyerang sasaran di barisan depan musuh. Pertama, ia mengurangkan pertahanan sihir sasaran di barisan depan sebanyak 40% selama 1 giliran, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#330% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$% #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 40% untuk [membekukan] sasaran selama 2 giliran (membekukan: kesan kawalan, tidak boleh bergerak, akan dialihkan selepas menerima pemulihan hayat terkumpul melebihi 30% daripada hayat maksimum sasaran).',
		describe = 'Rin Tosaka casts a spell, summoning icy meteors to attack the front-row enemy targets. First, it reduces the magic defense of the front-row targets by 40% for 1 turn, deals #C0x3D8A99#330% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$% #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, and has a 40% chance to [freeze] the target for 2 turns (freeze: a control effect that prevents movement and will be removed when the target receives accumulated healing exceeding 30% of their max HP).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Rin Tosaka thi triển bùa chú triệu hồi các thiên thạch băng giá tấn công mục tiêu ở hàng đầu của kẻ địch, có khả năng đóng băng mục tiêu.',
		simDesc_en = 'Rin Tosaka casts a spell summoning icy meteors to attack the enemy\'s front row targets, with the ability to freeze them.',
		simDesc_th = 'Rin Tosaka ร่ายเวทมนตร์เรียกอุกกาบาตน้ำแข็งโจมตีเป้าหมายแถวหน้าในฝั่งศัตรู มีความสามารถในการทำให้เป้าหมายแข็งตัว',
		simDesc_in = 'Rin Tosaka mengeluarkan mantra untuk memanggil meteorit beku menyerang target di barisan depan musuh, dengan kemampuan membekukan target.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Si Rin Tosaka ay nagpapalayag ng isang sumpa na tumatawag ng mga nagyeyelong meteor upang atakihin ang mga target sa unahang hanay ng kalaban, na may kakayahang i-freeze ang mga target.',
		simDesc_ma = 'Rin Tosaka melafazkan jampi untuk memanggil meteor beku menyerang sasaran di barisan hadapan musuh, dengan keupayaan membekukan sasaran.',
		simDesc = 'Rin Tosaka casts a spell summoning icy meteors to attack the enemy\'s front row targets, with the ability to freeze them.',
