		describe_en = 'Full Power: Initially, all allies will recover #C0x5c9970#$(100+skillLevel*1-1)$#C0x5B545B# HP. Energy points will be additionally restored by 50% for thunder heroes. When Misaka Mikoto is present, [Electric] heroes are 20% more likely to be struck by lightning.',
