		skillName = 'Thunder Punch',
		describe_vn = 'Quái Long tích tụ sức mạnh sấm sét vào hai vuốt, tung cú đấm mạnh vào mục tiêu hàng dọc của địch, gây ra #C0xE69900#160% vật công#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0xF13B54#, có 100% xác suất khiến mục tiêu bị [Tê liệt] trong 2 lượt (Tê liệt: hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể sử dụng kỹ năng đặc biệt), nếu mục tiêu đã bị [Tê liệt], có 30% xác suất khiến mục tiêu bị [Choáng] trong 1 lượt (Choáng: hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể hành động)',
		describe_en = 'The Thunder Tyrant channels lightning power into its two claws, delivering a powerful punch to the enemy\'s frontline target, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54#. It has a 100% chance to inflict [Paralysis] for 2 turns (Paralysis: a control effect that prevents the target from using special skills). If the target is already [Paralyzed], there is a 30% chance to inflict [Stun] for 1 turn (Stun: a control effect that prevents any action).',
		describe_th = 'มังกรอัสนีสะสมพลังสายฟ้าในกงเล็บทั้งสอง ส่งหมัดอันทรงพลังไปยังเป้าหมายแถวหน้า ทำให้เกิดความเสียหายร่างกาย #C0xE69900#160%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ และมีโอกาส 100% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมายติดสถานะ [เป็นอัมพาต] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (เป็นอัมพาต: เอฟเฟคควบคุม ทำให้ไม่สามารถใช้สกิลพิเศษได้) หากเป้าหมายอยู่ในสถานะ [เป็นอัมพาต] อยู่แล้ว จะมีโอกาส 30% ที่จะทำให้ติดสถานะ [มึนงง] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (มึนงง: เอฟเฟคควบคุม ทำให้ไม่สามารถทำอะไรได้)',
		describe_in = 'Naga Petir mengumpulkan kekuatan petir di kedua cakarnya, melancarkan pukulan kuat ke target barisan depan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#160% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Kerusakan Fisik#C0xF13B54#. Memiliki 100% kemungkinan membuat target terkena [Lumpuh] selama 2 giliran (Lumpuh: efek kontrol, tidak dapat menggunakan skill khusus). Jika target sudah [Lumpuh], ada 30% kemungkinan menyebabkan target terkena [Pingsan] selama 1 giliran (Pingsan: efek kontrol, tidak bisa melakukan tindakan).',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Nilalang na Dragon ay nag-ipon ng lakas ng kidlat sa dalawang kuko nito, naglunsad ng malakas na suntok sa target na nasa harap ng kaaway, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#160% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Pisikal na Pinsala#C0xF13B54#. May 100% na pagkakataon na ma-paralyze ang target sa loob ng 2 turn (Paralysis: control effect na pumipigil sa target na gumamit ng espesyal na kasanayan). Kung ang target ay naka-[Paralyze] na, may 30% na pagkakataon na ma-stun ang target sa loob ng 1 turn (Stun: control effect na pumipigil sa anumang aksyon).',
		describe_ma = 'Naga Ganas mengumpul tenaga petir di kedua cakarnya, melancarkan pukulan kuat ke sasaran barisan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#160% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Kerosakan Fizikal#C0xF13B54#. Mempunyai 100% peluang untuk menyebabkan sasaran terkena [Lumpuh] selama 2 pusingan (Lumpuh: kesan kawalan, tidak boleh menggunakan kemahiran khas). Jika sasaran sudah [Lumpuh], terdapat 30% peluang untuk menyebabkan sasaran terkena [Pengsan] selama 1 pusingan (Pengsan: kesan kawalan, tidak boleh bertindak).',
		describe = 'The Thunder Tyrant channels lightning power into its two claws, delivering a powerful punch to the enemy\'s frontline target, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54#. It has a 100% chance to inflict [Paralysis] for 2 turns (Paralysis: a control effect that prevents the target from using special skills). If the target is already [Paralyzed], there is a 30% chance to inflict [Stun] for 1 turn (Stun: a control effect that prevents any action).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Dragonite tích lũy sức mạnh sấm sét vào hai móng vuốt, thực hiện cú đấm mạnh vào mục tiêu hàng ngang của đối phương.',
		simDesc_en = 'Dragonite accumulates thunder power into its two claws, delivering a powerful punch to the opponent\'s horizontal line of targets.',
		simDesc_th = 'ดรากอนไนต์สะสมพลังสายฟ้าไว้ที่กรงเล็บทั้งสองข้าง ก่อนจะปล่อยหมัดหนักไปยังเป้าหมายแนวนอนของศัตรู',
