		describe_ph = 'Ang Monster Dragon ay nagtuon ng kapangyarihan ng apoy sa dalawang kuko, naglabas ng malakas na hook punch sa isang indibidwal na target ng kaaway, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#180% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Pisikal na Pinsala#C0xF13B54#, kasabay ng epekto na [Nasusunog] sa loob ng 2 turn (Nasusunog: negatibong epekto, ang target ay tumatanggap ng Pisikal na Pinsala bawat turn na katumbas ng #C0xE69900#30% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B#, maaaring mag-stack hanggang 5 layers).',
		describe_ma = 'Naga Raksasa memfokuskan kekuatan api ke kedua cakarnya, melontarkan pukulan kait kuat pada satu sasaran musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#180% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Kerosakan Fizikal#C0xF13B54#, disertai kesan [Membakar] selama 2 pusingan (Membakar: kesan negatif, sasaran menerima Kerosakan Fizikal setiap pusingan sebanyak #C0xE69900#30% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, bertindih sehingga 5 lapisan).',
		describe = 'The Monster Dragon focuses firepower into both claws, unleashing a powerful hook punch on a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#180% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54#, accompanied by the [Burn] effect for 2 turns (Burn: a negative effect causing the target to receive Physical Damage each turn equal to #C0xE69900#30% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#, stacking up to 5 layers).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Dragonite tập trung sức mạnh lửa vào hai móng vuốt, thực hiện cú đấm mạnh vào mục tiêu đơn lẻ của đối phương.',
		simDesc_en = 'Dragonite concentrates fire power into its two claws, delivering a powerful punch to a single enemy target.',
		simDesc_th = 'ดรากอนไนท์รวบรวมพลังไฟเข้าที่กรงเล็บทั้งสองข้าง ก่อนจะโจมตีหมัดรุนแรงใส่เป้าหมายเดียวของศัตรู',
