		skillName_ma = 'Pukul Guntur',
		skillName = 'Thunder Punch',
		describe_vn = 'Quái Long tích tụ sức mạnh sấm sét vào hai vuốt, tung cú đấm mạnh vào mục tiêu hàng dọc của địch, gây ra #C0xE69900#160% vật công#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0xF13B54#, có 100% xác suất khiến mục tiêu bị [Tê liệt] trong 2 lượt (Tê liệt: hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể sử dụng kỹ năng đặc biệt), nếu mục tiêu đã bị [Tê liệt], có 30% xác suất khiến mục tiêu bị [Choáng] trong 1 lượt (Choáng: hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể hành động)',
		describe_en = 'The Thunder Dragon channels the power of lightning into its two claws, delivering a powerful punch to the enemy\'s front line, dealing #C0xE69900#160% physical attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54#. It has a 100% chance to cause the target to be [Paralyzed] for 2 turns (Paralyzed: a control effect that prevents the use of special skills). If the target is already [Paralyzed], there is a 30% chance to cause the target to be [Stunned] for 1 turn (Stunned: a control effect that prevents any action).',
		describe_th = 'มังกรสายฟ้าสะสมพลังสายฟ้าไว้ที่กรงเล็บทั้งสอง ขว้างหมัดแรงไปยังเป้าหมายแถวหน้าของศัตรู ก่อให้เกิดความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#160%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# มีโอกาส 100% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมาย [แขนงล่าง] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (แขนงล่าง: ผลควบคุมไม่สามารถใช้สกิลพิเศษได้) ถ้าเป้าหมายอยู่ในสถานะ [แขนงล่าง] อยู่แล้ว จะมีโอกาส 30% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมาย [มึนงง] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (มึนงง: ผลควบคุมไม่สามารถกระทำการใดๆ ได้)',
		describe_in = 'Naga Petir mengumpulkan kekuatan listrik ke kedua cakarnya, melayangkan pukulan kuat ke barisan depan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#160% serangan fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Kerusakan Fisik#C0xF13B54#, dengan peluang 100% membuat target terkena [Lumpuh] selama 2 giliran (Lumpuh: efek kontrol, tidak dapat menggunakan skill khusus). Jika target sudah dalam keadaan [Lumpuh], ada peluang 30% membuat target terkena [Pingsan] selama 1 giliran (Pingsan: efek kontrol, tidak dapat melakukan aksi apapun).',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Thunder Dragon ay nag-iipon ng lakas ng kidlat sa kanyang dalawang kuko, nagpapalabas ng malakas na suntok sa harapang hanay ng kalaban, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#160% pisikal na atake#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Pisikal na Pinsala#C0xF13B54#. May 100% tsansa na ma-paralyze ang target sa loob ng 2 mga turn (Paralyze: control effect na pumipigil sa paggamit ng espesyal na kakayahan). Kung ang target ay naka-paralyze na, may 30% tsansa na ma-stun ang target sa loob ng 1 turn (Stun: control effect na pumipigil sa anumang aksyon).',
		describe_ma = 'Naga Guruh mengumpulkan tenaga kilat ke kedua cakarnya, melancarkan pukulan kuat ke barisan hadapan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#160% serangan fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Kerosakan Fizikal#C0xF13B54#. Ia mempunyai peluang 100% untuk menyebabkan sasaran mengalami [Terhenti] selama 2 pusingan (Terhenti: kesan kawalan, tidak boleh menggunakan kemahiran khas). Jika sasaran sudah dalam keadaan [Terhenti], terdapat peluang 30% untuk menyebabkan sasaran mengalami [Diluputkan Deria] selama 1 pusingan (Diluputkan Deria: kesan kawalan, tidak boleh bertindak).',
		describe = 'The Thunder Dragon channels the power of lightning into its two claws, delivering a powerful punch to the enemy\'s front line, dealing #C0xE69900#160% physical attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54#. It has a 100% chance to cause the target to be [Paralyzed] for 2 turns (Paralyzed: a control effect that prevents the use of special skills). If the target is already [Paralyzed], there is a 30% chance to cause the target to be [Stunned] for 1 turn (Stunned: a control effect that prevents any action).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Dragonite tích lũy sức mạnh sấm sét vào hai móng vuốt, thực hiện cú đấm mạnh vào mục tiêu hàng ngang của đối phương.',
		simDesc_en = 'Dragonite accumulates thunderpower in its two claws and delivers a powerful punch to the opponent\'s horizontal line of targets.',
		simDesc_th = 'Dragonite สะสมพลังสายฟ้าไว้ที่กรงเล็บทั้งสองข้าง และปล่อยหมัดอันทรงพลังสู่เป้าหมายในแนวนอนของฝ่ายตรงข้าม',
