		skillName = 'Fast Dragon',
		describe_vn = 'Khi tấn công, mỗi hiệu ứng tiêu cực hoặc khống chế trên mục tiêu sẽ tăng sát thương lên #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#, nếu hiệu ứng tiêu cực hoặc khống chế được thêm bởi anh hùng hệ Ma Thần, hiệu quả tăng sát thương sẽ được nhân đôi, tối đa tăng đến 40%',
		describe_en = 'When attacking, each negative effect or control on the target increases damage by #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#. If the negative effect or control is applied by a Demon-type hero, the damage increase effect is doubled, up to a maximum of 40%.',
		describe_th = 'เมื่อโจมตี ผลกระทบเชิงลบหรือการควบคุมบนเป้าหมายแต่ละอันจะเพิ่มความเสียหายขึ้น #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# หากผลกระทบเชิงลบหรือการควบคุมถูกเพิ่มโดยฮีโร่ประเภทปีศาจ ผลกระทบการเพิ่มความเสียหายจะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า สูงสุดไม่เกิน 40%',
		describe_in = 'Saat menyerang, setiap efek negatif atau kontrol pada target meningkatkan kerusakan sebesar #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#. Jika efek negatif atau kontrol ditambahkan oleh pahlawan tipe Iblis, efek peningkatan kerusakan akan digandakan, hingga maksimum 40%.',
		describe_ph = 'Kapag umaatake, bawat negatibong epekto o kontrol sa target ay nagdaragdag ng pinsala ng #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#. Kung ang negatibong epekto o kontrol ay idinagdag ng isang Demon-type na bayani, ang epekto ng pagtaas ng pinsala ay dodoblehin, hanggang sa maximum na 40%.',
