		describe = 'When attacking, each negative effect or control on the target increases damage by #C0x5c9970#$(5+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#. If the negative effect or control is applied by a Demon-type hero, the damage increase effect is doubled, up to a maximum of 40%.',
