		skillName = 'Save the Demon Girl',
		describe_vn = 'Hiệu ứng [Tàng hình] được kích hoạt khi nhận sát thương vượt quá giới hạn trên của lượng máu bản thân #C0x5c9970#$(30-skillLevel*0.15+0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# (Tàng hình: hiệu ứng đặc biệt, không thể chọn mục tiêu, có thể bị ảnh hưởng bởi các đòn tấn công phạm vi), kéo dài cho đến hành động tiếp theo và có một #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.5-0.5)$%#C0x5B545B# xác suất bật lại hiệu ứng điều khiển trong thời gian tàng hình.',
		describe_en = 'The [Invisibility] effect is activated when receiving damage exceeding the upper limit of the character\'s health at #C0x5c9970#$(30 - skillLevel * 0.15 + 0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# (Invisibility: a special effect, cannot be targeted, can be affected by area attacks), lasting until the next action and has a #C0x5c9970#$(50 + skillLevel * 0.5 - 0.5)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to reflect control effects during invisibility.',
		describe_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์ [ล่องหน] จะถูกกระตุ้นเมื่อได้รับความเสียหายเกินกว่าขีดจำกัดสูงสุดของพลังชีวิตที่มีอยู่ที่ #C0x5c9970#$(30 - skillLevel * 0.15 + 0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# (ล่องหน: เอฟเฟกต์พิเศษ ไม่สามารถเลือกเป้าหมาย และสามารถถูกโจมตีแบบวงกว้างได้), มีผลต่อเนื่องจนถึงการกระทำถัดไป และมีโอกาส #C0x5c9970#$(50 + skillLevel * 0.5 - 0.5)$%#C0x5B545B# ในการสะท้อนเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมในช่วงเวลาที่ล่องหน',
		describe_in = 'Efek [Menyamar] diaktifkan saat menerima kerusakan yang melebihi batas atas HP karakter sebanyak #C0x5c9970#$(30 - skillLevel * 0.15 + 0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# (Menyamar: efek khusus, tidak dapat menjadi target, dapat terpengaruh oleh serangan area), berlangsung hingga aksi berikutnya dan memiliki peluang sebesar #C0x5c9970#$(50 + skillLevel * 0.5 - 0.5)$%#C0x5B545B# untuk memantulkan efek kontrol selama masa menyamar.',
		describe_ph = 'Aktibo ang epekto ng [Invisible] kapag nakatanggap ng pinsalang lumampas sa itaas na limit ng sariling health na #C0x5c9970#$(30 - skillLevel * 0.15 + 0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# (Invisible: espesyal na epekto, hindi maaaring pagtutukan, maaaring maapektuhan ng mga area attacks), tumatagal hanggang sa susunod na aksyon at may #C0x5c9970#$(50 + skillLevel * 0.5 - 0.5)$%#C0x5B545B# tsansa na maipakita muli ang control effects habang invisible.',
		describe_ma = 'Kesan [Tersembunyi] diaktifkan apabila menerima kerosakan melebihi had atas kesihatan sendiri sebanyak #C0x5c9970#$(30 - skillLevel * 0.15 + 0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# (Tersembunyi: kesan khas, tidak boleh dipilih sebagai sasaran, boleh terjejas oleh serangan kawasan), bertahan sehingga tindakan seterusnya dan mempunyai peluang #C0x5c9970#$(50 + skillLevel * 0.5 - 0.5)$%#C0x5B545B# untuk memantul kesan kawalan semasa tersembunyi.',
		describe = 'The [Invisibility] effect is activated when receiving damage exceeding the upper limit of the character\'s health at #C0x5c9970#$(30 - skillLevel * 0.15 + 0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# (Invisibility: a special effect, cannot be targeted, can be affected by area attacks), lasting until the next action and has a #C0x5c9970#$(50 + skillLevel * 0.5 - 0.5)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to reflect control effects during invisibility.',
