		describe_ph = 'Ang dahon ng Chrysanthemum ay nagpalabas ng dahon, hinihila ang isang indibidwal na target na kalaban, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#130% Lakas ng Mahika#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Pinsalang Mahika #C0x5B545B#, at nagpapagaling sa alyadong yunit na may pinakamababang HP (epekto: #C0x3D8A99#80% Lakas ng Mahika#C0x5B545B# dagdag sa pagbawi ng HP).',
		describe_ma = 'Daun Krisan memancarkan daun, melibas satu sasaran musuh tunggal, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#130% Kuasa Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, memulihkan kesihatan kepada unit sekutu yang mempunyai kesihatan terendah (kesan: #C0x3D8A99#80% Kuasa Sihir#C0x5B545B# ditambah ke jumlah pemulihan).',
		describe = 'The Chrysanthemum Leaf shoots out a leaf, slashing a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#130% Magical Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, and heals the allied unit with the lowest health (effect: #C0x3D8A99#80% Magical Power#C0x5B545B# added to the heal amount).',
