		describe = 'Fireball Test spits fire to attack the enemy\'s front row target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#220% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#. Due to unstable emotions, the final damage this time may remain the same, double, or half.',
