		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'A zombie man dressed in black takes out a triple-barreled plasma cannon and sprays volcanic power in all directions to attack the enemy\'s front row targets, dealing #C0x3D8A99#240% magical attack damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, due to unstable emotions the final damage may be unchanged, can double, can be halved, and has an additional chance to triple.',
