		-- {79004}
		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Before starting your turn, there is a 50% chance to remove all control effects. If successful, increase your own #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# Physical Attack for 2 turns; before starting your turn, if not controlled, increase Physical Attack by 10% for 1 turn',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Before starting your turn, there is a 50% chance to remove all control effects. If successful, increase your own #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# Physical Attack for 2 turns; before starting your turn, if not controlled, increase Physical Attack by 10% for 1 turn',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'ก่อนเริ่มเทิร์นของคุณ มีโอกาส 50% ที่จะลบเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมทั้งหมด หากลบสำเร็จ จะเพิ่ม #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพของตัวเอง เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น; ก่อนเริ่มเทิร์น ถ้าไม่ได้ถูกควบคุม พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพจะเพิ่มขึ้น 10% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Sebelum memulai giliran Anda, ada kesempatan 50% untuk menghapus semua efek kontrol. Jika berhasil, tingkatkan #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# Serangan Fisik Anda selama 2 giliran; sebelum memulai giliran, jika tidak terkendali, Serangan Fisik meningkat 10% selama 1 giliran',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Bago magsimula ang iyong turn, may 50% na tsansa na matanggal ang lahat ng control effects. Kapag matagumpay na natanggal, tataas ang iyong #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# Physical Attack sa loob ng 2 turn; bago magsimula ang turn, kung hindi ka na-control, tataas ang Physical Attack ng 10% sa loob ng 1 turn',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Sebelum memulakan giliran anda, terdapat peluang 50% untuk menghapus semua kesan kawalan. Jika berjaya, tingkatkan #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# Serangan Fizikal anda selama 2 giliran; sebelum memulakan giliran, jika tidak dikawal, Serangan Fizikal meningkat 10% selama 1 giliran',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Trước khi bắt đầu lượt của bản thân có 50% cơ hội xóa bỏ tất cả hiệu ứng kiểm soát, nếu thành công xóa bỏ thì tăng #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.15-0.15)$%#C0x5B545B# Công Vật Lý của bản thân, kéo dài 2 lượt; trước khi bắt đầu lượt nếu không bị kiểm soát, Công Vật Lý tăng 10% trong 1 lượt',
