		describe_vn = 'Athena bay lên trời và tập trung thần lực tấn công tất cả mục tiêu địch, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#200% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54#Pháp thuật tổn thương#C0x5B545B#, mang lại [Lucky] cho hai đồng đội ngẫu nhiên trong 2 hiệp. Đối với đồng đội nhận được [Phước lành], hiệu ứng của [Lucky] sẽ được nhân đôi\n#F20# \n#F40#[Lucky]: Hiệu ứng buff, tăng khả năng kháng tiêu cực của mục tiêu thêm 20% (40% sau khi nhân đôi). Khi bị tấn công, có 30% (60% sau khi nhân đôi) xác suất tiêu thụ [May mắn] để chịu được 50% sát thương này.',
		describe_en = 'Athena soars into the sky and channels divine power to attack all enemy targets, dealing #C0x3D8A99#200% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54#Magic damage#C0x5B545B#, granting [Lucky] to two random allies for 2 turns. For allies who receive [Blessing], the effect of [Lucky] is doubled. #F20# [Lucky]: A buff effect that increases the target\'s resistance to negative effects by 20% (40% when doubled). When attacked, there is a 30% chance (60% when doubled) to consume [Lucky] and reduce the damage taken by 50%. #F40#',
		describe_th = 'อธีน่าทะยานขึ้นสู่ท้องฟ้า รวบรวมพลังเทพโจมตีศัตรูทุกตัว สร้างความเสียหายเวท #C0x3D8A99#200% พลังโจมตีเวท#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54#ความเสียหายเวท#C0x5B545B# และมอบ [โชคดี] ให้เพื่อนร่วมทีมแบบสุ่ม 2 คน เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น สำหรับเพื่อนที่ได้รับ [พร] เอฟเฟกต์ของ [โชคดี] จะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า [โชคดี]: เอฟเฟกต์เสริม เพิ่มต้านทานดีบัฟ 20% (หากได้รับการเสริม จะเป็น 40%) เมื่อถูกโจมตี มีโอกาส 30% (หรือ 60% หากเสริม) ที่จะใช้ [โชคดี] เพื่อลดความเสียหายของครั้งนั้นลง 50%',
		describe_in = 'Athena terbang ke langit dan mengumpulkan kekuatan ilahi untuk menyerang semua target musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#200% Kerusakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54#kerusakan sihir#C0x5B545B#, memberikan [Lucky] kepada dua rekan secara acak selama 2 giliran. Untuk rekan yang menerima [Blessing], efek dari [Lucky] akan digandakan #F20# [Lucky]: Efek buff yang meningkatkan ketahanan target terhadap efek negatif sebesar 20% (40% saat digandakan). Saat diserang, ada peluang 30% (60% saat digandakan) untuk mengkonsumsi [Lucky] dan menahan 50% dari kerusakan tersebut #F40#',
		describe_ph = 'Si Athena ay lumilipad paitaas at kumokolekta ng kapangyarihan ng diyos upang atakihin ang lahat ng kalabang target, nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#200% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54#Pinsalang Magic#C0x5B545B#, nagbibigay ng [Lucky] sa dalawang random na kakampi sa loob ng 2 rounds. Para sa mga kakampi na tumanggap ng [Blessing], ang epekto ng [Lucky] ay dodoblehin. #F20# [Lucky]: Isang buff effect na nagpapataas ng resistensya ng target laban sa negatibong epekto ng 20% (40% kapag nadoble). Kapag inatake, may 30% (60% kapag nadoble) na tsansa na gamitin ang [Lucky] para tiisin ang 50% ng pinsalang ito. #F40#',
		describe_ma = 'Athena terbang ke langit dan mengumpulkan kuasa ilahi untuk menyerang semua sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#200% Kerosakan Ahli Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54#kerosakan ahli sihir#C0x5B545B#, memberikan [Lucky] kepada dua rakan secara rawak selama 2 pusingan. Bagi rakan yang menerima [Blessing], kesan [Lucky] akan digandakan #F20# [Lucky]: Kesan buff yang meningkatkan ketahanan sasaran terhadap kesan negatif sebanyak 20% (40% apabila digandakan). Apabila diserang, terdapat peluang 30% (60% apabila digandakan) untuk menggunakan [Lucky] dan menahan 50% daripada kerosakan tersebut #F40#',
		describe = 'Athena soars into the sky and channels divine power to attack all enemy targets, dealing #C0x3D8A99#200% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54#Magic damage#C0x5B545B#, granting [Lucky] to two random allies for 2 turns. For allies who receive [Blessing], the effect of [Lucky] is doubled. #F20# [Lucky]: A buff effect that increases the target\'s resistance to negative effects by 20% (40% when doubled). When attacked, there is a 30% chance (60% when doubled) to consume [Lucky] and reduce the damage taken by 50%. #F40#',
