		skillName_ma = 'Dewi kebijaksanaan',
		skillName = 'Goddess of wisdom',
		describe_vn = 'Kỹ năng hào quang: Trước mỗi hành động, đơn vị của bạn có #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# xác suất nhận được [Phúc lành] trong 1 vòng (kéo dài cho đến hết vòng hiện tại). Đối với đồng đội có [May mắn], hiệu ứng của [Blessing] sẽ được nhân đôi\n#F20# \n#F40#[Blessing]: Tăng hiệu ứng, cải thiện Sát Thương Phép Thuật, khả năng phòng thủ phép thuật của mục tiêu (mức cải thiện là 10% thuộc tính tương ứng của Athena và là 20% sau khi nhân đôi)',
		describe_en = 'Aura Skill: Before each action, your unit has a #(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)% chance to receive [Blessing] for 1 turn (lasting until the end of the current turn). For allies with [Luck], the effect of [Blessing] is doubled. [Blessing]: Enhances effects, improves Magic Damage and the target\'s magic defense (the improvement is 10% of Athena\'s corresponding attribute and 20% after doubling).',
		describe_th = 'สกิลออร่า: ก่อนที่ยูนิตฝ่ายเราจะลงมือแต่ละครั้ง มีโอกาส #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# ที่จะได้รับสถานะ [พร] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (คงอยู่จนจบรอบใหญ่ปัจจุบัน) สำหรับเพื่อนร่วมทีมที่มีสถานะ [โชคดี] เอฟเฟกต์ของ [พร] จะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า [พร]: เอฟเฟกต์เสริม เพิ่มพลังโจมตีเวทและพลังป้องกันเวทของเป้าหมายตาม 10% ของค่าสถานะที่อธีน่ามี (หากเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่าจะเป็น 20%)',
		describe_in = 'Skill Aura: Sebelum setiap aksi, unit Anda memiliki peluang #(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)% untuk menerima [Berkah] selama 1 giliran (bertahan hingga akhir giliran saat ini). Untuk rekan satu tim yang memiliki [Keberuntungan], efek [Berkah] akan digandakan. [Berkah]: Meningkatkan efek, memperbaiki Damage Sihir dan pertahanan sihir target (peningkatan adalah 10% atribut Athena yang sesuai dan 20% setelah digandakan).',
		describe_ph = 'Aura Skill: Bago ang bawat aksyon, ang iyong yunit ay may #(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)% na tsansa na makatanggap ng [Bendisyon] sa loob ng 1 round (tatagal hanggang matapos ang kasalukuyang round). Para sa mga kakampi na may [Swerte], ang epekto ng [Bendisyon] ay dodoblehin. [Bendisyon]: Pinapalakas ang mga epekto, pinapahusay ang Magic Damage at magic defense ng target (ang pagpapabuti ay 10% ng katumbas na attribute ni Athena at 20% pagkatapos madoble).',
		describe_ma = 'Kemahiran Aura: Sebelum setiap tindakan, unit anda mempunyai peluang #(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)% untuk menerima [Berkat] selama 1 pusingan (berlanjutan sehingga akhir pusingan semasa). Bagi rakan sepasukan yang mempunyai [Nasib], kesan [Berkat] akan digandakan. [Berkat]: Meningkatkan kesan, memperbaiki Kerosakan Sihir dan pertahanan sihir sasaran (peningkatan adalah 10% atribut Athena yang berkaitan dan 20% selepas digandakan).',
		describe = 'Aura Skill: Before each action, your unit has a #(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)% chance to receive [Blessing] for 1 turn (lasting until the end of the current turn). For allies with [Luck], the effect of [Blessing] is doubled. [Blessing]: Enhances effects, improves Magic Damage and the target\'s magic defense (the improvement is 10% of Athena\'s corresponding attribute and 20% after doubling).',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[8636],
