		describe_en = 'Dream Love summons magical sparks to attack the enemy unit with the highest attack power, dealing #C0x3D8A99#140% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, while draining half of the target\'s rage value and has an 80% chance to cause the target to be [Illusion] for 2 turns.',
