		skillName_ma = 'Tiada baik atau jahat',
		skillName = 'No good or evil',
		describe_vn = 'Đòn tấn công của Amakusa Shirou Tokisada sẽ gây hiệu ứng [Nọc bọ cạp] trong 3 lượt. Mỗi khi áp dụng thành công hiệu ứng tiêu cực hoặc hiệu ứng khống chế, bản thân sẽ được cải thiện #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B#Phòng thủ vật lý cơ bản trong 1 lượt\n#F20# \n#F40#[Scorpion Venom]: Hiệu ứng tiêu cực, mục tiêu sẽ nhận 80% phòng thủ vật lý của Amakusa Shirau Tokisada sau mỗi hành động, có thể chồng lên nhau 2 lần; tỷ lệ trúng đích sẽ giảm 10% và nếu mục tiêu bị khống chế, tỷ lệ hồi máu sẽ giảm 60%.',
		describe_en = 'Amakusa Shirou Tokisada\'s attack will apply the [Scorpion Venom] effect for 3 turns. Each time a negative effect or control effect is successfully applied, he will increase his #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# base physical defense for 1 turn \n#F20# \n#F40#. [Scorpion Venom]: Negative effect, the target will receive 80% of Amakusa Shirou Tokisada\'s physical defense as damage after each action, can stack up to 2 times; hit rate will be reduced by 10% and if the target is controlled, healing rate will be reduced by 60%.',
		describe_th = 'การโจมตีของ Amakusa Shirou Tokisada จะทำให้เกิดเอฟเฟกต์ [พิษแมงป่อง] เป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์น ทุกครั้งที่ใช้เอฟเฟกต์ลบหรือเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมสำเร็จ ตัวเขาจะได้รับการเพิ่ม #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# การป้องกันทางกายภาพพื้นฐานเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น \n#F20# \n#F40# [พิษแมงป่อง]: เอฟเฟกต์ลบ เป้าหมายจะได้รับความเสียหายเท่ากับ 80% ของการป้องกันทางกายภาพของ Amakusa Shirou Tokisada หลังแต่ละการกระทำ สามารถซ้อนทับได้สูงสุด 2 ครั้ง; อัตราการโดนโจมตีจะลดลง 10% และหากเป้าหมายอยู่ในสถานะควบคุม อัตราการฟื้นฟูเลือดจะลดลง 60%',
		describe_in = 'Serangan Amakusa Shirou Tokisada akan memberikan efek [Racun Kalajengking] selama 3 giliran. Setiap kali efek negatif atau efek kontrol berhasil diterapkan, dia akan meningkatkan #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# pertahanan fisik dasar selama 1 giliran \n#F20# \n#F40#. [Racun Kalajengking]: Efek negatif, target akan menerima 80% pertahanan fisik Amakusa Shirou Tokisada setelah setiap aksi, dapat bertumpuk hingga 2 kali; akurasi serangan berkurang 10% dan jika target terkena efek kontrol, tingkat penyembuhan berkurang 60%.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang pag-atake ni Amakusa Shirou Tokisada ay magbibigay ng epekto ng [Scorpion Venom] sa loob ng 3 turn. Sa tuwing matagumpay na maipapataw ang negatibong epekto o control effect, siya ay mapapataas ng #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# ng kanyang base physical defense sa loob ng 1 turn \n#F20# \n#F40#. [Scorpion Venom]: Negatibong epekto, ang target ay tatanggap ng 80% ng physical defense ni Amakusa Shirou Tokisada kada aksyon, maaaring mag-stack hanggang 2 beses; ang hit rate ay bababa ng 10% at kung ang target ay na-control, ang healing rate ay bababa ng 60%.',
		describe_ma = 'Serangan Amakusa Shirou Tokisada akan memberi kesan [Bisa Kala Jengking] selama 3 giliran. Setiap kali kesan negatif atau kesan kawalan berjaya digunakan, dia akan meningkatkan #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# pertahanan fizikal asas selama 1 giliran \n#F20# \n#F40#. [Bisa Kala Jengking]: Kesan negatif, sasaran akan menerima 80% pertahanan fizikal Amakusa Shirou Tokisada selepas setiap tindakan, boleh bertindih sehingga 2 kali; kadar serangan tepat akan berkurang 10% dan jika sasaran terkawal, kadar pemulihan kesihatan akan berkurang 60%.',
		describe = 'Amakusa Shirou Tokisada\'s attack will apply the [Scorpion Venom] effect for 3 turns. Each time a negative effect or control effect is successfully applied, he will increase his #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# base physical defense for 1 turn \n#F20# \n#F40#. [Scorpion Venom]: Negative effect, the target will receive 80% of Amakusa Shirou Tokisada\'s physical defense as damage after each action, can stack up to 2 times; hit rate will be reduced by 10% and if the target is controlled, healing rate will be reduced by 60%.',
