		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Attack with #Ice Trap# for 2 turns (#Ice Trap#: after the target acts, reduce the target\'s physical defense by $(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% for 1 turn and has a $(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% chance to freeze the target for 1 turn)',
