		skillName_ma = 'Kemarahan Dewa Petir',
		skillName = 'The Wrath of the Thunder God',
		describe_vn = 'Thunder God Zombie triệu hồi sấm sét và gắn búa sét tấn công một mục tiêu địch, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#160% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54# magic Sát Thương Phép Thuật #C0x5B545B#, 100% xác suất [Tê liệt] mục tiêu trong 1 lượt (Tê liệt: hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể sử dụng chiêu thức đặc biệt), nếu mục tiêu bị tê liệt, pin sẽ bị quá tải, trực tiếp khiến mục tiêu bị [Choáng] trong 1 hiệp (Choáng: Hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể di chuyển)',
		describe_en = 'Thunder God Zombie summons thunder and attaches a thunder hammer to attack an enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#160% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# magic Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, 100% chance to [Paralyze] the target for 1 turn (Paralyze: control effect, cannot use special skills). If the target is paralyzed, the battery will overload, directly causing the target to be [Stunned] for 1 round (Stun: control effect, cannot move).',
		describe_th = 'ซอมบี้เทพเจ้าสายฟ้าจะเรียกสายฟ้าและแนบค้อนสายฟ้าเพื่อโจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรู ทำดาเมจเวทมนตร์ #C0x3D8A99#160%#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# ดาเมจเวทมนตร์ #C0x5B545B# มีโอกาส 100% ทำให้เป้าหมาย [เป็นอัมพาต] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (อัมพาต: สถานะควบคุม, ไม่สามารถใช้สกิลพิเศษได้) หากเป้าหมายถูกอัมพาต แบตเตอรี่จะเกินพิกัด ทำให้เป้าหมายถูก [มึนงง] เป็นเวลา 1 รอบ (มึนงง: สถานะควบคุม, ไม่สามารถเคลื่อนที่ได้)',
		describe_in = 'Thunder God Zombie memanggil petir dan melekatkan palu petir untuk menyerang target musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#160% Kerusakan Magis#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# kerusakan magis kerusakan magis #C0x5B545B#, peluang 100% untuk [Melumpuhkan] target selama 1 giliran (Melumpuhkan: efek kontrol, tidak bisa menggunakan skill khusus). Jika target terlumpuhkan, baterai akan mengalami overload, langsung menyebabkan target [Terpukul] selama 1 ronde (Terpukul: efek kontrol, tidak bisa bergerak).',
		describe_ph = 'Thunder God Zombie ay nagmumungkahi ng kidlat at nakakabit ng martilyo ng kidlat upang atakihin ang isang kalaban, nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#160% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# magic Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, 100% tsansa na [Paralyze] ang target sa loob ng 1 turn (Paralyze: control effect, hindi makagamit ng espesyal na kasanayan). Kung ang target ay na-paralyze, ang baterya ay mag-o-overload, direktang nagiging sanhi na ang target ay maging [Stunned] sa loob ng 1 round (Stun: control effect, hindi makagalaw).',
		describe_ma = 'Thunder God Zombie memanggil kilat dan melekatkan tukul kilat untuk menyerang sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#160% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# kerosakan sihir kerosakan sihir #C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 100% untuk [Melumpuhkan] sasaran selama 1 giliran (Melumpuhkan: kesan kawalan, tidak dapat menggunakan kemahiran khas). Jika sasaran dilumpuhkan, bateri akan mengalami beban berlebihan, terus menyebabkan sasaran [Terkejut] selama 1 pusingan (Terkejut: kesan kawalan, tidak dapat bergerak).',
		describe = 'Thunder God Zombie summons thunder and attaches a thunder hammer to attack an enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#160% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# magic Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, 100% chance to [Paralyze] the target for 1 turn (Paralyze: control effect, cannot use special skills). If the target is paralyzed, the battery will overload, directly causing the target to be [Stunned] for 1 round (Stun: control effect, cannot move).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Thunder God Zombie triệu tập sấm sét và gắn búa sấm sét để tấn công một mục tiêu kẻ thù.',
		simDesc_en = 'Thunder God Zombie summons thunder and wields the thunder hammer to attack an enemy target.',
		simDesc_th = 'ซอมบี้เทพเจ้าสายฟ้าทรงอำนาจเรียกสายฟ้าและถือค้อนสายฟ้าเพื่อโจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรู',
