		zawakeEffectDesc = 'In battle, Thor Zombie improves its own damage reduction ability by #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B#. When a hero with <Electric> attacks Thor Zombie, the damage is further reduced by 15% and 30% of the Magic Attack of Thunder Zombie is restored.',
