		skillName = 'Chord energy',
		describe_vn = 'Hatsune Miku tung ra một hợp âm năng lượng siêu năng lực tấn công mục tiêu ở hàng đầu của kẻ địch, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#160% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Phép Thuật #C0x5B545B#, tăng tỷ lệ không khống chế và tỷ lệ kháng hiệu ứng tiêu cực của bản thân thêm 30% (2 lượt); xóa bỏ trạng thái kiểm soát ngẫu nhiên trên một mục tiêu ngẫu nhiên không phải là bạn. Nếu mục tiêu không có trạng thái điều khiển, hãy tăng tỷ lệ không bị điều khiển thêm 15% (2 lượt)',
		describe_en = 'Hatsune Miku unleashes a superpower energy chord to attack the frontline enemy, dealing #C0x3D8A99#160% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, increases her own control resistance and negative effect resistance by 30% for 2 turns; removes a random control status from a random enemy target that is not an ally. If the target has no control status, increases control resistance by 15% for 2 turns.',
		describe_th = 'Hatsune Miku ปล่อยเสียงฮาร์โมนีพลังพิเศษเพื่อโจมตีศัตรูแถวหน้า ก่อให้เกิด #C0x3D8A99#ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ 160%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x5B545B#, เพิ่มอัตราต้านการควบคุมและอัตราต้านผลลบของตนเองขึ้น 30% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น; ลบสถานะควบคุมแบบสุ่มจากเป้าหมายศัตรูแบบสุ่มที่ไม่ใช่พันธมิตร ถ้าเป้าหมายไม่มีสถานะควบคุม จะเพิ่มอัตราต้านการควบคุมขึ้น 15% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Hatsune Miku melepaskan akord energi superpower untuk menyerang musuh di garis depan, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#160% Kerusakan Magis#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Magis #C0x5B545B#, meningkatkan peluang ketahanan kontrol dan ketahanan efek negatif dirinya sendiri sebesar 30% selama 2 giliran; menghapus status kontrol acak dari satu target musuh acak yang bukan sekutu. Jika target tidak memiliki status kontrol, tingkatkan ketahanan kontrol sebesar 15% selama 2 giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Inilalabas ni Hatsune Miku ang isang superpower energy chord upang atakihin ang nangungunang target sa hanay ng kalaban, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#160% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, pinapataas ang sariling rate ng control resistance at negative effect resistance ng 30% sa loob ng 2 turn; inaalis ang random control status mula sa isang random na kalaban na target na hindi kasama sa kaalyado. Kung walang control status ang target, taasan ang control resistance rate ng 15% sa loob ng 2 turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Hatsune Miku melepaskan kord tenaga kuasa super untuk menyerang musuh barisan hadapan, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#160% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, meningkatkan kadar penentangan kawalan dan kadar penentangan kesan negatif dirinya sendiri sebanyak 30% selama 2 pusingan; membuang status kawalan rawak dari satu sasaran musuh rawak yang bukan sekutu. Jika sasaran tidak mempunyai status kawalan, tingkatkan kadar penentangan kawalan sebanyak 15% selama 2 pusingan.',
		describe = 'Hatsune Miku unleashes a superpower energy chord to attack the frontline enemy, dealing #C0x3D8A99#160% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B#, increases her own control resistance and negative effect resistance by 30% for 2 turns; removes a random control status from a random enemy target that is not an ally. If the target has no control status, increases control resistance by 15% for 2 turns.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Hatsune Miku tung ra một hợp âm năng lượng siêu năng lực để tấn công một mục tiêu kẻ thù.',
