		describe_en = 'Lugia aggressively rushes at an enemy target, summoning a whirlwind attack that deals #C0x3D8A99#100% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54# Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#, and increases its own magical defense by 80%, lasting for 2 turns.',
