		skillName_in = 'Api Suci',
		skillName_ph = 'Banal na Apoy',
		skillName_ma = 'Api Suci',
		skillName = 'Sacred Fire',
		describe_vn = 'Phượng Hoàng Vương sẽ trút ra những đợt sóng lửa thiêu đốt tập trung ở các cánh, tấn công các mục tiêu địch liên tiếp, gây #C0xE69900#160% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$# C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, tăng sức Sát Thương Vật Lý của bản thân thêm 20% trong 2 lượt và thêm một lớp [Holy Fire] Đốt] vào mục tiêu trong 2 lượt; sau đó thêm [Holy Fire Barrier] cho bản thân trong 2 lượt\n#F20# \n#F40#[Holy Fire Barrier]: Khi một đơn vị có [Holy Fire Barrier] tấn công chính nó, sát thương giảm 15% (sát thương giảm 20% sau khi hồi sinh)',
		describe_en = 'Phoenix King will unleash concentrated waves of burning fire on the wings, continuously attacking enemy targets, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$# C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increasing its own Physical Damage by 20% for 2 turns and applying a layer of [Holy Fire Burn] on the target for 2 turns; then adds [Holy Fire Barrier] to itself for 2 turns. [Holy Fire Barrier]: When a unit with [Holy Fire Barrier] attacks itself, damage is reduced by 15% (damage is reduced by 20% after revival).',
		describe_th = 'ราชาฟีนิกซ์จะปลดปล่อยคลื่นไฟลุกโชนที่เข้มข้นบริเวณปีก โจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรูอย่างต่อเนื่อง สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#160%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$# C0xF13B54#ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# เพิ่มความเสียหายทางกายภาพของตนเองขึ้น 20% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น และเพิ่มชั้น [Holy Fire Burn] ให้เป้าหมายเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น; จากนั้นเพิ่ม [Holy Fire Barrier] ให้ตนเองเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น [Holy Fire Barrier]: เมื่อยูนิตที่มี [Holy Fire Barrier] โจมตีตัวเอง ความเสียหายจะลดลง 15% (ความเสียหายลดลง 20% หลังการฟื้นคืนชีพ).',
		describe_in = 'Raja Phoenix akan melepaskan gelombang api terbakar yang terkonsentrasi di sayap, menyerang target musuh secara beruntun, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#160% Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$# C0xF13B54#Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, meningkatkan Kerusakan Fisik dirinya sendiri sebesar 20% selama 2 giliran dan menambahkan satu lapis [Holy Fire Burn] pada target selama 2 giliran; kemudian menambahkan [Holy Fire Barrier] pada dirinya sendiri selama 2 giliran. [Holy Fire Barrier]: Ketika unit yang memiliki [Holy Fire Barrier] menyerang dirinya sendiri, kerusakan dikurangi 15% (kerusakan dikurangi 20% setelah kebangkitan).',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Hari ng Phoenix ay magpapalabas ng mga alon ng apoy na nakatuon sa mga pakpak, patuloy na inaatake ang mga target ng kaaway, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#160% Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$# C0xF13B54#Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#, pinapataas ang sariling Pisikal na Pinsala ng 20% sa loob ng 2 turn at nagdaragdag ng isang layer ng [Holy Fire Burn] sa target sa loob ng 2 turn; pagkatapos ay idinadagdag ang [Holy Fire Barrier] sa sarili sa loob ng 2 turn. [Holy Fire Barrier]: Kapag ang isang yunit na may [Holy Fire Barrier] ay inaatake ang sarili nito, ang pinsala ay nababawasan ng 15% (ang pinsala ay nababawasan ng 20% pagkatapos mabuhay muli).',
		describe_ma = 'Raja Phoenix akan melepaskan gelombang api terbakar yang tertumpu di bahagian sayap, menyerang sasaran musuh secara berterusan, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#160% Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$# C0xF13B54#Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, meningkatkan Kerosakan Fizikal diri sendiri sebanyak 20% selama 2 giliran dan menambah satu lapisan [Holy Fire Burn] pada sasaran selama 2 giliran; kemudian menambah [Holy Fire Barrier] untuk diri sendiri selama 2 giliran. [Holy Fire Barrier]: Apabila unit yang mempunyai [Holy Fire Barrier] menyerang dirinya sendiri, kerosakan dikurangkan sebanyak 15% (kerosakan dikurangkan 20% selepas kebangkitan).',
		describe = 'Phoenix King will unleash concentrated waves of burning fire on the wings, continuously attacking enemy targets, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$# C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increasing its own Physical Damage by 20% for 2 turns and applying a layer of [Holy Fire Burn] on the target for 2 turns; then adds [Holy Fire Barrier] to itself for 2 turns. [Holy Fire Barrier]: When a unit with [Holy Fire Barrier] attacks itself, damage is reduced by 15% (damage is reduced by 20% after revival).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Phượng Hoàng Vương trút ra những làn sóng lửa thiêu đốt tập trung trong đôi cánh của mình để tấn công liên tiếp các mục tiêu của kẻ địch.',
		simDesc_en = 'The Phoenix King unleashes waves of burning flames concentrated in his wings to relentlessly attack the enemy\'s targets.',
