		describe_en = 'Kappa Lạc Thiên sways the shaking tree in the water, happily singing, swinging leaves to wrap around a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#130% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ Magic Damage#C0xF13B54# and healing the ally with the lowest current HP for 60% of Kappa Lạc Thiên\'s Magic Power.',
