		describe_en = 'Ralts uses spiritual energy to control rocks thrown at the enemy\'s back row, dealing #C0x3D8A99#190% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*42)$ Magic Damage#C0xF13B54#, preventing the target from receiving beneficial effects for 2 turns and has a 25% chance to [Charm] the back row target for 1 turn.',
