		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Shanaido dances according to the lantern, then shoots magical bullets to attack the back row targets, causing #C0x3D8A99#210% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*42)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, making the targets unable to receive beneficial effects for 2 turns, and has a 40% chance to <charm> the back row targets for 1 turn',
