		skillName = 'Dark whirlwind',
		describe_vn = 'Ngọn lửa của con quỷ cầm lưỡi hái tử thần và tấn công các mục tiêu hàng của kẻ thù, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#220% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#, tăng vĩnh viễn xác suất [Bùa chú] lên 5% và thêm [Yêu thích] vào mục tiêu trong 2 lượt (mục tiêu giảm 20% khả năng miễn nhiễm khống chế và giảm 30% khả năng phòng thủ kép khi bị anh hùng bóng tối tấn công)',
		describe_en = 'The flame of the demon wields the Grim Reaper\'s scythe and attacks the enemy\'s frontline targets, dealing #C0x3D8A99#220% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#. Permanently increases the chance of [Charm] by 5% and applies [Favor] to the target for 2 turns (the target\'s control immunity is reduced by 20% and dual defense is reduced by 30% when attacked by the dark hero).',
		describe_th = 'เปลวไฟของปีศาจถือเคียวแห่งยมทูตและโจมตีเป้าหมายแนวหน้าของศัตรู สร้างความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x3D8A99#220%#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# เพิ่มโอกาส [มนต์สะกด] แบบถาวรขึ้น 5% และเพิ่ม [ความโปรดปราน] ให้เป้าหมายเป็นเวลา 2 ตา (เป้าหมายจะลดความต้านทานการควบคุมลง 20% และลดการป้องกันคู่ลง 30% เมื่อถูกฮีโร่มืดโจมตี)',
		describe_in = 'Api iblis yang memegang sabit kematian menyerang target barisan depan musuh, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#220% Kerusakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Kerusakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#. Meningkatkan kemungkinan [Mantra] secara permanen sebesar 5% dan menambahkan [Favor] ke target selama 2 giliran (target mengurangi 20% ketahanan terhadap kontrol dan mengurangi 30% pertahanan ganda saat diserang oleh pahlawan kegelapan).',
		describe_ph = 'Ang apoy ng demonyo na may hawak na karit ng kamatayan ay umaatake sa mga target na nasa unahang hanay ng kalaban, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#220% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#. Permanently pinapataas ang tsansa ng [Charm] ng 5% at inilalapat ang [Favor] sa target sa loob ng 2 turn (ang target ay bumababa ang immunity sa control ng 20% at bumababa ng 30% ang dual defense kapag inatake ng madilim na bayani).',
		describe_ma = 'Api iblis yang memegang sabit maut menyerang sasaran barisan hadapan musuh, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#220% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#. Meningkatkan peluang [Mantera] secara kekal sebanyak 5% dan menambah [Kegemaran] pada sasaran selama 2 pusingan (sasaran mengurangkan 20% imun kawalan dan mengurangkan 30% pertahanan berganda apabila diserang oleh wira gelap).',
		describe = 'The flame of the demon wields the Grim Reaper\'s scythe and attacks the enemy\'s frontline targets, dealing #C0x3D8A99#220% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#. Permanently increases the chance of [Charm] by 5% and applies [Favor] to the target for 2 turns (the target\'s control immunity is reduced by 20% and dual defense is reduced by 30% when attacked by the dark hero).',
