		skillName = 'The Scythe of the Demon #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		describe_vn = 'Ngọn lửa của con quỷ vung lưỡi hái tử thần tới một mục tiêu kẻ thù, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#200% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B 54#Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#, 20% xác suất [Quyến rũ] mục tiêu trong 1 lượt (Bùa chú: hiệu ứng khống chế, buộc sử dụng các đòn tấn công cơ bản để tấn công đồng minh), khi máu của bản thân thấp hơn 50%, xác suất quyến rũ lần này tăng lên 40%',
		describe_en = 'The demon\'s flame swings the grim reaper\'s scythe at an enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#200% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B 54#Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#. 20% chance to [Charm] the target for 1 turn (Charm: control effect forcing the target to use basic attacks to attack allies). When the user\'s HP is below 50%, the charm chance increases to 40%.',
		describe_th = 'เปลวไฟของปีศาจฟันเคียวยมฑูตไปยังเป้าหมายศัตรู ก่อให้เกิด #C0x3D8A99#ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ 200%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B 54#ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# โอกาส 20% ที่จะ [เสน่ห์] เป้าหมายเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (เสน่ห์: เอฟเฟกต์ควบคุม ทำให้ใช้การโจมตีพื้นฐานโจมตีพันธมิตรแทน) เมื่อพลังชีวิตของตนเองต่ำกว่า 50% โอกาสเสน่ห์เพิ่มเป็น 40%',
		describe_in = 'Api iblis mengayunkan sabit maut ke musuh sasaran, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#200% Kerusakan Magis#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B 54#Kerusakan Magis#C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 20% untuk [Mempesona] target selama 1 giliran (Mantra: efek kontrol, memaksa menggunakan serangan dasar untuk menyerang sekutu). Ketika HP pengguna kurang dari 50%, peluang pesona meningkat menjadi 40%.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang apoy ng demonyo ay nagwagayway ng liit ng kamatayan sa isang kaaway na target, nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#200% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B 54#Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#, 20% pagkakataon na [Mang-akit] sa target sa loob ng 1 turn (Spell: control effect na pumipilit gamitin ang mga basic attacks para salakayin ang mga kakampi). Kapag ang HP ng sarili ay mas mababa sa 50%, tumataas ang pagkakataon ng pang-akit sa 40%.',
		describe_ma = 'Api iblis mengayunkan sabit maut ke sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#200% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B 54#Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#, peluang 20% untuk [Mempesonakan] sasaran selama 1 giliran (Mantera: kesan kawalan yang memaksa menggunakan serangan asas untuk menyerang sekutu). Apabila darah sendiri kurang daripada 50%, peluang mempesonakan bertambah menjadi 40%.',
		describe = 'The demon\'s flame swings the grim reaper\'s scythe at an enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#200% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B 54#Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#. 20% chance to [Charm] the target for 1 turn (Charm: control effect forcing the target to use basic attacks to attack allies). When the user\'s HP is below 50%, the charm chance increases to 40%.',
		zawakeSimpleDesc = '30% chance to charm the target for 1 turn',
