		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Saitama delivered a critical punch, knocking away a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#980% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, this damage ignores 30% of the target\'s physical defense, after attacking self enters <Sleep> for one turn (Sleep: special effect, cannot be awakened or removed, if attacked during sleep restores 100 rage).',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Saitama delivered a critical punch, knocking away a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#980% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, this damage ignores 30% of the target\'s physical defense, after attacking self enters <Sleep> for one turn (Sleep: special effect, cannot be awakened or removed, if attacked during sleep restores 100 rage).',
