		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Hầu Bạo Đạn emits a noise attacking a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#140% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, the enemy is mentally disturbed, <vulnerable> for 3 turns (vulnerable: negative effect, receives 20% more damage)',
