		skillName = 'Firecracker sound',
		describe_vn = 'Bạo Âm Quái đắm chìm trong tiếng hát của mình, phát ra tiếng ồn tấn công tất cả mục tiêu trên sân (không phân biệt địch ta, sát thương nhận bởi đồng minh giảm 30%), gây ra #C0xE69900#200% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, số lượng mục tiêu bị tấn công càng nhiều sát thương càng cao, tối đa có thể tăng thêm 60%',
		describe_en = 'Violent Sound Beast immerses itself in its own singing, creating noise that attacks all targets on the field (regardless of friend or foe, damage received by allies is reduced by 30%), dealing #C0xE69900#200% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. The more targets attacked, the higher the damage, with a maximum damage increase of 60%.',
		describe_th = 'โจรเสียงโหดดื่มด่ำกับเสียงร้องของตัวเอง ส่งเสียงโจมตีเป้าหมายทั้งหมดในสนาม (ไม่แบ่งแยกศัตรูหรือพันธมิตร ความเสียหายที่พันธมิตรได้รับจะลดลง 30%) สร้างความเสียหาย #C0xE69900#200% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# จำนวนเป้าหมายที่ถูกโจมตียิ่งมาก ความเสียหายจะยิ่งสูงขึ้น สูงสุดเพิ่มได้ 60%',
		describe_in = 'Bunyi Keras Binatang Tenggelam dalam nyanyiannya sendiri, mengeluarkan suara yang menyerang semua target di lapangan (tidak membedakan musuh atau sekutu, kerusakan yang diterima sekutu berkurang 30%), menyebabkan #C0xE69900#200% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#. Semakin banyak target yang diserang, semakin tinggi kerusakannya, maksimal bisa meningkat hingga 60%.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Walang-hanggang Lakas na Halimaw ay nilulubog sa sariling awit, nagpapalabas ng ingay na umaatake sa lahat ng mga target sa campo (hindi pinaghihiwalay ang kaaway o kaalyado, ang pinsalang natatanggap ng mga kaalyado ay binabawasan ng 30%), nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#200% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#. Mas maraming target ang inaatake, mas mataas ang pinsala, maximum na pagtaas ng 60%.',
		describe_ma = 'Haiwan Bunyi Keras tenggelam dalam nyanyiannya sendiri, menghasilkan bunyi yang menyerang semua sasaran di medan (tidak mengira musuh atau rakan, kerosakan yang diterima oleh rakan dikurangkan sebanyak 30%), menyebabkan #C0xE69900#200% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#. Semakin banyak sasaran diserang, semakin tinggi kerosakannya, maksimum boleh meningkat sehingga 60%.',
		describe = 'Violent Sound Beast immerses itself in its own singing, creating noise that attacks all targets on the field (regardless of friend or foe, damage received by allies is reduced by 30%), dealing #C0xE69900#200% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. The more targets attacked, the higher the damage, with a maximum damage increase of 60%.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Quái Âm say mê với giọng hát của mình, phát ra tiếng ồn tấn công tất cả mục tiêu trên sân, số lượng mục tiêu bị đánh trúng càng nhiều thì sát thương càng cao.',
		simDesc_en = 'The Monster Spirit is enchanted by its own singing voice, emitting a noise that attacks all targets on the field; the more targets hit, the higher the damage.',
		simDesc_th = 'ปีศาจเสียงดนตรีหลงใหลในเสียงร้องของตนเอง ส่งเสียงดังโจมตีเป้าหมายทั้งหมดบนสนาม ยิ่งโดนเป้าหมายมากเท่าไร ความเสียหายก็ยิ่งสูงขึ้นเท่านั้น',
