		-- {79003}
		zawakeEffectDesc = 'The wandering night soul transforms into a ghost at night to attack the enemy\'s front row target, causing #C0xE69900#230% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54# and has a 50% chance (80% for the main target) to pull the target into <Black Hole> for 1 turn (<Black Hole>: control effect, unable to act, cannot be selected or attacked)',
