		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Snow Fairy steps on a large snowball and throws a small snowball at a single enemy target, dealing 140% Magic Power + skillLevel*4*24 Magic Damage, and grants herself an ice shield that can absorb 250% defense (the higher defense type among the two) for 3 turns.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Snow Fairy steps on a large snowball and throws a small snowball at a single enemy target, dealing 140% Magic Power + skillLevel*4*24 Magic Damage, and grants herself an ice shield that can absorb 250% defense (the higher defense type among the two) for 3 turns.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'หิมะนางฟ้าวางเท้าบนลูกบอลหิมะใหญ่แล้วขว้างลูกบอลหิมะเล็กไปยังเป้าหมายศัตรูเดี่ยว สร้างความเสียหายเวท 140% + skillLevel*4*24 และมอบโล่เย็นที่สามารถดูดซับ #F 250% #L  phòng thủ (ประเภทการป้องกันที่สูงกว่าในสองประเภท) เป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์น ให้กับตัวเอง',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Snow Fairy menginjak bola salju besar dan melempar bola salju kecil ke target musuh tunggal, memberikan 140% Kekuatan Sihir + skillLevel*4*24 Kerusakan Sihir, dan memberikan diri sendiri perisai es yang dapat menyerap 250% pertahanan (jenis pertahanan tertinggi di antara dua jenis pertahanan) selama 3 giliran.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Snow Fairy ay nagpadyak sa malaking snowball at bumato ng maliit na snowball sa isang solong target na kaaway, nagdudulot ng 140% Magic Power + skillLevel*4*24 Magic Damage, at nagbibigay sa sarili ng isang ice shield na maaaring sumipsip ng 250% depensa (ang mas mataas na uri ng depensa sa dalawang uri) sa loob ng 3 turn.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Snow Fairy menginjak bola salji besar dan melempar bola salji kecil ke sasaran musuh tunggal, menyebabkan 140% Kuasa Sihir + skillLevel*4*24 Kerosakan Sihir, dan memberikan dirinya pelindung ais yang boleh menyerap 250% pertahanan (jenis pertahanan tertinggi antara dua jenis pertahanan) selama 3 pusingan.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Tuyết Đồng Tử giẫm lên quả cầu tuyết lớn ném quả cầu tuyết nhỏ vào mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ địch, gây 140% Công Phép + skillLevel*4*24 Sát Thương Phép Thuật, và thêm cho bản thân một lá chắn băng có thể hấp thụ 250% phòng thủ (loại phòng thủ cao hơn trong hai loại phòng thủ) trong 3 lượt.',
