		describe_vn = 'Trước mỗi lượt bắt đầu, một thuộc tính trong sáu thuộc tính của bản thân sẽ ngẫu nhiên tăng vĩnh viễn#C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#, một thuộc tính khác giảm vĩnh viễn 15% (cả hai đều không thể bị xóa).',
		describe_en = 'Before each turn begins, one of your six attributes will permanently increase by #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)#%, and another attribute will permanently decrease by 15% (neither can be removed).',
		describe_th = 'ก่อนที่แต่ละรอบจะเริ่มต้น คุณสมบัติหนึ่งในหกคุณสมบัติของตัวเองจะเพิ่มขึ้นอย่างถาวร #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)#% และคุณสมบัติอีกหนึ่งอย่างจะลดลงอย่างถาวร 15% (ทั้งสองอย่างไม่สามารถถูกลบออกได้)',
		describe_in = 'Sebelum setiap giliran dimulai, satu dari enam atribut Anda akan meningkat secara permanen sebesar #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)#%, dan atribut lain akan menurun secara permanen sebesar 15% (keduanya tidak dapat dihapus).',
		describe_ph = 'Bago magsimula ang bawat turn, ang isa sa anim na attributes mo ay permanenteng tataas ng #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)#%, at ang isa pang attribute ay permanenteng bababa ng 15% (hindi maaaring alisin ang pareho).',
		describe_ma = 'Sebelum setiap pusingan bermula, satu daripada enam atribut anda akan meningkat secara kekal sebanyak #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)#%, dan satu lagi atribut akan berkurang secara kekal sebanyak 15% (kedua-duanya tidak boleh dipadamkan).',
