		describe_en = 'When attacking, an additional effect [Torn] is applied (Torn: Negative effect, the target is forbidden from healing, and when attacked will receive true damage equal to #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# of Dragon Treasure\'s Physical Attack, lasting 2 turns, stacking up to 3 layers).',
