		describe_vn = 'Superman Zombie khóa mục tiêu duy nhất của kẻ địch có phần trăm máu thấp nhất, nhảy lên và sử dụng Superman Shock, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#540% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#, cộng thêm sát thương 20% trên tổng số lá chắn mà bản thân và đồng đội hiện đang tích lũy (cả bản thân và đồng đội) các bổ sung được ghi lại và tổng số được tích lũy trong trò chơi)',
		describe_en = 'Superman Zombie locks onto the enemy target with the lowest HP percentage, jumps up and uses Superman Shock, dealing #C0x3D8A99#540% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54#Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#, plus an additional 20% damage based on the total shields currently accumulated by both himself and teammates (both self and teammates\' buffs are recorded and accumulated throughout the game).',
		describe_th = 'Superman Zombie ล็อกเป้าหมายศัตรูที่มีเปอร์เซ็นต์ HP ต่ำที่สุด กระโดดขึ้นและใช้ Superman Shock สร้างความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x3D8A99#540%#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54#ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# เพิ่มความเสียหายอีก 20% จากโล่รวมที่สะสมโดยตัวเองและทีม (บัพของตัวเองและทีมจะถูกบันทึกและสะสมในเกม)',
