		describe_ph = 'Inaangat ni Aqua ang kanyang tungkod, lumilikha ng alon na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54# Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# sa isang kaaway at nag-aalis ng dalawang negatibong epekto at crowd control na epekto nang random mula sa isang kakampi (nag-aalis ng kabuuang dalawang epekto, inuuna ang target na kontrolado).',
		describe_ma = 'Aqua melambai batang tongkatnya, menghasilkan gelombang yang menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#150% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# kepada satu musuh dan membuang dua kesan negatif dan kesan kawalan secara rawak daripada wira sekutu (membuang dua kesan jumlah, mengutamakan sasaran yang sedang dikawal).',
		describe = 'Aqua waves her scepter, creating a wave that deals #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0xF13B54# Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# to a single enemy target and removes two negative effects and crowd control effects randomly from an allied hero (removing a total of two effects, prioritizing targets currently controlled).',
