		skillName_ma = 'Sumber ayunan',
		skillName = 'Source of oscillation',
		describe_vn = '#C0xC0C0C0#Gọi gió gọi mưa, mở rộng vùng biển#C0x5B545B#\n#F20#\n#F40# Triệu hồi một cơn sóng dữ dội. Làn sóng cuồng nộ sẽ nảy lên 6 lần giữa các mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ địch. Lần nảy đầu tiên sẽ gây ra #C0x3D8A99#330% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+ $(skillLevel*4*24)$\'s #C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B# (hai mục tiêu phóng liên tiếp khác nhau, nó sẽ không phóng ra khi chỉ có một mục tiêu trên sân và sát thương sẽ tăng 100% khi chơi đơn chiến đấu). Mỗi lần phóng làm giảm tốc độ của nó đi 10% và thêm 8% nước. Dễ bị tổn thương (tối đa 5 lớp) trong 2 lượt\n#F20#\n#F40#Mục tiêu bị đẩy ra sẽ bị giảm sát thương thêm 20% trong 2 lượt (không thể cộng dồn). Khi kẻ địch bị đẩy ra, có 50% khả năng khiến kẻ địch bị nhầm lẫn trong 1 lượt\n#F20#\n#F40#Kẻ địch bị đẩy ra hai lần sẽ bị mắc kẹt trong [Nhà tù Nước] trong 1 lượt (Khi có [Mưa Mưa], [Nhà tù Nước] lượt +1), [Nhà tù Nước]: không thể hành động và sẽ ngẫu nhiên tham gia vào một đơn vị xung quanh mục tiêu không nằm trong [Nhà tù Nước] để cùng chịu sát thương. Anh hùng nước của bạn sẽ được ưu tiên tấn công mục tiêu trong [Tù Nước]. [Tù Nước] sẽ bị sát thương sau khi lấy đi tổng cộng 65% máu của mục tiêu. Mỗi chiêu thức đặc biệt có thể kích hoạt tối đa 2 [Tù Nước]',
		describe_en = 'Calling wind and rain, expanding the sea area. Summon a fierce wave. The raging wave will bounce 6 times between single enemy targets. The first bounce deals 330% Magic Damage + $(skillLevel*4*24)$\'s Magic Damage (two different consecutive targets, will not bounce if only one target on the field, damage increases by 100% in solo play). Each bounce reduces its speed by 10% and adds 8% water. Vulnerable (up to 5 layers) for 2 turns. Targets pushed will take an additional 20% damage reduction for 2 turns (cannot stack). When enemies are pushed, there is a 50% chance to confuse them for 1 turn. Enemies pushed twice will be trapped in the [Water Prison] for 1 turn (with [Rain Rain], [Water Prison] turn +1). [Water Prison]: unable to act and will randomly join a unit around the target not in [Water Prison] to share damage. Your water heroes will prioritize attacking targets in [Water Prison]. [Water Prison] will be destroyed after dealing a total of 65% of the target\'s HP as damage. Each special skill can trigger up to 2 [Water Prisons].',
		describe_th = 'เรียกลมเรียกฝน ขยายเขตทะเล เรียกคลื่นรุนแรง คลื่นดุร้ายจะเด้ง 6 ครั้งระหว่างเป้าหมายศัตรูเดี่ยว การเด้งครั้งแรกจะสร้างความเสียหายเวท 330% + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ ความเสียหายเวท (จะยิงไปยังเป้าหมายสองตัวที่แตกต่างกันติดต่อกัน ไม่ยิงถ้ามีเป้าหมายแค่ตัวเดียวในสนาม และ ความเสียหายจะเพิ่มขึ้น 100% เมื่อเล่นคนเดียว) แต่ละครั้งลดความเร็วลง 10% และเพิ่มน้ำ 8% อ่อนแอต่อการถูกโจมตี (สูงสุด 5 ชั้น) เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น เป้าหมายที่ถูกผลักจะได้รับลดความเสียหายเพิ่มอีก 20% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (ไม่สามารถเพิ่มซ้อนกันได้) เมื่อตัวศัตรูถูกผลัก มีโอกาส 50% ทำให้สับสนเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น ศัตรูที่ถูกผลักสองครั้งจะถูกขังใน [คุกน้ำ] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (ถ้ามี [ฝนฝน] [คุกน้ำ] เพิ่มอีก 1 เทิร์น) [คุกน้ำ]: ไม่สามารถกระทำการได้ และจะสุ่มเข้าร่วมกับหน่วยรอบเป้าหมายที่ไม่ใช่ [คุกน้ำ] เพื่อรับความเสียหายร่วมกัน ฮีโร่น้ำของคุณจะโจมตีเป้าหมายใน [คุกน้ำ] เป็นลำดับแรก [คุกน้ำ] ถูกทำลายหลังจากได้รับความเสียหายรวม 65% ของพลังชีวิตเป้าหมาย ทักษะพิเศษแต่ละท่าเปิดใช้งาน [คุกน้ำ] ได้สูงสุด 2 ครั้ง',
		describe_in = 'Memanggil angin dan hujan, memperluas wilayah laut. Memanggil gelombang ganas. Gelombang yang mengamuk akan memantul 6 kali di antara target musuh tunggal. Pantulan pertama menyebabkan 330% Kerusakan Sihir + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ Kerusakan Sihir (dua target berbeda berturut-turut, tidak akan memantul jika hanya ada satu target di medan dan kerusakan meningkat 100% saat bermain solo). Setiap pantulan mengurangi kecepatan sebesar 10% dan menambahkan 8% air. Rentan (maksimal 5 lapisan) selama 2 giliran. Target yang terdorong akan mengalami pengurangan kerusakan tambahan sebesar 20% selama 2 giliran (tidak dapat bertumpuk). Ketika musuh terdorong, ada kemungkinan 50% menyebabkan kebingungan selama 1 giliran. Musuh yang terdorong dua kali akan terperangkap dalam [Penjara Air] selama 1 giliran (dengan [Hujan Hujan], giliran [Penjara Air] +1). [Penjara Air]: tidak dapat bertindak dan akan bergabung secara acak dengan unit di sekitar target yang tidak dalam [Penjara Air] untuk menerima kerusakan bersama. Pahlawan air Anda akan memprioritaskan menyerang target dalam [Penjara Air]. [Penjara Air] akan hancur setelah menerima total 65% HP target sebagai kerusakan. Setiap skill khusus dapat memicu hingga 2 [Penjara Air].',
		describe_ph = 'Tumawag ng hangin at ulan, pinalalawak ang dagat. Nagpatawag ng isang malakas na alon. Ang umaaliong alon ay tatambal nang 6 na beses sa pagitan ng mga solong target ng kalaban. Ang unang tappak ay gagawa ng 330% Magic Damage + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ Magic Damage (dalawang magkaibang sunod-sunod na target, hindi magtatalbog kung iisa lamang ang target sa larangan at tumataas ng 100% ang pinsala kapag naglalaro nang solo). Bawat tâmbal ay nagpapababa ng bilis nito ng 10% at nagdadagdag ng 8% tubig. Madaling masugatan (hanggang 5 layers) sa loob ng 2 turn. Ang mga target na itinulak ay magkakaroon ng karagdagang 20% bawas sa pinsala sa loob ng 2 turn (hindi maaaring mag-stacking). Kapag ang mga kalaban ay naitulak, may 50% tsansa silang malito sa loob ng 1 turn. Ang mga kalabang na naitulak nang dalawang beses ay maikukulong sa [Water Prison] sa loob ng 1 turn (kapag may [Rain Rain], ang [Water Prison] ay tumatagal ng +1 turn). [Water Prison]: hindi makakilos at kusang sasali sa isang yunit sa paligid ng target na hindi kabilang sa [Water Prison] upang magsalo ng pinsala. Ang iyong mga water heroes ay prayoridad na umatake sa mga target sa [Water Prison]. Ang [Water Prison] ay mawawasak pagkatapos matanggap ang kabuuang 65% ng HP ng target bilang pinsala. Bawat espesyal na kasanayan ay maaaring mag-trigger ng hanggang 2 [Water Prison].',
		describe_ma = 'Memanggil angin dan hujan, meluaskan kawasan laut. Menyeru gelombang ganas. Gelombang marah akan memantul 6 kali antara sasaran musuh tunggal. Pantulan pertama menyebabkan 330% Kerosakan Sihir + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ Kerosakan Sihir (dua sasaran berbeza berturut-turut, tidak akan memantul jika hanya ada satu sasaran di medan dan kerosakan meningkat 100% ketika bermain solo). Setiap pantulan mengurangkan kelajuan sebanyak 10% dan menambah 8% air. Mudah terdedah (maksimum 5 lapisan) selama 2 giliran. Sasaran yang didorong akan menerima pengurangan kerosakan tambahan sebanyak 20% selama 2 giliran (tidak boleh bertindih). Apabila musuh didorong, ada kemungkinan 50% menyebabkan kekeliruan selama 1 giliran. Musuh yang didorong dua kali akan terperangkap dalam [Penjara Air] selama 1 giliran (dengan [Hujan Hujan], giliran [Penjara Air] +1). [Penjara Air]: tidak boleh bertindak dan akan secara rawak bersatu dengan unit di sekitar sasaran yang tidak berada dalam [Penjara Air] untuk menerima kerosakan bersama. Wira air anda akan mengutamakan menyerang sasaran dalam [Penjara Air]. [Penjara Air] akan hancur selepas menerima jumlah kerosakan sebanyak 65% HP sasaran. Setiap kemahiran khas boleh mengaktifkan sehingga 2 [Penjara Air].',
		describe = 'Calling wind and rain, expanding the sea area. Summon a fierce wave. The raging wave will bounce 6 times between single enemy targets. The first bounce deals 330% Magic Damage + $(skillLevel*4*24)$\'s Magic Damage (two different consecutive targets, will not bounce if only one target on the field, damage increases by 100% in solo play). Each bounce reduces its speed by 10% and adds 8% water. Vulnerable (up to 5 layers) for 2 turns. Targets pushed will take an additional 20% damage reduction for 2 turns (cannot stack). When enemies are pushed, there is a 50% chance to confuse them for 1 turn. Enemies pushed twice will be trapped in the [Water Prison] for 1 turn (with [Rain Rain], [Water Prison] turn +1). [Water Prison]: unable to act and will randomly join a unit around the target not in [Water Prison] to share damage. Your water heroes will prioritize attacking targets in [Water Prison]. [Water Prison] will be destroyed after dealing a total of 65% of the target\'s HP as damage. Each special skill can trigger up to 2 [Water Prisons].',
		simDesc_vn = '#C0xC0C0C0# Kêu gọi gió mưa, mở rộng vùng biển #C0x5B545B##F20##F40# Triệu hồi một làn sóng khổng lồ cuồng nộ. Làn sóng cuồng nộ sẽ nảy lên 6 lần giữa các mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ địch. Mỗi lần nảy sẽ gây sát thương phép, và mỗi lần nảy sẽ giảm tốc độ của nó cũng đi kèm với khả năng dễ bị tổn thương về nước. #F20##F40# Mục tiêu bị đẩy ra sẽ bị giảm sát thương cộng thêm. Khi kẻ địch bị đẩy ra với tốc độ ngẫu nhiên, có khả năng gây nhầm lẫn. #F20##F40# Kẻ địch bị đẩy ra hai lần sẽ bị mắc kẹt trong [Tù Nước]',
		simDesc_en = 'Summon wind and rain, expand the seas. Summon a raging gigantic wave. The furious wave will bounce 6 times among single enemy targets. Each bounce deals magic damage, and each bounce reduces their speed along with increasing vulnerability to water. Targets pushed out will suffer reduced bonus damage. When enemies are pushed out at random speeds, there is a chance to cause confusion. Enemies pushed out twice will be trapped in <Water Prison>.',
		simDesc_th = 'เรียกลมและฝน ขยายพื้นที่ทะเล เรียกคลื่นลูกใหญ่ที่ดุร้าย คลื่นดุร้ายจะกระเด้ง 6 ครั้งไปยังเป้าหมายศัตรูเดี่ยวแต่ละตัว แต่ละครั้งจะสร้างความเสียหายเวท และลดความเร็วของเป้าหมายพร้อมเพิ่มความเปราะบางต่อธาตุน้ำ เป้าหมายที่ถูกผลักออกจะได้รับความเสียหายโบนัสที่ลดลงเมื่อศัตรูถูกผลักออกด้วยความเร็วสุ่ม จะมีโอกาสทำให้เกิดความสับสน ศัตรูที่ถูกผลักออกสองครั้งจะถูกขังอยู่ใน [คุกน้ำ]',
		simDesc_in = 'Memanggil angin dan hujan, memperluas wilayah laut. Memanggil gelombang raksasa yang mengamuk. Gelombang amukan akan memantul 6 kali di antara target musuh tunggal. Setiap pantulan menyebabkan kerusakan sihir dan mengurangi kecepatan target serta meningkatkan kerentanan terhadap air. Target yang terdorong keluar akan mengalami pengurangan kerusakan tambahan. Ketika musuh terdorong keluar dengan kecepatan acak, ada kemungkinan menyebabkan kebingungan. Musuh yang terdorong keluar dua kali akan terjebak dalam <Penjara Air>.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Tumawag ng hangin at ulan, pinalalawak ang dagat. Nagpapakilos ng isang malaking galit na alon. Ang galit na alon ay tumatalbog ng 6 na beses sa mga indibidwal na layunin ng kaaway. Bawat talbog ay nagdudulot ng magic damage at nagpapabagal sa kanila habang nagpapataas ng kahinaan sa tubig. Ang mga target na natutulak palabas ay magkakaroon ng nabawasang karagdagang pinsala. Kapag ang mga kaaway ay natutulak palabas nang random ang bilis, may posibilidad na magdulot ng kalituhan. Ang mga kaaway na natutulak palabas ng dalawang beses ay makukulong sa <Water Prison>.',
		simDesc_ma = 'Memanggil angin dan hujan, meluaskan kawasan laut. Memanggil gelombang gergasi yang mengamuk. Gelombang marah akan memantul 6 kali antara sasaran musuh tunggal. Setiap pantulan menyebabkan kerosakan sihir dan mengurangkan kelajuan sasaran serta meningkatkan kerentanan kepada elemen air. Sasaran yang ditolak keluar akan mengalami pengurangan kerosakan tambahan. Apabila musuh ditolak keluar dengan kelajuan rawak, terdapat kemungkinan menyebabkan kekeliruan. Musuh yang ditolak keluar dua kali akan tersekat dalam <Penjara Air>.',
		simDesc = 'Summon wind and rain, expand the seas. Summon a raging gigantic wave. The furious wave will bounce 6 times among single enemy targets. Each bounce deals magic damage, and each bounce reduces their speed along with increasing vulnerability to water. Targets pushed out will suffer reduced bonus damage. When enemies are pushed out at random speeds, there is a chance to cause confusion. Enemies pushed out twice will be trapped in [Water Prison].',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[19623],
		-- {11}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng bổ sung: Đơn vị bị đẩy ra sẽ được phân tán ngẫu nhiên với 2 bùa lợi; Đơn vị trong nhà tù nước sẽ không thể nhận được hiệu ứng hỗ trợ trong một vòng bổ sung và sẽ có 30% khả năng bị thiệt hại do nước. Khi nhà tù nước xuất hiện và kết thúc, nó sẽ nhận sát thương nước bằng 200% Sát Thương Phép Thuật của Kyogre (sát thương này Sát thương nhà tù nước không được ghi lại)\n#F20#\n#F40#Sau khi đơn vị địch được giải phóng khỏi <Tù Nước>, nó sẽ mất khả năng miễn nhiễm với <Kiểm soát Nước>, <Vướng víu>, <Đóng băng> và các hiệu ứng khác, tồn tại trong 1 hiệp. Khi anh hùng nước/cỏ/băng của bạn tấn công đơn vị, 5% HP của chính đơn vị đó sẽ được phục hồi.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Additional effect: Units pushed out will be randomly dispersed with 2 buffs; Units in the Water Prison cannot receive support effects for one additional round and have a 30% chance to take water damage. When the Water Prison appears and ends, it will take water damage equal to 200% of Kyogre\'s Magic Damage (this damage from the Water Prison is not recorded)\n#F20#\n#F40#After the enemy unit is released from <Water Prison>, it will lose immunity to <Water Control>, <Entangle>, <Freeze>, and other effects for 1 turn. When your water/grass/ice hero attacks the unit, 5% of that unit\'s HP will be restored.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Additional effect: Units pushed out will be randomly dispersed with 2 buffs; Units in the Water Prison cannot receive support effects for one additional round and have a 30% chance to take water damage. When the Water Prison appears and ends, it will take water damage equal to 200% of Kyogre\'s Magic Damage (this damage from the Water Prison is not recorded)\n#F20#\n#F40#After the enemy unit is released from <Water Prison>, it will lose immunity to <Water Control>, <Entangle>, <Freeze>, and other effects for 1 turn. When your water/grass/ice hero attacks the unit, 5% of that unit\'s HP will be restored.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'ผลเพิ่มเติม: หน่วยที่ถูกผลักออกจะถูกกระจายแบบสุ่มพร้อมบัฟ 2 อย่าง; หน่วยในคุกน้ำจะไม่สามารถรับผลสนับสนุนในรอบเพิ่มเติมหนึ่งรอบและมีโอกาส 30% ที่จะได้รับความเสียหายจากน้ำ เมื่อคุกน้ำปรากฏและสิ้นสุด จะได้รับความเสียหายจากน้ำเท่ากับ 200% ของความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ของ Kyogre (ความเสียหายนี้จากคุกน้ำจะไม่ถูกบันทึก)\n#F20#\n#F40#หลังจากหน่วยศัตรูได้รับการปลดปล่อยจาก <คุกน้ำ> หน่วยนั้นจะสูญเสียภูมิคุ้มกันต่อ <การควบคุมน้ำ>, <การพันธนาการ>, <การแช่แข็ง> และเอฟเฟกต์อื่นๆ เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น เมื่อฮีโร่น้ำ/พืช/น้ำแข็งของคุณโจมตีหน่วยนั้น จะฟื้นฟู HP ของหน่วยนั้น 5%',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Efek tambahan: Unit yang didorong akan tersebar secara acak dengan 2 buff; Unit dalam Penjara Air tidak dapat menerima efek dukungan selama satu putaran tambahan dan memiliki 30% peluang untuk menerima kerusakan air. Ketika Penjara Air muncul dan berakhir, itu akan menerima kerusakan air sebesar 200% dari Damage Sihir Kyogre (kerusakan ini dari Penjara Air tidak dicatat)\n#F20#\n#F40#Setelah unit musuh dibebaskan dari <Penjara Air>, unit tersebut akan kehilangan kekebalan terhadap <Kontrol Air>, <Terjerat>, <Bekukan>, dan efek lainnya selama 1 giliran. Ketika pahlawan air/rumput/es Anda menyerang unit tersebut, 5% HP unit itu akan pulih.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Karagdagang epekto: Ang mga yunit na itinutulak palabas ay kusang ipinapamahagi na may 2 buffs; Ang mga yunit sa Water Prison ay hindi makatatanggap ng mga support effect sa isang karagdagang round at may 30% na chance na makatanggap ng water damage. Kapag lumitaw at natapos ang Water Prison, ito ay tatanggap ng water damage na katumbas ng 200% ng Magic Damage ni Kyogre (ang damage mula sa Water Prison na ito ay hindi naitatala)\n#F20#\n#F40#Pagkatapos mapalaya ang kalabang yunit mula sa <Water Prison>, mawawala ang pagiging immune nito sa <Water Control>, <Entangle>, <Freeze> at iba pang effects, na tumatagal ng 1 round. Kapag inatake ng iyong water/grass/ice hero ang yunit, 5% ng HP ng yunit ay magpapatuloy.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Kesan tambahan: Unit yang ditolak akan disebarkan secara rawak dengan 2 buff; Unit dalam Penjara Air tidak dapat menerima kesan sokongan dalam satu pusingan tambahan dan mempunyai 30% peluang untuk menerima kerosakan air. Apabila Penjara Air muncul dan berakhir, ia akan menerima kerosakan air sebanyak 200% daripada Kerosakan Sihir Kyogre (kerosakan dari Penjara Air ini tidak direkodkan)\n#F20#\n#F40#Selepas unit musuh dibebaskan dari <Penjara Air>, ia akan kehilangan kebal terhadap <Kawalan Air>, <Terkepung>, <Pembekuan> dan kesan lain selama 1 pusingan. Apabila wira air/tumbuhan/ais anda menyerang unit itu, 5% HP unit itu akan dipulihkan.',
		upLvDesc = 'Fixed damage +96',
		upLvDesc_en = 'Fixed damage +96',
		upLvDesc_th = 'ความเสียหายคงที่ +96',
		upLvDesc_in = 'Kerusakan tetap +96',
		upLvDesc_ph = 'Fixed damage +96',
		upLvDesc_ma = 'Kerosakan tetap +96',
		upLvDesc_vn = 'Sát thương cố định +96',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		changeUnitTrigger = true,
		isCombat = true,
		skillType2 = 2,
		skillDamageType = 1,
		skillNatureType = 3,
		hintChoose = 11,
		targetTypeDesc = 'Bounce between single enemy',
		targetTypeDesc_vn = 'Nảy giữa đơn thể địch',
		targetTypeDesc_en = 'Bounce between single enemy',
		targetTypeDesc_th = 'เด้งระหว่างศัตรูเดี่ยว',
		targetTypeDesc_in = 'Memantul di antara musuh tunggal',
		targetTypeDesc_ph = 'Tumalon sa pagitan ng isang kalaban',
		targetTypeDesc_ma = 'Memantul antara musuh tunggal',
		targetChooseType = 'single',
		damageFormula = '(self:specialDamage()*3.3+(self:flag(99) and skillLevel or skillLevel*4)*60)*(1+0.4*((getForceNum(self:force() == 1 and 2 or 1)==1) and 1 or 0)+0.6*(((getForceNum(self:force() == 1 and 1 or 2)==1) or self:hasBuff(1941401)) and 1 or 0))',
