		skillName = 'Root wave',
		describe_vn = '#C0xC0C0C0#Nhân danh đại dương, ta là vua của biển sâu#C0x5B545B#\n#F20#\n#F40##L10#The Sea of ​​Origin: #L0#Tạo hiệu ứng [Tốc độ hỗn loạn] trước mỗi hiệp lớn: trao đổi ngẫu nhiên thứ tự hành động của 3 tướng địch; tốc độ của tất cả đồng minh tăng 10% (hệ nước tăng gấp đôi). Khi đồng đội thuộc hệ nước nhận sát thương chí mạng, nguyên liệu thô sẽ tiêu tốn 15% lượng máu của Kyogre (nếu lượng máu dưới 15% sẽ không được kích hoạt) và 30% lượng máu tối đa sẽ được dành cho anh ta để sống sót (kích hoạt một lần cho mỗi đồng đội hệ nước). Mỗi lần triệu hồi trên sân sẽ tăng tốc độ hồi phục cơn giận của bản thân thêm 10% (tối đa 50%)\n#F20#\n#F40#Khi có 2 anh hùng hệ nước trở lên trên sân, nó sẽ gây ra [Mưa màn]: Tất cả các anh hùng hệ nước bên phía bạn sẽ bất thường. Khả năng kháng cự tăng thêm 40%, sát thương không nghiêm trọng nhận được giảm 20% và nhận được hiệu ứng [Ripple]\n#F20#\n#F40#[Ripple]: Kỹ năng chủ động đi kèm với 40% (tự bổ sung 80%) sát thương. Đa sát thương này không tạo ra sân hận. 3 sát thương mà kẻ địch nhận được trong một lượt sẽ xua tan 1 bùa lợi\n#F20#\n#F40##L10# Ocean Shelter: #L0# Cải thiện #C0x5c9970#$(60+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# khả năng kháng đòn chí mạng của bản thân và #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# kháng cự hoàn toàn bất thường (đồng đội xung quanh nhận được một nửa tiền thưởng); khi đơn vị của bạn bị tấn công nghiêm trọng hoặc nhận sát thương không chí mạng, nó sẽ nhận được [Bảo vệ nguồn] trong 1 vòng (Kyogre ban đầu chắc chắn sẽ nhận được [Bảo vệ nguồn gốc] cùng lúc khi được kích hoạt lần đầu tiên và xác suất giảm 10% cho mỗi vòng tiếp theo và mức tối thiểu giảm xuống 50%). Khi Kyogre ban đầu nhận được [Bảo vệ nguồn gốc], nó sẽ miễn nhiễm với mọi dị thường trong 1 lượt và miễn nhiễm với đòn chí mạng tiếp theo, đồng thời triệu hồi siêu Megalodon 3 lượt\n#F20#\n#F40#[Bảo vệ nguồn]: Phục hồi 5% HP ngay lập tức, giảm 20% sát thương nhận vào trong thời gian diễn ra và giảm 50% sát thương chí mạng. Không thể chồng lên nhau, tồn tại trong 1 hiệp\n#F20#\n#F40#Super Megalodon Hành động: Phản công kẻ thù khi cơ thể bị tấn công, hành động hai lần và gây 150% sát thương thuộc tính nước phép thuật cho hàng kẻ địch. Nó cũng đi kèm với [Chảy máu] trong 1 vòng (khi [Mưa màn] tồn tại, Super Megalodon có thể tấn công và chảy máu khi hai anh hùng đầu tiên của mỗi vòng lớn hành động. Chảy máu: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, gây sát thương chuẩn bằng 40% Sát Thương Phép Thuật ban đầu của Kyogre trước khi hành động trong mỗi vòng)\n#F20#\n#F40##L10#Rain Dispersion: #L0#Trước khi bắt đầu mỗi vòng lớn, hãy phân tán kẻ thù ngẫu nhiên trong bạn trại riêng. Máy có 2 tác dụng âm và 2 điều khiển. Trước khi mỗi bản thân hành động, nó sẽ loại bỏ 2 hiệu ứng kiểm soát ngẫu nhiên và 2 hiệu ứng tiêu cực trong trại của mình. Khi kỹ năng bị động được giải trừ thành công, nó có thể khôi phục lượng máu của bản thân bằng 75% sức tấn Công Phép thuật cộng thêm; ở vòng thứ hai, nó sẽ thực hiện [Thanh lọc hoàn toàn] (khi lượng máu của bản thân cao hơn 80% và không bị kiểm soát, nó sẽ ưu tiên cho các đồng đội bị điều khiển khác) và hồi chiêu trong 3 hiệp sau khi kích hoạt.',
		describe_en = 'In the name of the ocean, I am the king of the deep sea. The Sea of Origin: Applies [Chaos Speed] effect at the start of each major round: randomly swaps the action order of 3 enemy generals; increases speed of all allies by 10% (water type doubles). When water type teammates take critical damage, raw materials consume 15% of Kyogre\'s HP (does not activate if HP is below 15%) and reserves 30% max HP for survival (activates once per water ally). Each summon on the field increases self\'s rage regeneration speed by 10% (max 50%). When having 2 or more water heroes on the field, triggers [Rain Screen]: All allied water heroes receive abnormalities. Resistance increases by 40%, minor damage taken reduced by 20%, and receive [Ripple] effect. [Ripple]: Active skill deals 40% (plus 80% self-supplement) magic water damage. This multi-damage does not generate hate. Receiving 3 instances of damage per turn dispels 1 beneficial buff. Ocean Shelter: Improves own critical hit resistance by $(60+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$% and full abnormal resistance by $(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% (allies around get half the bonus). When your unit is severely attacked or takes non-critical damage, gains [Source Protection] for 1 round (Original Kyogre initially gains [Origin Protection] on first activation with 10% decrease chance per round, minimum 50%). When Original Kyogre gains [Origin Protection], it is immune to all abnormalities for 1 turn and immune to next critical hit, also summons super Megalodon 3 times. [Source Protection]: Instantly heals 5% HP, reduces incoming damage by 20% during effect, and reduces critical damage by 50%. Cannot stack; lasts 1 round. Super Megalodon Action: Counterattacks when attacked, acts twice and deals 150% magic water damage to enemy row. Also applies [Bleeding] for 1 turn (while [Rain Screen] lasts, Super Megalodon can attack and bleed during first two heroes’ actions each major round. Bleeding: negative effect dealing true damage equal to 40% of Kyogre’s original magic damage before acting each round). Rain Dispersion: Before each major round, randomly disperse enemies into separate camps. This skill has 2 debuff removals and 2 controls. Before self acts, removes 2 random control effects and 2 negative effects in own camp. Upon successful passive skill dispel, can restore HP by 75% of magic attack plus; on second round executes [Full Purification] (if HP ]80% and not controlled, prioritizes other controlled allies) and cooldowns for 3 rounds after activation.',
		describe_th = 'ในนามของมหาสมุทร ข้าเป็นราชาแห่งท้องทะเลลึก The Sea of Origin: สร้างเอฟเฟกต์ [ความเร็ววุ่นวาย] ก่อนเริ่มรอบใหญ่แต่ละรอบ: สลับลำดับการกระทำของทหารศัตรู 3 ตัวแบบสุ่ม; เพิ่มความเร็วของพันธมิตรทั้งหมด 10% (ประเภทน้ำเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า) เมื่อนักรบน้ำได้รับความเสียหายคริติคอล วัตถุดิบจะใช้พลังชีวิตของ Kyogre 15% (ไม่ทำงานถ้าพลังชีวิตต่ำกว่า 15%) และสงวนพลังชีวิตสูงสุด 30% เพื่อให้รอด (ทำงานครั้งเดียวต่อพันธมิตรน้ำแต่ละตัว) ทุกครั้งที่เรียกซัมมอนบนสนาม เพิ่มความเร็วฟื้นฟูความโกรธของตนเอง 10% (สูงสุด 50%) เมื่อนักรบน้ำ 2 ตัวขึ้นไปอยู่ในสนาม จะก่อให้เกิด [ฝนตกพรำ]: นักรบน้ำทั้งหมดในฝ่ายคุณจะได้รับความผิดปกติ ความต้านทานเพิ่มขึ้น 40%, ลดความเสียหายเล็กน้อยที่ได้รับลง 20% และได้รับเอฟเฟกต์ [Ripple] [Ripple]: สกิลแอคทีฟที่ก่อความเสียหายเวทน้ำ 40% (เพิ่มเอง 80%) ความเสียหายหลายครั้งนี้ไม่สร้างความเกลียดชัง การได้รับความเสียหาย 3 ครั้งในหนึ่งเทิร์นจะลบล้างบัฟดีๆ ออกหนึ่งครั้ง Ocean Shelter: ปรับปรุงความต้านทานการโจมตีคริติคอลของตนเอง $(60+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$% และความต้านทานความผิดปกติเต็มที่ $(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% (พันธมิตรใกล้เคียงได้รับโบนัสครึ่งหนึ่ง) เมื่อตัวละครถูกโจมตีอย่างรุนแรงหรือได้รับความเสียหายที่ไม่ใช่คริติคอล จะได้รับ [การปกป้องแหล่งที่มา] 1 รอบ (Kyogre ดั้งเดิมจะได้รับ [การปกป้องต้นกำเนิด] เมื่อเปิดใช้งานครั้งแรกพร้อมกับมีโอกาสลดลง 10% ทุกรอบและมีค่าต่ำสุดที่ 50%) เมื่อ Kyogre ดั้งเดิมได้รับ [การปกป้องต้นกำเนิด] จะได้รับภูมิคุ้มกันต่อความผิดปกติทุกชนิด 1 เทิร์นและภูมิคุ้มกันการโจมตีคริติคอลครั้งถัดไป รวมถึงเรียกซูเปอร์เมกาโลดอน 3 ตัว [การปกป้องแหล่งที่มา]: ฟื้นฟู HP ทันที 5%, ลดความเสียหายที่ได้รับลง 20% ระหว่างระยะเวลา และลดความเสียหายคริติคอลลง 50% ไม่สามารถซ้อนทับได้ อยู่ได้นาน 1 เทิร์น Super Megalodon การกระทำ: โต้กลับศัตรูเมื่อถูกโจมตี, ทำการกระทำสองครั้ง และก่อความเสียหายเวทน้ำ 150% ให้กับแถวศัตรู นอกจากนี้ยังมีเอฟเฟกต์ [เลือดไหล] 1 รอบ (เมื่อ [ฝนตกพรำ] อยู่ Super Megalodon จะสามารถโจมตีและทำให้เลือดไหลได้เมื่อฮีโร่สองคนแรกของแต่ละรอบใหญ่กระทำ เลือดไหล: เอฟเฟกต์ลบ ก่อความเสียหายจริง 40% ของเวทเดิมของ Kyogre ก่อนกระทำแต่ละรอบ) Rain Dispersion: ก่อนเริ่มรอบใหญ่แต่ละรอบ กระจายศัตรูแบบสุ่มไปยังค่ายต่างๆ สกิลนี้มีเอฟเฟกต์ลบบัฟ 2 อย่างและควบคุม 2 อย่าง ก่อนที่ตัวเองจะกระทำ จะลบเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมสุ่ม 2 อย่างและเอฟเฟกต์ลบ 2 อย่างในค่ายของตนเอง เมื่อสกิลพาสซีฟถูกลบสำเร็จ จะฟื้นฟู HP เท่ากับ 75% ของพลังโจมตีเวท และในรอบที่สองจะทำ [การชำระเต็มรูปแบบ] (หากพลังชีวิตของตนเองสูงกว่า 80% และไม่ได้ถูกควบคุม จะให้ความสำคัญกับพันธมิตรที่ถูกควบคุมคนอื่นๆ) และคูลดาวน์ 3 รอบหลังเปิดใช้',
		describe_in = 'Demi laut, Aku adalah raja lautan dalam. The Sea of Origin: Menerapkan efek [Kecepatan Kekacauan] sebelum setiap babak besar: menukar secara acak urutan aksi 3 jenderal musuh; kecepatan semua sekutu meningkat 10% (jenis air meningkat dua kali lipat). Ketika rekan satu tim tipe air menerima serangan kritis, bahan mentah akan menghabiskan 15% HP Kyogre (tidak aktif jika HP di bawah 15%) dan menyisihkan 30% HP maksimum untuk bertahan hidup (aktif sekali untuk setiap rekan tipe air). Setiap kali pemanggilan di lapangan meningkatkan kecepatan pemulihan kemarahan diri sebesar 10% (maks 50%). Ketika ada 2 pahlawan tipe air atau lebih di lapangan, akan memicu [Hujan Layar]: Semua pahlawan tipe air sekutu menerima abnormalitas. Ketahanan meningkat 40%, kerusakan kecil yang diterima berkurang 20%, dan menerima efek [Ripple]. [Ripple]: Skill aktif yang memberikan 40% (ditambah 80% tambahan sendiri) kerusakan air magic. Serangan multi ini tidak menghasilkan hate. Menerima 3 serangan dalam satu giliran akan menghilangkan 1 buff menguntungkan. Ocean Shelter: Meningkatkan ketahanan kritikal diri sendiri sebesar $(60+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$% dan ketahanan penuh abnormal $(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% (sekutu di sekitar mendapatkan setengah bonus). Ketika unit Anda diserang parah atau menerima kerusakan non-kritis, unit tersebut mendapatkan [Perlindungan Sumber] selama 1 putaran (Kyogre asli awalnya mendapat [Perlindungan Asal] pada aktivasi pertama dengan peluang berkurang 10% setiap putaran dan minimum 50%). Ketika Kyogre asli mendapatkan [Perlindungan Asal], ia kebal terhadap semua abnormalitas selama 1 giliran dan kebal terhadap serangan kritis berikutnya, serta memanggil Super Megalodon sebanyak 3 kali. [Perlindungan Sumber]: Pulihkan 5% HP langsung, kurangi 20% kerusakan yang diterima selama efek, dan kurangi kerusakan kritis sebesar 50%. Tidak bisa menumpuk, bertahan selama 1 giliran. Tindakan Super Megalodon: Melakukan serangan balasan saat tubuh diserang, bertindak dua kali dan memberikan 150% kerusakan magic air pada barisan musuh. Juga membawa efek [Pendarahan] selama 1 giliran (ketika [Hujan Layar] aktif, Super Megalodon dapat menyerang dan menyebabkan pendarahan saat dua pahlawan pertama setiap babak besar bertindak. Pendarahan: efek negatif yang memberikan damage sejati setara 40% Magic Damage asli Kyogre sebelum bertindak setiap ronde). Rain Dispersion: Sebelum setiap babak besar dimulai, mengacak musuh ke kamp terpisah. Skill ini memiliki 2 efek debuff dan 2 kontrol. Sebelum diri sendiri bertindak, menghilangkan 2 efek kontrol acak dan 2 efek negatif di kamp sendiri. Ketika skill pasif berhasil dihilangkan, dapat memulihkan HP sebesar 75% Attack Magic tambahan; pada ronde kedua melakukan [Pemurnian Total] (jika HP diri sendiri lebih dari 80% dan tidak terkendali, akan memprioritaskan sekutu lain yang terkendali) dan cooldown selama 3 giliran setelah aktivasi.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa ngalan ng karagatan, ako ang hari ng malalim na dagat. The Sea of Origin: Naglalagay ng epekto ng [Chaos Speed] bago magsimula ang bawat malaking round: nagpapalit ng random na pagkakasunod-sunod ng aksyon ng 3 kaaway na heneral; pinapataas ang bilis ng lahat ng kakampi ng 10% (doble para sa water type). Kapag tumanggap ng critical damage ang mga kakampi na water type, gagamitin ang 15% HP ng Kyogre mula sa raw materials (hindi aktibo kung ang HP ay nasa ilalim ng 15%) at itinatabi ang 30% max HP para mabuhay (mga beses na iisa lang bawat water ally). Sa bawat summon sa field, tumataas ng 10% ang bilis ng sariling rage regen (max 50%). Kapag may 2 o higit pang water heroes sa field, magbibigay ito ng [Rain Screen]: lahat ng water heroes sa iyong panig ay magkakaroon ng abnormalities. Tumataas ang resistensya ng 40%, nababawasan ang minor damage na natatanggap ng 20%, at nakakakuha ng effect na [Ripple]. [Ripple]: Isang active skill na may 40% (dagdag na 80% self supplement) magic water damage. Ang multi damage na ito ay hindi nagdudulot ng hate. Tatlong damage bawat turn ang matatanggap upang ma-dispel ang 1 buff. Ocean Shelter: Pinapataas ang sariling resistensya sa critical hit ng $(60+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$% at ganap na resistensya sa abnormalities ng $(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% (ang mga kakampi sa paligid ay nakakakuha ng kalahating bonus). Kapag ang iyong yunit ay naatake nang malubha o nakatanggap ng non-critical damage, magkakaroon ito ng [Source Protection] sa loob ng 1 round (ang orihinal na Kyogre ay unang nakakakuha ng [Origin Protection] sa unang activation na may 10% pagbaba ng chance kada round at minimum 50%). Kapag nakuha ng orihinal na Kyogre ang [Origin Protection], magiging immune ito sa lahat ng abnormalities sa loob ng 1 turn at immune sa susunod na critical hit, at nag-summon ng super Megalodon ng 3 beses. [Source Protection]: Nagpapagaling ng 5% HP agad, nagpapababa ng 20% damage na matatanggap habang aktibo, at nagpapababa ng 50% critical damage. Hindi pwedeng mag-stack, tumatagal ng 1 round. Super Megalodon Actions: Nagco-counterattack kapag inaatake, gumagawa ng dalawang aksyon at nagdudulot ng 150% magic water damage sa enemy row. Kasama rin nito ang [Bleeding] sa loob ng 1 round (kapag aktibo ang [Rain Screen], pwedeng mag-atake at magdulot ng bleeding ang Super Megalodon habang gumagalaw ang unang dalawang heroes sa bawat malaking round. Bleeding: isang negative effect na nagdudulot ng true damage na 40% ng original magic damage ni Kyogre bago kumilos sa bawat round). Rain Dispersion: Bago magsimula ang bawat malaking round, nagdi-disperse ng mga kaaway sa iba\'t ibang kampo nang random. Ang skill ay may 2 debuff at 2 control effects. Bago gumawa ng aksyon ang sarili, tatanggalin nito ang 2 random control effects at 2 negative effects mula sa sarili niyang kampo. Kapag matagumpay na natanggal ang passive skill, kayang mag-restore ng HP ng sarili ng 75% ng magic attack plus; sa ikalawang round ipapatupad ang [Full Purification] (kapag ang sariling HP ay higit sa 80% at hindi naka-control, inuuna ang ibang kontroladong kakampi) at may cooldown ng 3 rounds pagkatapos magamit.',
		describe_ma = 'Demi lautan, aku adalah raja laut dalam. The Sea of Origin: Memberikan efek [Kelajuan Kacau] sebelum setiap pusingan besar: menukar secara rawak susunan tindakan 3 jeneral musuh; kelajuan semua sekutu meningkat 10% (jenis air dua kali ganda). Apabila rakan sepasukan jenis air menerima kerosakan kritikal, bahan mentah akan menggunakan 15% darah Kyogre (tidak aktif jika darah di bawah 15%) dan memperuntukkan 30% darah maksimum untuk survive (aktif sekali bagi setiap rakan jenis air). Setiap kali summon di padang akan meningkatkan kelajuan pemulihan kemarahan diri sebanyak 10% (maksimum 50%). Apabila terdapat 2 atau lebih wira jenis air di padang, ia akan mencetuskan [Hujan Layar]: Semua wira jenis air pihak anda akan mengalami abnormal. Rintangan meningkat 40%, kerosakan kecil diterima dikurangkan 20% dan menerima efek [Ripple]. [Ripple]: Kemahiran aktif yang menyebabkan 40% (ditambah 80% tambahan sendiri) kerosakan air ajaib. Kerosakan berbilang ini tidak menimbulkan dendam. Menerima 3 kerosakan dalam satu pusingan akan menyingkirkan 1 buff baik. Ocean Shelter: Meningkatkan rintangan serangan kritikal sendiri sebanyak $(60+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$% dan rintangan penuh abnormal $(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% (rakan sepasukan berdekatan menerima setengah ganjaran). Apabila unit anda diserang teruk atau menerima kerosakan bukan kritikal, ia akan mendapat [Perlindungan Sumber] selama 1 pusingan (Kyogre asal mula-mula akan mendapat [Perlindungan Asal] pada pengaktifan pertama dengan kebarangkalian berkurangan 10% setiap pusingan dan minimum 50%). Apabila Kyogre asal mendapat [Perlindungan Asal], ia kebal terhadap semua abnormal selama 1 pusingan dan kebal terhadap serangan kritikal seterusnya, juga memanggil super Megalodon sebanyak 3 kali. [Perlindungan Sumber]: Pulihkan 5% HP serta-merta, kurangkan 20% kerosakan diterima sepanjang tempoh itu, dan kurangkan 50% kerosakan kritikal. Tidak boleh bertindih, bertahan selama 1 pusingan. Tindakan Super Megalodon: Menyerang balas musuh apabila diserang, bertindak dua kali dan menyebabkan kerosakan ajaib air 150% kepada barisan musuh. Ia juga membawa efek [Pendarahan] selama 1 pusingan (apabila [Hujan Layar] wujud, Super Megalodon boleh menyerang dan menyebabkan pendarahan semasa dua wira pertama setiap pusingan besar bertindak. Pendarahan: efek negatif yang memberikan kerosakan sebenar sebanyak 40% Kerosakan Ajaib asal Kyogre sebelum bertindak setiap pusingan). Rain Dispersion: Sebelum memulakan setiap pusingan besar, mengagihkan musuh secara rawak ke kem berasingan. Kemahiran ini mempunyai 2 kesan bunuh dan 2 kawalan. Sebelum diri bertindak, ia membuang 2 kesan kawalan rawak dan 2 kesan negatif dalam kem sendiri. Apabila kemahiran pasif berjaya dibuang, ia boleh memulihkan HP sendiri sebanyak 75% Serangan Ajaib tambahan; pada pusingan kedua, ia akan melaksanakan [Penjernihan Total] (apabila HP sendiri melebihi 80% dan tidak dikawal, ia akan mengutamakan rakan sepasukan lain yang dikawal) dan cukai sejuk selama 3 pusingan selepas diaktifkan.',
		describe = 'In the name of the ocean, I am the king of the deep sea. The Sea of Origin: Applies [Chaos Speed] effect at the start of each major round: randomly swaps the action order of 3 enemy generals; increases speed of all allies by 10% (water type doubles). When water type teammates take critical damage, raw materials consume 15% of Kyogre\'s HP (does not activate if HP is below 15%) and reserves 30% max HP for survival (activates once per water ally). Each summon on the field increases self\'s rage regeneration speed by 10% (max 50%). When having 2 or more water heroes on the field, triggers [Rain Screen]: All allied water heroes receive abnormalities. Resistance increases by 40%, minor damage taken reduced by 20%, and receive [Ripple] effect. [Ripple]: Active skill deals 40% (plus 80% self-supplement) magic water damage. This multi-damage does not generate hate. Receiving 3 instances of damage per turn dispels 1 beneficial buff. Ocean Shelter: Improves own critical hit resistance by $(60+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$% and full abnormal resistance by $(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$% (allies around get half the bonus). When your unit is severely attacked or takes non-critical damage, gains [Source Protection] for 1 round (Original Kyogre initially gains [Origin Protection] on first activation with 10% decrease chance per round, minimum 50%). When Original Kyogre gains [Origin Protection], it is immune to all abnormalities for 1 turn and immune to next critical hit, also summons super Megalodon 3 times. [Source Protection]: Instantly heals 5% HP, reduces incoming damage by 20% during effect, and reduces critical damage by 50%. Cannot stack; lasts 1 round. Super Megalodon Action: Counterattacks when attacked, acts twice and deals 150% magic water damage to enemy row. Also applies [Bleeding] for 1 turn (while [Rain Screen] lasts, Super Megalodon can attack and bleed during first two heroes’ actions each major round. Bleeding: negative effect dealing true damage equal to 40% of Kyogre’s original magic damage before acting each round). Rain Dispersion: Before each major round, randomly disperse enemies into separate camps. This skill has 2 debuff removals and 2 controls. Before self acts, removes 2 random control effects and 2 negative effects in own camp. Upon successful passive skill dispel, can restore HP by 75% of magic attack plus; on second round executes [Full Purification] (if HP ]80% and not controlled, prioritizes other controlled allies) and cooldowns for 3 rounds after activation.',
		simDesc_vn = '#C0xC0C0C0# Nhân danh đại dương, tôi là vua của biển sâu #C0x5B545B##F20##F40##L10#Ocean of the Origin: #L0# Tạo hiệu ứng [Tốc độ hỗn loạn] trước mỗi vòng lớn; tốc độ của tất cả đội của mình được tăng lên (hệ thống nước được tăng gấp đôi). Khi đồng đội thuộc hệ nước nhận sát thương chí mạng, lượng máu Kyogre ban đầu sẽ bị tiêu hao để giữ lại một lượng máu nhất định để tồn tại. Mỗi triệu hồi hệ nước ở trên sẽ tăng thêm tốc độ hồi phục cơn tức giận của chính nó khi vào sân #F20##F40# Khi có 2 anh hùng hệ nước trở lên trên sân, nó sẽ gây ra [Mưa màn]: Tất cả khả năng kháng cự bất thường của các tướng hệ nước bên bạn sẽ tăng lên, sát thương không nghiêm trọng sẽ giảm và sẽ nhận được hiệu ứng [gợn sóng] #F20##F40##L10#Ocean Shelter: #L0# Cải thiện Bản thân cơ thể có khả năng kháng đòn chí mạng và khả năng kháng cự bất thường hoàn toàn; khi đơn vị của bạn bị tấn công chí mạng hoặc nhận sát thương không chí mạng, đơn vị đó sẽ nhận được [Bảo vệ nguồn gốc] trong 1 hiệp. Khi Kyogre ban đầu có được [Bảo vệ nguồn gốc], nó sẽ miễn nhiễm với mọi bất thường và miễn nhiễm với sát thương chí mạng tiếp theo. Đồng thời, nó sẽ triệu hồi siêu megalodon #F20##F40# [Bảo vệ nguồn gốc]: Phục hồi HP ngay lập tức, trong khi Giảm sát thương nhận được và sát thương nhận được từ các đòn chí mạng #F20##F40##L10#Rain Dispels the Clouds: #L0#Trước khi bắt đầu mỗi vòng lớn và trước mỗi lượt tự hành động, hãy loại bỏ các hiệu ứng tiêu cực và kiểm soát ngẫu nhiên trong trại của riêng bạn. Khi phân tán thành công, bạn có thể khôi phục lượng máu của chính mình; ở vòng thứ hai, khi bạn tự mình hành động, hãy thực hiện [Thanh lọc hoàn toàn] và hồi chiêu trong 3 hiệp sau khi được kích hoạt.',
		simDesc_en = '#C0xC0C0C0# In the name of the ocean, I am the king of the deep sea #C0x5B545B##F20##F40##L10#Ocean of the Origin: #L0# Creates the <Chaotic Speed> effect before each major round; the speed of all your water-type teams is increased (water-type system effect doubled). When water-type allies take critical damage, Kyogre\'s initial HP will be consumed to preserve a certain amount of HP to survive. Each water-type summon above will increase its own anger recovery speed upon entering the battlefield #F20##F40# When there are 2 or more water-type heroes on the field, it will trigger <Rain Curtain>: All abnormal resistance abilities of your water-type heroes increase, minor damage is reduced, and they receive the <Ripple> effect #F20##F40##L10#Ocean Shelter: #L0# Enhances the body’s critical hit resistance and full abnormal resistance; when your unit is critically attacked or takes non-critical damage, that unit will receive <Origin Protection> for 1 turn. When Kyogre initially has <Origin Protection>, it is immune to all abnormalities and the next critical damage. At the same time, it will summon a super megalodon #F20##F40# <Origin Protection>: Instantly restores HP while reducing received damage and damage from critical hits #F20##F40##L10#Rain Dispels the Clouds: #L0# Before the start of each major round and before each auto-action turn, remove negative effects and random control effects from your camp. On successful dispel, you can restore your HP; on the second round, when you act by yourself, perform <Complete Purification> and cooldown for 3 turns after activation.',
		simDesc_th = '#C0xC0C0C0# ในนามของมหาสมุทร ฉันคือราชาแห่งท้องทะเลลึก #C0x5B545B##F20##F40##L10#Ocean of the Origin: #L0# สร้างเอฟเฟกต์ [ความเร็ววุ่นวาย] ก่อนแต่ละรอบใหญ่; เพิ่มความเร็วของทีมประเภทน้ำทั้งหมดของคุณ (ระบบน้ำเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า) เมื่อเพื่อนร่วมทีมประเภทน้ำได้รับความเสียหายวิกฤต HP เริ่มต้นของ Kyogre จะถูกใช้ไปเพื่อรักษาปริมาณเลือดที่กำหนดไว้ให้รอดชีวิต แต่ละครั้งที่เรียกประเภทน้ำขึ้นจะเพิ่มความเร็วในการฟื้นโกรธของมันเมื่อเข้าสนาม #F20##F40# เมื่อมีฮีโร่ประเภทน้ำอย่างน้อย 2 ตัวในสนาม จะสร้าง [สายฝน]: ความต้านทานความผิดปกติทั้งหมดของฮีโร่ประเภทน้ำในทีมคุณจะเพิ่มขึ้น ความเสียหายที่ไม่รุนแรงจะลดลง และได้รับเอฟเฟกต์ [คลื่น] #F20##F40##L10#Ocean Shelter: #L0# ปรับปรุงความต้านทานการโจมตีวิกฤตและความต้านทานความผิดปกติทั้งหมดของร่างกาย; เมื่อยูนิตของคุณถูกโจมตีวิกฤตหรือได้รับความเสียหายที่ไม่ใช่วิกฤต ยูนิตนั้นจะได้รับ [การปกป้องต้นกำเนิด] 1 เทิร์น เมื่อ Kyogre เริ่มต้นมี [การปกป้องต้นกำเนิด] มันจะได้รับภูมิคุ้มกันต่อความผิดปกติทั้งหมดและความเสียหายวิกฤตครั้งถัดไป พร้อมกันนั้นจะเรียกเมกาโลดอนสุดยอด #F20##F40# [การปกป้องต้นกำเนิด]: ฟื้นฟู HP ทันที ขณะที่ลดความเสียหายที่ได้รับและความเสียหายจากการโจมตีวิกฤต #F20##F40##L10#Rain Dispels the Clouds: #L0# ก่อนเริ่มแต่ละรอบใหญ่และก่อนแต่ละเทิร์นของการเคลื่อนไหวอัตโนมัติ ให้ลบเอฟเฟกต์ลบและการควบคุมแบบสุ่มในค่ายของคุณ เมื่อแยกการควบคุมสำเร็จ คุณจะฟื้นฟู HP ของตัวเอง ในรอบที่สอง เมื่อคุณทำการเคลื่อนไหวเอง ให้ทำ [การชำระล้างสมบูรณ์] และคูลดาวน์เป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์นหลังจากเปิดใช้งาน',
		simDesc_in = '#C0xC0C0C0# Atas nama lautan, aku adalah raja laut dalam #C0x5B545B##F20##F40##L10#Ocean of the Origin: #L0# Membuat efek <Kecepatan Chaos> sebelum setiap putaran besar; kecepatan semua tim tipe airmu meningkat (sistem tipe air meningkat dua kali lipat). Ketika rekan tipe air menerima kerusakan kritis, HP awal Kyogre akan digunakan untuk mempertahankan sejumlah HP tertentu untuk bertahan hidup. Setiap panggilan tipe air di atas akan menambah kecepatan pemulihan kemarahannya saat memasuki medan perang #F20##F40# Ketika ada 2 atau lebih pahlawan tipe air di medan perang, akan memicu <Hujan Tirai>: Semua kemampuan resistensi abnormal pahlawan tipe air di timmu meningkat, kerusakan ringan berkurang, dan mereka menerima efek <Gelombang> #F20##F40##L10#Ocean Shelter: #L0# Meningkatkan resistensi serangan kritis dan resistensi abnormal penuh pada tubuh; ketika unitmu diserang secara kritis atau menerima kerusakan non-kritis, unit tersebut akan menerima <Perlindungan Asal> selama 1 giliran. Ketika Kyogre awal memiliki <Perlindungan Asal>, dia kebal terhadap semua abnormalitas dan serangan kritis berikutnya. Pada saat yang sama, dia akan memanggil megalodon super #F20##F40# <Perlindungan Asal>: Memulihkan HP secara instan, sambil mengurangi kerusakan yang diterima dan kerusakan dari serangan kritis #F20##F40##L10#Rain Dispels the Clouds: #L0# Sebelum mulai setiap putaran besar dan sebelum setiap giliran aksi otomatis, hilangkan efek negatif dan kontrol acak di kampmu. Ketika dispel berhasil, kamu dapat memulihkan HP-mu; di putaran kedua, saat kamu bertindak sendiri, lakukan <Penyucian Sempurna> dan cooldown selama 3 giliran setelah diaktifkan',
		simDesc_ph = '#C0xC0C0C0# Sa pangalan ng karagatan, ako ang hari ng malalim na dagat #C0x5B545B##F20##F40##L10#Ocean of the Origin: #L0# Lumilikha ng epekto na <Magulong Bilis> bago ang bawat malaking round; nadaragdagan ang bilis ng lahat ng water-type na koponan mo (doble ang epekto ng water-type system). Kapag ang mga kasama na water-type ay tumanggap ng critical damage, używany HP ng Kyogre ay kinokonsumo upang mapanatili ang isang tiyak na halaga ng HP para mabuhay. Bawat water-type summon sa itaas ay nagpapabilis ng sariling recovery ng galit nito pagpasok sa laban #F20##F40# Kapag may 2 o higit pang water-type na bayani sa laban, magti-trigger ito ng <Ulan na Kurtina>: Lahat ng abnormal resistances ng iyong mga water-type na bayani ay tumataas, nababawasan ang hindi seryosong damage, at makakakuha ng epekto na <Alon> #F20##F40##L10#Ocean Shelter: #L0# Pinapahusay ang resistensya ng katawan laban sa kritikal na tama at ganap na abnormal resistances; kapag ang yunit mo ay na-critically attack o nakatanggap ng non-critical damage, tatanggap ang yunit ng <Proteksyon ng Pinagmulan> ng 1 turn. Kapag ang Kyogre ay may <Proteksyon ng Pinagmulan>, ito ay immune sa lahat ng abnormalidad at sa susunod na kritikal na damage. Kasabay nito, magde-deploy ito ng super megalodon #F20##F40# <Proteksyon ng Pinagmulan>: Agad na nagpapagaling ng HP habang binabawasan ang natatanggap na damage at damage mula sa kritikal na tama #F20##F40##L10#Rain Dispels the Clouds: #L0# Bago magsimula ng bawat malaking round at bago ang bawat auto-action turn, aalisin ang mga negatibong epekto at random control sa iyong kampo. Kapag matagumpay na na-disperse, makakabawi ka ng HP; sa ikalawang round, kapag ikaw mismo ang kumilos, isagawa ang <Ganap na Paglilinis> at cooldown ng 3 turn pagkatapos ma-activate',
		simDesc_ma = '#C0xC0C0C0# Atas nama lautan, aku adalah raja lautan dalam #C0x5B545B##F20##F40##L10#Ocean of the Origin: #L0# Mencipta kesan efek <Kelajuan Kacau> sebelum setiap pusingan besar; kelajuan semua pasukan jenis air anda meningkat (sistem jenis air berganda). Apabila rakan sepasukan jenis air menerima kerosakan kritikal, HP Kyogre asal akan digunakan untuk mengekalkan jumlah HP tertentu untuk bertahan. Setiap panggilan jenis air di atas akan meningkatkan kadar pemulihan kemarahannya ketika memasuki medan pertempuran #F20##F40# Apabila ada 2 atau lebih wira jenis air di medan, ia akan menyebabkan <Hujan Tirai>: Semua kemampuan rintangan luar biasa para wira jenis air anda meningkat, kerosakan yang tidak serius dikurangkan, dan mereka akan menerima kesan <Gelombang> #F20##F40##L10#Ocean Shelter: #L0# Meningkatkan kemampuan tubuh untuk melawan serangan kritikal dan rintangan luar biasa sepenuhnya; apabila unit anda diserang kritikal atau menerima kerosakan tidak kritikal, unit tersebut akan menerima <Perlindungan Asal> selama 1 giliran. Apabila Kyogre awal memperoleh <Perlindungan Asal>, ia akan kebal terhadap semua keabnormalan dan serangan kritikal seterusnya. Pada masa yang sama, ia akan memanggil megalodon super #F20##F40# <Perlindungan Asal>: Memulihkan HP dengan segera, sambil mengurangkan kerosakan diterima dan kerosakan yang diterima daripada serangan kritikal #F20##F40##L10#Rain Dispels the Clouds: #L0# Sebelum memulakan setiap pusingan besar dan sebelum setiap giliran bertindak automatik, hapus kesan negatif dan kawalan rawak dalam kem anda. Apabila penyebaran berjaya, anda boleh memulihkan HP sendiri; pada pusingan kedua, apabila anda bertindak sendiri, lakukan <Penjernihan Penuh> dan sejukkan selama 3 giliran selepas diaktifkan',
		simDesc = '#C0xC0C0C0# In the name of the ocean, I am the king of the deep sea #C0x5B545B##F20##F40##L10#Ocean of the Origin: #L0# Creates the [Chaotic Speed] effect before each major round; the speed of all your water-type teams is increased (water-type system effect doubled). When water-type allies take critical damage, Kyogre\'s initial HP will be consumed to preserve a certain amount of HP to survive. Each water-type summon above will increase its own anger recovery speed upon entering the battlefield #F20##F40# When there are 2 or more water-type heroes on the field, it will trigger [Rain Curtain]: All abnormal resistance abilities of your water-type heroes increase, minor damage is reduced, and they receive the [Ripple] effect #F20##F40##L10#Ocean Shelter: #L0# Enhances the body’s critical hit resistance and full abnormal resistance; when your unit is critically attacked or takes non-critical damage, that unit will receive [Origin Protection] for 1 turn. When Kyogre initially has [Origin Protection], it is immune to all abnormalities and the next critical damage. At the same time, it will summon a super megalodon #F20##F40# [Origin Protection]: Instantly restores HP while reducing received damage and damage from critical hits #F20##F40##L10#Rain Dispels the Clouds: #L0# Before the start of each major round and before each auto-action turn, remove negative effects and random control effects from your camp. On successful dispel, you can restore your HP; on the second round, when you act by yourself, perform [Complete Purification] and cooldown for 3 turns after activation.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[19636],
		-- {8}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng bổ sung: Khi bạn có mặt tại hiện trường, giảm 15% tốc độ và tỷ lệ chí mạng của 2 tướng địch có đòn chí mạng cao nhất (không thể hóa giải)\n#F20#\n#F40#Khi bạn hoặc đồng đội hệ nước của bạn chết, họ sẽ biến thành Hải Linh và gây 120% sát thương phép của chính tướng đó cho kẻ địch và phóng ra hai lần. Trong thời gian này, khả năng miễn nhiễm sát thương và sát thương của toàn đội sẽ tăng thêm 10%. Cơ thể chính Ocean Spirit sẽ tấn công mọi vòng lớn và khi đồng đội tấn công, và điều này sẽ kéo dài về phía bạn. Tất cả đều chết; Ocean Spirit được đồng đội hệ nước biến đổi sẽ tấn công mỗi hiệp lớn và khi Kyogre ban đầu tấn công (số lượng Ocean Spirits tối đa của đồng đội có thể được kích hoạt là 5, kéo dài 2 hiệp)\n#F20#\n#F40# Fengyuan Ba ​​vị thần tăng sức mạnh: Tăng khả năng phòng thủ kép ban đầu của Groudon gốc và tỷ lệ kháng 15% lên 60%, Tăng đòn tấn công kép ban đầu của Super Rayquaza thêm 15% và 20% sát thương chí mạng. Khi một trong các Yuangu hoặc Super Ray xuất hiện, anh ta tiến vào và kích hoạt <Màn mưa> trong 2 lượt.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Additional Effect: When you are present at the scene, reduce the attack speed and critical rate of the 2 enemy champions with the highest critical strike by 15% (cannot be dispelled)\n#F20#\n#F40#When you or your water element teammate dies, they will transform into Ocean Spirit and deal 120% magical damage of that champion to enemies and release twice. During this time, the team’s damage immunity and damage will increase by 10%. The main body of Ocean Spirit will attack every major turn and when teammates attack, and this will drag towards you. All die; Ocean Spirit transformed by water element teammates will attack every major turn and when Kyogre initially attacks (the maximum number of Ocean Spirits activated by teammates is 5, lasting 2 turns)\n#F20#\n#F40# Fengyuan Three Gods power-up: Increase the initial dual defense of original Groudon and resistance rate from 15% to 60%, increase the initial dual attack of Super Rayquaza by 15% and 20% critical damage. When one of the Yuangu or Super Ray appears, it enters and activates <Rain Screen> for 2 turns.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Additional Effect: When you are present at the scene, reduce the attack speed and critical rate of the 2 enemy champions with the highest critical strike by 15% (cannot be dispelled)\n#F20#\n#F40#When you or your water element teammate dies, they will transform into Ocean Spirit and deal 120% magical damage of that champion to enemies and release twice. During this time, the team’s damage immunity and damage will increase by 10%. The main body of Ocean Spirit will attack every major turn and when teammates attack, and this will drag towards you. All die; Ocean Spirit transformed by water element teammates will attack every major turn and when Kyogre initially attacks (the maximum number of Ocean Spirits activated by teammates is 5, lasting 2 turns)\n#F20#\n#F40# Fengyuan Three Gods power-up: Increase the initial dual defense of original Groudon and resistance rate from 15% to 60%, increase the initial dual attack of Super Rayquaza by 15% and 20% critical damage. When one of the Yuangu or Super Ray appears, it enters and activates <Rain Screen> for 2 turns.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'Additional Effect: When you are present at the scene, reduce the attack speed and critical rate of the 2 enemy champions with the highest critical strike by 15% (cannot be dispelled)\n#F20#\n#F40#When you or your water element teammate dies, they will transform into Ocean Spirit and deal 120% magical damage of that champion to enemies and release twice. During this time, the team’s damage immunity and damage will increase by 10%. The main body of Ocean Spirit will attack every major turn and when teammates attack, and this will drag towards you. All die; Ocean Spirit transformed by water element teammates will attack every major turn and when Kyogre initially attacks (the maximum number of Ocean Spirits activated by teammates is 5, lasting 2 turns)\n#F20#\n#F40# Fengyuan Three Gods power-up: Increase the initial dual defense of original Groudon and resistance rate from 15% to 60%, increase the initial dual attack of Super Rayquaza by 15% and 20% critical damage. When one of the Yuangu or Super Ray appears, it enters and activates <Rain Screen> for 2 turns.',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Additional Effect: When you are present at the scene, reduce the attack speed and critical rate of the 2 enemy champions with the highest critical strike by 15% (cannot be dispelled)\n#F20#\n#F40#When you or your water element teammate dies, they will transform into Ocean Spirit and deal 120% magical damage of that champion to enemies and release twice. During this time, the team’s damage immunity and damage will increase by 10%. The main body of Ocean Spirit will attack every major turn and when teammates attack, and this will drag towards you. All die; Ocean Spirit transformed by water element teammates will attack every major turn and when Kyogre initially attacks (the maximum number of Ocean Spirits activated by teammates is 5, lasting 2 turns)\n#F20#\n#F40# Fengyuan Three Gods power-up: Increase the initial dual defense of original Groudon and resistance rate from 15% to 60%, increase the initial dual attack of Super Rayquaza by 15% and 20% critical damage. When one of the Yuangu or Super Ray appears, it enters and activates <Rain Screen> for 2 turns.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Additional Effect: When you are present at the scene, reduce the attack speed and critical rate of the 2 enemy champions with the highest critical strike by 15% (cannot be dispelled)\n#F20#\n#F40#When you or your water element teammate dies, they will transform into Ocean Spirit and deal 120% magical damage of that champion to enemies and release twice. During this time, the team’s damage immunity and damage will increase by 10%. The main body of Ocean Spirit will attack every major turn and when teammates attack, and this will drag towards you. All die; Ocean Spirit transformed by water element teammates will attack every major turn and when Kyogre initially attacks (the maximum number of Ocean Spirits activated by teammates is 5, lasting 2 turns)\n#F20#\n#F40# Fengyuan Three Gods power-up: Increase the initial dual defense of original Groudon and resistance rate from 15% to 60%, increase the initial dual attack of Super Rayquaza by 15% and 20% critical damage. When one of the Yuangu or Super Ray appears, it enters and activates <Rain Screen> for 2 turns.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Additional Effect: When you are present at the scene, reduce the attack speed and critical rate of the 2 enemy champions with the highest critical strike by 15% (cannot be dispelled)\n#F20#\n#F40#When you or your water element teammate dies, they will transform into Ocean Spirit and deal 120% magical damage of that champion to enemies and release twice. During this time, the team’s damage immunity and damage will increase by 10%. The main body of Ocean Spirit will attack every major turn and when teammates attack, and this will drag towards you. All die; Ocean Spirit transformed by water element teammates will attack every major turn and when Kyogre initially attacks (the maximum number of Ocean Spirits activated by teammates is 5, lasting 2 turns)\n#F20#\n#F40# Fengyuan Three Gods power-up: Increase the initial dual defense of original Groudon and resistance rate from 15% to 60%, increase the initial dual attack of Super Rayquaza by 15% and 20% critical damage. When one of the Yuangu or Super Ray appears, it enters and activates <Rain Screen> for 2 turns.',
