		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Groudon uses Iron Tail to hit a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#100% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, causing the target\'s short skill cooldown to be extended by two turns, increasing own Physical Attack by 10% for 3 turns.',
