		skillName_ma = 'Serangan ekor besi',
		skillName = 'Iron tail strike',
		describe_vn = '#C0xC0C0C0# Nhân danh trái đất, tôi là chủ nhân của trái đất. #C0x5B545B#\n#F10#\n#F40#Groudon ban đầu sử dụng bộ đẩy tên lửa để lao về phía trước và giáng một đòn nặng vào một mục tiêu, gây ra #C0xE69900#100% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$\'s #C0xF1 3B54#Physical Sát thương#C0x5B545B#, kéo dài thời gian hồi chiêu của các kỹ năng nhỏ của mục tiêu trong hai lượt và tăng 300% khả năng phòng thủ kép của bản thân trong 2 lượt\n#F20#\n#F40#Sau khi Molten Core được kích hoạt, sát thương và hiệu ứng sẽ ảnh hưởng đến các tướng ở hàng sau của mục tiêu (thêm 80% sát thương cuối cùng của kỹ năng này sẽ gây ra cho mục tiêu phía sau mục tiêu chính)',
		describe_en = 'In the name of Earth, I am the master of the Earth. Groudon initially uses rocket boosters to charge forward and deliver a heavy blow to a target, causing 100% Physical Damage plus $(skillLevel*4*24)$\'s Physical Damage, extending the cooldown of the target\'s minor skills by two turns and increasing its own double defense capability by 300% for 2 turns. After Molten Core is activated, damage and effects will affect the backline allies of the target (an additional 80% of the final damage of this skill will be dealt to the target behind the main target).',
		describe_th = 'ในนามของโลก ฉันคือเจ้าของโลก Groudon ใช้ระบบขับเคลื่อนจรวดพุ่งไปข้างหน้าและโจมตีหนักใส่เป้าหมาย สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ 100% รวมถึงความเสียหายทางกายภาพเท่ากับ $(skillLevel*4*24)$, ทำให้เวลาคูลดาวน์ของสกิลเล็กๆ ของเป้าหมายยาวนานขึ้น 2 เทิร์น และเพิ่มความสามารถป้องกันแบบคู่ของตนเองขึ้น 300% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น หลังจากเปิดใช้ Molten Core ความเสียหายและผลกระทบจะส่งผลต่อกองหน้าแถวหลังของเป้าหมาย (เพิ่มความเสียหาย 80% ของความเสียหายสุดท้ายของสกิลนี้ไปยังเป้าหมายที่อยู่ด้านหลังเป้าหมายหลัก)',
		describe_in = 'Atas nama bumi, aku adalah penguasa bumi. Groudon awalnya menggunakan pendorong roket untuk melaju ke depan dan memberikan pukulan berat pada target, menyebabkan 100% Kerusakan Fisik ditambah $(skillLevel*4*24)$ Kerusakan Fisik, memperpanjang waktu pemulihan kemampuan kecil target selama dua giliran dan meningkatkan kemampuan pertahanan ganda dirinya sendiri sebesar 300% selama 2 giliran. Setelah Molten Core diaktifkan, kerusakan dan efek akan mempengaruhi pasukan baris belakang dari target (tambahan 80% dari kerusakan akhir skill ini akan diberikan ke target di belakang target utama).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa ngalan ng mundo, ako ang may-ari ng mundo. Unang ginamit ni Groudon ang rocket boosters upang mag-charge pasulong at maghatid ng matinding suntok sa isang target, na nagdulot ng 100% Pisikal na Pinsala dagdag pa ang $(skillLevel*4*24)$ Pisikal na Pinsala, pinalawig ang cooldown ng mga maliit na kasanayan ng target nang dalawang turn at tumaas ng 300% ang sariling kakayahan sa dobleng depensa sa loob ng 2 turn. Pagkatapos ma-activate ang Molten Core, ang pinsala at epekto ay makakaapekto sa mga nasa likurang hanay ng mga kalaban (dagdag na 80% ng huling pinsala ng skill na ito ay ibibigay sa target sa likod ng pangunahing target).',
		describe_ma = 'Bagi pihak bumi, saya adalah penguasa bumi. Groudon pada mulanya menggunakan pendorong roket untuk meluncur ke hadapan dan melancarkan serangan berat ke sasaran, menyebabkan 100% Kecederaan Fizikal ditambah $(skillLevel*4*24)$ Kecederaan Fizikal, memanjangkan masa pemulihan kemahiran kecil sasaran selama dua pusingan dan meningkatkan kemampuan pertahanan ganda dirinya sendiri sebanyak 300% selama 2 pusingan. Selepas Molten Core diaktifkan, kerosakan dan kesan akan memberi impak kepada barisan belakang musuh (tambahan 80% kerosakan akhir kemahiran ini akan diberikan kepada sasaran di belakang sasaran utama).',
		describe = 'In the name of Earth, I am the master of the Earth. Groudon initially uses rocket boosters to charge forward and deliver a heavy blow to a target, causing 100% Physical Damage plus $(skillLevel*4*24)$\'s Physical Damage, extending the cooldown of the target\'s minor skills by two turns and increasing its own double defense capability by 300% for 2 turns. After Molten Core is activated, damage and effects will affect the backline allies of the target (an additional 80% of the final damage of this skill will be dealt to the target behind the main target).',
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'Bonus effect: Increases own Physical Damage by 10%, lasts 2 turns  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'Bonus effect: Increases own Physical Damage by 10%, lasts 2 turns  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์เสริม: เพิ่มพลังโจมตีกายภาพของตัวเอง 10% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Efek tambahan: Meningkatkan Serangan Fisik diri sendiri sebesar 10%, berlangsung selama 2 giliran  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'Karagdagang epekto: Dagdagan ng 10% ang Physical Attack ng sarili, tumatagal ng 2 turn  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = 'Kesan tambahan: Meningkatkan Serangan Fizikal diri sendiri sebanyak 10%, bertahan selama 2 pusingan  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng bổ sung: Tăng sức Sát Thương Vật Lý của bản thân thêm 10%, kéo dài 2 lượt',
		upLvDesc = 'Fixed damage +96',
