		skillName_in = 'Pedang Jurang',
		skillName_ph = 'Palakol ng Abismo',
		skillName_ma = 'Pedang Jurang',
		skillName = 'Sword Abyss',
		describe_vn = '#C0xC0C0C0# Ai xúc phạm tôi và không thể bay sẽ bị tôi trừng phạt! #C0x5B545B#\n#F10#\n#F40#Original Groudon bước vào trạng thái chuẩn bị chiến đấu và lao về căn cứ, kích hoạt siêu biến hình, sau đó phóng một khẩu pháo năng lượng cao gây ra đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0xE69900#700% lên một mục tiêu kẻ địch#C0x5B545B #+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0x5B545B#, đòn tấn công này có hiệu ứng khuếch tán nứt mặt đất (gây thêm 50% sát thương cuối cùng của kỹ năng này tới các mục tiêu xung quanh) và kích hoạt ngay 1 #L10#Ending Land#L0#\n#F20#\n#F40# và tiến vào trạng thái dung nham #L10# trong 2 lượt: #L0#ngay lập tức tăng khả năng giảm sát thương của bản thân thêm 60% và giữ lại một nửa hiệu ứng vĩnh viễn sau khi kết thúc vòng liên tục; khi nhận được kỹ năng hoạt động, đó là đòn tấn công. Kẻ tấn công thêm hiệu ứng đốt dung nham trong 2 hiệp\n#F20#\n#F40#Sau khi Kích hoạt Lõi nóng chảy, nhận một đòn tấn công kỹ năng hoạt động ở trạng thái #L10#Dung nham #L0# có thể kích hoạt #L10#Vùng đất kết thúc#L0# và trạng thái dung nham sẽ giữ lại tất cả các hiệu ứng sau khi kết thúc hiệp.',
		describe_en = 'Anyone who insults me and cannot fly will be punished by me! Original Groudon enters battle preparation mode and rushes to the base, activating super transformation, then fires a high-energy cannon causing 700% Physical Damage to one enemy target. +$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s Physical Damage, this attack has an effect that causes ground crack diffusion (inflicting an additional 50% of the final damage of this skill to surrounding targets) and immediately triggers an Ending Land, entering the lava state for 2 turns: instantly increasing self damage reduction by 60% and retaining half of the permanent effects after the continuous rounds end; when receiving an active skill, it is an attack. The attacker adds a lava burn effect for 2 turns. After activating Molten Core, receiving an active skill attack while in Lava state can trigger Ending Land and the lava state retains all effects after the round ends.',
		describe_th = 'ใครก็ตามที่ดูถูกฉันและไม่สามารถบินได้จะถูกฉันลงโทษ! Original Groudon เข้าสู่โหมดเตรียมตัวสู้และพุ่งไปยังฐาน โดยเปิดใช้งานการเปลี่ยนรูปลักษณ์พิเศษ จากนั้นยิงปืนพลังงานสูงสร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ 700% ไปยังศัตรูเป้าหมายหนึ่งตัว +$(skillLevel*4*90)$ ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ โจมตีนี้มีผลทำให้เกิดรอยแตกกระจายบนพื้น (สร้างความเสียหายเพิ่มอีก 50% ของความเสียหายสุดท้ายของสกิลนี้แก่เป้าหมายรอบข้าง) และเปิดใช้งาน Ending Land ทันที จากนั้นเข้าสู่สถานะลาวานาน 2 เทิร์น: เพิ่มการลดความเสียหายของตัวเองทันทีอีก 60% และเก็บผลถาวรไว้ครึ่งหนึ่งหลังจบรอบต่อเนื่อง; เมื่อได้รับสกิลใช้งาน จะถือเป็นการโจมตี ผู้โจมตีจะเพิ่มผลเผาลาวาเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น หลังจากเปิดใช้งาน Molten Core การโจมตีด้วยสกิลใช้งานในสถานะลาวาสามารถเปิดใช้ Ending Land และสถานะลาวาจะเก็บผลทั้งหมดไว้หลังสิ้นสุดรอบ',
		describe_in = 'Siapa pun yang menghina saya dan tidak bisa terbang akan saya hukum! Original Groudon memasuki mode persiapan bertarung dan bergegas ke markas, mengaktifkan transformasi super, lalu menembakkan meriam energi tinggi yang menyebabkan 700% Kerusakan Fisik pada satu target musuh. +$(skillLevel*4*90)$ Kerusakan Fisik, serangan ini memiliki efek penyebaran retakan tanah (menimbulkan tambahan 50% kerusakan akhir dari skill ini ke target di sekitarnya) dan langsung mengaktifkan Ending Land, masuk ke status lava selama 2 giliran: langsung meningkatkan pengurangan kerusakan diri sendiri sebesar 60% dan mempertahankan setengah efek permanen setelah ronde berlanjut selesai; saat menerima skill aktif, itu adalah serangan. Penyerang menambahkan efek terbakar lava selama 2 giliran. Setelah mengaktifkan Molten Core, menerima serangan skill aktif saat dalam status Lava dapat mengaktifkan Ending Land dan status lava akan mempertahankan semua efek setelah ronde berakhir.',
		describe_ph = 'Sinumang mang-insulto sa akin at hindi makalipad ay parurusahan ko! Pumasok ang Original Groudon sa estado ng paghahanda ng laban at nagtungo sa base, nag-activate ng super transformation, pagkatapos ay nagpaputok ng mataas na enerhiyang kanyon na nagdudulot ng 700% Physical Damage sa isang kalabang target. +$(skillLevel*4*90)$ Physical Damage, ang atakeng ito ay may epekto ng pagkalat ng bitak sa lupa (nagdudulot ng dagdag na 50% ng huling pinsala ng kasanayang ito sa mga kalapit na target) at agad na nag-activate ng Ending Land, pumapasok sa lava state ng 2 turn: agad na nagpapataas ng 60% ng sariling damage reduction at pinananatili ang kalahati ng permanenteng epekto pagkatapos ng sunud-sunod na mga round; kapag tumanggap ng active skill, ito ay atake. Dagdag ang attacker ng lava burn effect sa loob ng 2 turn. Pagkatapos i-activate ang Molten Core, ang pagtanggap ng active skill attack habang nasa Lava state ay maaaring mag-trigger ng Ending Land at ang lava state ay magpapanatili ng lahat ng epekto pagkatapos ng round.',
		describe_ma = 'Sesiapa yang menghina saya dan tidak dapat terbang akan saya hukum! Original Groudon memasuki mod persediaan pertempuran dan meluru ke markas, mengaktifkan transformasi super, kemudian melepaskan meriam tenaga tinggi menyebabkan 700% Kerosakan Fizikal kepada satu sasaran musuh. +$(skillLevel*4*90)$ Kerosakan Fizikal, serangan ini mempunyai kesan merebakkan retakan tanah (menyebabkan tambahan 50% kerosakan akhir kemahiran ini kepada sasaran di sekeliling) dan terus mengaktifkan Ending Land, memasuki keadaan lava selama 2 pusingan: serta-merta meningkatkan pengurangan kerosakan diri sendiri sebanyak 60% dan mengekalkan separuh kesan kekal selepas pusingan berterusan berakhir; apabila menerima kemahiran aktif, ia adalah serangan. Penyerang menambah kesan terbakar lava selama 2 pusingan. Selepas mengaktifkan Molten Core, menerima serangan kemahiran aktif dalam keadaan Lava boleh mengaktifkan Ending Land dan keadaan lava akan mengekalkan semua kesan selepas pusingan tamat.',
		describe = 'Anyone who insults me and cannot fly will be punished by me! Original Groudon enters battle preparation mode and rushes to the base, activating super transformation, then fires a high-energy cannon causing 700% Physical Damage to one enemy target. +$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s Physical Damage, this attack has an effect that causes ground crack diffusion (inflicting an additional 50% of the final damage of this skill to surrounding targets) and immediately triggers an Ending Land, entering the lava state for 2 turns: instantly increasing self damage reduction by 60% and retaining half of the permanent effects after the continuous rounds end; when receiving an active skill, it is an attack. The attacker adds a lava burn effect for 2 turns. After activating Molten Core, receiving an active skill attack while in Lava state can trigger Ending Land and the lava state retains all effects after the round ends.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Groudon ban đầu thức tỉnh từ bề mặt magma, sau đó triệu hồi magma để gây sát thương vật lý cho một mục tiêu kẻ thù. Cuộc tấn công này đi kèm với hiệu ứng của Vùng đất kết thúc. Sau khi Lõi nóng chảy được kích hoạt, trạng thái dung nham có thể được kích hoạt bằng các đòn tấn công kỹ năng chủ động và trạng thái dung nham sẽ giữ lại mọi hiệu ứng sau khi kết thúc vòng đấu.',
		simDesc_en = 'Groudon initially awakens from the magma surface, then summons magma to deal physical damage to a target enemy. This attack is accompanied by the effect of the Ended Land Zone. After the Molten Core is activated, the lava state can be triggered by active skill attacks, and the lava state retains all effects after the round ends.',
		simDesc_th = 'กรูดอนตื่นขึ้นครั้งแรกจากผิวแมกมา จากนั้นเรียกแมกมาเพื่อสร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพแก่เป้าหมายศัตรู การโจมตีนี้มาพร้อมกับเอฟเฟกต์ของโซนดินแดนที่สิ้นสุดแล้ว หลังจากที่แก่นกลางร้อนละลายถูกเปิดใช้งาน สถานะลาวาสามารถถูกเปิดใช้งานโดยการโจมตีด้วยทักษะที่ใช้งาน และสถานะลาวาจะรักษาผลกระทบทั้งหมดไว้หลังจบรอบ',
		simDesc_in = 'Groudon awalnya terbangun dari permukaan magma, kemudian memanggil magma untuk memberikan kerusakan fisik pada musuh target. Serangan ini disertai dengan efek Zona Tanah Berakhir. Setelah Inti Cair diaktifkan, status lava dapat diaktifkan oleh serangan skill aktif dan status lava akan mempertahankan semua efek setelah ronde selesai.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Unang nagising si Groudon mula sa ibabaw ng magma, pagkatapos ay nagkatawag ng magma upang magdulot ng pisikal na pinsala sa isang target na kaaway. Kasama ng pag-atakeng ito ang epekto ng Natapos na Lugar ng Lupa. Matapos ma-activate ang Natunaw na Puso, maaaring ma-trigger ang estado ng lava sa pamamagitan ng mga aktibong skill attack at mapapanatili ng estado ng lava ang lahat ng epekto pagkatapos ng katapusan ng round.',
		simDesc_ma = 'Groudon pada mulanya bangun dari permukaan magma, kemudian memanggil magma untuk memberikan kerosakan fizikal kepada sasaran musuh. Serangan ini disertai dengan kesan Zon Tanah Berakhir. Selepas Teras Cair diaktifkan, keadaan lava boleh diaktifkan oleh serangan kemahiran aktif dan keadaan lava akan mengekalkan semua kesan selepas pusingan tamat.',
		simDesc = 'Groudon initially awakens from the magma surface, then summons magma to deal physical damage to a target enemy. This attack is accompanied by the effect of the Ended Land Zone. After the Molten Core is activated, the lava state can be triggered by active skill attacks, and the lava state retains all effects after the round ends.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[19733],
		-- {11}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Gây sát thương chuẩn tương đương 20% lượng máu đã mất của bản thân lên mục tiêu trong phạm vi, đồng thời kích nổ toàn bộ hiệu ứng Thiêu Đốt của địch; sau khi Lõi Dung Nham khởi động, sát thương kích nổ Thiêu Đốt tăng 20%.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Deals true damage equal to 20% of the user\'s lost HP to targets within range, and detonates all Burn effects on enemies; after Molten Core is activated, Burn detonation damage increases by 20%.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Deals true damage equal to 20% of the user\'s lost HP to targets within range, and detonates all Burn effects on enemies; after Molten Core is activated, Burn detonation damage increases by 20%.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'สร้างความเสียหายจริงเท่ากับ 20% ของพลังชีวิตที่เสียไปของตนเองแก่เป้าหมายในระยะ และทำให้เอฟเฟกต์การถูกเผาทั้งหมดของศัตรูระเบิด; หลังจากเปิดใช้งานแกนลาวา ความเสียหายจากการระเบิดของการถูกเผาเพิ่มขึ้น 20%',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Memberikan damage sejati sebesar 20% dari HP yang hilang milik diri sendiri kepada target di dalam jangkauan, sekaligus meledakkan semua efek Terbakar pada musuh; setelah Inti Lava diaktifkan, damage ledakan Terbakar meningkat 20%.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Nagdudulot ng totoong pinsala na katumbas ng 20% ng nawalang HP ng sarili sa mga target sa saklaw, at sumasabog ng lahat ng Burn effects ng mga kalaban; pagkatapos umandar ang Molten Core, tumataas ang pinsala ng Burn explosion ng 20%.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Menyebabkan kerosakan benar bersamaan dengan 20% jumlah HP yang hilang daripada diri sendiri kepada sasaran dalam julat, serta meletupkan semua kesan Terbakar pada musuh; selepas Teras Lava diaktifkan, kerosakan letupan Terbakar meningkat sebanyak 20%.',
		zawakeSimpleDesc = '<Primal Power> Improved effect: Upon activation, increases own damage reduction by 60% and earthquake damage in the ultimate skill includes true damage equal to 50% of own lost HP.  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = '<Primal Power> Improved effect: Upon activation, increases own damage reduction by 60% and earthquake damage in the ultimate skill includes true damage equal to 50% of own lost HP.  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = '<พลังดึกดำบรรพ์> เอฟเฟกต์ที่ปรับปรุง: เมื่อเปิดใช้งาน ลดความเสียหายเพิ่มขึ้น 60% และความเสียหายจากแผ่นดินไหวในท่าไม้ตายจะกลายเป็นความเสียหายจริง 50% ของ HP ที่สูญเสีย',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = '<Kekuatan Purba> Efek peningkatan: Saat diaktifkan, meningkatkan pengurangan damage sebesar 60% dan damage gempa pada skill ultimate menyertakan damage asli sebesar 50% dari HP yang hilang  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = '<Primal Power> Pinahusay na epekto: Kapag na-activate, dagdag 60% damage reduction at ang earthquake damage ng ultimate ay may kasamang tunay na pinsala na katumbas ng 50% ng sariling nawawalang HP  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = '<Kekuatan Purba> Kesan ditambah baik: Apabila diaktifkan, meningkatkan pengurangan kerosakan sebanyak 60% dan kerosakan gempa dalam skill ultimate akan termasuk kerosakan sebenar sebanyak 50% daripada HP yang hilang  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = '<Sức mạnh nguyên thủy> Cải thiện hiệu ứng: Khi được kích hoạt, khả năng giảm sát thương của bản thân tăng lên 60% và sát thương động đất trong chiêu thức đặc biệt đi kèm với sát thương thực sự là 50% lượng HP đã mất của bản thân.',
		upLvDesc = 'Fixed damage +360',
		upLvDesc_en = 'Fixed damage +360',
		upLvDesc_th = 'ความเสียหายคงที่ +360',
