		zawakeEffectDesc = 'The Grass Turtle absorbs sunlight, emitting a beam of energy from within its body to attack all enemy targets, causing #C0xE69900#110% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, vines rise from the ground with a 50% chance to <entangle> enemies for 1 turn (entangle: control effect, unable to act, can be destroyed by burning).',
