		skillName_ph = 'Ragnarök',
		skillName_ma = 'Ragnarök',
		skillName = 'Ragnarök',
		describe_vn = 'Kratos tấn công một mục tiêu kẻ thù duy nhất, gây ra #C0xE69900#640% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ của #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B# và mất 8% sinh mạng hiện tại. , thêm [Ngọn lửa thiêu đốt] vào mục tiêu trong 1 lượt (Ngọn lửa thiêu đốt: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, lỗ hổng thuộc tính lửa 20%, có thể bị xua tan, không thể chồng chất, phát nổ sau lượt của mục tiêu, gây Sát Thương Vật Lý thuộc tính lửa của đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý 100% của Kratos (có thể chí mạng), sau đó chuyển thành 2 đợt đốt cháy, nó sẽ phát nổ ngay lập tức khi thêm Ngọn lửa thiêu đốt liên tục)',
		describe_en = 'Kratos attacks a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#640% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*75)$ of #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# and losing 8% of current health. Applies [Burning Flame] to the target for 1 turn (Burning Flame: negative effect, 20% fire attribute weakness, can be dispelled, cannot stack, explodes after the target\'s turn, dealing Kratos\' Physical Damage with fire attribute 100% (can critical hit), then splits into 2 burning phases, it will immediately explode if [Burning Flame] is applied continuously).',
		describe_th = 'Kratos โจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรูเดี่ยว สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#640%#C0x5B545B# +$(skillLevel*4*75)$ ของ #C0xF13B54#ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# และสูญเสียพลังชีวิตปัจจุบัน 8% เพิ่ม [เปลวไฟเผาไหม้] ให้เป้าหมาย 1 เทิร์น (เปลวไฟเผาไหม้: ผลลบ, จุดอ่อนธาตุไฟ 20%, สามารถลบได้, ไม่สามารถทับซ้อน, ระเบิดหลังเทิร์นของเป้าหมาย, สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพธาตุไฟ 100% ของ Kratos (อาจเกิดคริติคอล), จากนั้นเปลี่ยนเป็นการเผาไหม้ 2 ช่วง, จะระเบิดทันทีหากเพิ่ม [เปลวไฟเผาไหม้] ติดต่อกัน)',
		describe_in = 'Kratos menyerang satu target musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#640% Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*75)$ dari #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B# dan kehilangan 8% dari HP saat ini. Menambahkan [Api Membara] ke target selama 1 giliran (Api Membara: efek negatif, kelemahan atribut api 20%, dapat dihilangkan, tidak dapat ditumpuk, meledak setelah giliran target, memberikan Kerusakan Fisik atribut api 100% dari Kratos (dapat kritikal), kemudian berubah menjadi 2 gelombang terbakar, akan langsung meledak jika [Api Membara] ditambahkan secara beruntun).',
		describe_ph = 'Atake ni Kratos ang isang target na kaaway, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#640% Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*75)$ ng #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B# at nawawala ng 8% ng kasalukuyang buhay. Nagdadagdag ng [Nagsusunog na Apoy] sa target sa loob ng 1 turn (Nagsusunog na Apoy: negatibong epekto, 20% kahinaan sa apoy na katangian, maaaring ma-dispel, hindi pwedeng mag-stack, sumasabog pagkatapos ng turn ng target, nagdudulot ng Pisikal na Pinsala na may katangian ng apoy ng 100% mula kay Kratos (maaaring critical hit), pagkatapos ay naghahati sa 2 yugto ng pagsunog, agad itong sasabog kapag patuloy na nadagdag ang [Nagsusunog na Apoy]).',
		describe_ma = 'Kratos menyerang satu sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#640% Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*75)$ Kerosakan Fizikal #C0xF13B54# dan kehilangan 8% kesihatan semasa. Tambah [Api Membakar] pada sasaran selama 1 pusingan (Api Membakar: kesan negatif, kelemahan atribut api 20%, boleh disingkirkan, tidak boleh bertindih, meletup selepas giliran sasaran, menyebabkan Kerosakan Fizikal beratribut api 100% Kratos (boleh kritikal), kemudian bertukar kepada 2 gelombang pembakaran, ia akan meletup serta-merta jika [Api Membakar] ditambah berterusan).',
		describe = 'Kratos attacks a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#640% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*75)$ of #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# and losing 8% of current health. Applies [Burning Flame] to the target for 1 turn (Burning Flame: negative effect, 20% fire attribute weakness, can be dispelled, cannot stack, explodes after the target\'s turn, dealing Kratos\' Physical Damage with fire attribute 100% (can critical hit), then splits into 2 burning phases, it will immediately explode if [Burning Flame] is applied continuously).',
