		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Prince Piplup lightly jumps up, perfectly spins 360 degrees in the air, then collides with a single enemy target using its body, dealing #C0x3D8A99#90% Magical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, permanently converting 2% of own critical resistance into 15% Magical Attack (can stack, up to 5 layers)',
