		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Prince Piplup surfs quickly to the target, attacking the enemy\'s horizontal target row, dealing #C0x3D8A99#290% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, each time the user has a negative effect or control effect, damage increases by 15% (up to 100%)',
