		describe = 'Luxio jumps into the air, then focuses all the electricity in its body into an electric orb to attack the enemy\'s target with the lowest physical defense, dealing 430% Physical Damage + $(skillLevel*4*60)$ Physical Damage. The residual electricity causes 15% splash damage to units surrounding the target.',
