		describe = 'Lucario uses a skateboard to attack by spinning around a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#140% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increasing his own speed by 15% for 2 turns.',
