		skillName = 'Blizzard',
		describe_vn = 'Super Blizzard King ẩn mình trong bão tuyết và tấn công tất cả kẻ thù, gây #C0xE69900#160% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ của #C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, triệu hồi [Blizzard Weather] 2 Một vòng lớn (Blizzard Weather: hiệu ứng thời tiết, ở cuối mỗi vòng lớn, tất cả Anh hùng không phải băng trên sân có 10% khả năng bị đóng băng trong 2 hiệp và sẽ được giải phóng sau khi nhận được mạng sống tích lũy vượt quá 30% mục tiêu. Mục tiêu không bị đóng băng sẽ chịu sát thương loại băng bằng 70% đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý của Super Blizzard King) và bảo vệ tất cả đồng minh khỏi tác động của [Thời tiết bão tuyết]',
		describe_en = 'Super Blizzard King hides in the blizzard and attacks all enemies, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ of #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, summoning [Blizzard Weather] 2 Large rounds (Blizzard Weather: weather effect, at the end of each large round, all non-ice Heroes on the field have a 10% chance to be frozen for 2 turns and will be released after receiving accumulated life exceeding 30% of the target. Unfrozen targets receive ice damage equal to 70% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage) and protects all allies from the effects of [Blizzard Weather].',
		describe_th = 'ราชันย์พายุหิมะซุปเปอร์ซ่อนตัวในพายุหิมะและโจมตีศัตรูทั้งหมด สร้าง #C0xE69900#160% ความเสียหายกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ ของ #C0xF13B54#ความเสียหายกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# เรียก [Blizzard Weather] 2 รอบใหญ่ (Blizzard Weather: เอฟเฟกต์สภาพอากาศ ในตอนท้ายของแต่ละรอบใหญ่ ฮีโร่ที่ไม่ใช่ธาตุน้ำแข็งทุกตัวมีโอกาส 10% ที่จะถูกแช่แข็งเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์นและจะได้รับการปลดปล่อยหลังจากได้รับพลังชีวิตสะสมเกิน 30% ของเป้าหมาย เป้าหมายที่ไม่ได้ถูกแช่แข็งจะได้รับความเสียหายธาตุน้ำแข็งเท่ากับ 70% ของความเสียหายกายภาพของราชันย์พายุหิมะซุปเปอร์) และปกป้องพันธมิตรทั้งหมดจากผลของ [Blizzard Weather].',
		describe_in = 'Super Blizzard King bersembunyi dalam badai salju dan menyerang semua musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#160% Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ dari #C0xF13B54#Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, memanggil [Blizzard Weather] 2 Putaran besar (Blizzard Weather: efek cuaca, di akhir setiap putaran besar, semua Pahlawan non-es di medan memiliki kemungkinan 10% untuk dibekukan selama 2 giliran dan akan dilepaskan setelah menerima akumulasi kehidupan melebihi 30% target. Target yang tidak dibekukan akan menerima damage es sebesar 70% dari Kerusakan Fisik Super Blizzard King) dan melindungi semua sekutu dari efek [Blizzard Weather].',
		describe_ph = 'Nagtatago ang Super Blizzard King sa gitna ng malakas na niyebe at inaatake ang lahat ng kalaban, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#160% Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ ng #C0xF13B54#Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#, nagpapatawag ng [Blizzard Weather] 2 Malalaking round (Blizzard Weather: epektong pangkalikasan, sa pagtatapos ng bawat malaking round, ang lahat ng hindi-yeyong Bayani sa larangan ay may 10% tsansang ma- freeze ng 2 turn at mapapalaya pagkatapos makatanggap ng naipon na buhay na higit sa 30% ng target. Ang mga hindi na-frozen na target ay tatanggap ng yelong pinsala na katumbas ng 70% ng Pisikal na Pinsala ni Super Blizzard King) at pinoprotektahan ang lahat ng kakampi mula sa epekto ng [Blizzard Weather].',
		describe_ma = 'Super Blizzard King bersembunyi dalam ribut salji dan menyerang semua musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#160% Kecederaan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ daripada #C0xF13B54#Kecederaan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, memanggil [Blizzard Weather] 2 Pusingan besar (Blizzard Weather: kesan cuaca, di akhir setiap pusingan besar, semua Wira bukan ais di medan mempunyai 10% kemungkinan untuk dibekukan selama 2 pusingan dan akan dilepaskan selepas menerima hayat terkumpul melebihi 30% sasaran. Sasaran yang tidak dibekukan akan menerima kecederaan ais sebanyak 70% daripada Kecederaan Fizikal Super Blizzard King) dan melindungi semua sekutu daripada kesan [Blizzard Weather].',
		describe = 'Super Blizzard King hides in the blizzard and attacks all enemies, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ of #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, summoning [Blizzard Weather] 2 Large rounds (Blizzard Weather: weather effect, at the end of each large round, all non-ice Heroes on the field have a 10% chance to be frozen for 2 turns and will be released after receiving accumulated life exceeding 30% of the target. Unfrozen targets receive ice damage equal to 70% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage) and protects all allies from the effects of [Blizzard Weather].',
		simDesc_vn = 'Super Blizzard King ẩn mình trong trận bão tuyết và tấn công tất cả kẻ thù, triệu hồi [Thời tiết bão tuyết]',
		simDesc_en = 'Super Blizzard King hides within the blizzard and attacks all enemies, summoning <Blizzard Weather>',
