		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Super Blizzard King hides in the blizzard and attacks all enemies, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ of #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, summoning <Blizzard Weather> 2 Big Rounds (Blizzard Weather: weather effect, at the end of each big round, all non-ice heroes on the field have a 20% chance to be frozen for 2 turns and will be released after receiving accumulated life exceeding 30% of the target. Unfrozen targets will receive ice attribute damage equal to 100% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage) and protect all allies from the effects of <Blizzard Weather>',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Super Blizzard King hides in the blizzard and attacks all enemies, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ of #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, summoning <Blizzard Weather> 2 Big Rounds (Blizzard Weather: weather effect, at the end of each big round, all non-ice heroes on the field have a 20% chance to be frozen for 2 turns and will be released after receiving accumulated life exceeding 30% of the target. Unfrozen targets will receive ice attribute damage equal to 100% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage) and protect all allies from the effects of <Blizzard Weather>',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'ราชาภูเขาน้ำแข็งซูเปอร์ซ่อนตัวในพายุหิมะและโจมตีศัตรูทั้งหมด สร้าง #C0xE69900#160% ดาเมจกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ ของ #C0xF13B54#ดาเมจกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# เรียก <สภาพอากาศพายุหิมะ> 2 รอบใหญ่ (สภาพอากาศพายุหิมะ: ผลกระทบของสภาพอากาศ เมื่อสิ้นสุดแต่ละรอบใหญ่ ฮีโร่ที่ไม่ใช่น้ำแข็งในสนามทั้งหมดมีโอกาส 20% ที่จะถูกแช่แข็งเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น และจะถูกปลดปล่อยหลังจากได้รับชีวิตสะสมเกิน 30% ของเป้าหมาย เป้าหมายที่ไม่ถูกแช่แข็งจะได้รับความเสียหายธาตุน้ำแข็งเท่ากับ 100% ของดาเมจกายภาพของราชาภูเขาน้ำแข็งซูเปอร์) และปกป้องพันธมิตรทั้งหมดจากผลของ <สภาพอากาศพายุหิมะ>',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Super Blizzard King bersembunyi dalam badai salju dan menyerang semua musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#160% Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ dari #C0xF13B54#Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, memanggil <Cuaca Badai Salju> 2 Putaran Besar (Cuaca Badai Salju: efek cuaca, di akhir setiap putaran besar, semua pahlawan bukan es di medan perang memiliki 20% peluang untuk membeku selama 2 giliran dan akan dilepaskan setelah menerima akumulasi kehidupan melebihi 30% dari target. Target yang tidak membeku akan menerima kerusakan atribut es sebesar 100% dari Kerusakan Fisik Super Blizzard King) dan melindungi semua sekutu dari efek <Cuaca Badai Salju>',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Ang Super Blizzard King ay nagtago sa gitna ng malakas na bagyong niyebe at umaatake sa lahat ng kalaban, naghahatid ng #C0xE69900#160% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ ng #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, nagbibigkis ng <Blizzard Weather> 2 Malalaking Round (Blizzard Weather: epektong panahon, sa katapusan ng bawat malaking round, lahat ng mga bayani na hindi yelo sa larena ay may 20% tsansa na ma-freeze ng 2 turn at mapapalaya matapos makatanggap ng naipong buhay na lumampas sa 30% ng target. Ang mga target na hindi na-freeze ay tatanggap ng ice attribute damage na katumbas ng 100% ng Physical Damage ng Super Blizzard King) at pinoprotektahan ang lahat ng kakampi mula sa mga epekto ng <Blizzard Weather>',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Raja Blizzard Super bersembunyi dalam ribut salji dan menyerang semua musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#160% Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ daripada #C0xF13B54#Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, memanggil <Cuaca Ribut Salji> 2 Pusingan Besar (Cuaca Ribut Salji: kesan cuaca, pada akhir setiap pusingan besar, semua wira bukan ais di medan pertarungan mempunyai peluang 20% untuk dibekukan selama 2 giliran dan akan dibebaskan selepas menerima jumlah nyawa terkumpul melebihi 30% daripada sasaran. Sasaran yang tidak dibekukan akan menerima kerosakan atribut ais sebanyak 100% daripada Kerosakan Fizikal Raja Blizzard Super) dan melindungi semua sekutu daripada kesan <Cuaca Ribut Salji>',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Super Blizzard King ẩn mình trong bão tuyết và tấn công tất cả kẻ thù, gây #C0xE69900#160% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$ của #C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, triệu hồi <Blizzard Weather> 2 Một vòng lớn (Blizzard Weather: hiệu ứng thời tiết, ở cuối mỗi vòng lớn, tất cả Những anh hùng không phải băng trên sân có 20% khả năng bị đóng băng trong 2 hiệp và sẽ được giải phóng sau khi nhận được mạng sống tích lũy vượt quá 30% mục tiêu. Các mục tiêu không bị đóng băng sẽ chịu sát thương thuộc tính băng bằng 100% đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý của Super Blizzard King) và bảo vệ tất cả đồng minh khỏi tác động của <Thời tiết bão tuyết>',
		zawakeSimpleType = 2,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'Blizzard Weather: Weather effect. At the end of each major round, all heroes without Ice on the field have a 10% chance to be frozen for 2 turns. They will be released after receiving cumulative HP above 30% of their max. Unfrozen targets will take Ice damage equal to 70% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Blizzard Weather: Weather effect. At the end of each major round, all heroes without Ice on the field have a 20% chance to be frozen for 2 turns. They will be released after receiving cumulative HP above 30% of their max. Unfrozen targets will take Ice damage equal to 100% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'Blizzard Weather: Weather effect. At the end of each major round, all heroes without Ice on the field have a 10% chance to be frozen for 2 turns. They will be released after receiving cumulative HP above 30% of their max. Unfrozen targets will take Ice damage equal to 70% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Blizzard Weather: Weather effect. At the end of each major round, all heroes without Ice on the field have a 20% chance to be frozen for 2 turns. They will be released after receiving cumulative HP above 30% of their max. Unfrozen targets will take Ice damage equal to 100% of Super Blizzard King\'s Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'สภาพอากาศพายุหิมะ: เอฟเฟกต์สภาพอากาศ เมื่อจบแต่ละรอบใหญ่ ฮีโร่ที่ไม่มีน้ำแข็งจะมีโอกาส 10% ถูกแช่แข็งเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น จะถูกปล่อยเมื่อฟื้นฟู HP สะสมเกิน 30% เป้าหมายที่ไม่ถูกแช่แข็งจะได้รับความเสียหายธาตุน้ำแข็ง 70%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→สภาพอากาศพายุหิมะ: เอฟเฟกต์สภาพอากาศ ฮีโร่ที่ไม่มีน้ำแข็งจะมีโอกาส 20% ถูกแช่แข็ง 2 เทิร์น จะถูกปล่อยเมื่อ HP สะสมเกิน 30%, เป้าหมายที่ไม่ถูกแช่แข็งจะได้รับดาเมจน้ำแข็ง 100% จาก Super Blizzard King#C0x5B545B#',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Cuaca Badai Salju: Efek cuaca. Di akhir setiap ronde besar, semua hero tanpa elemen es memiliki 10% peluang untuk dibekukan selama 2 giliran. Mereka akan dilepaskan setelah menerima pemulihan HP kumulatif lebih dari 30% dari target. Target yang tidak beku akan menerima damage es sebesar 70% dari Serangan Fisik Super Blizzard King\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Cuaca Badai Salju: Efek cuaca. Di akhir setiap ronde besar, semua hero tanpa elemen es memiliki 20% peluang untuk dibekukan selama 2 giliran. Mereka akan dilepaskan setelah menerima pemulihan HP kumulatif lebih dari 30%. Target yang tidak beku akan menerima damage es sebesar 100% dari Serangan Fisik Super Blizzard King#C0x5B545B#',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'Blizzard Weather: Weather effect. Sa dulo ng bawat major round, lahat ng hero na walang Ice ay may 10% chance na ma-freeze ng 2 turns. Lalaya sila kapag nakatanggap ng total heal na lumampas sa 30%. Ang hindi ma-freeze ay tatamaan ng Ice damage na katumbas ng 70% ng Physical Damage ni Super Blizzard King\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Blizzard Weather: Weather effect. Sa dulo ng bawat major round, lahat ng hero na walang Ice ay may 20% chance na ma-freeze ng 2 turns. Lalaya sila kapag nakatanggap ng total heal >30%. Ang hindi ma-freeze ay tatamaan ng Ice damage na katumbas ng 100% Physical Damage ni Super Blizzard King#C0x5B545B#',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = 'Cuaca Ribut Salji: Kesan cuaca. Pada akhir setiap pusingan besar, semua hero tanpa elemen ais mempunyai 10% peluang untuk dibekukan selama 2 pusingan. Mereka akan dibebaskan setelah menerima pemulihan melebihi 30% HP maksimum. Sasaran yang tidak dibekukan akan menerima kerosakan ais sebanyak 70% Serangan Fizikal Super Blizzard King\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Cuaca Ribut Salji: Pada akhir pusingan besar, semua hero tanpa ais mempunyai 20% peluang untuk dibekukan selama 2 pusingan. Yang tidak dibekukan akan menerima kerosakan ais sebanyak 100% daripada Serangan Fizikal Super Blizzard King#C0x5B545B#',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = 'Thời tiết bão tuyết: Hiệu ứng thời tiết. Vào cuối mỗi hiệp đấu lớn, tất cả các anh hùng không có băng trên sân đều có 10% khả năng bị đóng băng trong 2 hiệp. Họ sẽ được thả sau khi nhận được mạng sống tích lũy vượt quá 30% mục tiêu. Mục tiêu không bị đóng băng sẽ chịu sát thương băng bằng 70% đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý của Super Blizzard King\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→Blizzard Weather: Hiệu ứng thời tiết. Vào cuối mỗi hiệp đấu lớn, tất cả các anh hùng không có băng trên sân đều có 20% khả năng bị đóng băng trong 2 hiệp. Họ sẽ được thả sau khi nhận được mạng sống tích lũy vượt quá 30% mục tiêu. Mục tiêu không bị đóng băng sẽ chịu sát thương băng ở mức 100% đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý của Super Blizzard King#C0x5B545B#',
