		zawakeEffectDesc = 'King Yanwu uses all his strength to leap into the air, then attacks an enemy target with his blazing body, dealing #C0xE69900#150% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. This attack has a 40% chance to bypass the enemy\'s shield.',
