		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Mouse Burrow digs into the ground (during this time cannot be attacked), before the next action, burrow up to attack the enemy with the highest physical defense, dealing #C0xE69900#440% Physical Attack #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ Physical Damage #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B#, and deals true damage equal to 200% of the target\'s physical defense, temporarily increases critical rate by 30% for this attack',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Mouse Burrow digs into the ground (during this time cannot be attacked), before the next action, burrow up to attack the enemy with the highest physical defense, dealing #C0xE69900#440% Physical Attack #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ Physical Damage #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B#, and deals true damage equal to 200% of the target\'s physical defense, temporarily increases critical rate by 30% for this attack',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'Vít Đất Chuột ดำดิ่งลงดิน (ในช่วงเวลานี้ไม่สามารถถูกโจมตีได้), ก่อนการกระทำถัดไป ลุกขึ้นโจมตีเป้าหมายที่มีการป้องกันทางกายภาพสูงสุดของศัตรู สร้างความเสียหาย #C0xE69900#440% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B# และสร้างความเสียหายจริงเท่ากับ 200% ของการป้องกันทางกายภาพของเป้าหมาย เพิ่มอัตราคริติคอลชั่วคราว 30% สำหรับการโจมตีครั้งนี้',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Vít Đất Chuột menggali ke dalam tanah (selama waktu ini tidak bisa diserang), sebelum tindakan berikutnya, menyerang target musuh dengan pertahanan fisik tertinggi, memberikan #C0xE69900#440% Serangan Fisik #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ Kerusakan Fisik #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B#, dan memberikan damage nyata sebesar 200% pertahanan fisik target, meningkat 30% peluang kritis sementara untuk serangan ini',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Vít Đất Chuột humukot sa lupa (sa panahong ito ay hindi maaaring atakihin), bago ang susunod na aksyon, sumugod sa kalaban na may pinakamataas na pisikal na depensa, nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#440% Pisikal na Atake #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ Pisikal na Pinsala #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B#, at nagdudulot ng totoong pinsala na katumbas ng 200% pisikal na depensa ng target, pansamantalang nagdaragdag ng 30% tsansang kritikal para sa atakeng ito',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Vít Đất Chuột menggali ke dalam tanah (semasa ini tidak boleh diserang), sebelum tindakan seterusnya, menggali naik menyerang sasaran dengan pertahanan fizikal tertinggi musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#440% Serangan Fizikal #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ Kerosakan Fizikal #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B#, dan menyebabkan kerosakan sebenar sebanyak 200% pertahanan fizikal sasaran, meningkatkan 30% kadar kritikal sementara untuk serangan ini',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Vít Đất Chuột chui vào lòng đất (trong thời gian này không thể bị tấn công), trước khi hành động tiếp theo của bản thân, chui lên tấn công mục tiêu có phòng thủ vật lý cao nhất của địch, gây ra #C0xE69900#440% Công Vật Lý #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0xF13B54##C0x5B545B#, và gây sát thương thực tế bằng 200% phòng thủ vật lý của mục tiêu, tăng 30% tỷ lệ chí mạng tạm thời cho lần tấn công này',
