		describe = 'The little craftsman throws materials to attract the enemy\'s attention, then quickly slides to attack a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#130% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, with a 35% chance to stun for [1 turn] (stun: a control effect, unable to act).',
