		describe_vn = 'Rết trăm chân phun một đám sương độc tấn công mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch, gây #C0xE69900#210% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, 50% xác suất thêm hiệu ứng [trúng độc] 2 lượt (trúng độc: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, mục tiêu mỗi lượt mất sát thương thực bằng 20% Công Vật Lý của Rết trăm chân, tối đa cộng dồn 5 tầng), mỗi mục tiêu [trúng độc] thêm, Vua Rết tăng 10% sát thương',
		describe_en = 'The Hundred-Legged Centipede sprays a cloud of poisonous mist to attack the enemy\'s front-line targets, causing #C0xE69900#210% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. There is a 50% chance to apply the [poisoned] effect for 2 turns (poisoned: a negative effect where the target takes true damage equal to 20% of the Hundred-Legged Centipede\'s Physical Attack each turn, stacking up to 5 layers). For each target affected by [poisoned], the Centipede King gains 10% increased damage.',
		describe_th = 'ตะขาบร้อยขาขับไล่หมอกพิษเพื่อโจมตีเป้าหมายแนวหน้าของศัตรู สร้างความเสียหาย #C0xE69900#210% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# มีโอกาส 50% ที่จะเพิ่มสถานะ [ติดพิษ] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น ([ติดพิษ]: ผลกระทบทางลบ เป้าหมายจะได้รับความเสียหายจริงเท่ากับ 20% ของพลังโจมตีทางกายภาพของตะขาบร้อยขาทุกเทิร์น สูงสุดสะสมได้ 5 ชั้น) สำหรับเป้าหมายแต่ละตัวที่ [ติดพิษ] กษัตริย์ตะขาบจะเพิ่มความเสียหายขึ้น 10%',
		describe_in = 'Kalajengking Seratus Kaki menyemburkan kabut racun untuk menyerang target garis depan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#210% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#. Ada 50% kemungkinan menambahkan efek [terracun] selama 2 giliran ([terracun]: efek negatif, target kehilangan damage nyata sebesar 20% dari Serangan Fisik Kalajengking Seratus Kaki setiap giliran, maksimal bertumpuk hingga 5 lapis). Setiap target yang [terracun], Raja Kalajengking mendapatkan peningkatan 10% damage.',
		describe_ph = 'Anggulong May Isang Daang Paangumid ng isang ulap ng nakalalasong ulap upang atakihin ang mga front-line na target ng kaaway, nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#210% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#. May 50% posibilidad na magdagdag ng epekto ng [namumubo] sa loob ng 2 turn (namumubo: negatibong epekto, ang target ay nawawala ng tunay na pinsala na katumbas ng 20% ng Pisikal na Atake ng Daang Paang Anggulo sa bawat turn, hanggang sa maximum na 5 layer ang maaaring maipon). Sa bawat target na [namumubo], tumataas ng 10% ang pinsala ng Hari ng Anggulo.',
		describe_ma = 'Kelawar Seratus Kaki menyembur kabus beracun menyerang sasaran barisan hadapan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#210% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#. 50% peluang untuk menambah kesan [tercelu] selama 2 pusingan ([tercelu]: kesan negatif, sasaran akan kehilangan kerosakan sebenar sebanyak 20% Serangan Fizikal Kelawar Seratus Kaki setiap pusingan, maksimum bertindih 5 lapisan). Setiap sasaran yang [tercelu], Raja Kelawar meningkat 10% kerosakan.',
		describe = 'The Hundred-Legged Centipede sprays a cloud of poisonous mist to attack the enemy\'s front-line targets, causing #C0xE69900#210% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. There is a 50% chance to apply the [poisoned] effect for 2 turns (poisoned: a negative effect where the target takes true damage equal to 20% of the Hundred-Legged Centipede\'s Physical Attack each turn, stacking up to 5 layers). For each target affected by [poisoned], the Centipede King gains 10% increased damage.',
