		describe_vn = 'Bánh xe lăn phóng sương độc đâm vào mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch, gây #C0xE69900#220% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, 50% xác suất thêm hiệu ứng [trúng độc] 2 lượt (trúng độc: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, mục tiêu mỗi lượt mất sát thương thực bằng 20% Công Vật Lý của Bánh xe, tối đa cộng dồn 5 tầng), mỗi mục tiêu [trúng độc] thêm, Vua Rết tăng 10% sát thương',
		describe_en = 'The Rolling Wheel launches a poisonous mist piercing the enemy\'s front row target, dealing #C0xE69900#220% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, with a 50% chance to inflict [Poisoned] effect for 2 turns ([Poisoned]: negative effect, the target loses true damage each turn equal to 20% of the Rolling Wheel\'s Physical Attack, stacking up to 5 layers). For each [Poisoned] target, the Centipede King gains 10% damage.',
		describe_th = 'ล้อหมุนปล่อยหมอกพิษเจาะเป้าหมายแถวหน้าของศัตรู สร้างความเสียหาย #C0xE69900#220% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# มีโอกาส 50% ที่จะทำให้เกิดสถานะ [พิษ] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น ([พิษ]: ผลลบ, เป้าหมายจะสูญเสียความเสียหายจริงทุกเทิร์นเท่ากับ 20% ของพลังโจมตีทางกายภาพของล้อหมุน สะสมได้สูงสุด 5 ชั้น) สำหรับทุกเป้าหมายที่ [พิษ] ราชาแมงป่องจะเพิ่มพลังโจมตีขึ้น 10%',
		describe_in = 'Roda Berputar melepaskan kabut racun menembus target barisan depan musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#220% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 50% menambahkan efek [Teracuni] selama 2 giliran ([Teracuni]: efek negatif, target kehilangan damage nyata setiap giliran sebesar 20% dari Serangan Fisik Roda Berputar, menumpuk hingga 5 lapisan). Untuk setiap target [Teracuni], Raja Kelabang meningkatkan damage sebesar 10%.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Nagpapatulong na Gulong ay nagpapalabas ng lason na hamog na tumutusok sa harapang target ng kalaban, nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#220% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#, may 50% na tsansa na magdagdag ng epekto ng [Natamaan ng Lason] sa loob ng 2 turn ([Natamaan ng Lason]: negatibong epekto, nawawalan ang target ng totoong pinsala bawat turn na katumbas ng 20% ng Pisikal na Atake ng Nagpapatulong na Gulong, maaaring tumakbo hanggang 5 layer). Sa bawat target na [Natamaan ng Lason], tumataas ng 10% ang pinsala ng Haring Alupihan.',
		describe_ma = 'Roda Berputar melancarkan kabus beracun menembusi sasaran barisan hadapan musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#220% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, dengan kebarangkalian 50% untuk menambahkan kesan [Beracun] selama 2 pusingan ([Beracun]: kesan negatif, sasaran kehilangan kerosakan sebenar setiap pusingan bersamaan 20% Serangan Fizikal Roda Berputar, bertindih hingga 5 lapisan). Setiap sasaran [Beracun], Raja Kelabang meningkatkan kerosakan sebanyak 10%.',
		describe = 'The Rolling Wheel launches a poisonous mist piercing the enemy\'s front row target, dealing #C0xE69900#220% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*34)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, with a 50% chance to inflict [Poisoned] effect for 2 turns ([Poisoned]: negative effect, the target loses true damage each turn equal to 20% of the Rolling Wheel\'s Physical Attack, stacking up to 5 layers). For each [Poisoned] target, the Centipede King gains 10% damage.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Bánh xe lăn và phun ra sương độc tấn công mục tiêu ở hàng trước, có khả năng gây độc.',
		simDesc_en = 'The wheel rolls and sprays toxic mist to attack targets in the front row, with the ability to poison.',
		simDesc_th = 'ล้อเคลื่อนที่และพ่นหมอกพิษโจมตีเป้าหมายในแถวหน้า มีความสามารถในการทำให้เป็นพิษ',
