		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'For both sides, each Earth-element hero deployed permanently increases own Physical Attack by 5%\n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→For both sides, each Earth-element hero deployed permanently increases own Physical Attack by 8%  ',
