		skillName = 'Spatial distortion',
		describe_vn = 'Trước mỗi lượt hành động của bản thân, có #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# xác suất bao bọc trạng thái tiêu cực của bản thân vào không gian dị thứ, trước khi bắt đầu lượt hành động tiếp theo, sẽ chuyển hiệu ứng tiêu cực trong không gian dị thứ cho một đơn vị kẻ địch ngẫu nhiên',
		describe_en = 'Before each of your action turns, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to encapsulate your negative status effects into a mysterious space. Before starting your next action turn, the negative effects in the mysterious space will be transferred to a random enemy unit.',
		describe_th = 'ก่อนเริ่มรอบการกระทำแต่ละครั้งของตัวเอง จะมีโอกาส #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# ที่จะครอบคลุมสถานะลบของตัวเองไว้ในห้วงเวลาแปลกประหลาด ก่อนเริ่มรอบการกระทำถัดไป สถานะลบในห้วงเวลาแปลกประหลาดจะถูกส่งต่อไปยังศัตรูแบบสุ่มหนึ่งหน่วย',
		describe_in = 'Sebelum setiap giliran aksi Anda, ada kemungkinan #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# untuk membungkus status negatif Anda ke dalam ruang aneh. Sebelum giliran aksi berikutnya dimulai, efek negatif dalam ruang aneh tersebut akan dipindahkan ke satu unit musuh secara acak.',
		describe_ph = 'Bago ang bawat sarili mong turn sa aksyon, may #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# na tsansa na balutin ang sarili mong negatibong status sa isang kakaibang espasyo. Bago magsimula ang susunod na turn sa aksyon, ang negatibong epekto sa kakaibang espasyong ito ay ililipat sa isang random na yunit ng kalaban.',
		describe_ma = 'Sebelum setiap giliran tindakan anda, terdapat kebarangkalian #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# untuk membalut status negatif anda ke dalam ruang aneh. Sebelum memulakan giliran tindakan seterusnya, kesan negatif dalam ruang aneh itu akan dipindahkan kepada satu unit musuh secara rawak.',
		describe = 'Before each of your action turns, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to encapsulate your negative status effects into a mysterious space. Before starting your next action turn, the negative effects in the mysterious space will be transferred to a random enemy unit.',
