		skillName = 'Spatial distortion',
		describe_vn = 'Trước mỗi lượt hành động của bản thân, có #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# xác suất bao bọc trạng thái tiêu cực của bản thân vào không gian dị thứ, trước khi bắt đầu lượt hành động tiếp theo, sẽ chuyển hiệu ứng tiêu cực trong không gian dị thứ cho một đơn vị kẻ địch ngẫu nhiên',
		describe_en = 'Before each of your turns, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to encapsulate your negative status effects into an alternate dimension. Before starting your next turn, the negative effects in the alternate dimension will be transferred to a random enemy unit.',
		describe_th = 'ก่อนเริ่มการกระทำแต่ละครั้งของตัวเอง มีโอกาส #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# ในการห่อหุ้มสถานะลบของตัวเองไว้ในมิติอันแปลกประหลาด ก่อนเริ่มต้นรอบถัดไป สถานะลบในมิตินั้นจะถูกโอนไปยังศัตรูหนึ่งตัวแบบสุ่ม',
		describe_in = 'Sebelum setiap giliran tindakan Anda, ada peluang #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# untuk melindungi status negatif Anda ke dalam ruang dimensi aneh. Sebelum memulai giliran berikutnya, efek negatif di ruang dimensi tersebut akan dipindahkan ke satu unit musuh secara acak.',
		describe_ph = 'Bago ang bawat galaw ng iyong aksyon, may #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# na pagkakataon na balutin ang iyong negatibong estado sa isang kakaibang dimensyon. Bago magsimula ang susunod mong galaw, ang negatibong epekto sa kakaibang dimensyon ay ililipat sa isang random na kalaban.',
		describe_ma = 'Sebelum setiap giliran tindakan anda, terdapat #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# kemungkinan untuk membungkus status negatif diri anda ke dalam ruang dimensi aneh. Sebelum memulakan giliran seterusnya, kesan negatif dalam ruang dimensi aneh akan dipindahkan kepada satu unit musuh secara rawak.',
		describe = 'Before each of your turns, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to encapsulate your negative status effects into an alternate dimension. Before starting your next turn, the negative effects in the alternate dimension will be transferred to a random enemy unit.',
