		describe_ma = 'Sebelum setiap tindakan, terdapat kebarangkalian #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# untuk menyimpan status negatifnya dalam lampu magik. Sebelum pusingan tindakan seterusnya, kesan negatif dalam lampu magik akan dipindahkan ke unit musuh rawak.',
		describe = 'Before each action, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(50+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to store its negative status in the magic lamp. Before the next action round, the negative effects in the magic lamp will be transferred to a random enemy unit.',
