		zawakeEffectDesc = 'The Mini Ice Spike summons ice spikes continuously at the feet of a single enemy target to attack, dealing #C0x3D8A99#390% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, and causes the target to be <ice vulnerable> for 3 turns (ice vulnerable: a debuff that increases damage taken by 20% from ice skills).',
