		simDesc_ma = 'Dodo Ice menarik nafas, kemudian melepaskan cincin ais di sekelilingnya untuk menyerang satu sasaran musuh tunggal.',
		simDesc = 'Dodo Ice takes a breath, then releases an ice ring around itself to attack a single enemy target.',
