		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Duoduo releases ice shards to attack a single enemy target, dealing 400% Magic Power + $(skillLevel*4*60)$ Magic Damage, and causing the target to be <ice vulnerable> for 3 turns (ice vulnerable: a debuff that increases damage taken by 20% when attacked by ice skills).',
