		describe_ma = 'Béo ú-đực mengumpul air secukupnya, sentiasa menyembur meriam air menyerang sasaran barisan musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#230% Serangan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B#, serta menyebabkan Kerosakan Sihir tambahan sebanyak 30% daripada had nyawa sendiri.',
		describe = 'Chubby Male Bully accumulates enough water, continuously spitting water cannons to attack the enemy\'s horizontal target, causing #C0x3D8A99#230% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, and simultaneously causing additional Magic Damage equal to 30% of his own maximum health.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Fatty - Nam tích trữ nước, liên tục phun ra nước tấn công mục tiêu theo hàng, gây thêm sát thương phép thuật tương ứng với một phần giới hạn sinh lực của bản thân.',
		simDesc_en = 'Fatty - Accumulates water, continuously sprays water to attack targets in a row, dealing additional magic damage based on a portion of its own health limit.',
		simDesc_th = 'Fatty - สะสมพลังน้ำ พ่นน้ำโจมตีเป้าหมายต่อเนื่องเป็นแถว ก่อให้เกิดความเสียหายเวทเพิ่มเติมตามสัดส่วนของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของตนเอง',
