		describe_vn = 'Zombie cao bồi không tuân theo đạo đức võ thuật. Họ hạ gục lũ troll của mình để tấn công một mục tiêu kẻ thù, gây ra #C0xE69900#450% Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0x5B545B#. Nó tăng khả năng phòng thủ vật lý của bản thân thêm 30% trong 2 lượt; nó làm tăng cơn thịnh nộ của các anh hùng ở hàng sau thêm 150 điểm.',
		describe_en = 'Cowboy zombies do not follow martial ethics. They take down their trolls to attack an enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#450% Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#. It increases its own physical defense by 30% for 2 turns; it increases the rage of the heroes in the back row by 150 points.',
		describe_th = 'ซอมบี้คาวบอยไม่ปฏิบัติตามจรรยาบรรณศิลปะการต่อสู้ พวกเขากำจัดโทรลล์ของตนเองเพื่อต่อสู้กับเป้าหมายศัตรู สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#450% #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0x5B545B# เพิ่มการป้องกันทางกายภาพของตนเองขึ้น 30% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น และเพิ่มความโกรธของฮีโร่ในแถวหลังขึ้น 150 คะแนน',
		describe_in = 'Zombie koboi tidak mematuhi etika bela diri. Mereka menundukkan troll mereka untuk menyerang target musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#450% Kerusakan Fisik #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik #C0x5B545B#. Ini meningkatkan pertahanan fisik mereka sendiri sebesar 30% selama 2 giliran; ini juga meningkatkan kemarahan para pahlawan di barisan belakang sebanyak 150 poin.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang mga cowboy zombie ay hindi sumusunod sa etika ng martial arts. Pinapatumba nila ang kanilang mga troll upang atakihin ang isang kaaway na target, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#450% Pisikal na Pinsala #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala #C0x5B545B#. Pinapataas nito ang sariling pisikal na depensa ng 30% sa loob ng 2 turn; pinapalakas nito ang galit ng mga bayani sa likurang linya ng 150 puntos.',
		describe_ma = 'Zombi koboi tidak mengikuti etika seni mempertahankan diri. Mereka mengalahkan troll mereka untuk menyerang sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#450% Kecederaan Fizikal #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Kecederaan Fizikal #C0x5B545B#. Ia meningkatkan pertahanan fizikal dirinya sebanyak 30% selama 2 pusingan; ia juga meningkatkan kemarahan wira-wira di barisan belakang sebanyak 150 mata.',
		describe = 'Cowboy zombies do not follow martial ethics. They take down their trolls to attack an enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#450% Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#. It increases its own physical defense by 30% for 2 turns; it increases the rage of the heroes in the back row by 150 points.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Zombie cao bồi không tôn trọng võ đạo. Họ sử dụng bình xịt của mình để tấn công một mục tiêu của kẻ thù, tăng khả năng phòng thủ vật lý của chính họ và tăng sự tức giận của các anh hùng ở hàng sau của họ.',
		simDesc_en = 'Cowboy zombies disrespect the code of martial arts. They use their spray cans to attack an enemy target, increasing their own physical defense and boosting the rage of the heroes behind them.',
		simDesc_th = 'ซอมบี้คาวบอยไม่เคารพในหลักวิชาการต่อสู้ พวกเขาใช้สเปรย์ของตนโจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรู เพิ่มความสามารถในการป้องกันทางกายภาพของตนเองและเพิ่มความโกรธแค้นของฮีโร่ที่อยู่ข้างหลัง',
		simDesc_in = 'Zombie koboi tidak menghormati kode bela diri. Mereka menggunakan semprotan mereka untuk menyerang target musuh, meningkatkan pertahanan fisik mereka sendiri dan meningkatkan amarah pahlawan di belakang mereka.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Hindi iginagalang ng zombie cowboy ang kodigo ng pakikipaglaban. Ginagamit nila ang kanilang spray para atakihin ang isang target na kalaban, pinapataas ang kanilang sariling pisikal na depensa at pinalalakas ang galit ng mga bayani sa likuran nila.',
		simDesc_ma = 'Zombie koboi tidak menghormati kod seni mempertahankan diri. Mereka menggunakan semburan mereka untuk menyerang sasaran musuh, meningkatkan pertahanan fizikal mereka sendiri dan meningkatkan kemarahan wira di belakang mereka.',
		simDesc = 'Cowboy zombies disrespect the code of martial arts. They use their spray cans to attack an enemy target, increasing their own physical defense and boosting the rage of the heroes behind them.',
