		skillName_ph = 'Araw ng Demonio',
		skillName_ma = 'Api Syaitan',
		skillName = 'Demon Fire',
		describe_vn = 'Crystal Lantern sử dụng bốn chiếc sừng đèn để triệu hồi một quả cầu năng lượng tấn công một mục tiêu kẻ thù, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#180% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4* 48)$’s #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Phép Thuật #C0x5B545B# và đi kèm với [Will-o\'-the-wisp] hiệu ứng\n[Will-o\'-the-wisp]: ngay lập tức giảm cơn thịnh nộ đi 100 điểm và giảm lượng cơn thịnh nộ tương tự trước hành động tiếp theo',
		describe_en = 'Crystal Lantern uses four lantern horns to summon an energy orb that attacks an enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#180% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B# and accompanied by the [Will-o\'-the-wisp] effect \n[Will-o\'-the-wisp]: immediately reduces rage by 100 points and decreases the same amount of rage before the next action.',
		describe_th = 'Crystal Lantern ใช้เขากระทิงสี่เขาเพื่อนำมาซึ่งลูกแก้วพลังงานโจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรู สร้างความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x3D8A99#180%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$’s #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ #C0x5B545B# พร้อมด้วยเอฟเฟกต์ [Will-o\'-the-wisp] \n[Will-o\'-the-wisp]: ลดความโกรธทันที 100 แต้มและลดความโกรธเท่ากันก่อนการกระทำครั้งต่อไป',
		describe_in = 'Crystal Lantern menggunakan empat tanduk lentera untuk memanggil bola energi yang menyerang target musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#180% Kerusakan Magis#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Magis #C0x5B545B# dan disertai dengan efek [Will-o\'-the-wisp] \n[Will-o\'-the-wisp]: segera mengurangi kemarahan sebanyak 100 poin dan mengurangi jumlah kemarahan yang sama sebelum tindakan berikutnya.',
		describe_ph = 'Ginagamit ng Crystal Lantern ang apat na sungay ng parol upang magpa-summon ng isang orb ng enerhiya na umaatake sa isang kaaway na target, nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#180% na Sakit na Mahika#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$\'s #C0xF13B54# na Sakit na Mahika #C0x5B545B# at sinasamahan ng epekto ng [Will-o\'-the-wisp] \n[Will-o\'-the-wisp]: agad na nagpapababa ng 100 puntos ng galit at pinapababa ang parehong halaga ng galit bago ang susunod na aksyon.',
		describe_ma = 'Crystal Lantern menggunakan empat tanduk lampu untuk memanggil bola tenaga yang menyerang sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#180% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir #C0x5B545B# dan disertakan dengan kesan [Will-o\'-the-wisp] \n[Will-o\'-the-wisp]: segera mengurangkan kemarahan sebanyak 100 mata dan mengurangkan jumlah kemarahan yang sama sebelum tindakan seterusnya.',
		describe = 'Crystal Lantern uses four lantern horns to summon an energy orb that attacks an enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#180% Magical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Magical Damage #C0x5B545B# and accompanied by the [Will-o\'-the-wisp] effect \n[Will-o\'-the-wisp]: immediately reduces rage by 100 points and decreases the same amount of rage before the next action.',
