		describe = 'Bear Đồng Nguyên uses strong hands to deliver two ice punches to a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#150% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# and simultaneously increases own speed and Physical Attack by 15% for 2 turns.',
