		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Shana fires countless energy swords at the enemies\' backline targets, dealing #C0x3D8A99#350% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$#C0xF13B54# Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#, adding 20% increased vulnerability to the main target for 1 turn, increasing the chance to invite to battle by 20%, and can invite up to 4 friendly groups to attack the selected target.',
