		describe_en = 'Kakarot fires an energy cannon, attacking the enemy\'s horizontal row targets, dealing #C0xE69900#180% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, and increases lifesteal rate by 20% for 2 turns; if this damage exceeds 20% of the target\'s max HP, the target will be stunned for 1 turn.',
