		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Hiệu ứng tăng cường: Tăng mạnh khả năng bùng nổ của Goku: Trạng thái bùng nổ sức mạnh tột độ tăng 30% Công V.Lý, 30% Tỉ lệ chí mạng, 30% Sát thương chí mạng trong lần tấn công này.',
		zawakeSimpleType = 2,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'Enhancement Effect: Greatly boosts Goku\'s explosive power: The Extreme Power Burst state increases Physical ATK by 25%, Critical Rate by 25%, and Critical DMG by 25% in this attack. \n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Enhancement Effect: Greatly boosts Goku\'s explosive power: The Extreme Power Burst state increases Physical ATK by 30%, Critical Rate by 30%, and Critical DMG by 30% in this attack.',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'Enhancement Effect: Greatly boosts Goku\'s explosive power: The Extreme Power Burst state increases Physical ATK by 25%, Critical Rate by 25%, and Critical DMG by 25% in this attack. \n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Enhancement Effect: Greatly boosts Goku\'s explosive power: The Extreme Power Burst state increases Physical ATK by 30%, Critical Rate by 30%, and Critical DMG by 30% in this attack.',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์เสริม: เพิ่มพลังระเบิดของโกคูอย่างมาก: สถานะพลังระเบิดขั้นสูงเพิ่ม ATK กายภาพ 25%, อัตราคริติคอล 25% และดาเมจคริติคอล 25% ในการโจมตีครั้งนี้ \n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ เอฟเฟกต์เสริม: เพิ่มพลังระเบิดของโกคูอย่างมาก: สถานะพลังระเบิดขั้นสูงเพิ่ม ATK กายภาพ 30%, อัตราคริติคอล 30% และดาเมจคริติคอล 30% ในการโจมตีครั้งนี้',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Efek Peningkatan: Secara besar meningkatkan kekuatan ledakan Goku: Status Ledakan Kekuatan Ekstrem meningkatkan ATK Fisik sebesar 25%, Peluang Crit sebesar 25%, dan DMG Crit sebesar 25% dalam serangan ini. \n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Efek Peningkatan: Secara besar meningkatkan kekuatan ledakan Goku: Status Ledakan Kekuatan Ekstrem meningkatkan ATK Fisik sebesar 30%, Peluang Crit sebesar 30%, dan DMG Crit sebesar 30% dalam serangan ini.',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'Epekto ng Pagpapalakas: Malaki ang pagtaas ng lakas-pasabog ni Goku: Ang Extreme Power Burst state ay nagpapataas ng Physical ATK ng 25%, Critical Rate ng 25%, at Critical DMG ng 25% sa atakeng ito. \n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Epekto ng Pagpapalakas: Malaki ang pagtaas ng lakas-pasabog ni Goku: Ang Extreme Power Burst state ay nagpapataas ng Physical ATK ng 30%, Critical Rate ng 30%, at Critical DMG ng 30% sa atakeng ito.',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = 'Kesan Peningkatan: Meningkatkan kuasa letupan Goku dengan ketara: Keadaan Letupan Kuasa Maksimum meningkatkan ATK Fizikal sebanyak 25%, Kadar Kritikal sebanyak 25%, dan DMG Kritikal sebanyak 25% dalam serangan ini. \n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Kesan Peningkatan: Meningkatkan kuasa letupan Goku dengan ketara: Keadaan Letupan Kuasa Maksimum meningkatkan ATK Fizikal sebanyak 30%, Kadar Kritikal sebanyak 30%, dan DMG Kritikal sebanyak 30% dalam serangan ini.',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng tăng cường: Tăng mạnh khả năng bùng nổ của Goku: Trạng thái bùng nổ sức mạnh tột độ tăng 25% Công V.Lý, 25% Tỉ lệ chí mạng, 25% Sát thương chí mạng trong lần tấn công này. \n#F20# \n#F40##C0x5c9970#→ Hiệu ứng tăng cường: Tăng mạnh khả năng bùng nổ của Goku: Trạng thái bùng nổ sức mạnh tột độ tăng 30% Công V.Lý, 30% Tỉ lệ chí mạng, 30% Sát thương chí mạng trong lần tấn công này.',
