		skillName = 'Ice Age',
		describe_vn = '#C0xB15BFF#[Máy chủ thử nghiệm]#C0x5B545B#, Kyurem ngay lập tức nhận được 2 [Snowflakes] và biến sân thành [Frozen World] trong 2 hiệp: tốc độ và khả năng phòng thủ gấp đôi của tất cả đơn vị địch trong sân giảm 30%\n#F10# \n#F40# Nếu không có mục tiêu bị cấm trên sân, hãy đánh dấu một mục tiêu ngẫu nhiên ở hàng sau của kẻ địch làm mục tiêu [bị cấm] trong 2 lượt. Lệnh cấm sẽ được sử dụng để chữa lành mục tiêu [bị cấm] và tấn công một mục tiêu (tự động, nếu có mục tiêu bị cấm, mục tiêu bị cấm sẽ được chọn trước bất kể vị trí). Vào #C0xE69900#Sát Thương Vật Lý 600%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40#Ice Wall: [Frozen World] tồn tại trong một hiệp. Nếu còn chỗ trống ở hàng trước, một bức tường băng sẽ được triệu hồi: bức tường băng thừa hưởng 30% máu tối đa của Kyurem. Khi bức tường băng bị phá vỡ, nó sẽ gây 240% Sát Thương Phép Thuật của rồng băng lên tất cả kẻ địch và đóng băng một đơn vị kẻ địch ngẫu nhiên trong 2 lượt.',
		describe_en = '#C0xB15BFF#[Test Server]#C0x5B545B#, Kyurem immediately receives 2 [Snowflakes] and transforms the field into [Frozen World] for 2 rounds: speed and defense of all enemy units on the field are doubled, and reduced by 30%\n#F10# \n#F40# If there is no banned target on the field, mark a random target in the back row of the enemy as [banned] for 2 turns. The ban command will be used to heal the [banned] target and attack a target (automatic, if there is a banned target, the banned target will be selected first regardless of position). Deals #C0xE69900#600% PHYSICAL DAMAGE#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#PHYSICAL DAMAGE#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Ice Wall: [Frozen World] lasts for one round. If there is space in the front row, an Ice Wall will be summoned: the Ice Wall inherits 30% of Kyurem\'s max HP. When the Ice Wall breaks, it deals 240% Magical Damage of the ice dragon to all enemies and freezes a random enemy unit for 2 turns.',
		describe_th = '#C0xB15BFF#[เซิร์ฟเวอร์ทดสอบ]#C0x5B545B#, Kyurem รับทันที 2 [เกล็ดหิมะ] และเปลี่ยนสนามรบเป็น [โลกน้ำแข็ง] เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ: ความเร็วและการป้องกันของหน่วยศัตรูทั้งหมดในสนามจะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่าและลดลง 30%\n#F10# \n#F40# หากไม่มีเป้าหมายที่ถูกห้ามในสนาม ให้ทำเครื่องหมายเป้าหมายแบบสุ่มในแถวหลังของศัตรูเป็น [ถูกห้าม] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น คำสั่งห้ามจะถูกใช้เพื่อรักษาเป้าหมายที่ [ถูกห้าม] และโจมตีเป้าหมาย (อัตโนมัติ หากมีเป้าหมายที่ถูกห้าม จะเลือกเป้าหมายที่ถูกห้ามก่อนโดยไม่คำนึงตำแหน่ง) สร้าง #C0xE69900#600% ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# กำแพงน้ำแข็ง: [โลกน้ำแข็ง] คงอยู่ 1 รอบ หากมีที่ว่างในแถวหน้า จะมีการเรียกกำแพงน้ำแข็ง: กำแพงน้ำแข็งได้รับเลือดสูงสุด 30% ของ Kyurem เมื่อกำแพงน้ำแข็งถูกทำลาย จะทำความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ 240% ของมังกรน้ำแข็งแก่ศัตรูทั้งหมดและทำให้ศัตรูสุ่มแช่แข็งเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = '#C0xB15BFF#[Server Uji Coba]#C0x5B545B#, Kyurem langsung menerima 2 [Snowflakes] dan mengubah medan menjadi [Frozen World] selama 2 giliran: kecepatan dan pertahanan semua unit musuh di medan digandakan dan dikurangi 30%\n#F10# \n#F40# Jika tidak ada target yang dilarang di medan, tandai sebuah target acak di baris belakang musuh sebagai [dilarang] selama 2 giliran. Perintah larangan akan digunakan untuk menyembuhkan target [dilarang] dan menyerang sebuah target (otomatis, jika ada target yang dilarang, target tersebut akan dipilih terlebih dahulu tanpa memandang posisi). Memberikan #C0xE69900#600% DAMAGE FISIK#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#DAMAGE FISIK#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Tembok Es: [Frozen World] bertahan satu giliran. Jika ada ruang di baris depan, sebuah Tembok Es akan dipanggil: Tembok Es mewarisi 30% dari HP maksimal Kyurem. Ketika Tembok Es hancur, akan memberikan 240% Damage Magis naga es ke semua musuh dan membekukan satu unit musuh secara acak selama 2 giliran.',
		describe_ph = '#C0xB15BFF#[Test Server]#C0x5B545B#, Agadagad ay makakuha ng 2 [Snowflakes] at agad na ginawang [Frozen World] ang field sa loob ng 2 turn: doble ang bilis at depensa ng lahat ng kalaban sa field habang binabawasan ng 30%\n#F10# \n#F40# Kung walang ipinagbabawal na target sa field, markahan ang isang random na target sa likurang hanay ng kalaban bilang [ipinagbabawal] sa loob ng 2 turn. Gagamitin ang ban command para magpagaling sa [ipinagbabawal] na target at umatake sa isang target (awtomatiko, kapag may ipinagbabawal na target, pagpipiliin muna ang ipinagbabawal na target kahit saan man ito). Nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#600% PISIKAL NA SAKIT#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#PISIKAL NA SAKIT#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Ice Wall: [Frozen World] ay tumatagal ng isang turn. Kung may puwang sa harapang hanay, isang Ice Wall ang tatawagin: inherits ng Ice Wall ang 30% ng pinakamataas na HP ni Kyurem. Kapag nabasag ang Ice Wall, nagdudulot ito ng 240% ice dragon Magical Damage sa lahat ng kalaban at pinapairal ang isang random na kalaban sa loob ng 2 turn.',
		describe_ma = '#C0xB15BFF#[Pelayan Ujian]#C0x5B545B#, Kyurem segera menerima 2 [Salji Salji] dan mengubah medan menjadi [Dunia Beku] selama 2 pusingan: kelajuan dan pertahanan semua unit musuh di medan menjadi dua kali ganda dan dikurangkan sebanyak 30%\n#F10# \n#F40# Jika tiada sasaran yang diharamkan di medan, tandakan sasaran rawak di barisan belakang musuh sebagai [dilarang] selama 2 pusingan. Perintah larangan akan digunakan untuk menyembuhkan sasaran [dilarang] dan menyerang sasaran (automatik, jika terdapat sasaran yang diharamkan, sasaran tersebut akan dipilih terlebih dahulu tanpa mengira kedudukan). Memberikan #C0xE69900#600% KEROSAKAN FIZIKAL#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#KEROSAKAN FIZIKAL#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Dinding Ais: [Dunia Beku] wujud selama satu pusingan. Jika terdapat ruang di barisan hadapan, Dinding Ais akan dipanggil: Dinding Ais mewarisi 30% daripada HP maksimum Kyurem. Apabila Dinding Ais pecah, ia akan memberikan 240% Kerosakan Sihir naga ais kepada semua musuh dan membekukan satu unit musuh rawak selama 2 pusingan.',
		describe = '#C0xB15BFF#[Test Server]#C0x5B545B#, Kyurem immediately receives 2 [Snowflakes] and transforms the field into [Frozen World] for 2 rounds: speed and defense of all enemy units on the field are doubled, and reduced by 30%\n#F10# \n#F40# If there is no banned target on the field, mark a random target in the back row of the enemy as [banned] for 2 turns. The ban command will be used to heal the [banned] target and attack a target (automatic, if there is a banned target, the banned target will be selected first regardless of position). Deals #C0xE69900#600% PHYSICAL DAMAGE#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#PHYSICAL DAMAGE#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Ice Wall: [Frozen World] lasts for one round. If there is space in the front row, an Ice Wall will be summoned: the Ice Wall inherits 30% of Kyurem\'s max HP. When the Ice Wall breaks, it deals 240% Magical Damage of the ice dragon to all enemies and freezes a random enemy unit for 2 turns.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Tổng quan về kỹ năng đặc biệt:',
		simDesc_en = 'Overview of special skills:',
