		describe_vn = '#C0xB15BFF#[Máy chủ thử nghiệm]#C0x5B545B##L10#Ice Huyết thống: #L0# Kyurem miễn nhiễm với hiệu ứng đóng băng. Khi hàng đầu của anh ta chết, một cột băng sẽ được tạo ra, kế thừa 30% giới hạn máu trên của Kyurem. Khi cột băng bị vỡ, nó sẽ gây 240% Sát Thương Phép Thuật cho tất cả kẻ địch và đóng băng một tướng địch ngẫu nhiên trong 2 lượt;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Snowflake Guard: Kyurem sẽ bị theo sau bởi 3 [bông tuyết] khi bước vào sân: vòng đời của tất cả các bông tuyết là 3 vòng lớn và giới hạn trên là 3. Khi Kyurem chịu một sát thương duy nhất lớn hơn 20% tổng cơ thể của mình mất máu, một bông tuyết sẽ được tiêu hao để khiến lượng máu mất đi này bằng với giới hạn 20. % máu trên của chính anh ta, khi Bông tuyết được tiêu thụ, sẽ có #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# xác suất đóng băng nguồn sát thương của mục tiêu này trong 1 lượt và tăng 10% giảm sát thương của Kyurem trong 2 lượt\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Săn băng: #L0# Khi Kyurem bước vào, anh ta đánh dấu một mục tiêu ngẫu nhiên ở hàng sau của kẻ địch làm mục tiêu [Săn bắn] trong 2 lượt: giảm 90% tốc độ của mục tiêu. Khi dấu săn kết thúc, mục tiêu bị đóng băng trong 1 lượt. Kyurem sẽ ưu tiên tấn công các mục tiêu có dấu hiệu [Săn bắn]. Trong thời gian đánh dấu săn bắn, sát thương của mỗi đòn tấn công sẽ tăng thêm 10%.',
		describe_en = '#C0xB15BFF#[Test Server]#C0x5B545B##L10#Ice Blood Stat: #L0# Kyurem is immune to freezing effects. When his front line dies, an ice pillar is created, inheriting 30% of Kyurem\'s max HP. When the ice pillar breaks, it deals 240% Magic Damage to all enemies and freezes a random enemy hero for 2 turns;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Snowflake Guard: Kyurem is followed by 3 [snowflakes] when entering the field: the lifespan of all snowflakes is 3 major rounds, with a maximum of 3. When Kyurem takes a single damage greater than 20% of his total body HP, a snowflake is consumed to reduce this HP loss to equal 20% of his max HP. When a snowflake is consumed, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to freeze the damage source of this target for 1 turn and increase Kyurem\'s damage reduction by 10% for 2 turns;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Ice Hunt: #L0# When Kyurem enters, he marks a random target in the enemy\'s backline with the [Hunt] mark for 2 turns: reduces the target\'s speed by 90%. When the Hunt mark ends, the target is frozen for 1 turn. Kyurem will prioritize attacking targets marked with [Hunt]. While marked by Hunt, the damage of each attack is increased by 10%.',
		describe_th = '#C0xB15BFF#[เซิร์ฟเวอร์ทดสอบ]#C0x5B545B##L10#สถานะเลือดน้ำแข็ง: #L0# Kyurem ป้องกันการแช่แข็ง เมื่อตัวหน้าของเขาตาย จะมีเสาแข็งเกิดขึ้น โดยสืบทอดเลือดสูงสุด 30% ของ Kyurem เมื่อเสาน้ำแข็งแตก จะสร้างความเสียหายเวทย์ 240% ให้กับศัตรูทั้งหมด และแช่แข็งฮีโร่ศัตรูแบบสุ่มเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#เกราะเกล็ดหิมะ: Kyurem จะตามด้วย [เกล็ดหิมะ] 3 ชิ้นเมื่อเข้าสนาม: อายุของเกล็ดหิมะทั้งหมดคือ 3 รอบใหญ่ และจำกัดสูงสุดที่ 3 เมื่อ Kyurem ได้รับความเสียหายครั้งเดียวที่มากกว่า 20% ของเลือดทั้งหมดของเขา จะมีการใช้เกล็ดหิมะ 1 ชิ้นเพื่อลดความเสียหายนั้นให้เท่ากับ 20% ของเลือดสูงสุดของเขา เมื่อใช้เกล็ดหิมะ จะมีโอกาส #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# ที่จะทำให้แหล่งที่มาของความเสียหายถูกแช่แข็งเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น และเพิ่มการลดความเสียหายของ Kyurem 10% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#การล่าน้ำแข็ง: #L0# เมื่อ Kyurem เข้าสนาม เขาจะทำเครื่องหมายเป้าหมายสุ่มในแถวหลังของศัตรูด้วยเครื่องหมาย [ล่า] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น: ลดความเร็วของเป้าหมายลง 90% เมื่อเครื่องหมายล่าสิ้นสุด เป้าหมายจะถูกแช่แข็งเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น Kyurem จะให้ความสำคัญกับการโจมตีเป้าหมายที่มีเครื่องหมาย [ล่า] ในช่วงเวลาที่มีเครื่องหมายล่า ความเสียหายของการโจมตีแต่ละครั้งจะเพิ่มขึ้น 10%.',
		describe_in = '#C0xB15BFF#[Server Uji Coba]#C0x5B545B##L10#Status Darah Es: #L0# Kyurem kebal terhadap efek pembekuan. Ketika barisan depannya mati, sebuah pilar es akan dibuat, mewarisi 30% dari HP maksimum Kyurem. Ketika pilar es hancur, itu akan memberikan 240% Kerusakan Magis ke semua musuh dan membekukan satu pahlawan musuh secara acak selama 2 giliran;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Penjaga Serpihan Salju: Kyurem akan diikuti oleh 3 [serpihan salju] saat memasuki medan: masa hidup semua serpihan salju adalah 3 putaran besar dan batas maksimal adalah 3. Ketika Kyurem menerima satu serangan yang kerusakannya lebih dari 20% dari total HP tubuhnya, satu serpihan salju akan dikonsumsi untuk membuat kehilangan HP ini setara dengan 20% dari HP maksimumnya. Saat Serpihan Salju dikonsumsi, ada #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# peluang untuk membekukan sumber kerusakan target ini selama 1 giliran dan meningkatkan pengurangan kerusakan Kyurem sebesar 10% selama 2 giliran;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Berburu Es: #L0# Ketika Kyurem memasuki medan, dia menandai target acak di barisan belakang musuh sebagai target [Berburu] selama 2 giliran: mengurangi kecepatan target sebesar 90%. Ketika tanda berburu berakhir, target dibekukan selama 1 giliran. Kyurem akan memprioritaskan menyerang target yang ditandai dengan [Berburu]. Selama masa tanda berburu, kerusakan setiap serangan akan meningkat sebesar 10%.',
		describe_ph = '#C0xB15BFF#[Test Server]#C0x5B545B##L10#Ice Blood Status: #L0# Kyurem ayaw malabanan ang freezing effect. Kapag namatay ang kanyang front line, isang ice pillar ang lilikhain, na nagmamana ng 30% ng maximum HP ni Kyurem. Kapag nabasag ang ice pillar, magdudulot ito ng 240% Magic Damage sa lahat ng kalaban at mag-freeze ng isang random na kalaban na bayani sa loob ng 2 turn;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Snowflake Guard: Susundan si Kyurem ng 3 [snowflakes] kapag pumapasok sa field: ang lifespan ng lahat ng snowflakes ay 3 malaking rounds at ang maximum ay 3. Kapag nakatanggap si Kyurem ng isang damage na higit sa 20% ng kanyang total HP, isang snowflake ang ma-kokonsumo upang gawing katumbas ang HP loss na ito sa 20% ng kanyang max HP. Kapag na-konsumo ang snowflake, may #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance na ma-freeze ang damage source ng target na ito sa loob ng 1 turn at tataasan ang damage reduction ni Kyurem ng 10% sa loob ng 2 turn;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Ice Hunt: #L0# Kapag pumasok si Kyurem, mamamarkahan niya ang isang random na target sa backline ng kaaway bilang target ng [Hunt] sa loob ng 2 turn: binabawasan ang speed ng target ng 90%. Kapag natapos ang hunt mark, ma-freeze ang target sa loob ng 1 turn. Prayoridad ni Kyurem ang umatake sa mga target na may senyas [Hunt]. Habang may hunt mark, tataas ang damage ng bawat atake ng 10%.',
		describe_ma = '#C0xB15BFF#[Server Ujian]#C0x5B545B##L10#Status Darah Ais: #L0# Kyurem kebal terhadap kesan pembekuan. Apabila barisan hadapannya mati, satu tiang ais akan dihasilkan, mewarisi 30% daripada had darah maksimum Kyurem. Apabila tiang ais itu pecah, ia akan memberikan 240% Kerosakan Sihir kepada semua musuh dan membekukan satu pahlawan musuh secara rawak selama 2 pusingan;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Pengawal Serpihan Salji: Kyurem akan diikuti oleh 3 [serpihan salji] apabila memasuki medan: hayat semua serpihan salji adalah 3 pusingan besar dan had atasnya adalah 3. Apabila Kyurem menerima kerosakan tunggal yang melebihi 20% daripada jumlah badan keseluruhannya, satu serpihan salji akan digunakan untuk menjadikan kehilangan darah ini sama dengan 20% daripada had darah maksimumnya. Apabila serpihan salji digunakan, terdapat #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# peluang untuk membekukan sumber kerosakan sasaran ini selama 1 pusingan dan meningkatkan pengurangan kerosakan Kyurem sebanyak 10% untuk 2 pusingan;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Siasat Ais: #L0# Apabila Kyurem memasuki medan, dia akan menanda satu sasaran rawak di barisan belakang musuh sebagai sasaran [Siasatan] selama 2 pusingan: mengurangkan kelajuan sasaran sebanyak 90%. Apabila tanda siasatan tamat, sasaran akan dibekukan selama 1 pusingan. Kyurem akan mengutamakan menyerang sasaran yang ditanda dengan [Siasatan]. Semasa tanda siasatan, kerosakan setiap serangan akan meningkat sebanyak 10%.',
		describe = '#C0xB15BFF#[Test Server]#C0x5B545B##L10#Ice Blood Stat: #L0# Kyurem is immune to freezing effects. When his front line dies, an ice pillar is created, inheriting 30% of Kyurem\'s max HP. When the ice pillar breaks, it deals 240% Magic Damage to all enemies and freezes a random enemy hero for 2 turns;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Snowflake Guard: Kyurem is followed by 3 [snowflakes] when entering the field: the lifespan of all snowflakes is 3 major rounds, with a maximum of 3. When Kyurem takes a single damage greater than 20% of his total body HP, a snowflake is consumed to reduce this HP loss to equal 20% of his max HP. When a snowflake is consumed, there is a #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to freeze the damage source of this target for 1 turn and increase Kyurem\'s damage reduction by 10% for 2 turns;\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Ice Hunt: #L0# When Kyurem enters, he marks a random target in the enemy\'s backline with the [Hunt] mark for 2 turns: reduces the target\'s speed by 90%. When the Hunt mark ends, the target is frozen for 1 turn. Kyurem will prioritize attacking targets marked with [Hunt]. While marked by Hunt, the damage of each attack is increased by 10%.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[32436],
		-- {8}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Khi lượng HP của bản thân lần đầu tiên giảm xuống dưới 60% và 30%, lập tức hồi 30% HP và nhận 1 lớp bảo vệ Bông Tuyết.',
		starEffectDesc = 'When your own HP drops below 60% and 30% for the first time, immediately recover 30% HP and gain a Snow Blossom shield.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'When your own HP drops below 60% and 30% for the first time, immediately recover 30% HP and gain a Snow Blossom shield.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'เมื่อ HP ของตัวเองลดลงต่ำกว่า 60% และ 30% เป็นครั้งแรก จะฟื้นฟู HP 30% และได้รับชั้นป้องกันดอกไม้หิมะทันที',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Ketika HP sendiri pertama kali turun di bawah 60% dan 30%, segera pulihkan 30% HP dan dapatkan perlindungan Bunga Salju.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Kapag ang HP mo ay bumaba sa ilalim ng 60% at 30% sa unang pagkakataon, agad na magbawi ng 30% HP at makatanggap ng isang Snow Blossom shield.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Apabila HP sendiri turun bawah 60% dan 30% buat kali pertama, segera pulihkan 30% HP dan dapatkan lapisan pelindung Bunga Salji.',
