		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Meliodas unleashes Sword Skill Divine Thousand Slash to attack a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#210% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#Spell Damage#C0x5B545B#, gaining 2 stacks of <Swordsmanship> and increasing critical hit resistance by 60% until the next critical attack and permanently increasing critical hit resistance by 30% in awakened stance.',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Meliodas unleashes Sword Skill Divine Thousand Slash to attack a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#210% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$#C0xF13B54#Spell Damage#C0x5B545B#, gaining 2 stacks of <Swordsmanship> and increasing critical hit resistance by 60% until the next critical attack and permanently increasing critical hit resistance by 30% in awakened stance.',
