	[32718] = {
		id = 32718,
		describe_vn = 'Triệu hồi binh lính đến giới hạn trên và tăng vĩnh viễn hệ số tấn công của binh lính lên 20% (tối đa 100%)\n#F10# \n#F40# Sau đó, anh ta bước vào giai đoạn sạc pin trong 1 hiệp. Trong thời gian sạc, anh ta tăng 50% tỷ lệ miễn nhiễm khống chế và giảm phòng thủ vật lý và tích trữ cơn giận thu được dưới dạng năng lượng. Khi quá trình sạc kết thúc, anh ta tấn công mục tiêu trong hàng, gây ra #C0xE699 00#600% tấn công#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Vật Lý/phép thuật#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Sau khi sạc, bạn sẽ vào [chế độ tháp pháo], chế độ này sẽ kéo dài cho đến khi vào lần tiếp theo bạn hành động (tốc độ của bạn bị giảm xuống 1 điểm, khi năng lượng được tích trữ đầy đủ, áo giáp sẽ dày lên và bạn sẽ được giảm 30% sát thương. Khi các anh hùng côn trùng hoặc máy móc khác trong nhóm của bạn sử dụng kỹ năng chủ động, Genesect sẽ phóng đại bác hạng nhẹ để hỗ trợ trong trận chiến, gây ra #C0xE69900#480% attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54# tấn công các mục tiêu trong hàng. Sát Thương Vật Lý/phép thuật #C0x5B545B#, tận hưởng phần thưởng sát thương tấn công đặc biệt và giới hạn 2 lần), khi không bị khống chế, đòn tấn công sẽ bị gián đoạn và đòn tấn công đặc biệt sẽ được tung ra trước (gây ra đòn tấn công #C0xE69900#240% cho kẻ thù ngẫu nhiên trong hàng) Đánh #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý/phép thuật #C0x5B545B# và trả lại 300 cơn thịnh nộ, không thể vào [chế độ tháp pháo])',
		describe_en = 'Summon soldiers up to the upper limit and permanently increase soldiers\' attack coefficient by 20% (up to 100%)\n#F10# \n#F40# Then, he enters a charging phase for 1 turn. During charging, he increases control immunity by 50%, reduces physical defense, and stores rage as energy. When charging finishes, he attacks targets in a row dealing #C0xE69900#600% attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54# Physical/Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# After charging, you enter [turret mode], which lasts until your next action (your speed is reduced by 1 point; when energy is fully charged, armor thickens and damage taken is reduced by 30%. When insect or mechanical heroes in your team use active skills, Genesect launches light-support barrage to assist in battle, dealing #C0xE69900#480% attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54# attack to row targets. Physical/Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, enjoying special attack damage bonuses, limited to 2 times). When not controlled, the attack will be interrupted and the special attack will be triggered first (dealing #C0xE69900#240% attack to a random enemy in the row) dealing #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Physical/Magic Damage #C0x5B545B# and returning 300 rage, unable to enter [turret mode]).',
		describe_th = 'เรียกทหารจนถึงขีดจำกัดสูงสุดและเพิ่มอัตราการโจมตีของทหารถาวรขึ้น 20% (สูงสุด 100%)\n#F10# \n#F40# จากนั้นเขาจะเข้าสู่ช่วงชาร์จพลังเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น ในระหว่างการชาร์จ เขาจะเพิ่มอัตราการป้องกันสถานะควบคุมขึ้น 50% ลดการป้องกันทางกายภาพ และเก็บสะสมความโกรธในรูปแบบพลังงาน เมื่อการชาร์จเสร็จสิ้น เขาจะโจมตีเป้าหมายในแถวก่อให้เกิด #C0xE69900#600% การโจมตี#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ/เวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# หลังจากชาร์จ คุณจะเข้าสู่ [โหมดหอปืนใหญ่] โหมดนี้จะคงอยู่จนกว่าคุณจะทำการกระทำครั้งถัดไป (ความเร็วของคุณจะลดลง 1 แต้ม เมื่อพลังงานชาร์จเต็ม ชุดเกราะจะหนาขึ้นและคุณจะได้รับการลดความเสียหาย 30% เมื่อฮีโร่แมลงหรือเครื่องจักรอื่นๆ ในทีมของคุณใช้สกิลแอคทีฟ Genesect จะยิงสนับสนุนเบาในสนามรบ ทำให้เกิด #C0xE69900#480% การโจมตี#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54# โจมตีเป้าหมายในแถว ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ/เวทมนตร์ #C0x5B545B# เพลิดเพลินกับโบนัสความเสียหายโจมตีพิเศษ จำกัด 2 ครั้ง) เมื่อไม่ถูกควบคุม การโจมตีจะถูกขัดจังหวะและท่าโจมตีพิเศษจะถูกใช้ก่อน (ทำ #C0xE69900#240% การโจมตีต่อศัตรูสุ่มในแถว) โจมตี #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ/เวทมนตร์ #C0x5B545B# และคืน 300 ความโกรธ ไม่สามารถเข้าสู่ [โหมดหอปืนใหญ่])',
		describe_in = 'Memanggil pasukan hingga batas atas dan secara permanen meningkatkan koefisien serangan pasukan sebesar 20% (maksimal 100%)\n#F10# \n#F40# Kemudian, ia memasuki fase pengisian daya selama 1 giliran. Selama pengisian, ia meningkatkan resistensi kontrol sebesar 50%, mengurangi pertahanan fisik, dan menyimpan amarah sebagai energi. Ketika pengisian selesai, ia menyerang target dalam barisan, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#600% serangan#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik/Magis#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Setelah pengisian, Anda memasuki [mode turret], yang berlangsung hingga giliran Anda berikutnya (kecepatan Anda berkurang 1 poin; saat energi terisi penuh, armor menjadi lebih tebal dan Anda menerima pengurangan 30% kerusakan. Ketika pahlawan serangga atau mekanik lain dalam tim menggunakan skill aktif, Genesect akan meluncurkan serangan ringan untuk membantu pertempuran, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#480% serangan#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54# menyerang target dalam barisan. Kerusakan Fisik/Magis #C0x5B545B#, menikmati bonus kerusakan serangan khusus, dibatasi 2 kali). Saat tidak dalam kendali, serangan akan terganggu dan serangan khusus akan diluncurkan terlebih dahulu (menyebabkan serangan #C0xE69900#240% ke musuh acak dalam barisan) Menyerang #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik/Magis #C0x5B545B# dan mengembalikan 300 amarah, tidak bisa masuk [mode turret]).',
		describe_ph = 'Nag-summon ng mga sundalo hanggang sa pinakamataas na limitasyon at permanenteng tumataas ang attack coefficient ng mga sundalo ng 20% (hanggang 100% maximum)\n#F10# \n#F40# Pagkatapos, siya ay pumasok sa phase ng charging sa loob ng 1 turn. Sa panahon ng charging, pinapataas niya ang 50% control immunity, binabawasan ang physical defense, at nag-iimbak ng galit bilang enerhiya. Kapag natapos ang charging, inaatake niya ang mga target sa linya na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#600% attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54# Physical/Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Pagkatapos ng charging, papasok ka sa [turret mode], na tatagal hanggang sa susunod mong pag-aksiyon (nalaless ang iyong bilis ng 1 point; kapag puno na ang enerhiya, tumitibay ang armor at nakakatanggap ka ng 30% damage reduction. Kapag ang mga insect o mechanical na mga heroes sa iyong grupo ay gumamit ng active skills, si Genesect ay magpapalabas ng light support barrage upang tumulong sa laban, na nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#480% attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54# na inaatake ang mga target sa hanay. Physical/Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, mayroon kang espesyal na bonus sa damage ng attack, limitado sa 2 beses). Kapag hindi nakokontrol, mapuputol ang pag-atake at mauuna ang special attack (nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#240% attack sa random enemy sa linya) Nag-atake ng #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Physical/Magic Damage #C0x5B545B# at nagbabalik ng 300 rage, hindi maaaring pumasok sa [turret mode]).',
		describe_ma = 'Memanggil askar sehingga mencapai had atas dan secara kekal meningkatkan pekali serangan askar sebanyak 20% (maksimum 100%)\n#F10# \n#F40# Kemudian, dia memasuki fasa pengecasan selama 1 giliran. Semasa pengecasan, dia meningkatkan kadar ketahanan kawalan sebanyak 50%, mengurangkan pertahanan fizikal, dan menyimpan kemarahan sebagai tenaga. Apabila pengecasan tamat, dia menyerang sasaran dalam barisan, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#600% serangan#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal/Magikal#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# Selepas pengecasan, anda akan masuk ke [mod menara], mod ini akan berterusan sehingga anda bertindak pada giliran seterusnya (kelajuan anda dikurangkan 1 mata; apabila tenaga penuh, perisai akan menjadi tebal dan anda akan mendapat pengurangan kerosakan sebanyak 30%. Apabila wira serangga atau mekanikal lain dalam pasukan anda menggunakan kemahiran aktif, Genesect akan melepaskan serangan ringan untuk membantu dalam pertempuran, menyebabkan #C0xE69900#480% serangan#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54# menyerang sasaran dalam barisan. Kerosakan Fizikal/Magikal #C0x5B545B#, menikmati ganjaran kerosakan serangan khas, terhad 2 kali). Apabila tidak dikawal, serangan akan diganggu dan serangan khas akan dilancarkan terlebih dahulu (menyebabkan serangan #C0xE69900#240% kepada musuh rawak dalam barisan) Menyerang #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal/Magikal #C0x5B545B# dan mengembalikan 300 kemarahan, tidak boleh masuk [mod menara]).',
		describe = 'Summon soldiers up to the upper limit and permanently increase soldiers\' attack coefficient by 20% (up to 100%)\n#F10# \n#F40# Then, he enters a charging phase for 1 turn. During charging, he increases control immunity by 50%, reduces physical defense, and stores rage as energy. When charging finishes, he attacks targets in a row dealing #C0xE69900#600% attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$#C0xF13B54# Physical/Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#\n#F10# \n#F40# After charging, you enter [turret mode], which lasts until your next action (your speed is reduced by 1 point; when energy is fully charged, armor thickens and damage taken is reduced by 30%. When insect or mechanical heroes in your team use active skills, Genesect launches light-support barrage to assist in battle, dealing #C0xE69900#480% attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$ #C0xF13B54# attack to row targets. Physical/Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, enjoying special attack damage bonuses, limited to 2 times). When not controlled, the attack will be interrupted and the special attack will be triggered first (dealing #C0xE69900#240% attack to a random enemy in the row) dealing #C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*90)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Physical/Magic Damage #C0x5B545B# and returning 300 rage, unable to enter [turret mode]).',
