		describe_en = 'Frog Bubble Kicks a single enemy target into the air, then kicks them back to the ground, dealing #C0x3D8A99#140% Magic Power#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, stealing 10% of the enemy\'s speed for 3 turns; has a 50% chance to [stun] the target for 1 turn (stun: control effect, unable to act). If the target\'s speed is higher than the caster\'s, it will definitely stun for 1 turn.',
