		describe_en = 'Frog Bubble Jump condenses water bullets in hand, then throws them at a single enemy target, causing #C0x3D8A99#510% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B#, increases own critical rate by 20% and critical damage by 40%, lasting 2 turns.',
