		skillName_ma = 'Teknik klon air',
		skillName = 'Water clone technique',
		describe_vn = 'Bỏ qua kháng phép của mục tiêu có tốc độ tấn công thấp hơn bản thân #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#; chênh lệch tốc độ giữa bản thân và mục tiêu càng lớn, sát thương thêm càng cao, mỗi 1% tốc độ tăng thêm 3% sát thương, tối đa có thể tăng thêm 90%',
		describe_en = 'Ignore the target\'s magic resistance if their attack speed is lower than yours. #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#; the greater the speed difference between you and the target, the higher the additional damage. Each 1% speed difference increases damage by 3%, up to a maximum additional 90%.',
		describe_th = 'ละเลยการต้านเวทย์ของเป้าหมายหากความเร็วการโจมตีต่ำกว่าของตัวเอง #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#; ยิ่งความเร็วต่างกันมากขึ้น ความเสียหายที่เพิ่มขึ้นก็ยิ่งสูงขึ้น ทุกๆ 1% ของความเร็วที่เพิ่มขึ้นจะเพิ่มความเสียหาย 3% สูงสุดเพิ่มได้ถึง 90%',
		describe_in = 'Abaikan ketahanan sihir target jika kecepatan serangannya lebih rendah dari milikmu #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#; selisih kecepatan antara kamu dan target semakin besar, tambahan kerusakan semakin tinggi, setiap peningkatan 1% kecepatan menambahkan 3% kerusakan, maksimal tambahan 90%.',
		describe_ph = 'Balewalain ang resistensya ng target kung ang bilis ng pag-atake nila ay mas mababa kaysa sa iyo #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#; kapag mas malaki ang agwat ng bilis mo at ng target, mas mataas ang dagdag na pinsala, bawat 1% na pagtaas ng bilis ay nagdaragdag ng 3% na pinsala, hanggang sa maximum na 90% dagdag.',
		describe_ma = 'Abaikan keupayaan tahan sihir sasaran jika kelajuan serangan mereka lebih rendah daripada anda #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#; perbezaan kelajuan antara anda dan sasaran semakin besar, kerosakan tambahan semakin tinggi, setiap 1% peningkatan kelajuan menambah 3% kerosakan, maksimum boleh tambah sehingga 90%.',
		describe = 'Ignore the target\'s magic resistance if their attack speed is lower than yours. #C0x5c9970#$(10+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#; the greater the speed difference between you and the target, the higher the additional damage. Each 1% speed difference increases damage by 3%, up to a maximum additional 90%.',
