		describe = 'The alcohol-addicted zombie will ignite a bottle of liquor and throw it out to attack all enemy targets, dealing #C0x3D8A99#130% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*30)$#C0xF13B54# Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#, and has a 25% chance to cause the target to be [stunned] for 1 turn (stun: a control effect, unable to move).',
