		skillName = 'Cut the atmosphere',
		describe_vn = 'Dơi Vù bay lên không trung, sau đó phóng ra một đòn chém vào mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ địch, gây ra #C0x3D8A99#150% Công Phép thuật#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ sát thương #C0xF13B54#pháp thuật#C0x5B545B#, đồng thời vĩnh viễn tăng 15% tốc độ của bản thân, giảm 15% khả năng kháng khống chế của mục tiêu, kéo dài 2 lượt',
		describe_en = 'The Bat Soars into the air, then launches a slash attack at a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#150% Magical Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#magic#C0x5B545B# damage, while permanently increasing own speed by 15%, reducing the target\'s crowd control resistance by 15% for 2 turns.',
		describe_th = 'ค้างคาวบินขึ้นสู่ท้องฟ้า จากนั้นพุ่งโจมตีกระหน่ำด้วยการฟันใส่เป้าหมายศัตรูเพียงหนึ่งตัว สร้างความเสียหาย #C0x3D8A99#150% พลังเวทย์#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#เวทย์มนตร์#C0x5B545B# พร้อมทั้งเพิ่มความเร็วของตัวเองถาวร 15% ลดความต้านทานการควบคุมกลุ่มของเป้าหมายลง 15% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Kelelawar Terbang ke udara, kemudian meluncurkan serangan tebas ke satu target musuh, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#150% Kekuatan Sihir#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ kerusakan #C0xF13B54#magis#C0x5B545B#, sekaligus meningkatkan kecepatan sendiri secara permanen sebesar 15%, mengurangi resistensi kontrol massa target sebesar 15% selama 2 giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Paniki ay lumipad sa himpapawid, pagkatapos ay nagpakawala ng hiwa sa isang isang kaaway na target, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ na #C0xF13B54#magical#C0x5B545B# na pinsala, kasabay ng permanenteng pagtaas ng 15% sa sariling bilis, pagbabawas ng 15% ng resistensya sa crowd control ng target, tumatagal ng 2 turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Kelawar Terbang ke udara, kemudian melancarkan serangan tebas ke satu sasaran musuh, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#150% Kuasa Magik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ kerosakan #C0xF13B54#sihir#C0x5B545B#, sambil meningkatkan kelajuan diri sendiri secara kekal sebanyak 15%, mengurangkan rintangan kawalan sasaran sebanyak 15% selama 2 pusingan.',
		describe = 'The Bat Soars into the air, then launches a slash attack at a single enemy target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#150% Magical Power#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54#magic#C0x5B545B# damage, while permanently increasing own speed by 15%, reducing the target\'s crowd control resistance by 15% for 2 turns.',
