		skillName_th = 'สนามพลังความมืด',
		skillName_in = 'Aura Gelap',
		skillName_ph = 'Madilim na Aura',
		skillName_ma = 'Aura Gelap',
		skillName = 'Dark Aura',
		describe_vn = '#L10#Kén hủy diệt: #L0# rơi vào trạng thái Kén hủy diệt, không thể bị tấn công và không thể thêm vào hiệu ứng, giảm 50% hiệu quả hồi máu của tất cả kẻ địch và hóa đá 100% một mục tiêu kẻ địch trong 1 lượt, cướp 10% giới hạn HP ban đầu và tấn công kép ban đầu từ tất cả kẻ địch trước khi hành động và khi bị hấp thụ Tổng giới hạn sinh mệnh của Yveltar đạt 100% lượng máu ban đầu của Yveltal * hoặc thức dậy trước khi hành động ở hiệp thứ ba, kế thừa Kén hủy diệt để đánh cắp 50% tổng thuộc tính và khôi phục 500 điểm nộ, đồng thời giải phóng Hơi thở hóa đá lên tất cả kẻ địch: 50% khả năng bị hóa đá trong 1 lượt và gây 120% Sát Thương Vật Lý\n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Đánh cắp linh hồn: #L0# Khi một đơn vị kẻ địch trên sân chết, Yveltal hấp thụ 15% lượng máu tối đa của nó; khi một đơn vị đồng minh chết, Yveltal kế thừa ý chí của nó và nhận 100% cơn thịnh nộ chết chóc\n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Stone Destruction: #L0#Tự miễn nhiễm với hóa đá, tấn công các đơn vị bị hóa đá sẽ gây thêm 80% Sát Thương Vật Lý và bỏ qua mức giảm 30% sát thương của chúng\n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Hào quang bóng tối: #L0#Tất cả bóng tối thân thiện anh hùng đạt được #C0x5c9970#$(8+skillLevel*0,04-0,04)$%#C0x5B545B#Vampire',
		describe_en = 'Destruction Cocoon: Enters the Destruction Cocoon state, cannot be attacked and no additional effects can be applied, reduces healing effectiveness of all enemies by 50% and petrifies one enemy target for 1 turn, steals 10% of the initial HP limit and initial dual attack from all enemies before acting and when absorbed. Yveltal\'s total HP limit reaches 100% of Yveltal\'s initial HP * or wakes up before acting in the third round, inherits Destruction Cocoon to steal 50% of total attributes and recovers 500 rage points, while releasing Petrifying Breath on all enemies: 50% chance to petrify for 1 turn and deals 120% Physical Damage. Soul Theft: When an enemy unit on the field dies, Yveltal absorbs 15% of its max HP; when an allied unit dies, Yveltal inherits its will and gains 100% death rage. Stone Destruction: Immune to petrification, attacking petrified units deals an additional 80% Physical Damage and ignores their 30% damage reduction. Dark Aura: All friendly Dark heroes gain #C0x5c9970#$(8+skillLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#Vampire.',
		describe_th = 'ปลอกหุ้มทำลายล้าง: เข้าสู่สถานะปลอกหุ้มทำลายล้าง ไม่สามารถถูกโจมตีและไม่สามารถเพิ่มผลกระทบได้ ลดประสิทธิภาพการฟื้นฟูของศัตรูทั้งหมด 50% และทำให้เป้าหมายศัตรูหนึ่งรายกลายเป็นหินเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น ขโมยขีดจำกัด HP เริ่มต้น 10% และการโจมตีคู่เริ่มต้นจากศัตรูทั้งหมดก่อนการกระทำและเมื่อถูกดูดซับ ขีดจำกัด HP ของ Yveltal ทั้งหมดถึง 100% ของ HP เริ่มต้นของ Yveltal * หรือฟื้นคืนสติขึ้นก่อนการดำเนินการในรอบที่สาม สืบทอดปลอกหุ้มทำลายล้างเพื่อขโมย 50% ของคุณสมบัติทั้งหมดและฟื้นฟูพลังโกรธ 500 จุด พร้อมปล่อยลมหายใจหินใส่ศัตรูทั้งหมด: โอกาสติดสถานะกลายเป็นหิน 50% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น และสร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ 120% ขโมยวิญญาณ: เมื่อหน่วยศัตรูในสนามตาย Yveltal ดูดซับ 15% ของ HP สูงสุดของมัน; เมื่อหน่วยพันธมิตรตาย Yveltal สืบทอดเจตจำนงของมันและได้รับความโกรธ 100% หินทำลายล้าง: ป้องกันการกลายเป็นหิน โจมตีหน่วยที่กลายเป็นหินจะก่อให้เกิดความเสียหายทางกายภาพเพิ่มขึ้น 80% และละเลยการลดความเสียหาย 30% ของพวกมัน รัศมีความมืด: ฮีโร่กลุ่มมิตรที่มีธาตุมืดทั้งหมดได้รับ #C0x5c9970#$(8+skillLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#ดูดเลือด',
		describe_in = 'Kepompong Kehancuran: Masuk ke status Kepompong Kehancuran, tidak dapat diserang dan tidak dapat diberikan efek tambahan, mengurangi efektivitas penyembuhan semua musuh sebanyak 50% dan mengubah satu target musuh menjadi batu selama 1 giliran, mencuri 10% batas HP awal dan serangan ganda awal dari semua musuh sebelum bertindak dan saat diserap. Batas total HP Yveltal mencapai 100% dari HP awal Yveltal * atau bangun sebelum bertindak di putaran ketiga, mewarisi Kepompong Kehancuran untuk mencuri 50% dari total atribut dan memulihkan 500 poin kemarahan, sekaligus melepaskan Nafas Pemati Batu pada semua musuh: 50% kemungkinan menjadi batu selama 1 giliran dan memberikan 120% Kerusakan Fisik. Pencuri Jiwa: Ketika satu unit musuh di medan mati, Yveltal menyerap 15% dari HP maksimumnya; ketika satu unit sekutu mati, Yveltal mewarisi tekadnya dan mendapatkan 100% kemarahan kematian. Penghancur Batu: Kebal terhadap pembatuan, menyerang unit yang menjadi batu akan memberikan tambahan 80% Kerusakan Fisik dan mengabaikan pengurangan damage 30% mereka. Aura Kegelapan: Semua pahlawan kegelapan teman mendapatkan #C0x5c9970#$(8+skillLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#Vampirisme.',
		describe_ph = 'Cocoon ng Pagkawasak: Pumasok sa estado ng Cocoon ng Pagkawasak, hindi maaaring atakihin at hindi maaaring dagdagan ng mga epekto, nagpapababa ng 50% bisa ng pagpapagaling ng lahat ng kalaban at nagiging bato ang isang target na kalaban sa loob ng 1 turn, nagnanakaw ng 10% ng orihinal na limitasyon ng HP at orihinal na doble na atake mula sa lahat ng kalaban bago kumilos at kapag na-absorb. Ang kabuuang limitasyon ng HP ni Yveltal ay umaabot sa 100% ng orihinal na HP ni Yveltal * o nagigising bago kumilos sa ikatlong round, namamana ang Cocoon ng Pagkawasak upang magnakaw ng 50% ng kabuuang katangian at nakakabawi ng 500 puntos ng galit, kasabay ng pagpapakawala ng Hiningang Nakakapetrok sa lahat ng kalaban: 50% tsansa ng pagiging batong petrified sa loob ng 1 turn at nagdudulot ng 120% Pisikal na Pinsala. Pagnanakaw ng Kaluluwa: Kapag isang yunit ng kalaban sa larangan ay namatay, nasisipsip ni Yveltal ang 15% ng maximum nitong HP; kapag isang kaalyadong yunit ang namatay, namamana ni Yveltal ang kanyang kalooban at nakakakuha ng 100% ng galit ng kamatayan. Pagwasak ng Bato: Imyun sa petrification, ang pag-atake sa mga yunit na petrified ay nagdudulot ng karagdagang 80% Pisikal na Pinsala at nilalampasan ang 30% bawas pinsala nila. Madilim na Aura: Lahat ng mabubuting bayani na may madilim na elemento ay nakakakuha ng #C0x5c9970#$(8+skillLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#Bampira.',
		describe_ma = 'Kepompong Pemusnahan: Masuk ke keadaan Kepompong Pemusnahan, tidak boleh diserang dan tidak boleh ditambah kesan tambahan, mengurangkan 50% keberkesanan pemulihan kesihatan semua musuh dan mengubah satu sasaran musuh menjadi batu selama 1 pusingan, mencuri 10% had HP asal dan serangan berganda asal daripada semua musuh sebelum bertindak dan apabila diserap. Had HP keseluruhan Yveltal mencapai 100% daripada HP asal Yveltal * atau bangun sebelum bertindak pada pusingan ketiga, mewarisi Kepompong Pemusnahan untuk mencuri 50% jumlah atribut dan memulihkan 500 mata kemarahan, serta melepaskan Nafas Batu kepada semua musuh: 50% peluang untuk menjadi batu selama 1 pusingan dan memberikan 120% Kerosakan Fizikal. Mencuri Jiwa: Apabila satu unit musuh di medan mati, Yveltal menyerap 15% daripada HP maksima; apabila satu unit sekutu mati, Yveltal mewarisi kehendaknya dan mendapat 100% kemarahan kematian. Pemusnah Batu: Kebal terhadap pembatuan, menyerang unit yang telah menjadi batu akan memberikan tambahan 80% Kerosakan Fizikal dan mengabaikan pengurangan 30% kerosakan mereka. Aura Kegelapan: Semua wira gelap sekutu mendapat #C0x5c9970#$(8+skillLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#Vampir.',
		describe = 'Destruction Cocoon: Enters the Destruction Cocoon state, cannot be attacked and no additional effects can be applied, reduces healing effectiveness of all enemies by 50% and petrifies one enemy target for 1 turn, steals 10% of the initial HP limit and initial dual attack from all enemies before acting and when absorbed. Yveltal\'s total HP limit reaches 100% of Yveltal\'s initial HP * or wakes up before acting in the third round, inherits Destruction Cocoon to steal 50% of total attributes and recovers 500 rage points, while releasing Petrifying Breath on all enemies: 50% chance to petrify for 1 turn and deals 120% Physical Damage. Soul Theft: When an enemy unit on the field dies, Yveltal absorbs 15% of its max HP; when an allied unit dies, Yveltal inherits its will and gains 100% death rage. Stone Destruction: Immune to petrification, attacking petrified units deals an additional 80% Physical Damage and ignores their 30% damage reduction. Dark Aura: All friendly Dark heroes gain #C0x5c9970#$(8+skillLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#Vampire.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[36116],
		-- {8}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng ăn cắp linh hồn bổ sung: Khi cả hai bên đều chết, Yveltal có thể vĩnh viễn hấp thụ 12% tăng công cho cả hai; Hiệu ứng khí trường bóng tối bổ sung: Tất cả các anh hùng thuộc hệ bóng tối của đồng minh gây thêm 10% sát thương lên mục tiêu đang ở trạng thái tiêu cực hoặc bị kiểm soát.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Additional Soul Steal Effect: When both sides die, Yveltal can permanently absorb 12% attack increase for both; Additional Dark Aura Effect: All allied Dark-type heroes deal 10% more damage to targets in negative or controlled states.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Additional Soul Steal Effect: When both sides die, Yveltal can permanently absorb 12% attack increase for both; Additional Dark Aura Effect: All allied Dark-type heroes deal 10% more damage to targets in negative or controlled states.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์การขโมยวิญญาณเพิ่มเติม: เมื่อทั้งสองฝ่ายตาย Yveltal สามารถดูดซับการเพิ่มพลังโจมตี 12% อย่างถาวรสำหรับทั้งสองฝ่าย; เอฟเฟกต์สนามพลังแห่งความมืดเพิ่มเติม: ฮีโร่พันธุ์ความมืดทั้งหมดของพันธมิตรจะสร้างความเสียหายเพิ่มขึ้นอีก 10% ต่อเป้าหมายที่อยู่ในสถานะลบหรือถูกควบคุม',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Efek Pencurian Jiwa Tambahan: Ketika kedua belah pihak mati, Yveltal dapat menyerap peningkatan serangan 12% secara permanen untuk keduanya; Efek Aura Gelap Tambahan: Semua pahlawan tipe gelap sekutu memberikan 10% lebih banyak kerusakan pada target yang dalam kondisi negatif atau terkendali.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Karagdagang Epekto ng Pagnanakaw ng Kaluluwa: Kapag pareho silang namatay, maaaring permanente na sumipsip si Yveltal ng 12% pagtaas ng atake para sa pareho; Karagdagang Epekto ng Madilim na Aura: Lahat ng mga madilim na uri ng bayani ng kakampi ay gumagawa ng 10% dagdag na pinsala sa mga target na nasa negatibo o kontroladong estado.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Kesan Curi Jiwa Tambahan: Apabila kedua pihak mati, Yveltal boleh menyerap peningkatan serangan sebanyak 12% secara kekal untuk kedua-duanya; Kesan Aura Gelap Tambahan: Semua wira aloi jenis gelap memberikan 10% lebih banyak kerosakan ke atas sasaran yang dalam keadaan negatif atau dikawal.',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		changeUnitTrigger = true,
		isCombat = true,
		passivePriority = 9,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
