		describe_vn = 'Hoopa sử dụng bánh xe ánh sáng để triệu hồi một lỗ không gian khác để kéo mục tiêu ở hàng đầu của kẻ địch vào thế giới không gian khác của mình, giảm vĩnh viễn mức giảm sát thương của hàng trước đi 15% (có thể chồng lên nhau và không thể giải trừ). target) gây ra #C0x3D8A99#420% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B# (các mục tiêu còn lại ở hàng trước#C0x3D8A99#150% Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B#)+$(s #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Phép Thuật#C0x5B545B# của killLevel*4*48)$ sẽ [dịch chuyển] mục tiêu chính tới một mục tiêu không gian chiều khác nhau cho đến sau hành động tiếp theo của Hoopa và ghi lại lượng sát thương mà tất cả kẻ thù nhận được trong khoảng thời gian đó. Nếu Hoopa sống sót khi mục tiêu thoát ra khỏi bánh xe ánh sáng, nó sẽ tung ra [đòn tấn công khác chiều], gây ra 50% tổng giá trị được ghi và 100% đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý của chính nó là sát thương chuẩn\n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Teleport: #L0# Hiệu ứng khống chế, không thể xua tan, không thể tấn công hoặc bị đánh trong thời gian này, Hupa vẫn có thể tấn công mục tiêu',
		describe_en = 'Hoopa uses the wheel of light to summon another spatial hole, pulling the front-row target of the enemy into its own spatial world, permanently reducing the front row\'s damage reduction by 15% (stackable and cannot be dispelled). Target deals #C0x3D8A99#420% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# (remaining front row targets deal #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#) + $(s #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# of killLevel*4*48)$. Hoopa [teleports] the main target to a different spatial dimension until after its next action and records the damage all enemies receive during that period. If Hoopa survives when the target escapes the wheel of light, it unleashes an [interdimensional attack], dealing 50% of the total recorded damage and 100% of its own Physical Damage as base damage. #F20# \n#F40##L10#Teleport: #L0# Control effect, cannot be dispelled, cannot attack or be attacked during this time, Hoopa can still attack the target.',
		describe_th = 'Hoopa ใช้ล้อแสงในการอัญเชิญหลุมมิติอื่น ดึงเป้าหมายแถวหน้า ศัตรูเข้าสู่โลกมิติของตัวเอง ลดความเสียหายที่ลดลงของแถวหน้าอย่างถาวร 15% (สามารถซ้อนทับได้และไม่สามารถลบได้) เป้าหมายก่อให้เกิด #C0x3D8A99#420% ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# (เป้าหมายที่เหลือในแถวหน้าก่อให้เกิด #C0x3D8A99#150% ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B#) + $(s #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# ของ killLevel*4*48)$ Hoopa [เคลื่อนย้าย] เป้าหมายหลักไปยังมิติพื้นที่ต่างกันจนกว่าจะถึงหลังการกระทำถัดไปและบันทึกความเสียหายที่ศัตรูทั้งหมดได้รับในช่วงเวลานั้น หาก Hoopa รอดชีวิตเมื่อเป้าหมายหลุดออกจากล้อแสง มันจะปล่อย [การโจมตีข้ามมิติ] สร้างความเสียหาย 50% ของค่าที่บันทึกทั้งหมดและ 100% ความเสียหายทางกายภาพของตัวเองเป็นความเสียหายพื้นฐาน #F20# \n#F40##L10#Teleport: #L0# เอฟเฟกต์ควบคุม ไม่สามารถลบสถานะ ไม่สามารถโจมตีหรือถูกโจมตีในระหว่างนี้ Hoopa ยังคงสามารถโจมตีเป้าหมายได้',
		describe_in = 'Hoopa menggunakan roda cahaya untuk memanggil lubang ruang lain, menarik target barisan depan musuh ke dunia ruang miliknya, mengurangi secara permanen pengurangan kerusakan barisan depan sebesar 15% (dapat ditumpuk dan tidak dapat dibatalkan). Target menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#420% Kerusakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# (target lain di barisan depan #C0x3D8A99#150% Kerusakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#) + $(s #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# dari killLevel*4*48)$. Hoopa [berpindah] target utama ke dimensi ruang berbeda sampai setelah tindakan Hoopa berikutnya dan merekam jumlah kerusakan yang diterima semua musuh selama periode itu. Jika Hoopa bertahan saat target keluar dari roda cahaya, ia melancarkan [serangan antar dimensi], memberikan 50% nilai total yang direkam dan 100% kerusakan Fisiknya sendiri sebagai kerusakan dasar. #F20# \n#F40##L10#Teleport: #L0# Efek kontrol, tidak dapat dihapus, tidak dapat menyerang atau diserang selama waktu ini, Hoopa masih bisa menyerang target.',
		describe_ph = 'Gumagamit si Hoopa ng gulong ng liwanag upang mag-summon ng ibang puwang na butas, hinihila ang target sa unahang hanay ng kalaban papunta sa sarili nitong spatial na mundo, permanente nitong binabawasan ang pagbawas ng pinsala ng unahang hanay ng 15% (pwedeng mag-stack at hindi mapapalabas). Target ay nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#420% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# (ang mga natitirang target sa unahang hanay ay nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#) + $(s #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# mula sa killLevel*4*48)$. In [teleports] ni Hoopa ang pangunahing target sa ibang spatial dimension hanggang matapos ang kanyang susunod na aksyon at nire-record ang damage na natanggap ng lahat ng kalaban sa panahong iyon. Kung buhay si Hoopa nang makatakas ang target mula sa gulong ng liwanag, magpapalabas siya ng [interdimensional attack], na nagdudulot ng 50% ng total na_Record na damage at 100% ng sarili niyang Physical Damage bilang base damage. #F20# \n#F40##L10#Teleport: #L0# Control effect, hindi maaaring ma-dispel, hindi makaatake o maatake sa panahong ito, kaya makakapag-atake pa rin si Hoopa sa target.',
		describe_ma = 'Hoopa menggunakan roda cahaya untuk memanggil lubang ruang lain, menarik sasaran barisan hadapan musuh ke dunia ruangnya sendiri, mengurangkan secara kekal pengurangan kerosakan barisan hadapan sebanyak 15% (boleh bertindih dan tidak boleh dibatalkan). Sasaran menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#420% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# (sasaran lain di barisan hadapan #C0x3D8A99#150% Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B#) + $(s #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Sihir#C0x5B545B# daripada killLevel*4*48)$. Hoopa [teleport] sasaran utama ke dimensi ruang yang berbeza sehingga selepas tindakan Hoopa yang seterusnya dan merekod jumlah kerosakan yang diterima semua musuh dalam tempoh itu. Jika Hoopa masih hidup apabila sasaran keluar dari roda cahaya, ia akan melancarkan [serangan antara dimensi], menyebabkan 50% jumlah nilai yang direkodkan dan 100% Kerosakan Fizikalnya sendiri sebagai kerosakan asas. #F20# \n#F40##L10#Teleport: #L0# Kesan kawalan, tidak boleh dihapus, tidak boleh menyerang atau diserang dalam tempoh ini, Hoopa masih boleh menyerang sasaran.',
		describe = 'Hoopa uses the wheel of light to summon another spatial hole, pulling the front-row target of the enemy into its own spatial world, permanently reducing the front row\'s damage reduction by 15% (stackable and cannot be dispelled). Target deals #C0x3D8A99#420% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# (remaining front row targets deal #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Damage#C0x5B545B#) + $(s #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage#C0x5B545B# of killLevel*4*48)$. Hoopa [teleports] the main target to a different spatial dimension until after its next action and records the damage all enemies receive during that period. If Hoopa survives when the target escapes the wheel of light, it unleashes an [interdimensional attack], dealing 50% of the total recorded damage and 100% of its own Physical Damage as base damage. #F20# \n#F40##L10#Teleport: #L0# Control effect, cannot be dispelled, cannot attack or be attacked during this time, Hoopa can still attack the target.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Hupa sử dụng vòng ánh sáng triệu hồi một hố không gian, kéo mục tiêu ở hàng trước vào thế giới khác của mình, giảm vĩnh viễn khả năng giảm sát thương của mục tiêu, sau đó chuyển mục tiêu chính vào không gian khác, và khi mục tiêu trở về, thực hiện đòn tấn công không gian.',
		simDesc_en = 'Hupa uses a light ring to summon a spatial hole, pulling the frontline target into their own different world, permanently reducing the target\'s damage reduction ability, then transfers the main target into another space. When the target returns, a spatial attack is executed.',
		simDesc_th = 'ฮูปะใช้วงแสงเรียกหลุมอวกาศ ดึงเป้าหมายแถวหน้าเข้าสู่โลกที่แตกต่างของตนเอง ลดความสามารถในการลดดาเมจของเป้าหมายแบบถาวร จากนั้นย้ายเป้าหมายหลักไปยังอีกมิติ และเมื่อเป้าหมายกลับมา จะทำการโจมตีอวกาศ',
		simDesc_in = 'Hupa menggunakan cincin cahaya untuk memanggil lubang ruang, menarik target barisan depan ke dunia lain miliknya, secara permanen mengurangi kemampuan target untuk mengurangi kerusakan, kemudian memindahkan target utama ke ruang lain. Ketika target kembali, serangan ruang dilakukan.',
		simDesc_ph = 'Gumagamit si Hupa ng singsing ng liwanag upang tawagin ang isang butas sa espasyo, hinahatak ang target sa front line papunta sa sarili niyang ibang mundo, permanenteng binabawasan ang kakayahan ng target na magbawas ng pinsala, pagkatapos ay inililipat ang pangunahing target sa ibang espasyo. Kapag bumalik ang target, isinasagawa ang isang espasyong atake.',
		simDesc_ma = 'Hupa menggunakan cincin cahaya untuk memanggil lubang ruang, menarik sasaran barisan hadapan ke dunia lain miliknya, mengurangkan keupayaan pengurangan kerosakan sasaran secara kekal, kemudian memindahkan sasaran utama ke ruang lain. Apabila sasaran kembali, serangan ruang dilaksanakan.',
		simDesc = 'Hupa uses a light ring to summon a spatial hole, pulling the frontline target into their own different world, permanently reducing the target\'s damage reduction ability, then transfers the main target into another space. When the target returns, a spatial attack is executed.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[36413],
		-- {11}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Đánh Bại Dị Thế: Gây thêm 30% sát thương thật dựa trên giới hạn máu của mục tiêu.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Defeat the Different World: Deals an additional 30% true damage based on the target\'s HP limit.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Defeat the Different World: Deals an additional 30% true damage based on the target\'s HP limit.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'พิชิตโลกต่างมิติ: สร้างความเสียหายจริงเพิ่มขึ้น 30% โดยคำนวณจากขีดจำกัดพลังชีวิตของเป้าหมาย',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Mengalahkan Dunia Lain: Memberikan tambahan 30% kerusakan nyata berdasarkan batas HP target.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Talunin ang Ibang Mundo: Nagdudulot ng dagdag na 30% totoong pinsala batay sa limit ng HP ng target.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Kalahkan Dunia Berbeza: Menyebabkan tambahan 30% kerosakan sebenar berdasarkan had HP sasaran.',
		zawakeEffect = __data_t__zawakeEffect[36413],
		-- {79003, 1}
		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Enhance effect: Damage from other spatial attacks increases by 20%, and adds true damage equal to 30% of the target\'s maximum HP; if other spatial attacks do not kill the target, it adds 300 rage points to the target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Enhance effect: Damage from other spatial attacks increases by 20%, and adds true damage equal to 30% of the target\'s maximum HP; if other spatial attacks do not kill the target, it adds 300 rage points to the target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'เสริมประสิทธิภาพ: ความเสียหายจากการโจมตีเชิงมิติเพิ่มขึ้น 20% และเพิ่มความเสียหายจริงเท่ากับ 30% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของเป้าหมาย; หากการโจมตีเชิงมิติไม่ฆ่าเป้าหมาย จะเพิ่มค่าความโกรธ 300 หน่วยให้เป้าหมาย',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Tingkatkan efektivitas: Kerusakan dari serangan ruang lainnya meningkat 20%, dan menambahkan kerusakan nyata sebesar 30% dari batas HP target; jika serangan ruang lainnya tidak membunuh target, akan menambahkan 300 poin kemarahan ke target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Palakasin ang epekto: Nadagdag ang pinsala mula sa ibang spatial attack ng 20%, at dagdag pa ng totoong pinsala na 30% ng maximum HP ng target; kung ang ibang spatial attack ay hindi pumatay sa target, magdadagdag ito ng 300 rage points sa target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Tingkatkan keberkesanan: Kerosakan daripada serangan ruang lain meningkat sebanyak 20%, dan menambah kerosakan sebenar sebanyak 30% daripada had nyawa sasaran; jika serangan ruang lain tidak membunuh sasaran, ia akan menambah 300 mata kemarahan kepada sasaran',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Tăng cường hiệu quả: Sát thương đòn đánh không gian khác tăng 20%, và thêm sát thương thực bằng 30% giới hạn sinh mệnh của mục tiêu, nếu đòn đánh không gian khác không giết chết mục tiêu, sẽ thêm 300 điểm nộ khí của mục tiêu',
		zawakeSimpleType = 1,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'Otherworld Strike deals bonus true damage equal to 30% of the target’s max HP#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Otherworld Strike damage increased by 20%, and adds true damage equal to 30% of the target’s max HP; if it does not kill, it steals 300 Rage from the target',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'Otherworld Strike deals bonus true damage equal to 30% of the target’s max HP#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Otherworld Strike damage increased by 20%, and adds true damage equal to 30% of the target’s max HP; if it does not kill, it steals 300 Rage from the target',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'การโจมตีจากโลกอื่นจะสร้างความเสียหายจริงเพิ่มเติมเท่ากับ 30% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของเป้าหมาย#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→ความเสียหายจากการโจมตีจากโลกอื่นเพิ่มขึ้น 20% และสร้างความเสียหายจริงเพิ่มเติมเท่ากับ 30% ของ HP สูงสุดของเป้าหมาย หากไม่ฆ่าเป้าหมาย จะขโมย 300 โทสะของเป้าหมาย',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Serangan Dunia Lain memberikan kerusakan sejati tambahan sebesar 30% dari max HP target#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Kerusakan Serangan Dunia Lain meningkat 20%, dan memberikan kerusakan sejati tambahan sebesar 30% dari HP maksimal target; jika tidak membunuh target, mencuri 300 Rage dari target',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'Ang Otherworld Strike ay magdudulot ng karagdagang true damage na katumbas ng 30% ng max HP ng target#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Otherworld Strike: +20% damage at dagdag na true damage 30% ng max HP; kung di mapatay ang target, mananakaw ang 300 Rage nito',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = 'Serangan Dunia Lain memberikan kerosakan sebenar tambahan sebanyak 30% daripada HP maksimum sasaran#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Serangan Dunia Lain meningkat 20% dan menambah kerosakan sebenar 30% HP maksimum; jika tidak membunuh, mencuri 300 Mata Amarah',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = 'Đòn tấn công Dị Thế Giới thêm sát thương thực bằng 30% giới hạn máu của mục tiêu#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Sát thương của Đòn tấn công Dị Thế Giới tăng 20%, và thêm sát thương thực bằng 30% giới hạn máu của mục tiêu, nếu Đòn tấn công Dị Thế Giới không tiêu diệt mục tiêu, sẽ cướp thêm 300 điểm nộ khí của mục tiêu',
