		skillName_ma = 'Lepaskan cincin cahaya',
		skillName = 'Release the ring of light',
		describe_vn = 'Trước mỗi vòng lớn, chỉ định ngẫu nhiên 6 [Bánh xe Ánh sáng] trên cơ thể của bạn cho hàng đầu của kẻ địch và lấy lại tất cả [Bánh xe Ánh sáng] trước lượt của mình (hồi phục ngay sau khi mục tiêu chết)\n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Bánh xe Ánh sáng: #L0#Hiệu ứng đặc biệt, 6 bánh xe ánh sáng tương ứng với thuộc tính sáu chiều. Khi được áp dụng, các thuộc tính cơ bản tương ứng của mục tiêu sẽ bị giảm vĩnh viễn (từ 8% thuộc tính sáu chiều cơ bản của Hupa, có thể bị xua tan và giới hạn trên của một mục tiêu là 3 lớp). Khi bánh xe ánh sáng quay trở lại, nó sẽ vĩnh viễn chuyển thành thuộc tính của chính nó\n#F20# \n#F40# Giảm #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# sát thương cuối cùng mà bạn nhận được và chuyển 150% sát thương này sang một mục tiêu ngẫu nhiên ở hàng đầu của kẻ địch với 50% đòn Sát Thương Vật Lý của chính bạn là sát thương chuẩn',
		describe_en = 'Before each major round, randomly assign 6 [Wheels of Light] on your body to the enemy\'s front row and recover all [Wheels of Light] before your turn (recover immediately after the target dies) \n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Wheels of Light: #L0#Special effect, 6 wheels of light correspond to six-dimensional attributes. When applied, the target\'s corresponding basic attributes will be permanently reduced (from 8% of Hupa\'s six basic attributes, can be dispelled, and the upper limit per target is 3 layers). When the wheel of light returns, it will permanently transform into its own attribute \n#F20# \n#F40# Reduce #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# of the final damage you receive and transfer 150% of this damage to a random target in the enemy\'s front row, with 50% of your Physical Damage as true damage.',
		describe_th = 'ก่อนแต่ละรอบใหญ่ ให้สุ่มกำหนด 6 [ล้อแสง] บนร่างกายของคุณให้กับแถวหน้าของศัตรู และฟื้นฟู [ล้อแสง] ทั้งหมดก่อนเทิร์นของคุณ (ฟื้นฟูทันทีหลังเป้าหมายตาย) \n#F20# \n#F40##L10#ล้อแสง: #L0#เอฟเฟกต์พิเศษ ล้อแสง 6 ล้อสอดคล้องกับแอตทริบิวต์หกมิติ เมื่อถูกใช้ แอตทริบิวต์พื้นฐานที่สอดคล้องของเป้าหมายจะถูกลดถาวร (จาก 8% ของแอตทริบิวต์หกมิติพื้นฐานของฮูปะ สามารถถูกล้างได้ และขีดจำกัดสูงสุดต่อเป้าหมายคือ 3 ชั้น) เมื่อ ล้อแสง กลับมา มันจะถูกแปลงถาวรเป็นแอตทริบิวต์ของตัวเอง \n#F20# \n#F40# ลด #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# ความเสียหายสุดท้ายที่คุณได้รับ และถ่ายโอน 150% ของความเสียหายนี้ไปยังเป้าหมายสุ่มในแถวหน้าของศัตรู ด้วยความเสียหายทางกายภาพ 50% ของคุณเป็นความเสียหายจริง',
		describe_in = 'Sebelum setiap putaran besar, secara acak tetapkan 6 [Roda Cahaya] pada tubuh Anda ke barisan depan musuh dan pulihkan semua [Roda Cahaya] sebelum giliran Anda (pulih segera setelah target mati) \n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Roda Cahaya: #L0#Efek khusus, 6 roda cahaya sesuai dengan atribut enam dimensi. Saat diterapkan, atribut dasar target yang sesuai akan dikurangi secara permanen (dari 8% atribut dasar enam dimensi Hupa, bisa dihilangkan dan batas atas per target adalah 3 lapisan). Ketika roda cahaya kembali, itu akan berubah permanen menjadi atributnya sendiri \n#F20# \n#F40# Mengurangi #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# dari kerusakan akhir yang Anda terima dan mentransfer 150% dari kerusakan ini ke target acak di barisan depan musuh dengan 50% dari Damage Fisik Anda sebagai damage nyata.',
		describe_ph = 'Bago ang bawat malaking round, pumili ng random ng 6 [Gulong ng Liwanag] sa iyong katawan para sa unahan ng kalaban at ibalik ang lahat ng [Gulong ng Liwanag] bago ang iyong turn (agad na nare-recover pagkatapos mamatay ang target) \n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Gulong ng Liwanag: #L0#Espesyal na epekto, ang 6 na gulong ng liwanag ay tumutugma sa anim na dimensyon ng katangian. Kapag naipatupad, ang kaukulang pangunahing katangian ng target ay permanenteng babawasan (mula sa 8% ng anim na pangunahing katangian ng Hupa, maaaring mapawi at ang maximum per target ay 3 layer). Kapag bumalik ang gulong ng liwanag, ito ay permanenteng nagiging sarili nitong katangian \n#F20# \n#F40# Binabawasan ang #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# ng huling pinsalang matatanggap mo at ililipat ang 150% ng pinsalang ito sa isang random na target sa unahan ng kalaban, na may 50% ng iyong Physical Damage bilang tunay na pinsala.',
		describe_ma = 'Sebelum setiap pusingan besar, tetapkan secara rawak 6 [Roda Cahaya] pada badan anda kepada barisan hadapan musuh dan pulihkan semua [Roda Cahaya] sebelum giliran anda (pulih serta-merta selepas sasaran mati) \n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Roda Cahaya: #L0#Kesan khas, 6 roda cahaya sepadan dengan atribut enam dimensi. Apabila digunakan, atribut asas sasaran yang sepadan akan dikurangkan secara kekal (daripada 8% atribut asas enam dimensi Hupa, boleh dibersihkan dan had atas setiap sasaran adalah 3 lapisan). Apabila roda cahaya kembali, ia akan berubah menjadi atributnya sendiri secara kekal \n#F20# \n#F40# Kurangkan #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# kerosakan akhir yang anda terima dan alihkan 150% daripada kerosakan ini ke sasaran rawak di barisan hadapan musuh dengan 50% daripada Kerosakan Fizikal anda sebagai kerosakan sebenar.',
		describe = 'Before each major round, randomly assign 6 [Wheels of Light] on your body to the enemy\'s front row and recover all [Wheels of Light] before your turn (recover immediately after the target dies) \n#F20# \n#F40##L10#Wheels of Light: #L0#Special effect, 6 wheels of light correspond to six-dimensional attributes. When applied, the target\'s corresponding basic attributes will be permanently reduced (from 8% of Hupa\'s six basic attributes, can be dispelled, and the upper limit per target is 3 layers). When the wheel of light returns, it will permanently transform into its own attribute \n#F20# \n#F40# Reduce #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.05-0.05)$%#C0x5B545B# of the final damage you receive and transfer 150% of this damage to a random target in the enemy\'s front row, with 50% of your Physical Damage as true damage.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[36436],
		-- {8}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu Ứng Bổ Sung: Khi vào trận, Hu Pa sẽ vươn tay ma quái để vĩnh viễn đánh cắp 10% giảm sát thương từ mỗi mục tiêu hàng đầu của kẻ thù (không thể bị giải tán), và chuyển đổi 10% giảm sát thương đã đánh cắp thành tăng sát thương trước khi tấn công.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Supplementary Effect: When entering battle, Hu Pa will extend a ghostly hand to permanently steal 10% damage reduction from each of the enemy\'s front-line targets (cannot be dispelled), and convert the 10% stolen damage reduction into damage increase before attacking.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Supplementary Effect: When entering battle, Hu Pa will extend a ghostly hand to permanently steal 10% damage reduction from each of the enemy\'s front-line targets (cannot be dispelled), and convert the 10% stolen damage reduction into damage increase before attacking.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์เสริม: เมื่อเข้าสู่สนามรบ Hu Pa จะยื่นมือผีสิงเพื่อขโมยการลดความเสียหาย 10% อย่างถาวรจากแต่ละเป้าหมายแนวหน้าของศัตรู (ไม่สามารถละลายได้) และเปลี่ยนการลดความเสียหายที่ขโมยมา 10% เป็นการเพิ่มความเสียหายก่อนการโจมตี',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Efek Tambahan: Saat memasuki pertarungan, Hu Pa akan mengulurkan tangan hantu untuk secara permanen mencuri pengurangan kerusakan 10% dari setiap target garis depan musuh (tidak dapat dibatalkan), dan mengubah 10% pengurangan kerusakan yang dicuri menjadi peningkatan kerusakan sebelum menyerang.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Karagdagang Epekto: Kapag pumasok sa laban, si Hu Pa ay aabot ng isang mahiwagang kamay upang permanenteng manakaw ng 10% bawas sa pinsala mula sa bawat nangungunang target ng kalaban (hindi maaaring matanggal), at babaguhin ang 10% na nakuha na bawas sa pinsala bilang dagdag sa pinsala bago umatake.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Kesan Tambahan: Apabila memasuki pertempuran, Hu Pa akan menghulurkan tangan ghaib untuk mencuri pengurangan kerosakan 10% secara kekal daripada setiap sasaran barisan hadapan musuh (tidak boleh dibuang), dan menukar 10% pengurangan kerosakan yang dicuri itu kepada peningkatan kerosakan sebelum menyerang.',
		zawakeEffect = __data_t__zawakeEffect[36436],
		-- {79004, 1}
		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Additional effect: When entering battle, Hoopa\'s demonic hand permanently steals 10% damage reduction from each enemy front row target (#cannot be dispelled#), before attacking, converts 5% stolen damage reduction into 10% increased damage; each time the light ring returns, steals 20 energy points from the target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Additional effect: When entering battle, Hoopa\'s demonic hand permanently steals 10% damage reduction from each enemy front row target (#cannot be dispelled#), before attacking, converts 5% stolen damage reduction into 10% increased damage; each time the light ring returns, steals 20 energy points from the target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟ็กต์เพิ่มเติม: เมื่อเข้าสู่การต่อสู้ มือปีศาจของ Hoopa ขโมยการลดความเสียหาย 10% ของเป้าหมายแถวหน้าศัตรูแต่ละตัวอย่างถาวร (#ไม่สามารถลบออกได้#), ก่อนโจมตีจะแปลงการลดความเสียหายที่ขโมยได้ 5% เป็นการเพิ่มความเสียหาย 10%; ทุกครั้งที่วงแสงกลับตำแหน่ง จะขโมย 20 คะแนนพลังงานจากเป้าหมาย',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Efek tambahan: Saat memasuki pertarungan, tangan iblis Hoopa secara permanen mencuri pengurangan kerusakan 10% dari setiap target baris depan musuh (#tidak dapat dibatalkan#), sebelum menyerang mengubah 5% pengurangan kerusakan yang dicuri menjadi peningkatan kerusakan 10%; setiap kali cincin cahaya kembali ke posisi, mencuri 20 poin energi dari target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Karagdagang epekto: Kapag pumasok sa laban, ang demonyong kamay ni Hoopa ay permanenteng nagnanakaw ng 10% bawas pinsala mula sa bawat target sa unahang hanay ng kalaban (#hindi maaaring alisin#), bago umatake, binabago ang 5% na nakaw na bawas pinsala sa 10% dagdag pinsala; sa bawat pagbabalik ng singsing ng ilaw sa posisyon, nagnanakaw ng 20 puntos ng enerhiya mula sa target',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Kesan tambahan: Apabila memasuki pertempuran, tangan syaitan Hoopa secara kekal mencuri pengurangan kerosakan sebanyak 10% dari setiap sasaran barisan hadapan musuh (#tidak boleh dihapuskan#), sebelum menyerang menukar 5% pengurangan kerosakan yang dicuri menjadi peningkatan kerosakan 10%; setiap kali cincin cahaya kembali ke posisi, mencuri 20 mata tenaga dari sasaran',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng bổ sung: Khi vào trận, Hoopa đưa tay ma quỷ vĩnh viễn đánh cắp 10% giảm sát thương của mỗi mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch (không thể xua tan), trước khi tấn công sẽ chuyển đổi 5% giảm sát thương đã đánh cắp thành 10% tăng sát thương; mỗi khi vòng sáng trở về vị trí, đánh cắp 20 điểm nộ khí của mục tiêu',
		zawakeSimpleType = 1,
		zawakeSimpleDesc = 'At the start of battle, Hoopa extends its demonic hand to permanently steal 10% damage reduction from each enemy front-row target (cannot be removed); before attacking, converts 10% of the stolen reduction into bonus damage#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→At the start of battle, Hoopa extends its demonic hand to permanently steal 10% damage reduction from each enemy front-row target (cannot be removed); before attacking, converts 5% of the stolen reduction into 10% bonus damage; each time the Halo returns to position, steals an additional 20 Rage from the target  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_en = 'At the start of battle, Hoopa extends its demonic hand to permanently steal 10% damage reduction from each enemy front-row target (cannot be removed); before attacking, converts 10% of the stolen reduction into bonus damage#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→At the start of battle, Hoopa extends its demonic hand to permanently steal 10% damage reduction from each enemy front-row target (cannot be removed); before attacking, converts 5% of the stolen reduction into 10% bonus damage; each time the Halo returns to position, steals an additional 20 Rage from the target  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_th = 'เมื่อเริ่มการต่อสู้ Hoopa ยื่นมือปีศาจเพื่อขโมย 10% การลดความเสียหายของศัตรูแถวหน้าแบบถาวร (ไม่สามารถลบได้); ก่อนโจมตี จะเปลี่ยน 10% ที่ขโมยเป็นโบนัสความเสียหาย#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→เมื่อเริ่มการต่อสู้ Hoopa ยื่นมือปีศาจเพื่อขโมย 10% การลดความเสียหายของศัตรูแถวหน้าแบบถาวร (ไม่สามารถลบได้); ก่อนโจมตี เปลี่ยน 5% ที่ขโมยเป็นโบนัสความเสียหาย 10%; ทุกครั้งที่ Halo กลับตำแหน่ง จะขโมยเพิ่มอีก 20 โทสะ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_in = 'Saat pertempuran dimulai, Hoopa mencuri permanen 10% pengurangan kerusakan dari setiap musuh baris depan (tidak bisa dihapus); sebelum menyerang, mengubah 10% yang dicuri menjadi damage tambahan#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Saat pertempuran dimulai, Hoopa mencuri permanen 10% pengurangan kerusakan dari setiap musuh baris depan (tidak bisa dihapus); sebelum menyerang, mengubah 5% dari itu menjadi 10% damage tambahan; setiap kali Halo kembali ke posisi, mencuri 20 Rage tambahan  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ph = 'Sa simula ng laban, ninanakaw ni Hoopa ang 10% bawas pinsala mula sa bawat kalaban sa harap (hindi matatanggal); bago umatake, ginagawa niyang dagdag pinsala ang 10% nito#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Sa simula ng laban, ninanakaw ni Hoopa ang 10% bawas pinsala mula sa bawat kalaban sa harap (hindi matatanggal); bago umatake, ginagawa niyang 10% dagdag pinsala mula sa 5% ninakaw; tuwing bumabalik ang Halo, kukuha pa ng 20 Rage  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_ma = 'Apabila pertempuran bermula, Hoopa mencuri secara kekal 10% pengurangan kerosakan dari setiap musuh barisan hadapan (tidak boleh dihapuskan); sebelum menyerang, menukar 10% itu menjadi kerosakan tambahan#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Apabila pertempuran bermula, Hoopa mencuri secara kekal 10% pengurangan kerosakan dari setiap musuh barisan hadapan (tidak boleh dihapuskan); sebelum menyerang, menukar 5% menjadi 10% kerosakan tambahan; setiap kali Halo kembali ke posisi, mencuri lagi 20 Mata Amarah  ',
		zawakeSimpleDesc_vn = 'Khi vào trận, Hoopa đưa tay ma quỷ ra cướp vĩnh viễn 10% giảm sát thương của mỗi mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch (không thể xóa), trước khi tấn công sẽ chuyển đổi 10% giảm sát thương đã cướp thành tăng sát thương#F20# #F40##C0x5c9970#→Khi vào trận, Hoopa đưa tay ma quỷ ra cướp vĩnh viễn 10% giảm sát thương của mỗi mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch (không thể xóa), trước khi tấn công sẽ chuyển đổi 5% giảm sát thương đã cướp thành 10% tăng sát thương; mỗi khi Vòng Sáng trở về vị trí, sẽ cướp thêm 20 điểm nộ khí của mục tiêu',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		changeUnitTrigger = true,
		isCombat = true,
