		skillName = 'Sudden Attack',
		describe_vn = 'Cú mèo lướt đi không phát ra một tiếng động, nhanh chóng tiếp cận kẻ địch, tung cú đá mạnh vào mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ địch, gây #C0xE69900#160% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0xF13B54# và sau khi tấn công sẽ vào trạng thái [Ẩn thân] (Ẩn thân: hiệu ứng đặc biệt, mục tiêu không thể bị chọn, có thể bị ảnh hưởng bởi tấn công diện rộng, giải trừ sau khi tấn công, tối đa kéo dài 3 lượt), hiệu ứng ẩn thân có thời gian hồi 1 lượt',
		describe_en = 'The cat sweep silently glides forward, quickly approaching the enemy, delivering a powerful kick to a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54# and after the attack enters [Stealth] state (Stealth: special effect, target cannot be selected, can be hit by AoE attacks, removed after attacking, lasts up to 3 turns), stealth effect has a cooldown of 1 turn.',
		describe_th = 'การลื่นไถลของแมวดำดำเนินไปอย่างเงียบเชียบ เข้าหาศัตรูอย่างรวดเร็ว และเตะอย่างแรงไปยังเป้าหมายศัตรูเพียงหนึ่งตัว สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#160%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ #C0xF13B54# และหลังจากโจมตี จะเข้าสู่สถานะ [ซ่อนตัว] (ซ่อนตัว: เอฟเฟกต์พิเศษ เป้าหมายไม่สามารถถูกเลือก, สามารถถูกโจมตีแบบพื้นที่ได้, ถูกยกเลิกหลังโจมตี, คงอยู่สูงสุด 3 เทิร์น) เอฟเฟกต์ซ่อนตัวมีเวลาคูลดาวน์ 1 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Luncuran kucing meluncur tanpa suara, dengan cepat mendekati musuh, melancarkan tendangan kuat ke satu target musuh, memberikan #C0xE69900#160% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Kerusakan Fisik#C0xF13B54# dan setelah serangan masuk ke status [Menyamar] (Menyamar: efek khusus, target tidak dapat dipilih, dapat terpengaruh oleh serangan area, dihapus setelah menyerang, berlangsung maksimal 3 giliran), efek menyamar memiliki waktu cooldown 1 giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Tahimik na dumulas ang pusa, mabilis lumapit sa kalaban, matinding sipa sa isang target ng kalaban, nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54# at pagkatapos ng atake ay papasok sa estado ng [Pagkakubli] (Pagkakubli: espesyal na epekto, ang target ay hindi maaaring piliin, maaaring maapektuhan ng area attack, mawawala pagkatapos ng pag-atake, tumatagal ng hanggang 3 na turn), ang epekto ng pagkakubli ay may cooldown na 1 turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Gerakan kucing meluncur tanpa suara, dengan pantas menghampiri musuh, menendang sasaran musuh tunggal dengan kuat, memberikan #C0xE69900#160% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Kerosakan Fizikal#C0xF13B54# dan selepas menyerang akan memasuki keadaan [Menyamar] (Menyamar: kesan khas, sasaran tidak boleh dipilih, boleh terjejas oleh serangan kawasan, dibuang selepas menyerang, maksimum bertahan 3 pusingan), kesan menyamar mempunyai masa sejuk 1 pusingan.',
		describe = 'The cat sweep silently glides forward, quickly approaching the enemy, delivering a powerful kick to a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ Physical Damage#C0xF13B54# and after the attack enters [Stealth] state (Stealth: special effect, target cannot be selected, can be hit by AoE attacks, removed after attacking, lasts up to 3 turns), stealth effect has a cooldown of 1 turn.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Mộc Mộc Ưng bay lặng lẽ, nhanh chóng tiếp cận kẻ thù, thực hiện một cú đá mạnh vào mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ thù.',
		simDesc_en = 'Moc Moc Eagle flies silently, swiftly approaching the enemy to deliver a powerful kick to a single target.',
		simDesc_th = 'โมค โมค อีเกิล บินอย่างเงียบ ๆ เข้าหาศัตรูอย่างรวดเร็ว และใช้เท้าถีบอย่างแรงใส่เป้าหมายเดี่ยวของศัตรู',
		simDesc_in = 'Elang Moc Moc terbang diam-diam, dengan cepat mendekati musuh dan melakukan tendangan kuat ke target musuh tunggal.',
