		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Decidueye charges for 1 turn, in the next turn unleashes the ultimate skill, then shoots an extremely powerful feather arrow at a single enemy target, dealing #C0xE69900#790% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*75)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. This ultimate skill increases critical damage by 20%',
