		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Beerus crosses his arms and kicks the enemy unit with the lowest health in the back row, dealing #C0xE69900#150% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*2 4)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#, while increasing his own Physical Damage by 30% for 2 turns, stacking up to 3 layers; each layer adds one additional normal attack to his combat spirit.',
