		simDesc_en = 'Tian Wu Ni rushes swiftly towards the enemy and unleashes a continuous kick combo attacking the enemy\'s single target, dealing #C0xE69900#160% physical attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ points of #C0xF13B54#physical damage#C0x5B545B#.',
