		zawakeEffectDesc = 'Aura skill: reduces #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# Physical Attack and 10% physical defense of all enemies. After attacking, if rage is full and the target is still alive, Tian Leng Mei Hou will immediately unleash a critical skill (activates only once)',
		zawakeEffectDesc_en = 'Aura skill: reduces #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# Physical Attack and 10% physical defense of all enemies. After attacking, if rage is full and the target is still alive, Tian Leng Mei Hou will immediately unleash a critical skill (activates only once)',
		zawakeEffectDesc_th = 'ทักษะออร่า: ลด #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# การโจมตีทางกายภาพและการป้องกันทางกายภาพ 10% ของศัตรูทั้งหมด หลังจากโจมตี หากพลังแค้นเต็มและเป้ายังไม่ตาย Tian Leng Mei Hou จะปล่อยทักษะคริติคอลทันที (เปิดใช้ได้ครั้งเดียวเท่านั้น)',
		zawakeEffectDesc_in = 'Keterampilan aura: mengurangi #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# Serangan Fisik dan 10% pertahanan fisik dari semua musuh. Setelah menyerang, jika amarah penuh dan target belum mati, Tian Leng Mei Hou akan segera mengeluarkan keterampilan kritis (hanya aktif sekali)',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ph = 'Kasanayan sa aura: nagpababa ng #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# Pisikal na Atake at 10% pisikal na depensa ng lahat ng mga kalaban. Pagkatapos umatake, kung puno ang galit at buhay pa ang target, agad na gagamitin ni Tian Leng Mei Hou ang kasanayang kritikal (isa lang ang pag-activate)',
		zawakeEffectDesc_ma = 'Kemahiran aura: mengurangkan #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# Serangan Fizikal dan 10% pertahanan fizikal semua musuh. Selepas menyerang, jika kemarahan penuh dan sasaran belum mati, Tian Leng Mei Hou akan segera melancarkan kemahiran kritikal (hanya aktif sekali)',
		zawakeEffectDesc_vn = 'Kỹ năng hào quang: giảm #C0x5c9970#$(15+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# Công Vật Lý và 10% phòng thủ vật lý của toàn bộ kẻ địch\nSau khi tấn công, nếu đầy nộ và mục tiêu chưa chết, Tian Leng Mei Hou sẽ ngay lập tức tung ra kỹ năng chí mạng (chỉ kích hoạt một lần)',
