		skillName_in = 'Pukulan Plasma',
		skillName_ph = 'Plasma Punch',
		skillName_ma = 'Pukulan Plasma',
		skillName = 'Plasma Punch',
		describe_vn = 'Zeraora tập hợp dòng điện hàng chục nghìn volt vào tay và ngay lập tức đấm 6 phát với tốc độ tia chớp để cắt gió, tấn công ngẫu nhiên các mục tiêu địch. Mỗi cú đấm gây ra #C0xE69900#220% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLev el*4*60)$\'s #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0x5B545B#, nếu trúng 3 tướng khác nhau, hiệu ứng [static field] sẽ được kích hoạt và tác động lên toàn bộ sân của kẻ địch, kéo dài 1~2 hiệp lớn\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Điện trường tĩnh: Trong #L0#, có 50% khả năng bị [Cảm ứng] và không thể nhận được buff, và 80% khả năng bị [Tê liệt] trong 1 lượt sau khi phát động tấn công. Khi Anh hùng Sấm sét của bạn tấn công một mục tiêu trong Điện trường tĩnh, 25% sát thương kỹ năng sẽ được truyền tới tối đa hai mục tiêu [Từ hóa].',
		describe_en = 'Zeraora gathers tens of thousands of volts of electricity in its hands and immediately punches 6 times at lightning speed to cut through the air, randomly attacking enemy targets. Each punch deals #C0xE69900#220% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#. If it hits 3 different enemy heroes, the [static field] effect is activated and affects the entire enemy field, lasting 1~2 turns. Static Field: For #L0#, there is a 50% chance to receive [Induction] and cannot be buffed, and an 80% chance to be [Paralyzed] for 1 turn after launching an attack. When your Thunder Hero attacks a target within the Static Field, 25% of the skill damage is transferred to up to two [Conducted] targets.',
		describe_th = 'Zeraora รวบรวมกระแสไฟฟ้าหลายหมื่นโวลต์ไว้ที่มือและทันทีที่นั้นก็ชก 6 ครั้งด้วยความเร็วเหมือนไฟฟ้า เพื่อเฉือนลม โจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรูแบบสุ่ม การชกแต่ละครั้งสร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#220%#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0x5B545B# หากชกโดน 3 ฮีโร่อื่นที่แตกต่างกัน เอฟเฟกต์ [สนามไฟฟ้าสถิต] จะถูกเปิดใช้งานและส่งผลกระทบต่อสนามทั้งหมดของศัตรู เป็นระยะเวลา 1~2 เทิร์น สนามไฟฟ้าสถิต: ใน #L0#, มีโอกาส 50% ที่จะได้รับ [การเหนี่ยวนำ] และไม่สามารถรับบัพได้ และมีโอกาส 80% ที่จะถูก [เป็นอัมพาต] 1 เทิร์นหลังจากโจมตี เมื่อฮีโร่สายฟ้าของคุณโจมตีเป้าหมายในสนามไฟฟ้าสถิต ความเสียหายทักษะ 25% จะถูกส่งต่อไปยังเป้าหมาย [กระแสไฟฟ้า] สูงสุด 2 ตัว',
		describe_in = 'Zeraora mengumpulkan listrik puluhan ribu volt di tangan dan langsung meninju 6 kali dengan kecepatan kilat untuk memotong angin, menyerang target musuh secara acak. Setiap pukulan memberikan #C0xE69900#220% Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik #C0x5B545B#. Jika mengenai 3 pahlawan berbeda, efek [static field] akan aktif dan berdampak pada seluruh medan musuh selama 1~2 giliran. Static Field: Dalam #L0#, ada kemungkinan 50% terkena [Induksi] dan tidak bisa menerima buff, serta kemungkinan 80% terkena [Paralisis] selama 1 giliran setelah melancarkan serangan. Ketika Pahlawan Petir Anda menyerang target dalam Static Field, 25% dari kerusakan skill akan dialihkan ke maksimal dua target [Konduksi].',
		describe_ph = 'Pinagsama ni Zeraora ang sampu-sampung libong bolt ng kuryente sa mga kamay at agad na tumama ng 6 na suntok na kasing bilis ng kidlat upang hatiin ang hangin, random na ina-atake ang mga kalaban. Bawat suntok ay nagdudulot ng #C0xE69900#220% Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala #C0x5B545B#. Kung tama sa 3 magkakaibang bayani, ang epekto ng [static field] ay ma-a-activate at tatama sa buong larangan ng kalaban, tumatagal ng 1~2 turn. Static Field: Sa loob ng #L0#, may 50% tsansa na magkaroon ng [Induction] at hindi maaaring makatanggap ng buff, at 80% tsansa na magkaroon ng [Paralysis] sa loob ng 1 turn matapos maglunsad ng atake. Kapag inatake ng iyong Thunder Hero ang target sa Static Field, 25% ng pinsalang mula sa skill ay malilipat sa hanggang dalawang target na [Conducted].',
		describe_ma = 'Zeraora mengumpul puluhan ribu volt elektrik di tangan dan segera menumbuk sebanyak 6 kali dengan kelajuan kilat untuk memotong angin, menyerang sasaran musuh secara rawak. Setiap tumbukan menyebabkan #C0xE69900#220% Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal #C0x5B545B#. Jika terkena 3 wira berbeza, kesan [static field] akan diaktifkan dan memberi kesan ke seluruh medan musuh selama 1~2 pusingan. Medan Statik: Dalam #L0#, terdapat 50% kemungkinan menerima [Induksi] dan tidak dapat menerima buff, serta 80% kemungkinan mengalami [Terparalisis] selama 1 pusingan selepas melancarkan serangan. Apabila Wira Petir anda menyerang sasaran dalam Medan Statik, 25% kerosakan kemahiran akan dipindahkan ke maksimum dua sasaran [Penghantaran].',
		describe = 'Zeraora gathers tens of thousands of volts of electricity in its hands and immediately punches 6 times at lightning speed to cut through the air, randomly attacking enemy targets. Each punch deals #C0xE69900#220% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*60)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage #C0x5B545B#. If it hits 3 different enemy heroes, the [static field] effect is activated and affects the entire enemy field, lasting 1~2 turns. Static Field: For #L0#, there is a 50% chance to receive [Induction] and cannot be buffed, and an 80% chance to be [Paralyzed] for 1 turn after launching an attack. When your Thunder Hero attacks a target within the Static Field, 25% of the skill damage is transferred to up to two [Conducted] targets.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[41619],
		-- {11}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Giải phóng sau nếu tồn tại <Ảo ảnh sấm sét>, thì hợp thể với Ảo ảnh sấm sét thành <Pháp tướng sấm sét> trong 2 lượt\nPháp tướng sấm sét: thêm 80% thuộc tính hiện tại của Ảo ảnh sấm sét, và tăng thêm 50% né tránh, mỗi lần tấn công chủ động đều là phát ra đòn điện plasma (không tiêu hao, hồi phục tức giận nhưng tốc độ hồi tức giận của bản thân giảm 50%), số lần ra đòn tăng một và chắc chắn trúng đích',
		starEffectDesc = 'Release after if <Illusion of Thunder> exists, then merge with Illusion of Thunder into <Thunder Dharma General> for 2 rounds. o0ooThunder Dharma General: adds 80% of the current attributes of Illusion of Thunder, and increases dodge by 50%. Each active attack emits a plasma electric strike (no consumption, restores rage but self rage recovery speed is reduced by 50%). The number of strikes increases by one and is guaranteed to hit.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Release after if <Illusion of Thunder> exists, then merge with Illusion of Thunder into <Thunder Dharma General> for 2 rounds. o0ooThunder Dharma General: adds 80% of the current attributes of Illusion of Thunder, and increases dodge by 50%. Each active attack emits a plasma electric strike (no consumption, restores rage but self rage recovery speed is reduced by 50%). The number of strikes increases by one and is guaranteed to hit.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'ปล่อยหลังหากมี <ภาพลวงตาสายฟ้า> จากนั้นรวมกับภาพลวงตาสายฟ้าเป็น <ทหารพรานสายฟ้า> ภายใน 2 เทิร์น o0ooทหารพรานสายฟ้า: เพิ่มคุณสมบัติปัจจุบันของภาพลวงตาสายฟ้า 80% และเพิ่มการหลบหลีกอีก 50% แต่ละครั้งที่โจมตีแบบแอคทีฟจะปล่อยสายในพลาสม่าไฟฟ้า (ไม่ใช้พลังงาน ฟื้นฟูความโกรธ แต่ความเร็วในการฟื้นฟูความโกรธของตัวเองลดลง 50%) จำนวนการโจมตีเพิ่มขึ้นหนึ่งครั้งและการโจมตีจะถูกต้องแน่นอน',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Lepaskan setelah jika <Ilusi Petir> ada, maka gabungkan dengan Ilusi Petir menjadi <Jenderal Petir Dharma> selama 2 giliran. o0ooJenderal Petir Dharma: menambahkan 80% atribut saat ini dari Ilusi Petir, dan meningkatkan penghindaran sebesar 50%. Setiap serangan aktif akan mengeluarkan serangan listrik plasma (tanpa konsumsi, memulihkan kemarahan tetapi kecepatan pemulihan kemarahan diri sendiri berkurang 50%). Jumlah serangan meningkat satu dan dipastikan mengenai sasaran.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Pakawalan pagkatapos kung mayroon <Illusion ng Kidlat>, pagkatapos ay pagsamahin sa Illusion ng Kidlat upang maging <Thunder Dharma General> sa loob ng 2 turn. o0ooThunder Dharma General: nagdadagdag ng 80% ng kasalukuyang mga katangian ng Illusion ng Kidlat, at nagpapataas ng 50% na pag-iwas. Bawat aktibong pag-atake ay nagpapalabas ng plasma electric strike (hindi kumokonsumo, nagpapagaling ng galit ngunit binabawasan ang bilis ng paggaling ng sariling galit ng 50%). Ang bilang ng mga pag-atake ay nadaragdagan ng isa at tiyak na tumatama.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Lepaskan selepas jika <Ilusi Kilat> wujud, kemudian gabungkan dengan Ilusi Kilat menjadi <Jeneral Kilat Dharma> dalam 2 pusingan. o0ooJeneral Kilat Dharma: menambah 80% sifat semasa Ilusi Kilat, dan meningkatkan dodge sebanyak 50%. Setiap serangan aktif akan melepaskan serangan elektrik plasma (tiada penggunaan, memulihkan kemarahan tetapi kelajuan pulih kemarahan sendiri berkurangan 50%). Bilangan serangan meningkat satu dan mesti tepat sasaran.',
