		skillName_ma = 'Ilusi kilat',
		skillName = 'Illusion of lightning',
		describe_vn = '#L10#Thunder Phantom: #L0# Trước khi bắt đầu mỗi vòng đấu lớn, hãy tạo một [Phantom] để theo dõi chính nó. Phantom thừa hưởng 50% thuộc tính của Zeraora và không bị ảnh hưởng bởi bất kỳ hiệu ứng nào. Khi kẻ địch tấn công cơ thể chính, có 50% cơ hội đánh trúng Bóng ma và được thêm [Điện] trong 2 lượt. Cơ thể chính không bị ảnh hưởng bởi sát thương và tác dụng của kỹ năng này. Khi cơ thể chính tấn công, Bóng ma sẽ hỗ trợ tấn công các mục tiêu trong cùng phạm vi, gây 240% Sát Thương Vật Lý của chính Bóng ma\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Đòn tấn công phủ đầu: #L0# Khi đi theo Bóng ma sấm sét, Zeraora sẽ thực hiện đòn tấn công cơ bản lên kẻ địch trước khi tự tấn công, chuyển một trong các hiệu ứng bùa lợi của nó thành [Điện] trong 2 lượt, sau đó tăng tốc độ của bản thân thêm 20% trong 1 lượt Turn\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Dòng điện tần số thay đổi: #L0# Khi Zeraora tấn công một mục tiêu đã được [Điện khí hóa], nó sẽ thêm [Từ hóa] vào mục tiêu trong 1 lượt nữa (Từ hóa: Khi được thêm vào, nó sẽ thu hút hai bùa lợi vào mục tiêu và nó sẽ được kích hoạt lại khi tấn công mục tiêu sấm sét. Khi quá trình từ hóa kết thúc, có 50% cơ hội làm tê liệt mục tiêu trong 1 lượt lượt);\nDòng điện được khuếch đại, cuộc tấn công của các anh hùng sấm sét thân thiện bị hạn chế ( Anh hùng có thuộc tính bay và nước được trang bị [Điện] trong 2 lượt và sát thương khi tấn công mục tiêu [Điện] tăng thêm #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B#;\nDòng điện bị suy yếu và khi anh hùng [Điện] tấn công đồng minh Anh hùng thuộc loại sấm sét, sát thương bổ sung và sát thương thụ động giảm thêm 30%.',
		describe_en = 'Thunder Phantom: Before each major round starts, summon a [Phantom] to follow itself. The Phantom inherits 50% of Zeraora\'s attributes and is unaffected by any effects. When enemies attack the main body, there is a 50% chance to hit the Phantom and add [Electric] for 2 turns. The main body is immune to damage and effects from this skill. When the main body attacks, the Phantom assists by attacking targets in the same range, dealing 240% of the Phantom\'s Physical Damage.\n\nInitial Attack: While following the Thunder Phantom, Zeraora performs a basic attack on the enemy before attacking itself, converting one of its positive buffs into [Electric] for 2 turns, then increases its own speed by 20% for 1 turn.\n\nVariable Frequency Electricity: When Zeraora attacks a target who is [Electrified], it adds [Magnetize] to the target for 1 additional turn (Magnetize: When applied, it attracts two buffs to the target and reactivates when attacking Thunder targets. When the magnetize process ends, there is a 50% chance to paralyze the target for 1 turn);\n\nElectricity is amplified, friendly Thunder heroes\' attacks are enhanced (Flying and Water attribute heroes equipped with [Electric] for 2 turns, and damage dealt to [Electric] targets is increased by #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)%#);\n\nElectricity is weakened, and when an [Electric] hero attacks an ally Thunder hero, additional and passive damage is reduced by 30%.',
		describe_th = 'ฟันเดอร์แฟนท่อม: ก่อนเริ่มรอบใหญ่แต่ละรอบ ให้สร้าง [แฟนท่อม] เพื่อติดตามตัวเอง แฟนท่อมสืบทอด 50% ของคุณสมบัติของเซราออร่าและไม่ถูกผลกระทบใดๆ เมื่อศัตรูโจมตีตัวหลัก มีโอกาส 50% ที่จะโจมตีโดนแฟนท่อมและได้รับ [ไฟฟ้า] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น ตัวหลักไม่ถูกทำร้ายหรือได้รับผลจากสกิลนี้ เมื่อร่างหลักโจมตี แฟนท่อมจะช่วยโจมตีเป้าหมายในระยะเดียวกัน สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ 240% ของแฟนท่อม\n\nการโจมตีเบื้องต้น: ขณะตามฟันเดอร์แฟนท่อม เซราออร่าจะทำการโจมตีพื้นฐานกับศัตรูก่อนโจมตีตัวเอง แปลงหนึ่งในบัฟช่วยเหลือของเขาเป็น [ไฟฟ้า] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น จากนั้นเพิ่มความเร็วของตัวเอง 20% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น\n\nกระแสไฟฟ้าความถี่แปรผัน: เมื่อเซราออร่าโจมตีเป้าหมายที่ถูก [ช็อตไฟฟ้า] เขาจะเพิ่ม [แม่เหล็กไฟฟ้า] ให้เป้าหมายเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์นเพิ่มเติม (แม่เหล็กไฟฟ้า: เมื่อถูกเพิ่ม จะดึงเอาบัฟสองอย่างเข้าเป้าหมาย และจะปลุกปั่นเมื่อโจมตีเป้าหมายสายฟ้า เมื่อกระบวนการแม่เหล็กไฟฟ้าสิ้นสุด มีโอกาส 50% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมายช็อตไฟฟ้าเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น);\n\nกระแสไฟฟ้าเพิ่มพลัง การโจมตีของฮีโร่สายฟ้าเพื่อนร่วมทีมถูกจำกัด (ฮีโร่ที่มีคุณสมบัติบินและน้ำที่ติดตั้ง [ไฟฟ้า] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น และความเสียหายเมื่อโจมตีเป้าหมาย [ไฟฟ้า] เพิ่มขึ้น #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)%#);\n\nกระแสไฟฟ้าอ่อนแอ และเมื่อฮีโร่ [ไฟฟ้า] โจมตีเพื่อนฮีโร่สายฟ้า ความเสียหายเพิ่มเติมและความเสียหายแบบพาสซีฟลดลง 30%.',
		describe_in = 'Thunder Phantom: Sebelum setiap putaran besar dimulai, buat sebuah [Phantom] untuk mengikuti dirinya sendiri. Phantom mewarisi 50% atribut Zeraora dan tidak terpengaruh oleh efek apapun. Ketika musuh menyerang tubuh utama, ada peluang 50% untuk mengenai Phantom dan menambahkan [Listrik] selama 2 giliran. Tubuh utama tidak terpengaruh oleh kerusakan dan efek dari keterampilan ini. Ketika tubuh utama menyerang, Phantom akan membantu menyerang target dalam jangkauan yang sama, menyebabkan 240% Kerusakan Fisik dari Phantom itu sendiri.\n\nSerangan Pendahuluan: Saat mengikuti Thunder Phantom, Zeraora akan melakukan serangan dasar ke musuh sebelum menyerang sendiri, mengubah salah satu efek buff-nya menjadi [Listrik] selama 2 giliran, kemudian meningkatkan kecepatannya sendiri sebesar 20% selama 1 giliran.\n\nArus Listrik Berfrekuensi Variabel: Ketika Zeraora menyerang target yang sudah [Dialiri Listrik], ia akan menambahkan [Magnetisasi] ke target selama 1 giliran tambahan (Magnetisasi: Saat diterapkan, akan menarik dua buff ke target dan akan diaktifkan ulang saat menyerang target petir. Ketika proses magnetisasi berakhir, ada peluang 50% untuk melumpuhkan target selama 1 giliran);\n\nListrik diperkuat, serangan pahlawan petir ramah terbatas (Pahlawan dengan atribut terbang dan air yang dilengkapi [Listrik] selama 2 giliran dan kerusakan saat menyerang target [Listrik] meningkat sebesar #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)%#);\n\nListrik melemah dan ketika pahlawan [Listrik] menyerang sekutu pahlawan petir, kerusakan tambahan dan kerusakan pasif berkurang 30%.',
		describe_ph = 'Thunder Phantom: Bago magsimula ang bawat malaking round, lumikha ng isang [Phantom] upang sundan ang sarili nito. Ang Phantom ay minamana ang 50% ng mga katangian ni Zeraora at hindi naapektuhan ng anumang epekto. Kapag inatake ng mga kalaban ang pangunahing katawan, may 50% na pagkakataon na tamaan ang Phantom at madagdagan ng [Kuryente] sa loob ng 2 turn. Ang pangunahing katawan ay hindi naaapektuhan ng pinsala at epekto ng kakayahang ito. Kapag inatake ng pangunahing katawan, tutulong ang Phantom sa pag-atake sa mga target sa parehong saklaw, na nagdudulot ng 240% Physical Damage ng Phantom.\n\nUnang Atake: Kapag sumusunod sa Thunder Phantom, gagawa si Zeraora ng basic attack sa kalaban bago atakihin ang sarili, isaayos ang isa sa kanyang mga buff upang maging [Kuryente] sa loob ng 2 turn, pagkatapos ay tataasan ang kanyang bilis ng 20% sa loob ng 1 turn.\n\nVariable Frequency Electricity: Kapag inatake ni Zeraora ang target na [Electrified], magdaragdag siya ng [Magnetize] sa target para sa 1 karagdagang turn (Magnetize: Kapag inilapat, huhugutin nito ang dalawang buff sa target at muling uikutin kapag inatake ang target na may thunder. Kapag natapos ang proseso ng magnetize, may 50% na pagkakataon na paralisisin ang target sa loob ng 1 turn);\n\nPinalakas ang kuryente, limitado ang mga atake ng friendly Thunder heroes (Mga bayani na may attribute na lumilipad at tubig na may [Kuryente] sa loob ng 2 turn at tumataas ang pinsala kapag inaatake ang [Kuryente] na target ng #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)%#);\n\nHina ang kuryente, at kapag ang [Kuryente] na bayani ay umaatake sa kakampi na Thunder hero, bumababa ang dagdag na pinsala at passive damage ng 30%.',
		describe_ma = 'Thunder Phantom: Sebelum setiap pusingan besar bermula, cipta sebuah [Phantom] untuk mengikuti dirinya sendiri. Phantom mewarisi 50% atribut Zeraora dan tidak terjejas oleh mana-mana kesan. Apabila musuh menyerang tubuh utama, terdapat peluang 50% untuk terkena Phantom dan menambah [Elektrik] selama 2 pusingan. Tubuh utama tidak terjejas oleh kerosakan dan kesan dari kemahiran ini. Apabila tubuh utama menyerang, Phantom akan membantu menyerang sasaran dalam julat yang sama, menyebabkan 240% Kerosakan Fizikal daripada Phantom itu sendiri.\n\nSerangan Pendahuluan: Semasa mengikuti Thunder Phantom, Zeraora akan melakukan serangan asas ke musuh sebelum menyerang dirinya sendiri, menukar salah satu kesan buffnya menjadi [Elektrik] selama 2 pusingan, kemudian meningkatkan kelajuannya sendiri sebanyak 20% selama 1 pusingan.\n\nArus Elektrik Kekerapan Bervariasi: Apabila Zeraora menyerang sasaran yang sudah [Dielektrifikasikan], dia akan menambah [Magnetisasi] ke sasaran selama 1 pusingan tambahan (Magnetisasi: Apabila digunakan, ia menarik dua buff ke sasaran dan akan diaktifkan semula apabila menyerang sasaran petir. Apabila proses magnetisasi berakhir, terdapat peluang 50% untuk melumpuhkan sasaran selama 1 pusingan);\n\nElektrik diperkuat, serangan wira petir mesra terhad (Wira dengan atribut terbang dan air yang dilengkapi dengan [Elektrik] selama 2 pusingan dan kerosakan ketika menyerang sasaran [Elektrik] meningkat sebanyak #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)%#);\n\nElektrik lemah dan apabila wira [Elektrik] menyerang sekutu wira petir, kerosakan tambahan dan kerosakan pasif dikurangkan sebanyak 30%.',
		describe = 'Thunder Phantom: Before each major round starts, summon a [Phantom] to follow itself. The Phantom inherits 50% of Zeraora\'s attributes and is unaffected by any effects. When enemies attack the main body, there is a 50% chance to hit the Phantom and add [Electric] for 2 turns. The main body is immune to damage and effects from this skill. When the main body attacks, the Phantom assists by attacking targets in the same range, dealing 240% of the Phantom\'s Physical Damage.\n\nInitial Attack: While following the Thunder Phantom, Zeraora performs a basic attack on the enemy before attacking itself, converting one of its positive buffs into [Electric] for 2 turns, then increases its own speed by 20% for 1 turn.\n\nVariable Frequency Electricity: When Zeraora attacks a target who is [Electrified], it adds [Magnetize] to the target for 1 additional turn (Magnetize: When applied, it attracts two buffs to the target and reactivates when attacking Thunder targets. When the magnetize process ends, there is a 50% chance to paralyze the target for 1 turn);\n\nElectricity is amplified, friendly Thunder heroes\' attacks are enhanced (Flying and Water attribute heroes equipped with [Electric] for 2 turns, and damage dealt to [Electric] targets is increased by #(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)%#);\n\nElectricity is weakened, and when an [Electric] hero attacks an ally Thunder hero, additional and passive damage is reduced by 30%.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[41626],
		-- {8}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Trước mỗi lượt lớn bắt đầu: Tạo một <Ảo Ảnh> cho đồng đội có chỉ số tấn công cao nhất thuộc hệ Sét hoặc Đấu Sĩ, và nhận hiệu ứng <Tiên Phát Chiến>. <Ảo Ảnh> nhận được năng lượng sẽ truyền cho bản thể, và khi bị tiêu diệt, sẽ gây sát thương 200% Công Vật Lý lên kẻ tấn công.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Before each major turn begins: Create an <Illusion> for the ally with the highest attack stat belonging to the Lightning or Fighter class, and gain the <First Strike> effect. The <Illusion> receives energy that will be transferred to the original, and when destroyed, deals 200% Physical Attack damage to the attacker.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Before each major turn begins: Create an <Illusion> for the ally with the highest attack stat belonging to the Lightning or Fighter class, and gain the <First Strike> effect. The <Illusion> receives energy that will be transferred to the original, and when destroyed, deals 200% Physical Attack damage to the attacker.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'ก่อนเริ่มแต่ละเทิร์นหลัก: สร้าง <ภาพลวงตา> ให้กับพันธมิตรวัดพลังการโจมตีสูงสุดที่เป็นระบบสายฟ้าหรือสไตล์นักสู้ และได้รับเอฟเฟกต์ <โจมตีก่อน>. <ภาพลวงตา> จะได้รับพลังงานที่ส่งต่อไปยังต้นฉบับ และเมื่อถูกทำลาย จะสร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ 200% แก่ผู้โจมตี',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Sebelum setiap giliran besar dimulai: Buat <Ilusi> untuk rekan tim dengan stat serangan tertinggi yang berasal dari sistem Petir atau Petarung, dan dapatkan efek <Serangan Pertama>. <Ilusi> menerima energi yang akan diteruskan ke aslinya, dan saat dihancurkan, memberikan kerusakan Fisik sebesar 200% kepada penyerang.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Bago magsimula ang bawat malaking turn: Lumikha ng isang <Illusion> para sa kakampi na may pinakamataas na attack stat na kabilang sa Lightning o Fighter system, at tumanggap ng epekto ng <First Strike>. Ang <Illusion> ay tumatanggap ng enerhiya na ipapasa sa orihinal, at kapag nasira, magdudulot ng 200% Physical Attack na pinsala sa umaatake.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Sebelum setiap giliran besar bermula: Buat satu <Ilusi> untuk rakan sepasukan dengan statistik serangan tertinggi yang tergolong dalam Sistem Kilat atau Pejuang, dan terima kesan <Serangan Pertama>. <Ilusi> menerima tenaga yang akan dipindahkan kepada asal, dan apabila dimusnahkan, akan menyebabkan kerosakan Fizikal sebanyak 200% kepada penyerang.',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
