		describe_en = 'Melmetal charges at a single enemy target with its head, dealing #C0xE69900#90% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*24)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, increasing its own physical defense by 40% and parry rate by 20%, cannot be stacked, lasts for 2 turns.',
