		skillName_ma = 'Logam cecair',
		skillName = 'Liquid metal',
		describe_vn = '#L10# Kim loại lỏng: #L0# Mỗi lần bạn bị đánh, nó sẽ hấp thụ 20% sát thương trúng đòn và chuyển thành lượng máu tương đương, đồng thời tăng 20% ​​tỷ lệ kháng cự và sức kháng cự của bản thân trong 1 hiệp. Bất cứ khi nào kháng cự được kích hoạt thành công, nó sẽ kích hoạt hiệu ứng [tăng cường phản đòn] (tăng vĩnh viễn phòng thủ vật lý cơ bản của bạn thêm 10% (có thể cộng dồn 10 lần) và phản công kẻ tấn công, sát thương là sát thương thực sự của 300% phòng thủ vật lý)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Bất kể sự an toàn của bản thân: #L0# Khi anh hùng của chính mình bị sát thương bởi một đòn tấn công chủ động vượt quá 80% mức hiện tại mạng sống, thay vào đó Meilu Meta sẽ chịu thiệt hại trong đòn tấn công này; khi bản thân Meilu Meta bị trúng một đòn chí mạng, nó sẽ miễn nhiễm với sát thương của đòn chí mạng này. Sau khi bất kỳ hiệu ứng nào ở trên được kích hoạt, bất kể sự an toàn của bản thân, Meilu Meta sẽ bước vào thời gian hồi chiêu 2 hiệp\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Rust: #L0#Khi Melumeta chết, nó sẽ rỉ sét và phân hủy thành Meltan. Meltan kế thừa tất cả các thuộc tính ban đầu của Melumeta#C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# (làm mới nội tại và đặt lại thời gian hồi chiêu kỹ năng nhỏ)',
		describe_en = '#L10# Liquid Metal: #L0# Each time you are hit, it absorbs 20% of the damage taken and converts it into equivalent health, while increasing your resistance rate and resistance strength by 20% for 1 round. Whenever resistance activates successfully, it triggers the [counterattack enhancement] effect (permanently increases your basic physical defense by 10% (stackable up to 10 times) and counterattacks the attacker, dealing true damage equal to 300% of physical defense)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Regardless of self-preservation: #L0# When your own hero takes damage from an active attack exceeding 80% of current HP, Meilu Meta takes the damage instead; when Meilu Meta is hit by a critical strike, it becomes immune to that critical strike damage. After any of these effects activate, regardless of self-preservation, Meilu Meta enters a 2-round cooldown\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Rust: #L0# When Melumeta dies, it rusts and decomposes into Meltan. Meltan inherits all original attributes of Melumeta#C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# (refreshes passive and resets skill cooldown).',
		describe_th = '#L10# โลหะเหลว: #L0# ทุกครั้งที่คุณถูกโจมตี มันจะดูดซับดาเมจ 20% ของการโจมตีที่ได้รับและแปลงเป็นพลังชีวิตเท่ากัน พร้อมเพิ่มอัตราการต้านทานและความแข็งแกร่งในการต้านทานของตัวเองขึ้น 20% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น เมื่อใดก็ตามที่การต้านทานทำงานสำเร็จ จะเปิดใช้งานเอฟเฟค [การเสริมการสวนกลับ] (เพิ่มค่าป้องกันกายภาพพื้นฐานถาวรของคุณขึ้น 10% (ซ้อนกันได้สูงสุด 10 ครั้ง) และสวนกลับผู้โจมตี สร้างความเสียหายจริงเท่ากับ 300% ของค่าป้องกันกายภาพ)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# ไม่คำนึงถึงความปลอดภัยของตัวเอง: #L0# เมื่อฮีโร่ของคุณถูกโจมตีแบบแอคทีฟมากกว่า 80% ของพลังชีวิตปัจจุบัน Meilu Meta จะรับความเสียหายแทน; เมื่อ Meilu Meta ถูกโจมตีคริติคอล จะเป็นภูมิคุ้มกันต่อความเสียหายคริติคอลนั้น หลังจากเอฟเฟคใดๆ เหล่านี้ทำงาน ไม่คำนึงถึงความปลอดภัยของตัวเอง Meilu Meta จะเข้าสู่ช่วงเวลาคูลดาวน์ 2 เทิร์น\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# สนิม: #L0# เมื่อ Melumeta ตาย มันจะเกิดสนิมและสลายตัวเป็น Meltan ซึ่ง Meltan จะสืบทอดคุณสมบัติเดิมทั้งหมดของ Melumeta#C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# (รีเฟรชพาสซีฟและรีเซ็ตเวลาคูลดาวน์สกิล).',
		describe_in = '#L10# Logam Cair: #L0# Setiap kali Anda terkena serangan, ia menyerap 20% dari kerusakan yang diterima dan mengubahnya menjadi jumlah darah yang setara, sekaligus meningkatkan tingkat dan kekuatan ketahanan Anda sebesar 20% selama 1 giliran. Setiap kali ketahanan berhasil aktif, akan memicu efek [peningkatan serangan balasan] (meningkatkan pertahanan fisik dasar Anda secara permanen sebesar 10% (dapat ditumpuk hingga 10 kali) dan menyerang balik penyerang, dengan kerusakan berupa kerusakan nyata sebesar 300% pertahanan fisik)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tidak peduli tentang keselamatan diri sendiri: #L0# Ketika pahlawan Anda mendapatkan kerusakan dari serangan aktif yang melebihi 80% dari HP saat ini, Meilu Meta akan menerima kerusakan tersebut; ketika Meilu Meta terkena serangan kritis, ia kebal terhadap kerusakan serangan kritis tersebut. Setelah efek apapun di atas aktif, tanpa mempedulikan keselamatan diri sendiri, Meilu Meta akan memasuki cooldown selama 2 giliran\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Karat: #L0# Ketika Melumeta mati, ia akan berkarat dan terurai menjadi Meltan. Meltan mewarisi semua atribut asli Melumeta#C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# (menyegarkan pasif dan mereset cooldown skill).',
		describe_ph = '#L10# Likidong Metal: #L0# Sa bawat beses na ikaw ay tamaan, sumisipsip ito ng 20% ng pinsalang natanggap at ginagawang katumbas na dami ng buhay, sabay tumaas ng 20% ang iyong rate ng resistensya at lakas ng resistensya sa loob ng 1 round. Tuwing matagumpay na umaktibo ang resistensya, nagti-trigger ito ng efektong [pinalakas na pananabik] (permanenteng tumaas ang iyong pangunahing pisikal na depensa ng 10% (maaari umulit hanggang 10 beses) at bumabalik ang panlaban laban sa umaatake, ang pinsala ay totoong pinsala na katumbas ng 300% ng pisikal na depensa)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Hindi alintana ang sariling kaligtasan: #L0# Kapag ang iyong sariling bayani ay nasugatan ng isang aktibong atake na lampas sa 80% ng kasalukuyang HP, si Meilu Meta ang tatanggap ng pinsala sa halip; kapag si Meilu Meta ay tinamaan ng kritikal na suntok, siya ay immune sa pinsalang iyon. Pagkatapos maaktibo ang alinman sa mga epektong ito, hindi alintana ang sariling kaligtasan, papasok si Meilu Meta sa 2 round cooldown\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Kalawang: #L0# Kapag namatay si Melumeta, ito ay kinakalawang at nabubulok upang maging Meltan. Namamana ni Meltan ang lahat ng orihinal na katangian ni Melumeta#C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# (nire-refresh ang passive at ni-reset ang cooldown ng skill).',
		describe_ma = '#L10# Logam Cecair: #L0# Setiap kali anda diserang, ia menyerap 20% kerosakan yang diterima dan menukarnya menjadi jumlah darah yang setara, sambil meningkatkan kadar ketahanan dan kekuatan ketahanan anda sebanyak 20% selama 1 giliran. Setiap kali ketahanan berjaya diaktifkan, ia akan mencetuskan efek [peningkatan serangan balas] (secara kekal meningkatkan pertahanan fizikal asas anda sebanyak 10% (boleh ditambah sehingga 10 kali) dan menyerang balas penyerang, kerosakannya adalah kerosakan sebenar sebanyak 300% pertahanan fizikal)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tidak mengira keselamatan diri sendiri: #L0# Apabila wira anda menerima kerosakan daripada serangan aktif melebihi 80% daripada HP semasa, Meilu Meta akan menanggung kerosakan itu sebaliknya; apabila Meilu Meta terkena serangan kritikal, ia kebal terhadap kerosakan serangan kritikal itu. Selepas mana-mana kesan di atas diaktifkan, tanpa mengira keselamatan diri sendiri, Meilu Meta akan memasuki waktu penyejukan selama 2 giliran\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Karat: #L0# Apabila Melumeta mati, ia akan berkarat dan terurai menjadi Meltan. Meltan mewarisi semua atribut asal Melumeta#C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# (menyegarkan pasif dan menetapkan semula masa penyejukan kemahiran).',
		describe = '#L10# Liquid Metal: #L0# Each time you are hit, it absorbs 20% of the damage taken and converts it into equivalent health, while increasing your resistance rate and resistance strength by 20% for 1 round. Whenever resistance activates successfully, it triggers the [counterattack enhancement] effect (permanently increases your basic physical defense by 10% (stackable up to 10 times) and counterattacks the attacker, dealing true damage equal to 300% of physical defense)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Regardless of self-preservation: #L0# When your own hero takes damage from an active attack exceeding 80% of current HP, Meilu Meta takes the damage instead; when Meilu Meta is hit by a critical strike, it becomes immune to that critical strike damage. After any of these effects activate, regardless of self-preservation, Meilu Meta enters a 2-round cooldown\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Rust: #L0# When Melumeta dies, it rusts and decomposes into Meltan. Meltan inherits all original attributes of Melumeta#C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.3-0.3)$%#C0x5B545B# (refreshes passive and resets skill cooldown).',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[41756],
		-- {8}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng Bổ Sung: Sát thương của kỹ năng hợp tác và phản công của các anh hùng thuộc hệ Cơ Giới tăng 30%; khi vào trận hoặc chắn sát thương cho đồng đội, sẽ thêm <Khiên Thép> cho các anh hùng thuộc hệ Cơ Giới (lượng khiên tương đương 500% phòng thủ vật lý của Melometa). Nếu có 3 anh hùng thuộc hệ Thép trở lên, toàn bộ đồng đội sẽ nhận được <Khiên Thép>.',
		starEffectDesc = 'Supplement Effect: The damage of cooperative and counterattack skills of heroes of the Mechanical system is increased by 30%; when entering battle or blocking damage for teammates, add <Steel Shield> to heroes of the Mechanical system (shield amount equivalent to 500% of Melometa\'s physical defense). If there are 3 or more heroes of the Steel system, the entire team will receive <Steel Shield>.',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Supplement Effect: The damage of cooperative and counterattack skills of heroes of the Mechanical system is increased by 30%; when entering battle or blocking damage for teammates, add <Steel Shield> to heroes of the Mechanical system (shield amount equivalent to 500% of Melometa\'s physical defense). If there are 3 or more heroes of the Steel system, the entire team will receive <Steel Shield>.',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์เสริม: ความเสียหายของสกิลร่วมมือและสวนกลับของฮีโร่ในระบบเครื่องจักรเพิ่มขึ้น 30%; เมื่อเข้าสู่สนามรบหรือป้องกันความเสียหายให้เพื่อนร่วมทีม จะเพิ่ม <เกราะเหล็ก> ให้กับฮีโร่ในระบบเครื่องจักร (ปริมาณโล่เทียบเท่ากับการป้องกันทางกายภาพ 500% ของ Melometa) หากมีฮีโร่ในระบบเหล็ก 3 ตัวขึ้นไป ทั้งทีมจะได้รับ <เกราะเหล็ก>',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Efek Tambahan: Kerusakan dari keterampilan kerja sama dan serangan balik dari pahlawan Sistem Mekanis meningkat 30%; saat masuk arena atau menahan kerusakan untuk rekan satu tim, akan menambahkan <Perisai Baja> untuk pahlawan Sistem Mekanis (jumlah perisai setara dengan 500% pertahanan fisik Melometa). Jika ada 3 atau lebih pahlawan Sistem Baja, seluruh tim akan menerima <Perisai Baja>.',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Dagdag na Epekto: Tumaas ng 30% ang pinsala mula sa mga kasanayan sa pakikipagtulungan at pagtutugon ng mga bayani ng Mekanikal na sistema; kapag pumasok sa laban o sumisimang sa pinsala para sa mga kakampi, magdaragdag ng <Steel Shield> sa mga bayani ng Mekanikal na sistema (kapantayang dami ng kalasag ay 500% ng pisikal na depensa ni Melometa). Kung may 3 o higit pang mga bayani ng Steel na sistema, lahat ng miyembro ng koponan ay makakatanggap ng <Steel Shield>.',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Kesan Tambahan: Kerosakan kemahiran kerjasama dan serangan balas wira Sistem Mekanikal meningkat sebanyak 30%; ketika memasuki pertempuran atau melindungi serangan untuk rakan sepasukan, akan menambah <Perisai Keluli> untuk wira Sistem Mekanikal (jumlah perisai bersamaan dengan 500% pertahanan fizikal Melometa). Jika terdapat 3 atau lebih wira Sistem Keluli, seluruh pasukan akan menerima <Perisai Keluli>.',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		changeUnitTrigger = true,
		isCombat = true,
