		skillName_ph = 'Passive skill naka-equip',
		skillName_ma = 'Kemahiran pasif dipasang',
		skillName = 'Passive skill equipped',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, vào cuối mỗi hiệp lớn, HP của tất cả người dùng trang bị anh hùng thân thiện sẽ được phục hồi bằng $(skillLevel+6,5)$% lượng máu tối đa của họ. Nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội giao hữu thì chỉ một trang bị có tác dụng.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, at the end of each major round, the HP of all friendly hero equipment users will be restored by $(skillLevel+6.5)$% of their maximum health. If there are multiple equipment pieces in the friendly team, only one equipment will take effect.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ เมื่อสิ้นสุดแต่ละรอบใหญ่ HP ของผู้ใช้อุปกรณ์ฮีโร่ฝ่ายเดียวกันทั้งหมดจะถูกฟื้นฟูขึ้น $(skillLevel+6.5)$% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของพวกเขา หากมีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีมฝ่ายเดียว จะมีเพียงอุปกรณ์เดียวที่มีผล',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, pada akhir setiap ronde besar, HP semua pengguna peralatan pahlawan yang ramah akan dipulihkan sebesar $(skillLevel+6.5)$% dari total kesehatan maksimum mereka. Jika ada beberapa peralatan dalam tim ramah, hanya satu peralatan yang akan berfungsi.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, sa pagtatapos ng bawat malaking round, ang HP ng lahat ng mga gumagamit ng kaibigang hero equipment ay mare-recover ng $(skillLevel+6.5)$% ng kanilang maximum na buhay. Kung maraming kagamitan sa friendly team, isa lamang ang magkakaroon ng epekto.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertarungan, pada akhir setiap pusingan utama, HP semua pengguna peralatan wira yang mesra akan dipulihkan sebanyak $(skillLevel+6.5)$% daripada jumlah kesihatan maksimum mereka. Jika terdapat beberapa peralatan dalam pasukan mesra, hanya satu peralatan yang akan berfungsi.',
		describe = 'In battle, at the end of each major round, the HP of all friendly hero equipment users will be restored by $(skillLevel+6.5)$% of their maximum health. If there are multiple equipment pieces in the friendly team, only one equipment will take effect.',
