		skillName_ma = 'Bawa prop - Tenaga negatif',
		skillName = 'Carry props - Negative energy',
		describe_vn = 'Trong chiến đấu, tấn công kèm theo giảm $(40+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% hiệu quả trị liệu và $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% tốc độ hồi phục nộ khí của mục tiêu có tấn công cao nhất (giá trị Công Vật Lý hoặc Công Phép lớn hơn), kéo dài 2 lượt',
		describe_en = 'In battle, attacks reduce the target with the highest attack (whichever is greater between Physical Attack or Magic Attack) by $(40+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% healing effectiveness and $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% chakra recovery speed for 2 turns.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ การโจมตีจะลดประสิทธิภาพการฟื้นฟู $(40+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% และความเร็วในการฟื้นฟูพลังจิต $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% ของเป้าหมายที่มีพลังโจมตีสูงสุด (ค่าพลังโจมตีทางกายภาพหรือเวทมนตร์ที่มากกว่า) เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, serangan mengurangi efektivitas penyembuhan sebesar $(40+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan kecepatan pemulihan chakra sebesar $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% pada target dengan serangan tertinggi (nilai Serangan Fisik atau Serangan Magis yang lebih besar), berlangsung selama 2 giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang mga atake ay nagpapababa ng bisa ng paggaling ng target na may pinakamataas na atake (alinman ang mas mataas sa Pisikal na Atake o Mahiwagang Atake) ng $(40+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% at nagpapabagal ng bilis ng pagpapagaling ng chakra ng $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% sa loob ng 2 na turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, serangan mengurangkan keberkesanan penyembuhan sebanyak $(40+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan kelajuan pemulihan chakra sebanyak $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% pada sasaran yang mempunyai serangan tertinggi (nilai Serangan Fizikal atau Serangan Sihir yang lebih tinggi), berlangsung selama 2 pusingan.',
		describe = 'In battle, attacks reduce the target with the highest attack (whichever is greater between Physical Attack or Magic Attack) by $(40+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% healing effectiveness and $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% chakra recovery speed for 2 turns.',
