		skillName_ma = 'Barangan Manga - Naga Syaitan',
		skillName = 'Manga Items - Demon Dragon',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, trong 3 hiệp đầu tiên, khi người mặc hoặc anh hùng được bảo vệ bởi [Người bảo vệ bất khuất] bị tấn công, phần thưởng sát thương của người thi triển là $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% và tốc độ hồi phục cơn tức giận của $(24+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% có thể bị giảm trong 1 hiệp, không thể cộng dồn\n#F10# \n#F40#Trong vòng đầu tiên của trận đấu trận chiến, một anh hùng được đưa ra hàng sau trong đội của bạn (anh hùng phía sau bạn được ưu tiên và không thể chọn anh hùng được trang bị Khiên bất khuất)\n#F10# \n#F40#Người bảo vệ bất khuất: #L0#: Nó giúp giảm sát thương và kháng đòn chí mạng giống như người đeo, sau đó giảm 40% vào cuối mỗi hiệp (nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội, chỉ một trong những Người bảo vệ bất khuất mới có thể có hiệu lực)',
		describe_en = 'In the battle, during the first 3 rounds, when the wearer or a hero protected by [Unyielding Guardian] is attacked, the damage bonus of the caster is $(12 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% and the rage recovery speed of $(24 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$% can be reduced for 1 round, and cannot be stacked.#F10# #F40# In the first round of the battle, a hero placed in the backline of your team (the hero behind you is prioritized and heroes equipped with Unyielding Shield cannot be selected) #F10# #F40# Unyielding Guardian: #L0#: It helps reduce damage and critical hit resistance similar to the wearer, then reduces by 40% at the end of each round (if there are multiple equipment in the team, only one Unyielding Guardian can take effect).',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ ใน 3 รอบแรก เมื่อผู้สวมใส่หรือฮีโร่ที่ได้รับการปกป้องโดย [ผู้พิทักษ์ที่ไม่ย่อท้อ] ถูกโจมตี รางวัลความเสียหายของผู้ร่ายจะถูกลดลง $(12 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% และความเร็วการฟื้นฟูความโกรธที่ $(24 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$% ใน 1 รอบ และไม่สามารถซ้อนกันได้ #F10# #F40# ในรอบแรกของการต่อสู้ ฮีโร่ที่ถูกวางไว้ในตำแหน่งหลังของทีมคุณ (ฮีโร่ด้านหลังคุณจะถูกให้ความสำคัญ และไม่สามารถเลือกฮีโร่ที่ติดตั้งโล่อันไม่ย่อท้อ) #F10# #F40# ผู้พิทักษ์ที่ไม่ย่อท้อ: #L0#: ช่วยลดความเสียหายและต้านทานการโจมตีคริติคอลเหมือนผู้สวมใส่ จากนั้นลดลง 40% เมื่อสิ้นสุดแต่ละรอบ (หากมีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีม มีเพียง ผู้พิทักษ์ที่ไม่ย่อท้อ หนึ่งคนเท่านั้นที่มีผล)',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, selama 3 ronde pertama, saat pemakai atau pahlawan yang dilindungi oleh [Penjaga Pantang Menyerah] diserang, bonus kerusakan dari pelaku adalah $(12 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% dan kecepatan pemulihan kemarahan sebesar $(24 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$% dapat dikurangi selama 1 ronde, dan tidak bisa ditumpuk.#F10# #F40# Pada ronde pertama pertempuran, seorang pahlawan ditempatkan di garis belakang tim Anda (pahlawan di belakang Anda diprioritaskan dan pahlawan yang dilengkapi dengan Perisai Pantang Menyerah tidak dapat dipilih) #F10# #F40# Penjaga Pantang Menyerah: #L0#: Membantu mengurangi kerusakan dan resistensi serangan kritis seperti pemakai, kemudian mengurangi 40% di akhir setiap ronde (jika ada beberapa perlengkapan dalam tim, hanya satu Penjaga Pantang Menyerah yang bisa efektif).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, sa unang 3 rounds, kapag ang tagasuot o bayani na pinoprotektahan ng [Hindi Matitinag na Tagapagtanggol] ay inatake, ang damage bonus ng tagapagpakuha ay maaaring bumaba ng $(12 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% at ang bilis ng paggaling ng galit na $(24 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$% ay maaaring mabawasan sa loob ng 1 round, at hindi maaaring pagsamasamahin.#F10# #F40# Sa unang round ng laban, isang bayani ang inilalagay sa likurang linya ng iyong koponan (bini-prioritize ang bayani sa likod mo at hindi pwedeng piliin ang bayaning may nakapiring na Hindi Matitinag na Pangkalas) #F10# #F40# Hindi Matitinag na Tagapagtanggol: #L0#: Nakakatulong ito sa pagbawas ng damage at resistensya sa critical hit gaya ng tagasuot, pagkatapos ay bumaba ng 40% sa katapusan ng bawat round (kung maraming kagamitan sa koponan, isa lamang ang pinakamahusay na Hindi Matitinag na Tagapagtanggol ang mabibisa).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, dalam 3 pusingan pertama, apabila pemakai atau wira yang dilindungi oleh [Penjaga Teguh] diserang, ganjaran kerosakan pengamal adalah $(12 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% dan kelajuan pemulihan kemarahan sebanyak $(24 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$% boleh dikurangkan selama 1 pusingan, dan tidak boleh bertindih.#F10# #F40# Dalam pusingan pertama pertempuran, seorang wira diletakkan di barisan belakang pasukan anda (wira di belakang anda diutamakan dan wira yang dilengkapi dengan Perisai Teguh tidak boleh dipilih) #F10# #F40# Penjaga Teguh: #L0#: Ia membantu mengurangkan kerosakan dan ketahanan serangan kritikal seperti pemakai, kemudian mengurangkan 40% pada akhir setiap pusingan (jika terdapat beberapa kelengkapan dalam pasukan, hanya satu Penjaga Teguh yang boleh berkuat kuasa).',
		describe = 'In the battle, during the first 3 rounds, when the wearer or a hero protected by [Unyielding Guardian] is attacked, the damage bonus of the caster is $(12 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% and the rage recovery speed of $(24 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$% can be reduced for 1 round, and cannot be stacked.#F10# #F40# In the first round of the battle, a hero placed in the backline of your team (the hero behind you is prioritized and heroes equipped with Unyielding Shield cannot be selected) #F10# #F40# Unyielding Guardian: #L0#: It helps reduce damage and critical hit resistance similar to the wearer, then reduces by 40% at the end of each round (if there are multiple equipment in the team, only one Unyielding Guardian can take effect).',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520211}
	},
	[52022] = {
		id = 52022,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang đạo cụ - Quỷ Long',
		skillName_en = 'Item mage - Demon Dragon',
		skillName_th = 'ไอเท็มจอมเวทย์ - มังกรปีศาจ',
		skillName_in = 'Barang penyihir - Naga Iblis',
		skillName_ph = 'Item mage - Demon Dragon',
		skillName_ma = 'Item ahli sihir - Naga Syaitan',
		skillName = 'Item mage - Demon Dragon',
		describe_vn = 'Trong 3 vòng đầu tiên của trận chiến (tích lũy khi chơi một người chơi), chủ sở hữu trang bị và các đơn vị đồng minh khác có sức tấn công cao nhất sẽ có tỷ lệ không bị kiểm soát là $(5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% và phần thưởng hiệu ứng kỹ năng là $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (cả sát thương kỹ năng và hồi phục kỹ năng sẽ được tăng lên)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Deep Sea Recovery: #L0# Khi thành viên trang bị kích hoạt hiệu ứng hồi máu lần đầu tiên trong 3 hiệp đầu tiên, hiệu ứng hồi máu sẽ bị xóa đối với anh hùng có phần trăm máu thấp nhất và thêm 20% máu của anh ta sẽ được phục hồi. Lượng hồi máu tràn sẽ có hiệu lực trở lại ở vòng tiếp theo (nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội, Deep Sea Recovery chỉ có thể có hiệu lực trên 1)',
		describe_en = 'In the first 3 rounds of the battle (accumulated in single-player mode), the equipment owner and other ally units with the highest attack power have a $(5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% chance to resist control effects, and the skill effect rewards are increased by $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (both skill damage and skill healing will be enhanced). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Deep Sea Recovery: #L0# When the equipped member triggers a healing effect for the first time within the first 3 rounds, the healing effect will be removed from the hero with the lowest health percentage, and an additional 20% of his health will be restored. Excess healing will take effect again in the next round (if there are multiple pieces of equipment in the team, Deep Sea Recovery can only activate once).',
		describe_th = 'ใน 3 รอบแรกของการต่อสู้ (สะสมเมื่อเล่นโหมดผู้เล่นคนเดียว) เจ้าของอุปกรณ์และหน่วยพันธมิตรอื่นที่มีพลังโจมตีสูงสุดจะมีโอกาส $(5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% ที่จะไม่ถูกควบคุม และรางวัลเอฟเฟกต์ทักษะจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (ทั้งความเสียหายทักษะและการฟื้นฟูทักษะจะเพิ่มขึ้น) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#การฟื้นฟูลึกของทะเล: #L0# เมื่อสมาชิกผู้ติดตั้งอุปกรณ์เปิดใช้งานเอฟเฟกต์การฟื้นฟูเลือดเป็นครั้งแรกภายใน 3 รอบแรก เอฟเฟกต์การฟื้นฟูเลือดจะถูกลบออกจากฮีโร่ที่มีเปอร์เซ็นต์เลือดต่ำที่สุดและจะฟื้นฟูเลือดเพิ่มขึ้นอีก 20% ของเลือดของเขา การฟื้นฟูเลือดส่วนเกินจะมีผลอีกครั้งในรอบถัดไป (หากมีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีม Deep Sea Recovery จะมีผลเพียงครั้งเดียวเท่านั้น)',
		describe_in = 'Pada 3 putaran pertama pertempuran (terakumulasi saat bermain mode pemain tunggal), pemilik perlengkapan dan unit sekutu lain dengan serangan tertinggi memiliki peluang $(5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% untuk tidak terkena kontrol, dan hadiah efek keterampilan meningkat sebesar $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (baik kerusakan keterampilan maupun penyembuhan keterampilan akan meningkat). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Deep Sea Recovery: #L0# Ketika anggota yang dilengkapi mengaktifkan efek penyembuhan untuk pertama kalinya dalam 3 putaran pertama, efek penyembuhan akan dihapus pada pahlawan dengan persentase kesehatan terendah dan 20% kesehatan tambahan akan dipulihkan. Penyembuhan berlebih akan aktif kembali pada putaran berikutnya (jika ada beberapa perlengkapan dalam tim, Deep Sea Recovery hanya bisa aktif sekali).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa unang 3 rounds ng laban (naipon sa paglaro ng single-player), ang may-ari ng kagamitan at iba pang alyadong yunit na may pinakamataas na lakas ng atake ay may $(5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% na tsansa na hindi makontrol, at ang gantimpala ng skill effect ay tataas ng $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (parehong damage ng skill at recovery ng skill ay mapapataas). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Deep Sea Recovery: #L0# Kapag ang miyembrong may kagamitan ay unang nag-trigger ng healing effect sa unang 3 rounds, ang healing effect ay aalisin para sa bayani na may pinakamababang porsyento ng HP at dagdag na 20% ng kanyang HP ang ire-recover. Ang sobrang healing ay magiging epektibo muli sa susunod na round (kung maraming kagamitan sa koponan, ang Deep Sea Recovery ay maaaring mag-activate lamang ng isang beses).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam 3 pusingan pertama pertempuran (terkumpul semasa bermain mod pemain tunggal), pemilik peralatan dan unit sekutu lain dengan serangan tertinggi mempunyai peluang $(5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% untuk tidak dikawal, dan ganjaran kesan kemahiran meningkat sebanyak $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (keduanya kerosakan kemahiran dan pemulihan kemahiran akan bertambah). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Pemulihan Laut Dalam: #L0# Apabila ahli yang dilengkapi mengaktifkan kesan pemulihan HP untuk kali pertama dalam 3 pusingan pertama, kesan pemulihan akan dipadamkan pada wira yang mempunyai peratusan HP terendah dan tambahan 20% HP beliau akan dipulihkan. Pemulihan berlebihan akan berkuat kuasa semula pada pusingan seterusnya (jika terdapat beberapa peralatan dalam pasukan, Pemulihan Laut Dalam hanya boleh berkuat kuasa sekali).',
		describe = 'In the first 3 rounds of the battle (accumulated in single-player mode), the equipment owner and other ally units with the highest attack power have a $(5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% chance to resist control effects, and the skill effect rewards are increased by $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (both skill damage and skill healing will be enhanced). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Deep Sea Recovery: #L0# When the equipped member triggers a healing effect for the first time within the first 3 rounds, the healing effect will be removed from the hero with the lowest health percentage, and an additional 20% of his health will be restored. Excess healing will take effect again in the next round (if there are multiple pieces of equipment in the team, Deep Sea Recovery can only activate once).',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520221}
	},
	[52023] = {
		id = 52023,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ - Quỷ Long',
		skillName_en = 'Carry the item - Demon Dragon',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์ - มังกรปีศาจ',
		skillName_in = 'Bawa alat - Naga Iblis',
		skillName_ph = 'Dalhin ang gamit - Demon Dragon',
		skillName_ma = 'Bawa alat - Naga Syaitan',
		skillName = 'Carry the item - Demon Dragon',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, mỗi khi kết thúc lượt lớn hồi phục lượng máu bằng $(6.5+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% máu tối đa cho đơn vị có công cao nhất và đơn vị có máu thấp nhất của phe mình, kéo dài 5 lượt lớn',
		describe_en = 'In battle, at the end of each major turn, recover health equal to $(6.5 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% of the maximum HP for the ally with the highest attack and the ally with the lowest HP on your side, lasting for 5 major turns.',
		describe_th = 'ในสงคราม เมื่อสิ้นสุดรอบใหญ่แต่ละครั้ง ฟื้นฟูพลังชีวิตเท่ากับ $(6.5 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดให้กับหน่วยที่มีพลังโจมตีสูงสุดและหน่วยที่มีพลังชีวิตต่ำสุดในฝ่ายของคุณ โดยมีผลต่อเนื่องเป็นเวลา 5 รอบใหญ่',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, pada akhir setiap giliran besar, pulihkan HP sebesar $(6.5 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% dari HP maksimum untuk satuan dengan serangan tertinggi dan satuan dengan HP terendah di pihakmu, berlangsung selama 5 giliran besar.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, sa pagtatapos ng bawat malaking round, magpagaling ng katumbas ng $(6.5 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% ng maximum HP para sa yunit na may pinakamataas na atake at yunit na may pinakamababang HP sa iyong panig, tumatagal ng 5 malaking round.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, pada akhir setiap pusingan besar, pulihkan kesihatan sebanyak $(6.5 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% daripada jumlah kesihatan maksimum untuk unit dengan serangan tertinggi dan unit dengan kesihatan terendah di pihak anda, berlangsung selama 5 pusingan besar.',
		describe = 'In battle, at the end of each major turn, recover health equal to $(6.5 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% of the maximum HP for the ally with the highest attack and the ally with the lowest HP on your side, lasting for 5 major turns.',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520231}
	},
	[52024] = {
		id = 52024,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Khi người mặc đầy tức giận, tốc độ của người mặc sẽ tăng thêm $(26+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% và sát thương cộng thêm thêm $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%, đồng thời 1 hiệu ứng khống chế sẽ bị loại bỏ trước khi bắt đầu vòng hành động tiếp theo. Hiệu ứng tổng thể trên kéo dài cho đến lần tấn công tiếp theo. Hiệu ứng thưởng sẽ không được kích hoạt nhiều lần khi nó tồn tại. Nó sẽ được kích hoạt hai lần trên toàn sân (tích lũy trong chế độ chơi đơn)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Crush Devour#L0# (Hiệu quả nếu người mặc là Bóng tối hoặc Bất tử): Khi đang tức giận, cướp một đơn vị địch ngẫu nhiên trong 2 hiệp với 15% tấn công kép và 15% phòng thủ kép, kích hoạt 2 lần trên toàn sân (tích lũy trong chế độ chơi đơn)',
		describe_en = 'When the wearer is full of anger, the wearer\'s speed increases by $(26 + (skillLevel - 1)*2)$% and additional damage increases by $(12 + (skillLevel - 1)*1.5)$%. At the same time, one crowd control effect will be removed before the next action round begins. The overall effect lasts until the next attack. The bonus effect will not be triggered multiple times while it exists. It will be triggered twice on the whole field (accumulative in single-player mode). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Crush Devour#L0# (Effect if the wearer is Darkness or Immortal): When enraged, steal a random enemy unit for 2 turns with 15% double attack and 15% double defense, triggered twice on the whole field (accumulative in single-player mode).',
		describe_th = 'เมื่อผู้สวมใส่เต็มไปด้วยความโกรธ ความเร็วของผู้สวมใส่จะเพิ่มขึ้น $(26 + (skillLevel - 1)*2)$% และความเสียหายเพิ่มขึ้น $(12 + (skillLevel - 1)*1.5)$% พร้อมกันนั้นจะลบเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุม 1 ครั้งก่อนรอบการกระทำถัดไป เอฟเฟกต์โดยรวมนี้จะคงอยู่จนกว่าจะถึงการโจมตีครั้งถัดไป เอฟเฟกต์โบนัสจะไม่ถูกกระตุ้นซ้ำเมื่อมันยังคงอยู่ จะถูกกระตุ้นสองครั้งทั่วสนาม (สะสมในโหมดเล่นคนเดียว) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Crush Devour#L0# (ผลถ้าผู้สวมใส่เป็นความมืดหรืออมตะ): เมื่ออยู่ในอารมณ์โกรธ ขโมยหน่วยศัตรูแบบสุ่มเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น พร้อมการโจมตีคู่ 15% และการป้องกันคู่ 15% กระตุ้นสองครั้งทั่วสนาม (สะสมในโหมดเล่นคนเดียว)',
		describe_in = 'Ketika pemakai penuh dengan amarah, kecepatan pemakai akan meningkat sebesar $(26 + (skillLevel - 1)*2)$% dan kerusakan tambahan sebesar $(12 + (skillLevel - 1)*1.5)$%. Saat yang sama, satu efek kontrol kerumunan akan dihapus sebelum ronde aksi berikutnya dimulai. Efek keseluruhan berlangsung hingga serangan berikutnya. Efek bonus tidak akan diaktifkan berkali-kali saat masih ada. Efek ini akan diaktifkan dua kali di seluruh arena (terakumulasi dalam mode pemain tunggal). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Crush Devour#L0# (Efek jika pemakai adalah Kegelapan atau Abadi): Saat dalam kemarahan, mencuri satu unit musuh secara acak selama 2 giliran dengan serangan ganda 15% dan pertahanan ganda 15%, diaktifkan dua kali di seluruh arena (terakumulasi dalam mode pemain tunggal).',
		describe_ph = 'Kapag ang nagsusuot ay puno ng galit, tataas ang bilis ng nagsusuot ng $(26 + (skillLevel - 1)*2)$% at karagdagang pinsala ng $(12 + (skillLevel - 1)*1.5)$%. Kasabay nito, isang crowd control effect ang aalisin bago magsimula ang susunod na round ng aksyon. Ang kabuuang epekto ay magtatagal hanggang sa susunod na pag-atake. Ang bonus effect ay hindi muling ma-a-activate habang ito ay umiiral. Ito ay ma-a-activate ng dalawang beses sa buong field (naipon sa single-player mode). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Crush Devour#L0# (Epekto kung ang nagsusuot ay Darkness o Immortal): Kapag nagagalit, nakawin ang isang random na unit ng kalaban sa loob ng 2 rounds na may 15% double attack at 15% double defense, na na-a-activate ng dalawang beses sa buong field (naipon sa single-player mode).',
		describe_ma = 'Apabila pemakai dipenuhi dengan kemarahan, kelajuan pemakai akan meningkat sebanyak $(26 + (skillLevel - 1)*2)$% dan kerosakan tambahan sebanyak $(12 + (skillLevel - 1)*1.5)$%. Pada masa yang sama, satu kesan kawalan akan dibuang sebelum pusingan tindakan seterusnya bermula. Kesan keseluruhan ini berterusan sehingga serangan seterusnya. Kesan bonus tidak akan diaktifkan berkali-kali semasa ia wujud. Ia akan diaktifkan dua kali di seluruh medan (terakumulasi dalam mod pemain tunggal). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Crush Devour#L0# (Kesan jika pemakai adalah Kegelapan atau Abadi): Apabila dalam kemarahan, mencuri satu unit musuh secara rawak selama 2 pusingan dengan serangan berganda 15% dan pertahanan berganda 15%, diaktifkan dua kali di seluruh medan (terakumulasi dalam mod pemain tunggal).',
		describe = 'When the wearer is full of anger, the wearer\'s speed increases by $(26 + (skillLevel - 1)*2)$% and additional damage increases by $(12 + (skillLevel - 1)*1.5)$%. At the same time, one crowd control effect will be removed before the next action round begins. The overall effect lasts until the next attack. The bonus effect will not be triggered multiple times while it exists. It will be triggered twice on the whole field (accumulative in single-player mode). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Crush Devour#L0# (Effect if the wearer is Darkness or Immortal): When enraged, steal a random enemy unit for 2 turns with 15% double attack and 15% double defense, triggered twice on the whole field (accumulative in single-player mode).',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520241}
	},
	[52025] = {
		id = 52025,
		skillName_vn = 'Đạo cụ mang theo',
		skillName_en = 'Carried prop',
		skillName_th = 'อุปกรณ์ที่พกติดตัว',
		skillName_in = 'Properti yang dibawa',
		skillName_ph = 'Dinadala na gamit',
		skillName_ma = 'Alatan dibawa',
		skillName = 'Carried prop',
		describe_vn = 'Được kích hoạt khi người mặc sắp chết (chết, hồi sinh, tránh chết, ép xung), nguyền rủa đơn vị kẻ địch có đòn tấn công cao nhất, giảm $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% đòn tấn công kép và $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% tốc độ hồi phục của nó (không thể chồng lên nhau) trong 4 vòng. Hiệu ứng bị suy yếu 40% khi được kích hoạt lần thứ hai (giới hạn 2 lần kích hoạt trong toàn bộ trò chơi, tích lũy khi chơi một người chơi)\n#F10# \n#F40# cũng đi kèm với #L10# Sakura Tự hủy: #L0# gây sát thương thực sự cho tất cả kẻ thù bằng 300% tổng phòng thủ kép của người mặc. Hiệu ứng bị suy yếu đi 40% khi được kích hoạt lần thứ hai (có nhiều trang bị trong đội và Tự hủy của Sakura chỉ có thể có hiệu lực trên một trang bị)',
		describe_en = 'Activated when the wearer is about to die (death, revival, death avoidance, burst), curses the enemy unit with the highest attack, reducing its dual attack by $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% and its recovery speed by $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% (cannot stack) for 4 turns. The effect is weakened by 40% when triggered the second time (limited to 2 activations throughout the game, accumulates when playing single-player). \n#F10# \n#F40# also comes with #L10# Sakura Self-Destruct: #L0# deals true damage to all enemies equal to 300% of the wearer’s total dual defense. The effect is weakened by 40% when triggered the second time (multiple equipments in the team and Sakura’s Self-Destruct effect can only be active on one equipment).',
		describe_th = 'จะถูกเปิดใช้งานเมื่อผู้สวมใกล้จะตาย (ตาย, ฟื้นคืนชีพ, หลีกเลี่ยงความตาย, ระเบิดพลัง), สาปหน่วยศัตรูที่มีการโจมตีสูงที่สุด ลดการโจมตีคู่ลง $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% และความเร็วฟื้นฟูลง $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% (ไม่สามารถซ้อนทับได้) เป็นเวลา 4 รอบ ผลกระทบจะลดลง 40% เมื่อถูกเปิดใช้ครั้งที่สอง (จำกัดการเปิดใช้งาน 2 ครั้งตลอดเกม, สะสมเมื่อเล่นคนเดียว) \n#F10# \n#F40# มาพร้อมกับ #L10# ซากุระ ทำลายตัวเอง: #L0# สร้างความเสียหายจริงต่อศัตรูทั้งหมดเท่ากับ 300% ของการป้องกันคู่รวมของผู้สวม ผลกระทบจะลดลง 40% เมื่อถูกเปิดใช้ครั้งที่สอง (มีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีมและการทำลายตัวเองของซากุระจะมีผลกับอุปกรณ์เพียงชิ้นเดียวเท่านั้น)',
		describe_in = 'Diaktifkan saat pemakai hampir mati (mati, bangkit kembali, menghindari kematian, overclock), mengutuk unit musuh dengan serangan tertinggi, mengurangi serangan ganda sebesar $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan kecepatan pemulihannya sebesar $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% (tidak dapat menumpuk) selama 4 giliran. Efek berkurang 40% saat diaktifkan untuk kali kedua (batas 2 kali aktif selama seluruh permainan, terakumulasi saat bermain solo). \n#F10# \n#F40# juga dilengkapi dengan #L10# Sakura Penghancuran Diri: #L0# memberikan damage nyata ke semua musuh sebesar 300% dari total pertahanan ganda pemakai. Efek berkurang 40% saat diaktifkan untuk kali kedua (ada banyak perlengkapan dalam tim dan Penghancuran Diri Sakura hanya dapat berlaku pada satu perlengkapan).',
		describe_ph = 'Ina-activate kapag malapit nang mamatay ang nagsusuot (patay, muling buhay, pag-iwas sa kamatayan, overclock), sinisumpa ang kaaway na may pinakamataas na atake, binabawasan ang kanyang dobleng atake ng $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% at bilis ng pag-recover ng $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% (hindi pwedeng mag-stack) sa loob ng 4 na turn. Nababawasan ang epekto ng 40% kapag na-activate ng pangalawang beses (limitado sa 2 activations sa buong laro, naipon kapag single player ang laro). \n#F10# \n#F40# kasama rin ang #L10# Sakura Self-Destruct: #L0# nagbibigay ng tunay na pinsala sa lahat ng kaaway na katumbas ng 300% ng kabuuang dobleng depensa ng nagsusuot. Ang epekto ay nababawasan ng 40% kapag na-activate ng pangalawang beses (maraming equipment sa team at ang Self-Destruct ng Sakura ay maaari lamang umiral sa isang equipment).',
		describe_ma = 'Diaktifkan apabila pemakai hampir mati (mati, kebangkitan, mengelak kematian, overclock), mengutuk unit musuh yang mempunyai serangan tertinggi, mengurangkan serangan berganda sebanyak $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan kelajuan pemulihan sebanyak $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% (tidak boleh bertindih) selama 4 pusingan. Kesan terlemah 40% apabila diaktifkan kali kedua (had 2 kali pengaktifan sepanjang permainan, terkumpul ketika bermain seorang pemain). \n#F10# \n#F40# juga disertakan dengan #L10# Sakura Memusnahkan Diri: #L0# memberikan kerosakan sebenar kepada semua musuh sebanyak 300% daripada jumlah pertahanan berganda pemakai. Kesan terlemah 40% apabila diaktifkan kali kedua (terdapat banyak peralatan dalam pasukan dan Memusnahkan Diri Sakura hanya boleh berkuat kuasa pada satu peralatan).',
		describe = 'Activated when the wearer is about to die (death, revival, death avoidance, burst), curses the enemy unit with the highest attack, reducing its dual attack by $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% and its recovery speed by $(24+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% (cannot stack) for 4 turns. The effect is weakened by 40% when triggered the second time (limited to 2 activations throughout the game, accumulates when playing single-player). \n#F10# \n#F40# also comes with #L10# Sakura Self-Destruct: #L0# deals true damage to all enemies equal to 300% of the wearer’s total dual defense. The effect is weakened by 40% when triggered the second time (multiple equipments in the team and Sakura’s Self-Destruct effect can only be active on one equipment).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520251}
	},
	[52026] = {
		id = 52026,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Mỗi khi người mặc mất 20% lượng máu, người mặc sẽ tăng phần thưởng sát thương kỹ năng hoạt động $(8+ (skillLevel-1)*1)$% và $(8+ (skillLevel-1)*1)$% sấm sét/cơ khí/nước bí ẩn phần thưởng kỹ năng hoạt động, kéo dài trong 2 hiệp (không thể chồng lên nhau. Khi lượng máu thấp hơn 20%, các hiệu ứng trên sẽ tăng thêm thêm 20%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Hiệu ứng siêu dẫn: #L0# Ba kỹ năng hoạt động đầu tiên của người mặc có hiệu ứng dẫn điện, sẽ truyền 50% sát thương cuối cùng mà mục tiêu chính nhận được trong phạm vi sát thương dưới dạng sát thương thuộc tính sấm sét tới một đơn vị kẻ địch ngẫu nhiên khác.',
		describe_en = 'Each time the wearer loses 20% of their HP, the wearer gains an increase of $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% to active skill damage rewards and $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% to lightning/mechanical/water mystery active skill damage rewards, lasting for 2 rounds (effects cannot stack). When HP is below 20%, these effects increase by an additional 20%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Superconductor Effect: #L0# The wearer’s first three active skills have an electric conduction effect, transmitting 50% of the final damage received by the main target within damage range as lightning elemental damage to a random other enemy unit.',
		describe_th = 'ทุกครั้งที่ผู้สวมสูญเสียพลังชีวิต 20% ผู้สวมจะได้รับรางวัลความเสียหายจากสกิลใช้งานเพิ่มขึ้น $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% และรางวัลความเสียหายจากสกิลใช้งานสายสายฟ้า/เครื่องกล/น้ำลึกลับเพิ่มขึ้น $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (ไม่สามารถซ้อนทับ) เมื่อพลังชีวิตต่ำกว่า 20% ผลกระทบเหล่านี้จะเพิ่มขึ้นอีก 20% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# เอฟเฟกต์ตัวนำไฟฟ้า: #L0# สกิลใช้งาน 3 ครั้งแรกของผู้สวมจะมีเอฟเฟกต์การนำไฟฟ้า ส่งผ่านความเสียหายสุดท้าย 50% ที่เป้าหมายหลักได้รับในระยะความเสียหายเป็นความเสียหายธาตุสายฟ้าไปยังศัตรูในกลุ่มสุ่มอีกตัวหนึ่ง',
		describe_in = 'Setiap kali pemakai kehilangan 20% HP, pemakai akan mendapatkan peningkatan hadiah kerusakan skill aktif sebesar $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% dan hadiah kerusakan skill aktif petir/mekanik/air misterius sebesar $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$%, bertahan selama 2 giliran (efek tidak bisa bertumpuk). Ketika HP di bawah 20%, efek ini meningkat tambahan 20%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Efek Superkonduktor: #L0# Tiga skill aktif pertama pemakai memiliki efek konduksi listrik, mengirimkan 50% dari kerusakan akhir yang diterima oleh target utama dalam jangkauan kerusakan sebagai kerusakan elemen petir ke satu unit musuh acak lainnya.',
		describe_ph = 'Tuwing mawawala ang 20% ng HP ng nagsusuot, tataas ang gantimpala sa pinsalang dulot ng aktibong kasanayan ng nagsusuot ng $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% at gantimpala sa pinsalang aktibong kasanayan ng kidlat/mekanikal/tubig na misteryoso ng $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$%, tumatagal ng 2 rounds (hindi maaaring mag-stack). Kapag ang HP ay mas mababa sa 20%, tataas pa ito ng karagdagang 20%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Epekto ng Superconductor: #L0# Ang unang tatlong aktibong kasanayan ng nagsusuot ay may epekto ng kuryenteng nagpapadaloy, na nagpapasa ng 50% ng panghuling pinsalang natanggap ng pangunahing target sa loob ng sakop ng pinsala bilang pinsalang elemento ng kidlat sa isa pang random na yunit ng kalaban.',
		describe_ma = 'Setiap kali pemakai kehilangan 20% HP, pemakai akan mendapat peningkatan ganjaran kerosakan kemahiran aktif sebanyak $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% dan ganjaran kerosakan kemahiran aktif petir/mekanikal/air misteri sebanyak $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$%, bertahan selama 2 pusingan (kesan tidak boleh bertindih). Apabila HP kurang daripada 20%, kesan ini akan meningkat sebanyak 20% tambahan. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Kesan Penghantar Super: #L0# Tiga kemahiran aktif pertama pemakai mempunyai kesan pengaliran elektrik, menyebarkan 50% kerosakan akhir yang diterima oleh sasaran utama dalam julat kerosakan sebagai kerosakan unsur petir kepada satu unit musuh rawak lain.',
		describe = 'Each time the wearer loses 20% of their HP, the wearer gains an increase of $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% to active skill damage rewards and $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% to lightning/mechanical/water mystery active skill damage rewards, lasting for 2 rounds (effects cannot stack). When HP is below 20%, these effects increase by an additional 20%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Superconductor Effect: #L0# The wearer’s first three active skills have an electric conduction effect, transmitting 50% of the final damage received by the main target within damage range as lightning elemental damage to a random other enemy unit.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520261}
	},
	[52027] = {
		id = 52027,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, ở vòng đầu tiên tham gia, một tấm khiên bằng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% HP tối đa của người đeo sẽ được thêm cho tất cả đồng minh. Trong khi lá chắn tồn tại, tỷ lệ không bị kiểm soát sẽ tăng thêm $(3+ (skillLevel-1)*0.5)$%\n#F10# \n#F40# Nếu đơn vị của bạn bị hư hại bởi một chiêu thức đặc biệt không vượt quá 35% lượng máu tối đa của người đeo, hiệu ứng lộ diện #L10# sẽ được kích hoạt: #L0# Người đeo có thể miễn nhiễm với hiệu ứng điều khiển không thống trị tiếp theo và sẽ thêm khiên cho toàn bộ nhóm một lần nữa. Hiệu ứng lộ diện có thể được kích hoạt tối đa hai lần (nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội, chỉ một trang bị có thể phát huy tác dụng)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, during the first round of participation, a shield equal to $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% of the wielder\'s maximum HP will be added for all allies. While the shield exists, the control immunity rate will increase by $(3+ (skillLevel-1)*0.5)$%\n#F10# \n#F40#. If your unit is damaged by a special move that does not exceed 35% of the wielder\'s maximum HP, the exposure effect #L10# will be triggered: #L0# The wielder can become immune to the next dominant control effect and will add a shield for the entire team once again. The exposure effect can be triggered up to two times (if there are multiple pieces of equipment in the team, only one can take effect).',
		describe_th = 'ในระหว่างการต่อสู้ในรอบแรกที่เข้าร่วม จะมีโล่ที่มีค่าเท่ากับ $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของผู้สวมใส่ถูกเพิ่มให้กับพันธมิตรทั้งหมด ในขณะที่โล่ยังคงอยู่ อัตราการไม่ถูกควบคุมจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(3+ (skillLevel-1)*0.5)$%\n#F10# \n#F40# หากหน่วยของคุณได้รับความเสียหายจากท่าพิเศษที่ไม่เกิน 35% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของผู้สวมใส่ เอฟเฟกต์การเปิดเผย #L10# จะถูกเปิดใช้งาน: #L0# ผู้สวมใส่จะสามารถป้องกันตนเองจากเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมที่มีอำนาจถัดไปและจะเพิ่มโล่อีกครั้งให้กับทีมทั้งหมด เอฟเฟกต์การเปิดเผยสามารถเปิดใช้งานได้สูงสุดสองครั้ง (หากมีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีม จะมีเพียงหนึ่งชิ้นที่มีผล)',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, pada putaran pertama berpartisipasi, perisai sebesar $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% dari HP maksimal pemakai akan ditambahkan untuk semua sekutu. Selama perisai ada, tingkat ketidakmampuan dikontrol akan meningkat sebesar $(3+ (skillLevel-1)*0.5)$%\n#F10# \n#F40#. Jika unit Anda mengalami kerusakan oleh serangan khusus yang tidak melebihi 35% dari HP maksimal pemakai, efek paparan #L10# akan diaktifkan: #L0# Pemakai dapat kebal terhadap efek kontrol dominan berikutnya dan akan menambahkan perisai untuk seluruh tim sekali lagi. Efek paparan dapat diaktifkan hingga dua kali (jika ada beberapa peralatan dalam tim, hanya satu peralatan yang dapat berpengaruh).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, sa unang round ng paglahok, isang kalasag na may halagang $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% ng maximum HP ng tagadala ay idaragdag para sa lahat ng kaalyado. Habang umiiral ang kalasag, tataas ang rate ng hindi makokontrol ng $(3+ (skillLevel-1)*0.5)$%\n#F10# \n#F40#. Kung ang yunit mo ay masaktan ng isang espesyal na galaw na hindi lalampas sa 35% ng maximum na HP ng tagadala, maa-activate ang exposure effect na #L10#: #L0# Ang tagadala ay maaaring maging immune sa susunod na dominadong control effect at magdadagdag uli ng kalasag para sa buong grupo. Ang exposure effect ay maaaring ma-activate ng hanggang dalawang beses (kung maraming kagamitan sa grupo, isang kagamitan lamang ang maaaring magkaroon ng epekto).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, pada pusingan pertama penyertaan, satu perisai bersamaan dengan $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% daripada HP maksimum pemakai akan ditambah untuk semua sekutu. Semasa perisai wujud, kadar kebal kawalan akan meningkat sebanyak $(3+ (skillLevel-1)*0.5)$%\n#F10# \n#F40#. Jika unit anda mengalami kerosakan oleh satu serangan khas yang tidak melebihi 35% daripada jumlah HP maksimum pemakai, kesan pendedahan #L10# akan diaktifkan: #L0# Pemakai boleh kebal terhadap kesan kawalan dominan yang seterusnya dan akan menambah perisai untuk seluruh kumpulan sekali lagi. Kesan pendedahan boleh diaktifkan sehingga dua kali (jika terdapat beberapa peralatan dalam kumpulan, hanya satu peralatan boleh berfungsi).',
		describe = 'In battle, during the first round of participation, a shield equal to $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% of the wielder\'s maximum HP will be added for all allies. While the shield exists, the control immunity rate will increase by $(3+ (skillLevel-1)*0.5)$%\n#F10# \n#F40#. If your unit is damaged by a special move that does not exceed 35% of the wielder\'s maximum HP, the exposure effect #L10# will be triggered: #L0# The wielder can become immune to the next dominant control effect and will add a shield for the entire team once again. The exposure effect can be triggered up to two times (if there are multiple pieces of equipment in the team, only one can take effect).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520271}
	},
	[52028] = {
		id = 52028,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Manga props',
		skillName_th = 'อุปกรณ์มังงะ',
		skillName_in = 'Perlengkapan manga',
		skillName_ph = 'Mga gamit sa manga',
		skillName_ma = 'Peralatan manga',
		skillName = 'Manga props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong khi chiến đấu, khi các kỹ năng chủ động của người đeo tấn công các anh hùng đang bị kiểm soát hoặc ở trạng thái tiêu cực, sát thương sẽ tăng thêm $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% và tốc độ của chủ sở hữu sẽ tăng thêm $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% trong 2 lượt (phần thưởng tốc độ có thể được cộng dồn lên đến 2 lần)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Twilight Transmission: #L0#: Trong khi chiến đấu, khả năng kháng sát thương thuộc tính của người mặc tăng thêm 20%. Mỗi khi hai kỹ năng chủ động được tung ra, một hiệu ứng tiêu cực ngẫu nhiên sẽ được thêm vào mục tiêu chính (bao gồm đốt/ngộ độc/chảy máu, debuff thuộc tính và hồi máu) trong 2 hiệp, đồng thời tốc độ của người đeo được tăng thêm 10% trong 2 hiệp.',
		describe_en = 'While fighting, when the active skills of the wearer attack heroes who are controlled or in a negative state, damage will increase by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% and the speed of the owner will increase by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% for 2 turns (speed bonuses can stack up to 2 times). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Twilight Transmission: #L0#: During battle, the wearer’s elemental damage resistance increases by 20%. Each time two active skills are used, a random negative effect is applied to the main target (including burn/poison/bleed, attribute debuffs, and healing reduction) for 2 rounds, and the wearer’s speed increases by 10% for 2 rounds.',
		describe_th = 'ในระหว่างการต่อสู้ เมื่อสกิลแอคทีฟของผู้สวมใส่โจมตีฮีโร่ที่ถูกควบคุมหรืออยู่ในสถานะลบ ความเสียหายจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% และความเร็วของเจ้าของจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (โบนัสความเร็วสามารถซ้อนกันได้สูงสุด 2 ครั้ง) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Twilight Transmission: #L0#: ในระหว่างการต่อสู้ ความสามารถต้านทานความเสียหายธาตุของผู้สวมใส่เพิ่มขึ้น 20% ทุกครั้งที่สกิลแอคทีฟ 2 สกิลถูกใช้ จะมีผลลบแบบสุ่มถูกเพิ่มไปยังเป้าหมายหลัก (รวมถึงการถูกเผา/พิษ/เลือดไหล, ดีบัฟคุณสมบัติ และลดการฟื้นฟู) เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น พร้อมทั้งความเร็วของผู้สวมใส่เพิ่มขึ้น 10% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Saat bertarung, ketika skill aktif pemakai menyerang pahlawan yang sedang dikendalikan atau dalam keadaan negatif, kerusakan akan meningkat $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% dan kecepatan pemilik akan meningkat $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% selama 2 giliran (bonus kecepatan dapat bertumpuk hingga 2 kali). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Twilight Transmission: #L0#: Saat bertarung, ketahanan terhadap kerusakan elemen pemakai meningkat 20%. Setiap kali dua skill aktif digunakan, efek negatif acak akan diterapkan pada target utama (termasuk terbakar/keracunan/pendarahan, debuff atribut, dan pengurangan penyembuhan) selama 2 ronde, dan kecepatan pemakai meningkat 10% selama 2 ronde.',
		describe_ph = 'Habang nakikipaglaban, kapag ang mga aktibong kakayahan ng nagsusuot ay umatake sa mga bayani na nasa kontrol o negatibong estado, tataas ang pinsala ng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% at tataas ang bilis ng may-ari ng $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% sa loob ng 2 na turn (ang mga bonus sa bilis ay maaaring mag-stack hanggang 2 beses). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Twilight Transmission: #L0#: Habang nakikipaglaban, tumataas ng 20% ang resistensya ng nagsusuot laban sa elemental damage. Sa bawat pagkakataon na naipalabas ang dalawang aktibong kakayahan, isang random na negatibong epekto ang ilalagay sa pangunahing target (kasama ang paso/pagkalason/pagdurugo, attribute debuffs, at healing reduction) sa loob ng 2 rounds, at tataas ang bilis ng nagsusuot ng 10% sa loob ng 2 rounds.',
		describe_ma = 'Semasa bertarung, apabila kemahiran aktif pemakai menyerang wira yang sedang dikawal atau dalam keadaan negatif, kerosakan akan bertambah sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% dan kelajuan pemilik akan meningkat sebanyak $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% selama 2 pusingan (ganjaran kelajuan boleh bertindan sehingga 2 kali). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Twilight Transmission: #L0#: Semasa bertarung, keupayaan rintangan kerosakan elemen pemakai meningkat sebanyak 20%. Setiap kali dua kemahiran aktif digunakan, satu kesan negatif rawak akan dikenakan pada sasaran utama (termasuk terbakar/keracunan/pendarahan, debuff atribut dan pengurangan penyembuhan) selama 2 pusingan, selain kelajuan pemakai meningkat sebanyak 10% selama 2 pusingan.',
		describe = 'While fighting, when the active skills of the wearer attack heroes who are controlled or in a negative state, damage will increase by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% and the speed of the owner will increase by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% for 2 turns (speed bonuses can stack up to 2 times). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Twilight Transmission: #L0#: During battle, the wearer’s elemental damage resistance increases by 20%. Each time two active skills are used, a random negative effect is applied to the main target (including burn/poison/bleed, attribute debuffs, and healing reduction) for 2 rounds, and the wearer’s speed increases by 10% for 2 rounds.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520281}
	},
	[52029] = {
		id = 52029,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo dụng cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry tools #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_th = 'นำเครื่องมือมา #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_in = 'Bawa alat #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga kagamitan #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_ma = 'Bawa alat #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName = 'Carry tools #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, mỗi anh hùng trong trại của bạn có xác suất $(20+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (xác suất giảm 10% sau khi kích hoạt và xác suất của người mặc tăng thêm 15%) để miễn nhiễm sát thương của tối đa một chiêu thức đặc biệt (tích lũy trong toàn bộ trò chơi ở chế độ một người chơi) và trại của bạn có thể chống lại tổng cộng tối đa 2 chiêu thức đặc biệt\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#miracle Guard#L0#: Trong vòng đầu tiên của trận chiến, tất cả các hệ thống cơ khí thân thiện sẽ được tăng thêm 10% giảm sát thương và tăng gấp đôi phòng thủ; và mỗi khi khả năng miễn dịch được kích hoạt, khả năng giảm sát thương và khả năng phòng thủ kép của đơn vị sẽ tăng thêm 10% (được kích hoạt khi người kích hoạt là anh hùng cơ khí)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, each hero in your camp has a $(20+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% chance (chance decreases by 10% after activation and wearer’s chance increases by 15%) to be immune to damage from up to one special move (accumulated throughout the game in single-player mode), and your camp can resist a total of up to 2 special moves. #F10# \n#F40##L10#miracle Guard#L0#: During the first round of the battle, all friendly mechanical units receive an additional 10% damage reduction and double defense; and each time the immunity activates, the unit\'s damage reduction and double defense increase by an additional 10% (activated when the trigger is a mechanical hero).',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ ฮีโร่แต่ละคนในค่ายของคุณมีโอกาส $(20+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (โอกาสลดลง 10% หลังจากเปิดใช้และโอกาสของผู้สวมใส่เพิ่มขึ้น 15%) ที่จะได้รับความคุ้มกันจากความเสียหายจากท่าพิเศษสูงสุดหนึ่งท่า (สะสมตลอดทั้งเกมในโหมดเล่นคนเดียว) และค่ายของคุณสามารถต้านทานท่าพิเศษได้รวมกันสูงสุด 2 ท่า #F10# \n#F40##L10#miracle Guard#L0#: ในรอบแรกของการต่อสู้ หน่วยกลไกฝ่ายเดียวกันทั้งหมดจะได้รับการลดความเสียหายเพิ่มขึ้น 10% และเพิ่มการป้องกันเป็นสองเท่า; และทุกครั้งที่ความสามารถป้องกันเปิดใช้งาน ความสามารถในการลดความเสียหายและการป้องกันสองเท่าของหน่วยจะเพิ่มขึ้นอีก 10% (เปิดใช้เมื่อฮีโร่กลไกเป็นผู้เปิดใช้งาน)',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, setiap pahlawan di kamp Anda memiliki peluang $(20+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (peluang berkurang 10% setelah aktivasi dan peluang pemakai meningkat 15%) untuk kebal terhadap kerusakan dari maksimal satu serangan khusus (terakumulasi selama permainan dalam mode pemain tunggal), dan kamp Anda dapat menahan total hingga 2 serangan khusus. #F10# \n#F40##L10#miracle Guard#L0#: Pada putaran pertama pertempuran, semua unit mekanik ramah akan mendapatkan tambahan pengurangan kerusakan sebesar 10% dan bertahan dua kali lipat; dan setiap kali kekebalan diaktifkan, pengurangan kerusakan dan pertahanan ganda unit akan bertambah 10% (diaktifkan ketika pemicu adalah pahlawan mekanik).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang bawat bayani sa iyong kampo ay may pagkakataong $(20+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (ang pagkakataon ay bumababa ng 10% pagkatapos ma-activate at ang pagkakataon ng nagsusuot ay tataas ng 15%) na maging immune sa pinsala mula sa hanggang isang espesyal na galaw (nakaipon sa buong laro sa single-player mode), at ang iyong kampo ay maaaring makatiis ng kabuuang hanggang 2 espesyal na galaw. #F10# \n#F40##L10#miracle Guard#L0#: Sa unang round ng laban, lahat ng mga kaibigang mekanikal na yunit ay makakakuha ng karagdagang 10% bawas pinsala at doble ang depensa; at sa tuwing na-activate ang immunity, ang pagbabawas ng pinsala at dobleng depensa ng yunit ay tataas ng karagdagang 10% (na-activate kapag ang nag-trigger ay isang mekanikal na bayani).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, setiap wira di kemah anda mempunyai peluang $(20+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (peluang berkurang 10% selepas pengaktifan dan peluang pemakai meningkat 15%) untuk kebal kepada kerosakan dari maksimum satu serangan khas (terakumulasi sepanjang permainan dalam mod pemain tunggal), dan kemah anda boleh menahan sejumlah maksimum 2 serangan khas. #F10# \n#F40##L10#miracle Guard#L0#: Dalam pusingan pertama pertempuran, semua unit mekanikal mesra akan mendapat tambahan pengurangan kerosakan sebanyak 10% dan pertahanan berganda; dan setiap kali kekebalan diaktifkan, pengurangan kerosakan dan pertahanan berganda unit akan bertambah 10% (diaktifkan apabila pencetus adalah wira mekanikal).',
		describe = 'In battle, each hero in your camp has a $(20+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% chance (chance decreases by 10% after activation and wearer’s chance increases by 15%) to be immune to damage from up to one special move (accumulated throughout the game in single-player mode), and your camp can resist a total of up to 2 special moves. #F10# \n#F40##L10#miracle Guard#L0#: During the first round of the battle, all friendly mechanical units receive an additional 10% damage reduction and double defense; and each time the immunity activates, the unit\'s damage reduction and double defense increase by an additional 10% (activated when the trigger is a mechanical hero).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520291}
	},
	[52030] = {
		id = 52030,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, trước khi người đeo hoặc các mục tiêu xung quanh cây thánh giá bị tấn công chí mạng bởi các kỹ năng chủ động, bản thân sẽ tăng $(13+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% giảm sát thương trong 1 lượt và các mục tiêu xung quanh sẽ nhận được hiệu ứng cải thiện 60% (mỗi kỹ năng hoạt động chỉ kích hoạt 1 lớp hiệu ứng và có thể cộng dồn tối đa 2 lớp), đồng thời thêm một lá chắn tăng thêm 300% phòng thủ vật lý cho bản thân và các mục tiêu xung quanh (lá chắn không thể chồng lên và chỉ được sử dụng duy nhất) được kích hoạt 2 lần trên toàn khu vực)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Mechanical Pioneer: #L0# Khi trang bị anh hùng máy móc, tỷ lệ kháng cự tăng thêm 20%. Khi người sử dụng trang bị máy móc thêm khiên cho đồng đội máy móc, anh ta cũng sẽ nhận được 40% tỷ lệ chống chịu của người đeo và giảm 20% sát thương. Phần thưởng sẽ biến mất sau khi tấm khiên bị vỡ.',
		describe_en = 'During battle, before the wearer or targets around the holy cross suffer a critical hit from active skills, the wearer gains $(13+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% damage reduction for one turn, and surrounding targets receive a 60% improvement effect (each skill activation triggers only one layer of the effect, stacking up to 2 layers). At the same time, a shield that increases physical defense by 300% for the wearer and surrounding targets (the shield cannot stack and is unique, activated twice per entire area) is granted. Mechanical Pioneer: When equipped with a mechanical hero, resistance rate increases by 20%. When the user equips a mechanical shield for mechanical allies, they also gain 40% resistance rate of the wearer and reduce damage by 20%. The bonus disappears when the shield breaks.',
		describe_th = 'ในระหว่างการต่อสู้ ก่อนที่ผู้สวมใส่หรือเป้าหมายรอบๆ ไม้กางเขนจะถูกโจมตีอย่างรุนแรงจากสกิลแอคทีฟ ผู้สวมใส่จะได้รับการลดความเสียหาย $(13+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น และเป้าหมายรอบๆ จะได้รับสถานะปรับปรุง 60% (แต่ละสกิลเปิดใช้งานเอฟเฟกต์เพียง 1 ชั้นและสามารถซ้อนกันได้สูงสุด 2 ชั้น) พร้อมทั้งสร้างโล่ป้องกันที่เพิ่มพลังป้องกันกายภาพ 300% ให้กับตัวเองและเป้าหมายรอบข้าง (โล่ไม่สามารถซ้อนทับได้และใช้ได้เพียงครั้งเดียว โดยจะถูกเปิดใช้งานได้สองครั้งทั่วทั้งพื้นที่) Mechanical Pioneer: เมื่อสวมใส่ฮีโร่เครื่องจักร จะเพิ่มอัตราต้านทานอีก 20% เมื่อตัวผู้ใช้สวมใส่อุปกรณ์โล่สำหรับเพื่อนร่วมทีมเครื่องจักร เขาจะได้รับอัตราต้านทาน 40% ของผู้สวมใส่และลดความเสียหาย 20% โบนัสจะหายไปเมื่อโล่แตก',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, sebelum pemakai atau target di sekitar salib suci terkena serangan kritis oleh skill aktif, pemakai akan mendapatkan pengurangan damage sebesar $(13+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% selama satu giliran, dan target di sekitar akan menerima efek peningkatan 60% (setiap skill yang aktif hanya memicu satu lapisan efek dan dapat menumpuk hingga 2 lapisan). Bersamaan itu, sebuah perisai yang meningkatkan pertahanan fisik sebesar 300% untuk pemakai dan target di sekitar (perisai tidak dapat bertumpuk dan hanya digunakan satu kali, aktif dua kali di seluruh area) akan diaktifkan. Mechanical Pioneer: Ketika menggunakan pahlawan mekanik, tingkat resistensi meningkat sebesar 20%. Ketika pengguna memasang perisai mekanik untuk sekutu mekanik, dia juga akan mendapatkan 40% tingkat ketahanan dari pemakai dan mengurangi kerusakan sebesar 20%. Bonus akan hilang setelah perisai tersebut hancur.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa panahon ng labanan, bago ang tagasuot o ang mga target sa paligid ng banal na krus ay tamaan ng kritikal na atake mula sa mga aktibong kasanayan, ang tagasuot mismo ay makakatanggap ng $(13+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% na pagbawas sa pinsala para sa isang turn at ang mga target sa paligid ay makatatanggap ng 60% na epekto ng pagpapabuti (bawat kasanayan ay nagti-trigger lamang ng isang layer ng efekto at maaaring mag-stack hanggang 2 layer). Kasabay nito, isang panangga na nagdaragdag ng 300% pisikal na depensa para sa tagasuot at mga target sa paligid (ang panangga ay hindi maaaring mag-stack at ginagamit lamang nang isang beses, at na-activate ng dalawang beses sa kabuuang lugar) ay ma-aaktiba. Mechanical Pioneer: Kapag may suot na mekanikal na bayani, tataas ang porsyento ng resistensya ng 20%. Kapag ang gumagamit ay nagbigay ng mekanikal na panangga sa mga mekanikal na kasama, makakatanggap din siya ng 40% ng resistensya ng tagasuot at magpapabawas ng 20% pinsala. Mawawala ang gantimpala kapag nabasag ang panangga.',
		describe_ma = 'Semasa pertempuran, sebelum pemakai atau sasaran di sekitar salib suci diserang kritikal oleh kemahiran aktif, pemakai akan mendapat pengurangan kerosakan sebanyak $(13+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% untuk satu pusingan dan sasaran di sekitar akan menerima kesan peningkatan 60% (setiap kemahiran aktif hanya mencetuskan satu lapisan kesan dan boleh bertindih sehingga maksimum 2 lapisan). Pada masa yang sama, sebuah perisai yang meningkatkan pertahanan fizikal sebanyak 300% untuk pemakai dan sasaran di sekeliling (perisai tidak boleh bertindih dan hanya digunakan sekali, diaktifkan dua kali di seluruh kawasan) akan diaktifkan. Mechanical Pioneer: Apabila melengkapkan wira mekanikal, kadar ketahanan meningkat sebanyak 20%. Apabila pengguna melengkapkan perisai mekanikal untuk sekutu mekanikal, dia juga akan menerima 40% kadar ketahanan pemakai dan mengurangkan kerosakan sebanyak 20%. Ganjaran akan hilang selepas perisai tersebut musnah.',
		describe = 'During battle, before the wearer or targets around the holy cross suffer a critical hit from active skills, the wearer gains $(13+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% damage reduction for one turn, and surrounding targets receive a 60% improvement effect (each skill activation triggers only one layer of the effect, stacking up to 2 layers). At the same time, a shield that increases physical defense by 300% for the wearer and surrounding targets (the shield cannot stack and is unique, activated twice per entire area) is granted. Mechanical Pioneer: When equipped with a mechanical hero, resistance rate increases by 20%. When the user equips a mechanical shield for mechanical allies, they also gain 40% resistance rate of the wearer and reduce damage by 20%. The bonus disappears when the shield breaks.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		hintChoose = 14,
		skillProcess = {520300, 520301, 520302, 520303, 520304}
	},
	[52031] = {
		id = 52031,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Manga props',
		skillName_th = 'อุปกรณ์มังงะ',
		skillName_in = 'Perlengkapan manga',
		skillName_ph = 'Mga gamit sa manga',
		skillName_ma = 'Peralatan manga',
		skillName = 'Manga props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, đòn tấn công kỹ năng chủ động của người đeo gây ra $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2.5)$% sát thương thực tế với phần thưởng tấn công gấp đôi cho mục tiêu chính. Nếu người đeo không thực hiện vòng này, hành động tiếp theo sẽ kích hoạt hiệu ứng nâng cao: hiệu ứng lên mục tiêu chính. Nếu nó tăng gấp đôi và đạt giới hạn trên của lượng máu bằng với lượng sát thương (có thể cộng dồn tối đa 5 lần) và thêm [Torture] vào nó trong 3 lượt, thì nó sẽ miễn nhiễm với hiệu ứng khống chế mà nó nhận được vào lần tiếp theo (anh hùng bóng tối có thể miễn nhiễm 3 lần, nhưng không miễn nhiễm với khống chế chiếm ưu thế)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Torture: #L0#Khi anh hùng bóng tối của chính mình chủ động tấn công, nó sẽ gây thêm 5% giới hạn trên của sát thương thực sự của HP lên nó. Có thể thêm tối đa 2 dấu tra tấn vào toàn bộ sân.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, the active skill attack of the wearer deals $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2.5)$% true damage with double attack bonus to the main target. If the wearer does not act this round, the next action will trigger an enhanced effect: an effect on the main target. If it doubles and matches the maximum HP limit equal to the damage dealt (can stack up to 5 times) and adds [Torture] for 3 turns, it becomes immune to control effects on the next time it would receive them (the Dark Hero can be immune 3 times but not immune to dominant control). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Torture: #L0#When the Dark Hero on your side performs an active attack, it deals an additional 5% of the true damage max HP on it. Up to 2 Torture marks can be added across the entire field.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ การโจมตีสกิลแอคทีฟของผู้สวมใส่จะก่อให้เกิดความเสียหายจริง $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2.5)$% โดยมีโบนัสโจมตีสองเท่าสำหรับเป้าหมายหลัก หากผู้สวมใส่ไม่ทำการกระทำในรอบนี้ การกระทำถัดไปจะเปิดใช้งานเอฟเฟกต์ขั้นสูง: เอฟเฟกต์กับเป้าหมายหลัก หากมันเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่าและมีค่าเท่ากับขีดจำกัดพลังชีวิตสูงสุดที่เท่ากับความเสียหาย (สามารถสะสมได้สูงสุด 5 ครั้ง) และเพิ่ม [Torture] เป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์น จะทำให้มีภูมิคุ้มกันต่อเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมที่ได้รับในครั้งถัดไป (ฮีโร่แห่งความมืดสามารถมีภูมิคุ้มกัน 3 ครั้ง แต่ไม่สามารถต้านทานการควบคุมชนะแบบเด่น) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Torture: #L0#เมื่อฮีโร่แห่งความมืดของคุณโจมตีด้วยสกิลแอคทีฟ จะก่อให้เกิดความเสียหายจริงเพิ่มเติม 5% ของขีดจำกัดพลังชีวิตสูงสุดบนมัน สามารถเพิ่ม Torture ได้สูงสุด 2 จุดในสนามทั้งหมด',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, serangan keterampilan aktif dari pemakai menghasilkan $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2.5)$% kerusakan nyata dengan hadiah serangan ganda untuk target utama. Jika pemakai tidak melakukan aksi pada putaran ini, aksi berikutnya akan memicu efek peningkatan: efek pada target utama. Jika efek tersebut berlipat ganda dan mencapai batas atas HP yang sama dengan jumlah kerusakan (dapat ditumpuk hingga 5 kali) dan menambahkan [Torture] selama 3 giliran, maka ia menjadi kebal terhadap efek kontrol pada kesempatan berikutnya (Pahlawan Kegelapan dapat kebal 3 kali tetapi tidak kebal terhadap kontrol dominan). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Torture: #L0#Ketika Pahlawan Kegelapan milikmu melakukan serangan aktif, ia akan menyebabkan tambahan 5% dari batas atas HP kerusakan nyata pada target tersebut. Maksimal bisa menambahkan 2 tanda Torture di seluruh medan.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang aktibong skill attack ng nagsusuot ay nagdudulot ng $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2.5)$% totoong pinsala na may dobleng gantimpala sa pangunahing target. Kung hindi kumilos ang nagsusuot sa round na ito, ang susunod na aksyon ay mag-i-activate ng pinalakas na epekto: epekto sa pangunahing target. Kung ito ay dumoble at umabot sa maximum HP na katumbas ng pinsalang ginawa (pwedeng ma-stack hanggang 5 beses) at magdadagdag ng [Torture] sa loob ng 3 turn, magiging immune ito sa control effects sa susunod na matanggap (ang Dark Hero ay pwedeng maging immune ng 3 beses ngunit hindi immune sa dominant control). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Torture: #L0#Kapag ang Dark Hero mo ay gumawa ng aktibong pag-atake, magdaragdag ito ng 5% ng maximum true damage HP dito. Pwedeng magdagdag ng hanggang 2 Torture marks sa buong field.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, serangan kemahiran aktif pemakai memberikan $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2.5)$% kerosakan sebenar dengan ganjaran serangan berganda untuk sasaran utama. Jika pemakai tidak melakukan tindakan pada pusingan ini, tindakan seterusnya akan mengaktifkan kesan peningkatan: kesan ke atas sasaran utama. Jika ia berganda dan mencapai had atas kesihatan sama dengan jumlah kerosakan (boleh bertindih sehingga 5 kali) dan menambah [Torture] selama 3 pusingan, ia akan kebal kepada kesan kawalan yang diterimanya pada kali seterusnya (Wira Gelap boleh kebal 3 kali tetapi tidak kebal kepada kawalan dominan). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Torture: #L0#Apabila Wira Gelap milik anda melakukan serangan aktif, ia akan menyebabkan tambahan 5% had atas kesihatan sebenar ke atasnya. Boleh menambah sehingga 2 tanda Torture di seluruh medan.',
		describe = 'In battle, the active skill attack of the wearer deals $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2.5)$% true damage with double attack bonus to the main target. If the wearer does not act this round, the next action will trigger an enhanced effect: an effect on the main target. If it doubles and matches the maximum HP limit equal to the damage dealt (can stack up to 5 times) and adds [Torture] for 3 turns, it becomes immune to control effects on the next time it would receive them (the Dark Hero can be immune 3 times but not immune to dominant control). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Torture: #L0#When the Dark Hero on your side performs an active attack, it deals an additional 5% of the true damage max HP on it. Up to 2 Torture marks can be added across the entire field.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520311, 520312}
	},
	[52032] = {
