		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, ba đơn vị đồng minh đầu tiên sẽ nhận được các bùa lợi ngẫu nhiên sau khi hành động (tăng $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tiền thưởng sát thương, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% giảm sát thương, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tỷ lệ trúng đòn chí mạng, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0,5)$% tỷ lệ không kiểm soát) trong 1 hiệp. Cùng nhau; ba đơn vị địch đầu tiên sẽ nhận được hiệu ứng tiêu cực ngẫu nhiên sau khi thực hiện hành động (giảm $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tiền thưởng sát thương, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% giảm sát thương, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tỷ lệ trúng đòn chí mạng, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% tỷ lệ không cần kiểm soát) kéo dài trong 1 hiệp.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, the first three allied units will receive random buffs after taking action (increase $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% damage reduction, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% critical hit rate, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% control resistance) for 1 turn. Meanwhile, the first three enemy units will receive random negative effects after their action (reduce $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% damage reduction, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% critical hit rate, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% control resistance) lasting for 1 turn.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ หน่วยพันธมิตรสามหน่วยแรกจะได้รับบัฟสุ่มหลังจากดำเนินการ (เพิ่ม $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% โบนัสความเสียหาย, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% การลดความเสียหาย, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% โอกาสวิ่งถูกคริติคอล, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% อัตราต้านการควบคุม) เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น ขณะเดียวกัน หน่วยศัตรูสามหน่วยแรกจะได้รับเอฟเฟกต์ลบสุ่มหลังจากดำเนินการ (ลด $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% โบนัสความเสียหาย, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% การลดความเสียหาย, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% โอกาสถูกคริติคอล, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% อัตราการต้านการควบคุม) เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, tiga unit sekutu pertama akan menerima buff acak setelah bertindak (meningkatkan $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% pengurangan damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tingkat serangan kritis, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% resistensi kontrol) selama 1 giliran. Sementara itu, tiga unit musuh pertama akan menerima efek negatif acak setelah bertindak (mengurangi $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% pengurangan damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tingkat serangan kritis, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% resistensi kontrol) yang bertahan selama 1 giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang unang tatlong yunit ng mga alyado ay makakatanggap ng mga random na buff pagkatapos kumilos (taasan ang $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% pagbawas ng damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tsansa ng critical hit, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% resistensya sa control) para sa 1 turn. Samantala, ang unang tatlong yunit ng kalaban ay makakatanggap ng mga random na negative effect pagkatapos kumilos (bawasan ang $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% pagbawas ng damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% tsansa ng critical hit, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% resistensya sa control) na tatagal ng 1 turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, tiga unit sekutu pertama akan menerima buff rawak selepas bertindak (meningkatkan $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus kerosakan, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% pengurangan kerosakan, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% kadar serangan kritikal, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% rintangan kawalan) selama 1 giliran. Sementara itu, tiga unit musuh pertama akan menerima kesan negatif rawak selepas bertindak (mengurangkan $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus kerosakan, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% pengurangan kerosakan, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% kadar serangan kritikal, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% rintangan kawalan) yang berlangsung selama 1 giliran.',
		describe = 'In battle, the first three allied units will receive random buffs after taking action (increase $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% damage reduction, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% critical hit rate, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% control resistance) for 1 turn. Meanwhile, the first three enemy units will receive random negative effects after their action (reduce $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% bonus damage, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% damage reduction, $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% critical hit rate, $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% control resistance) lasting for 1 turn.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
