		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, sau khi người sử dụng tung ra một kỹ năng nhỏ, có khả năng (xác suất ban đầu: 100%, xác suất giảm 20% sau mỗi lần tung ra một kỹ năng nhỏ và tối thiểu giảm xuống 20%) thời gian hồi chiêu của kỹ năng nhỏ tiếp theo sẽ giảm đi 1 lượt. Nếu thất bại, sát thương của kỹ năng nhỏ này sẽ tăng thêm $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$%. Sau khi người mặc tung ra một kỹ năng nhỏ, tốc độ của bản thân sẽ được tăng thêm $(8+ (skillLevel-1)*1)$% trong 1 lượt #F10# #F40# Đi kèm với #L10#Miracle Angel: #L0#: Sau khi anh hùng gió giải phóng một kỹ năng nhỏ khi được trang bị, anh hùng gió có đòn tấn công cao nhất sẽ ngay lập tức tung ra một kỹ năng nhỏ và khiến bản thân và đồng đội của mình nhận được hiệu ứng [Dự đoán tương lai]. [Dự đoán tương lai]: Phát hiện trước những nguy hiểm trong tương lai và tránh hoàn toàn sát thương kỹ năng (Hiệu ứng Thiên thần kỳ diệu được kích hoạt hai lần trên sân và chỉ có thể được kích hoạt một lần trong một vòng lớn. Nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội, chỉ một trang bị có thể phát huy tác dụng)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, after the user unleashes a minor skill, there is a chance (initial probability: 100%, decreasing by 20% after each minor skill used, minimum reduction down to 20%) that the cooldown of the next minor skill will be reduced by 1 turn. If it fails, the damage of this minor skill will increase by $(20 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$%. After the wearer releases a minor skill, their speed will increase by $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% for 1 turn. #F10# #F40# Accompanied by #L10#Miracle Angel: #L0#: When the Wind Hero releases a minor skill while equipped, the Wind Hero with the highest attack will immediately unleash a minor skill and grant themselves and their allies the [Future Prediction] effect. [Future Prediction]: Detects upcoming dangers and completely avoids skill damage (The Miracle Angel effect activates twice on the field and can only be triggered once per major round. If there are multiple equipments in the team, only one equipment can take effect).',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ หลังจากผู้ใช้ปล่อยสกิลเล็ก มีโอกาส (โอกาสเริ่มต้น: 100% โอกาสลดลง 20% หลังจากใช้สกิลเล็กแต่ละครั้ง และลดลงต่ำสุดที่ 20%) ที่เวลาคูลดาวน์ของสกิลเล็กถัดไปจะลดลง 1 เทิร์น หากล้มเหลว ความเสียหายของสกิลเล็กนี้จะเพิ่มขึ้น $(20 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$% หลังจากผู้สวมใส่ปล่อยสกิลเล็ก ความเร็วของตนเองจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น #F10# #F40# มาพร้อมกับ #L10#Miracle Angel: #L0#: เมื่อฮีโร่ลมปล่อยสกิลเล็กขณะที่สวมใส่อุปกรณ์ ฮีโร่ลมที่มีการโจมตีสูงสุดจะปล่อยสกิลเล็กทันทีและทำให้ตัวเองและพันธมิตรได้รับเอฟเฟกต์ [ทำนายอนาคต] [ทำนายอนาคต]: ตรวจพบอันตรายที่จะมาถึงล่วงหน้าและหลีกเลี่ยงความเสียหายจากสกิลทั้งหมด (เอฟเฟกต์ Miracle Angel จะทำงานสองครั้งในสนามและสามารถเปิดใช้งานได้เพียงครั้งเดียวในหนึ่งรอบใหญ่ หากมีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีม จะมีเพียงอุปกรณ์เดียวที่สามารถทำงานได้)',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, setelah pengguna melepaskan skill kecil, ada kemungkinan (probabilitas awal: 100%, turun 20% setiap kali skill kecil dilepaskan dan penurunan minimum hingga 20%) waktu cooldown skill kecil berikutnya akan berkurang 1 giliran. Jika gagal, damage dari skill kecil ini akan bertambah sebesar $(20 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$%. Setelah pemakai menggunakan skill kecil, kecepatan dirinya akan bertambah sebesar $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% selama 1 giliran. #F10# #F40# Disertai dengan #L10#Miracle Angel: #L0#: Ketika Pahlawan Angin melepaskan skill kecil saat dipasangkan, Pahlawan Angin dengan serangan tertinggi akan segera melepaskan skill kecil dan memberikan efek [Peramalan Masa Depan] pada dirinya dan sekutunya. [Peramalan Masa Depan]: Mendeteksi bahaya yang akan datang dan sepenuhnya menghindari damage skill (Efek Miracle Angel aktif dua kali di arena dan hanya dapat diaktifkan satu kali dalam satu ronde besar. Jika ada beberapa peralatan dalam tim, hanya satu yang dapat berlaku).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa labanan, matapos ilabas ng gumagamit ang isang maliit na kakayahan, may posibilidad (unang posibilidad: 100%, bumababa ng 20% pagkatapos ng bawat maliit na kakayahan na ginamit at hindi bababa sa 20%) na mababawasan ng 1 turn ang cooldown ng susunod na maliit na kakayahan. Kung nabigo, ang pinsala ng maliit na kakayahang ito ay tataas ng $(20 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$%. Pagkatapos ilabas ng suot ang isang maliit na kakayahan, ang bilis ng sarili ay tataas ng $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% sa loob ng 1 turn. #F10# #F40# Kalakip ang #L10#Miracle Angel: #L0#: Kapag naglabas ang Hero ng Hangin ng maliit na kakayahan habang nakasuot, ang Hero ng Hangin na may pinakamataas na atake ay agad na magpapalabas ng isang maliit na kakayahan at bibigyan ang sarili at ang mga kakampi ng epekto na [Hinulaan ang Hinaharap]. [Hinulaan ang Hinaharap]: Nakikita ang mga paparating na panganib at ganap na iniiwasan ang pinsala mula sa kakayahan (Ang epekto ng Miracle Angel ay na-activate nang dalawang beses sa larangan at maaari lamang mabuo nang isang beses sa isang malaking round. Kung may maraming kagamitan sa koponan, iisa lamang ang epektibo).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, selepas pengguna melancarkan kemahiran kecil, terdapat kebarangkalian (kebarangkalian awal: 100%, berkurang 20% selepas setiap kemahiran kecil dilancarkan dan berkurang sekurang-kurangnya 20%) masa penyejukan kemahiran kecil seterusnya akan dikurangkan sebanyak 1 giliran. Jika gagal, kerosakan kemahiran kecil ini akan meningkat sebanyak $(20 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$%. Selepas pemakai melancarkan kemahiran kecil, kelajuan dirinya akan meningkat sebanyak $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% selama 1 giliran. #F10# #F40# Disertakan dengan #L10#Miracle Angel: #L0#: Apabila Wira Angin melancarkan kemahiran kecil ketika dilengkapi, Wira Angin dengan serangan tertinggi akan segera melancarkan satu kemahiran kecil dan memberi kesan [Ramalan Masa Depan] kepada dirinya dan sekutunya. [Ramalan Masa Depan]: Mengesan bahaya yang akan datang dan mengelakkan sepenuhnya kerosakan kemahiran (Kesan Miracle Angel diaktifkan dua kali di medan dan hanya boleh diaktifkan sekali dalam satu pusingan besar. Jika terdapat beberapa peralatan dalam pasukan, hanya satu peralatan yang boleh berfungsi).',
		describe = 'In battle, after the user unleashes a minor skill, there is a chance (initial probability: 100%, decreasing by 20% after each minor skill used, minimum reduction down to 20%) that the cooldown of the next minor skill will be reduced by 1 turn. If it fails, the damage of this minor skill will increase by $(20 + (skillLevel - 1) * 2)$%. After the wearer releases a minor skill, their speed will increase by $(8 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% for 1 turn. #F10# #F40# Accompanied by #L10#Miracle Angel: #L0#: When the Wind Hero releases a minor skill while equipped, the Wind Hero with the highest attack will immediately unleash a minor skill and grant themselves and their allies the [Future Prediction] effect. [Future Prediction]: Detects upcoming dangers and completely avoids skill damage (The Miracle Angel effect activates twice on the field and can only be triggered once per major round. If there are multiple equipments in the team, only one equipment can take effect).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520331, 520332, 520333, 520334, 520335}
	},
	[52034] = {
		id = 52034,
		skillName_vn = 'Đạo cụ mang theo',
		skillName_en = 'Carried prop',
		skillName_th = 'อุปกรณ์ที่พกติดตัว',
		skillName_in = 'Properti yang dibawa',
		skillName_ph = 'Dinadala na gamit',
		skillName_ma = 'Alatan dibawa',
		skillName = 'Carried prop',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, trước mỗi vòng chính, sát thương thưởng của người đeo được tăng thêm $(16+ (skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% trong 1 vòng (người đeo là người đầu tiên trong hành động của mình được tăng thêm 5%) và $(4+ (skillLevel-1)*1)$% giảm sát thương trong 1 vòng (người đeo được thêm 5% cho hành động của chính mình). Mỗi khi đồng đội khác hành động trong một hiệp trong vòng hiện tại (các hiệp hành động bổ sung không được ghi lại), sát thương cộng thêm giảm 2% nhưng mức giảm sát thương tăng thêm 2% (được tính cho mỗi hiệp)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Demon Sense: #L0# Trong trận chiến, khi bạn đứng đầu về phía mình, sát thương kỹ năng sẽ tăng thêm 20%. Sau vòng hành động, tốc độ của bản thân sẽ giảm xuống 1 điểm. Đồng thời, tỷ lệ miễn nhiễm chấn thương của chính bạn sẽ tăng thêm 20% và tỷ lệ miễn nhiễm kiểm soát của bạn sẽ tăng thêm 40%. Điều này sẽ kéo dài cho đến hành động tiếp theo của bạn. Hiệu ứng này sẽ hạ nhiệt trong 1 hiệp sau khi được kích hoạt và có hiệu lực hai lần trên toàn sân.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, before each main round, the wearer\'s bonus damage is increased by $(16 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% for 1 round (the wearer is the first to act and gains an additional 5%) and damage reduction is increased by $(4 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% for 1 round (the wearer gains an additional 5% for their own actions). Each time another teammate acts during a phase in the current round (additional action phases are not recorded), bonus damage decreases by 2% but damage reduction increases by 2% (calculated per phase). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Demon Sense: #L0# In battle, when you are the first on your side, skill damage is increased by 20%. After the action round, your speed decreases by 1 point. At the same time, your injury immunity rate increases by 20% and your control immunity rate increases by 40%. This lasts until your next action. This effect cools down after 1 phase and can activate twice on the entire field.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ ก่อนรอบหลักแต่ละรอบ ความเสียหายโบนัสของผู้สวมใส่จะเพิ่มขึ้น $(16 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% เป็นเวลา 1 รอบ (ผู้สวมใส่เป็นคนแรกที่ลงมือและได้รับเพิ่มอีก 5%) และการลดความเสียหายจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(4 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% เป็นเวลา 1 รอบ (ผู้สวมใส่ได้รับเพิ่มอีก 5% สำหรับการกระทำของตนเอง) ทุกครั้งที่พันธมิตรคนอื่นทำการในช่วงหนึ่งของรอบปัจจุบัน (รอบการกระทำเสริมจะไม่ถูกบันทึก) ความเสียหายโบนัสจะลดลง 2% แต่การลดความเสียหายจะเพิ่มขึ้น 2% (คำนวณตามแต่ละช่วง) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#สัมผัสปีศาจ: #L0# ในการต่อสู้ เมื่อคุณเป็นคนแรกในฝั่งของตน ความเสียหายสกิลจะเพิ่มขึ้น 20% หลังจบรอบการกระทำ ความเร็วของคุณจะลดลง 1 คะแนน พร้อมกันนั้น อัตราการป้องกันการบาดเจ็บของคุณจะเพิ่มขึ้น 20% และอัตราการป้องกันการควบคุมจะเพิ่มขึ้น 40% ผลลัพธ์นี้จะยาวนานจนกว่าคุณจะลงมือครั้งต่อไป ผลกระทบนี้จะคูลดาวน์หลังจาก 1 ช่วงและสามารถเปิดใช้งานได้สองครั้งทั่วสนาม',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, sebelum setiap putaran utama, bonus kerusakan pemakai meningkat sebesar $(16 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% selama 1 putaran (pemakai adalah yang pertama bertindak dan mendapatkan tambahan 5%) dan pengurangan kerusakan sebesar $(4 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% selama 1 putaran (pemakai mendapatkan tambahan 5% untuk aksinya sendiri). Setiap kali anggota tim lain bertindak dalam fase di putaran saat ini (fase aksi tambahan tidak dicatat), bonus kerusakan berkurang 2% tetapi pengurangan kerusakan meningkat 2% (dihitung per fase). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Indera Iblis: #L0# Dalam pertarungan, saat Anda menjadi yang terdepan di pihak Anda, kerusakan skill meningkat 20%. Setelah putaran aksi, kecepatan Anda berkurang 1 poin. Pada saat yang sama, tingkat kebal cedera Anda meningkat 20% dan tingkat kebal kontrol Anda meningkat 40%. Efek ini bertahan hingga aksi Anda berikutnya. Efek ini akan cooldown selama 1 fase setelah diaktifkan dan dapat berlaku dua kali di seluruh medan.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, bago magsimula ang bawat pangunahing round, ang bonus na pinsalang natatanggap ng nagsusuot ay tumataas ng $(16 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% sa loob ng 1 round (ang nagsusuot na siya ang unang kumikilos at tumatanggap ng dagdag na 5%) at $(4 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% na pagbawas sa pinsala sa loob ng 1 round (ang nagsusuot ay tumatanggap ng dagdag na 5% para sa sariling kilos). Sa tuwing ang ibang kasapi ng koponan ay kumikilos sa isang phase sa kasalukuyang round (hindi naitala ang mga karagdagang phase ng kilos), ang dagdag na pinsala ay bumababa ng 2% ngunit ang pagbawas sa pinsala ay tumataas ng 2% (binibilang bawat phase). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Demon Sense: #L0# Sa laban, kapag ikaw ang nauuna sa iyong panig, tumataas ang pinsala ng skill ng 20%. Pagkatapos ng aksyon, ang iyong bilis ay bababa ng 1 punto. Kasabay nito, ang iyong injury immunity rate ay tataas ng 20% at ang control immunity rate ay tataas ng 40%. Ito ay magtatagal hanggang sa iyong susunod na aksyon. Ang epekto ay magkakaroon ng cooldown ng 1 phase pagkatapos ma-activate at maaaring ma-activate ng dalawang beses sa buong field.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, sebelum setiap pusingan utama, kerosakan bonus pemakai meningkat sebanyak $(16 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% selama 1 pusingan (pemakai adalah yang pertama bertindak dan mendapat tambahan 5%) dan pengurangan kerosakan sebanyak $(4 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% selama 1 pusingan (pemakai mendapat tambahan 5% untuk tindakannya sendiri). Setiap kali rakan sepasukan lain bertindak dalam fasa pada pusingan semasa (fasa tindakan tambahan tidak direkod), kerosakan bonus berkurang 2% tetapi pengurangan kerosakan meningkat 2% (dihitung setiap fasa). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Deria Iblis: #L0# Dalam pertempuran, apabila anda menjadi yang terdepan di pihak anda, kerosakan kemahiran meningkat 20%. Selepas pusingan tindakan, kelajuan anda berkurang 1 mata. Pada masa yang sama, kadar kebal kecederaan anda meningkat 20% dan kadar kebal kawalan anda meningkat 40%. Kesan ini berterusan sehingga tindakan seterusnya anda. Kesan ini akan sejuk selama 1 fasa selepas diaktifkan dan boleh berkuat kuasa dua kali di seluruh medan.',
		describe = 'In battle, before each main round, the wearer\'s bonus damage is increased by $(16 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1.5)$% for 1 round (the wearer is the first to act and gains an additional 5%) and damage reduction is increased by $(4 + (skillLevel - 1) * 1)$% for 1 round (the wearer gains an additional 5% for their own actions). Each time another teammate acts during a phase in the current round (additional action phases are not recorded), bonus damage decreases by 2% but damage reduction increases by 2% (calculated per phase). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Demon Sense: #L0# In battle, when you are the first on your side, skill damage is increased by 20%. After the action round, your speed decreases by 1 point. At the same time, your injury immunity rate increases by 20% and your control immunity rate increases by 40%. This lasts until your next action. This effect cools down after 1 phase and can activate twice on the entire field.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520341}
	},
	[52035] = {
		id = 52035,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Manga props',
		skillName_th = 'อุปกรณ์มังงะ',
		skillName_in = 'Perlengkapan manga',
		skillName_ph = 'Mga gamit sa manga',
		skillName_ma = 'Peralatan manga',
		skillName = 'Manga props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong khi chiến đấu, khi người mặc trở nên tàng hình, tốc độ hồi phục của người mặc được tăng thêm $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% trong 2 lượt và 2 hiệu ứng tiêu cực của người mặc bị xóa bỏ. Khi người mặc trở nên tàng hình hoặc tổng phần trăm máu của các anh hùng trên sân thấp hơn 50%, người mặc và tất cả đồng đội trong hàng được tăng thêm $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% Giảm sát thương thực tế kéo dài trong 2 hiệp và chỉ có thể được kích hoạt 3 lần trên toàn sân (tích lũy trong chơi một người chơi)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Thời gian Ẩn: #L0# Khi có 3 hoặc nhiều anh hùng vô hình hơn về phía bạn, tất cả các anh hùng của bạn sẽ vô hình và nó sẽ tồn tại cho đến khi người mặc hành động trong vòng lớn tiếp theo. Nó chỉ có thể được kích hoạt một lần trên toàn bộ sân (nhiều trang bị có hiệu ứng Time Hide chỉ có thể kích hoạt một)',
		describe_en = 'During combat, when the wearer becomes invisible, the wearer\'s recovery speed is increased by $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% for 2 turns and 2 negative effects on the wearer are removed. When the wearer becomes invisible or the total HP percentage of heroes on the field is below 50%, the wearer and all teammates in the row gain an additional $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% Real Damage Reduction lasting for 2 rounds and can only be triggered 3 times on the entire field (accumulated in single-player mode). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Hide Duration: #L0# When there are 3 or more invisible heroes on your side, all your heroes become invisible and this lasts until the wearer acts in the next major round. It can only be triggered once on the entire field (multiple Time Hide effect equipment can only activate one).',
		describe_th = 'ในระหว่างการต่อสู้ เมื่อผู้สวมใส่กลายเป็นล่องหน ความเร็วการฟื้นฟูของผู้สวมใส่จะเพิ่มขึ้น $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น และสถานะลบ 2 อย่างบนผู้สวมใส่จะถูกลบออก เมื่อผู้สวมใส่กลายเป็นล่องหน หรือเปอร์เซ็นต์พลังชีวิตรวมของฮีโร่บนสนามน้อยกว่า 50% ผู้สวมใส่และเพื่อนร่วมทีมทั้งหมดในแถวจะได้รับการลดความเสียหายจริงเพิ่มขึ้น $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ และสามารถถูกเปิดใช้ได้เพียง 3 ครั้งในสนามทั้งหมด (สะสมในโหมดเล่นคนเดียว) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# ระยะเวลาการซ่อน: #L0# เมื่อมีฮีโร่ล่องหน 3 ตัวขึ้นไปฝั่งคุณ ฮีโร่ทั้งหมดของคุณจะกลายเป็นล่องหนและจะคงอยู่จนกว่าผู้สวมใส่จะทำการกระทำในรอบใหญ่ถัดไป สามารถเปิดใช้ได้เพียง 1 ครั้งในสนามทั้งหมด (อุปกรณ์ที่มีเอฟเฟกต์ Time Hide หลายชิ้นสามารถเปิดใช้ได้เพียงชิ้นเดียว)',
		describe_in = 'Selama pertarungan, saat pemakai menjadi tak terlihat, kecepatan pemulihan pemakai bertambah $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% selama 2 giliran dan 2 efek negatif pada pemakai dihapus. Saat pemakai menjadi tak terlihat atau total persentase HP para pahlawan di medan kurang dari 50%, pemakai dan semua rekan satu baris mendapatkan tambahan $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% Pengurangan Damage Nyata selama 2 ronde dan hanya dapat aktif 3 kali di seluruh medan (terakumulasi dalam mode pemain tunggal). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Durasi Sembunyi: #L0# Ketika ada 3 atau lebih pahlawan tak terlihat di pihakmu, semua pahlawanmu menjadi tak terlihat dan efek ini bertahan hingga pemakai bertindak di ronde besar berikutnya. Hanya dapat diaktifkan sekali di seluruh medan (beberapa perlengkapan dengan efek Time Hide hanya dapat mengaktifkan satu).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa panahon ng laban, kapag ang nagsusuot ay naging invisible, ang bilis ng pag-recover ng nagsusuot ay tumataas ng $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% sa loob ng 2 turn at 2 negatibong epekto ng nagsusuot ay tinatanggal. Kapag ang nagsusuot ay naging invisible o ang kabuuang porsyento ng HP ng mga bayani sa larangan ay mababa sa 50%, ang nagsusuot at lahat ng mga kakampi sa hilera ay tumatanggap ng karagdagang $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% Real Damage Reduction na tumatagal ng 2 rounds at maaaring ma-trigger lamang ng 3 beses sa buong larangan (nakaipon sa single-player mode). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tagal ng Nakatago: #L0# Kapag mayroong 3 o higit pang invisible na bayani sa iyong panig, lahat ng iyong mga bayani ay magiging invisible at ito ay magtatagal hanggang kumilos ang nagsusuot sa susunod na malaking round. Maaari lamang itong ma-trigger nang isang beses sa buong larangan (maraming kagamitan na may Time Hide effect ay maaaring mag-trigger ng isa lamang).',
		describe_ma = 'Semasa pertempuran, apabila pemakai menjadi tidak kelihatan, kelajuan pemulihan pemakai meningkat sebanyak $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% selama 2 pusingan dan 2 kesan negatif pada pemakai akan dihapuskan. Apabila pemakai menjadi tidak kelihatan atau jumlah peratus HP keseluruhan wira di medan kurang daripada 50%, pemakai dan semua rakan sebaris akan menerima peningkatan sebanyak $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% Pengurangan Kerusakan Sebenar selama 2 pusingan dan hanya boleh diaktifkan 3 kali keseluruhan medan (digabungkan dalam mod pemain tunggal). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tempoh Sembunyi: #L0# Apabila terdapat 3 atau lebih wira tidak kelihatan di pihak anda, semua wira anda akan menjadi tidak kelihatan dan ia akan kekal sehingga pemakai bertindak pada pusingan besar seterusnya. Ia hanya boleh diaktifkan sekali keseluruhan medan (peralatan dengan kesan Time Hide yang banyak hanya boleh mengaktifkan satu).',
		describe = 'During combat, when the wearer becomes invisible, the wearer\'s recovery speed is increased by $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% for 2 turns and 2 negative effects on the wearer are removed. When the wearer becomes invisible or the total HP percentage of heroes on the field is below 50%, the wearer and all teammates in the row gain an additional $(20+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% Real Damage Reduction lasting for 2 rounds and can only be triggered 3 times on the entire field (accumulated in single-player mode). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Hide Duration: #L0# When there are 3 or more invisible heroes on your side, all your heroes become invisible and this lasts until the wearer acts in the next major round. It can only be triggered once on the entire field (multiple Time Hide effect equipment can only activate one).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520351}
	},
	[52036] = {
		id = 52036,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, khi mục tiêu của kỹ năng đặc biệt do người sử dụng tung ra là "loại sát thương mục tiêu đơn", nó sẽ bỏ qua $(16+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% mức giảm sát thương tiêu diệt đặc biệt của mục tiêu và có $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% xác suất làm tê liệt ngẫu nhiên một tướng địch không bị kiểm soát trong 1 hiệp (xem hướng dẫn chiến đấu để biết chi tiết về loại sát thương một mục tiêu)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Spear xuyên không: #L0# Mỗi khi người đeo tung ra chiêu thức đặc biệt trên tổng cộng 2 lần, phạm vi mục tiêu tấn công trong chiêu thức đặc biệt thứ ba sẽ trở thành sát thương lan cho một mục tiêu (tỷ lệ văng là 40%), và nó có thể được kích hoạt tổng cộng 2 lần trên toàn sân (tích lũy trong toàn bộ trò chơi ở chế độ chơi đơn)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, when the target of a special skill cast by the user is a "single target damage type", it will ignore $(16+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% of the target\'s special damage reduction and has a $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% chance to randomly paralyze one uncontrolled enemy hero for 1 turn (see battle guide for details on single target damage types). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Void Piercing Spear: #L0# Each time the wearer uses special skills a total of 2 times, the attack range of the third special skill will become splash damage for one target (with a 40% splash rate), and this can be triggered a total of 2 times on the entire field (accumulated throughout the entire game in single player mode).',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ เมื่อเป้าหมายของทักษะพิเศษที่ผู้ใช้ปล่อยออกมาเป็น "ประเภทความเสียหายเป้าหมายเดี่ยว" จะข้ามการลดความเสียหายพิเศษของเป้าหมายได้ $(16+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% และมีโอกาส $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% ที่จะทำให้ศัตรูที่ไม่ได้ถูกควบคุมเป็นหนึ่งตัวถูกทำให้เป็นอัมพาตแบบสุ่มเป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (ดูคำแนะนำการต่อสู้สำหรับรายละเอียดเกี่ยวกับประเภทความเสียหายเป้าหมายเดี่ยว) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# หอกทะลุผา: #L0# ทุกครั้งที่ผู้สวมใส่ใช้สกิลพิเศษทั้งหมด 2 ครั้ง พื้นที่โจมตีของสกิลพิเศษครั้งที่สามจะกลายเป็นความเสียหายแบบระเบิดสำหรับเป้าหมายหนึ่งตัว (อัตราการกระเด็น 40%) และสามารถเปิดใช้งานได้ทั้งหมด 2 ครั้งในสนาม (สะสมตลอดทั้งเกมในโหมดผู้เล่นคนเดียว).',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, ketika target dari skill khusus yang digunakan adalah "jenis kerusakan target tunggal", itu akan mengabaikan $(16+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% pengurangan kerusakan khusus target dan memiliki peluang $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% untuk melumpuhkan secara acak satu pahlawan musuh yang tidak terkendali selama 1 giliran (lihat panduan pertempuran untuk detail jenis kerusakan target tunggal). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tombak Menembus Kosong: #L0# Setiap kali pemakai menggunakan skill khusus sebanyak total 2 kali, jangkauan target serangan pada skill khusus ketiga akan menjadi kerusakan area untuk satu target (tingkat pantulan 40%), dan dapat diaktifkan total 2 kali di seluruh arena (terakumulasi sepanjang permainan di mode pemain tunggal).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, kapag ang target ng espesyal na kakayahan na inilunsad ng gumagamit ay isang "uri ng pinsalang iisang target", ito ay magpapawalang-bisa sa $(16+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% ng espesyal na pagbawas ng pinsala ng target at may $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% na tsansa na ma-random na ma-paralyze ang isang kalabang bayani na hindi kontrolado sa loob ng 1 turn (tingnan ang gabay sa labanan para sa detalye tungkol sa uri ng pinsala ng isang target). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Bala ng Tagalipas: #L0# Sa tuwing gagamitin ng suwiter ang espesyal na kakayahan ng kabuuang 2 beses, ang saklaw ng target ng ikatlong espesyal na kakayahan ay magiging splash damage para sa isang target (40% na rate ng pag-splash), at maaari itong ma-activate ng kabuuang 2 beses sa buong arena (naipon sa buong laro sa single player mode).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, apabila sasaran kemahiran khas yang dilancarkan oleh pengguna adalah "jenis kerosakan sasaran tunggal", ia akan mengabaikan $(16+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% pengurangan kerosakan khas sasaran dan mempunyai peluang $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% untuk melumpuhkan secara rawak seorang wira musuh yang tidak dikawal selama 1 giliran (lihat panduan pertempuran untuk butiran jenis kerosakan sasaran tunggal). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tombak Merentas Kosong: #L0# Setiap kali pemakai melancarkan kemahiran khas sebanyak 2 kali, julat sasaran serangan dalam kemahiran khas ketiga akan menjadi kerosakan area untuk satu sasaran (kadar pantulan 40%), dan ia boleh diaktifkan sebanyak 2 kali di seluruh medan (berkumpul sepanjang permainan dalam mod pemain tunggal).',
		describe = 'In battle, when the target of a special skill cast by the user is a "single target damage type", it will ignore $(16+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% of the target\'s special damage reduction and has a $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% chance to randomly paralyze one uncontrolled enemy hero for 1 turn (see battle guide for details on single target damage types). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Void Piercing Spear: #L0# Each time the wearer uses special skills a total of 2 times, the attack range of the third special skill will become splash damage for one target (with a 40% splash rate), and this can be triggered a total of 2 times on the entire field (accumulated throughout the entire game in single player mode).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520361}
	},
	[52037] = {
		id = 52037,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, tốc độ được tăng thêm $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% trong vòng đầu tiên (gấp đôi đối với anh hùng hệ lửa). Người mặc thêm hiệu ứng [Karma Fire] cho ba đơn vị kẻ địch ngẫu nhiên trước mỗi hiệp trong 2 hiệp. [Nghiệp Hỏa]: Đốt âm, không thể chồng chất. Các đơn vị Karma Fire nhận 8% sát thương HP tối đa trước khi hành động\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Burning Devotion: #L0# Sau khi người mặc tung ra một kỹ năng nhỏ, 20% HP ban đầu sẽ bị trừ và 30% đòn tấn công kép ban đầu sẽ được chuyển cho đồng đội tức giận nhất cho đến khi kết thúc vòng lớn tiếp theo. Tiền hoàn lại sẽ được trả lại vào cuối vòng lớn tiếp theo và anh ta sẽ nhận được [Red Lotus] trong 2 vòng: Khi bị tấn công bởi các kỹ năng chủ động, hãy thêm [Karma Fire] vào người làm phép trong 1 vòng. Sau khi kết thúc trạng thái không hành động độc quyền của người mặc (xem hướng dẫn chiến đấu để biết chi tiết), nó sẽ tăng thêm $(26+ (skillLevel-1)*2)$% tốc độ và $(90+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ điểm tức giận và miễn nhiễm với một sát thương. Burning Devotion có thể được kích hoạt tổng cộng 2 lần trong toàn bộ trò chơi (tích lũy trong toàn bộ trò chơi ở chế độ chơi đơn)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, speed is increased by $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)% during the first round (double for Fire-element heroes). The wearer applies the [Karma Fire] effect to three random enemy units before each round for 2 rounds. [Karma Fire]: Silent burn, cannot stack. Units with Karma Fire take 8% of their max HP as damage before acting. Burning Devotion: After the wearer uses a minor skill, 20% of initial HP is deducted and 30% of the initial dual attack is transferred to the angriest ally until the end of the next major round. Refunds will be returned at the end of the next major round and the wearer will gain [Red Lotus] for 2 rounds: When attacked by active skills, add [Karma Fire] to the attacker for 1 round. After ending the wearer\'s exclusive non-action state (see battle guide for details), speed increases by $(26+(skillLevel-1)*2)% and anger points increase by $(90+(skillLevel-1)*15), with immunity to one damage. Burning Devotion can be activated a total of 2 times throughout the entire game (cumulative in single-player mode).',
		describe_th = 'ในสนามรบ ความเร็วจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)% ในรอบแรก (เพิ่มเป็นสองเท่าสำหรับฮีโร่ธาตุไฟ) ผู้สวมใส่จะมอบเอฟเฟกต์ [Karma Fire] ให้กับศัตรูสุ่ม 3 หน่วยก่อนแต่ละรอบ เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ [Karma Fire]: การเผาไหม้แบบเงียบ ไม่สามารถซ้อนทับ หน่วยที่ติด [Karma Fire] จะได้รับความเสียหาย 8% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดก่อนเริ่มต้นการเคลื่อนไหว Burning Devotion: หลังจากผู้สวมใส่ใช้ทักษะเล็ก จะสูญเสียพลังชีวิตเริ่มต้น 20% และโอนพลังการโจมตีคู่เริ่มต้น 30% ให้กับพันธมิตรที่โกรธที่สุดจนกว่าจะจบรอบใหญ่ถัดไป เงินคืนจะได้รับคืนเมื่อจบรอบใหญ่ถัดไป และผู้สวมใส่จะได้รับ [Red Lotus] เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ: เมื่อถูกโจมตีด้วยทักษะที่ใช้งาน ให้เพิ่ม [Karma Fire] ให้กับผู้โจมตีเป็นเวลา 1 รอบ หลังจากสิ้นสุดสถานะไม่เคลื่อนไหวพิเศษของผู้สวมใส่ (ดูคำแนะนำการต่อสู้สำหรับรายละเอียด) จะเพิ่มความเร็วขึ้น $(26+(skillLevel-1)*2)% และเพิ่มคะแนนความโกรธ $(90+(skillLevel-1)*15) พร้อมกันนี้จะได้รับภูมิคุ้มกันต่อความเสียหาย 1 ครั้ง Burning Devotion สามารถเปิดใช้งานได้ทั้งหมด 2 ครั้งตลอดเกม (สะสมในโหมดเล่นคนเดียว)',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, kecepatan bertambah $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)% pada putaran pertama (dua kali lipat untuk pahlawan elemen api). Pemakai memberikan efek [Karma Fire] pada tiga unit musuh acak sebelum setiap putaran selama 2 putaran. [Karma Fire]: Pembakaran senyap, tidak dapat menumpuk. Unit yang memiliki Karma Fire menerima 8% damage dari HP maksimum mereka sebelum bertindak. Burning Devotion: Setelah pemakai menggunakan skill kecil, 20% HP awal akan dikurangi dan 30% dari serangan ganda awal akan dialihkan ke rekan yang paling marah hingga akhir putaran besar berikutnya. Uang pengembalian akan dikembalikan pada akhir putaran besar berikutnya dan pemakai akan mendapatkan [Red Lotus] selama 2 putaran: Saat diserang oleh skill aktif, tambahkan [Karma Fire] pada penyerang selama 1 putaran. Setelah mengakhiri status non-aksi eksklusif pemakai (lihat panduan pertempuran untuk detail), kecepatan akan bertambah $(26+(skillLevel-1)*2)% dan poin kemarahan bertambah $(90+(skillLevel-1)*15) serta kebal terhadap satu serangan. Burning Devotion dapat diaktifkan total 2 kali selama keseluruhan permainan (terakumulasi dalam mode single player).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang bilis ay nadaragdagan ng $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)% sa unang round (doble para sa mga Fire-element na bayani). Binibigyan ng suot ang tatlong random na kalabang yunit ng effect na [Karma Fire] bago ang bawat round sa loob ng 2 round. [Karma Fire]: Silent burn, hindi pwedeng mag-stack. Ang mga yunit na may Karma Fire ay tumatanggap ng 8% ng kanilang max HP bilang damage bago kumilos. Burning Devotion: Pagkatapos gumamit ng minor skill ang may suot, 20% ng initial HP ay mababawasan at 30% ng initial dual attack ay ililipat sa pinaka-galit na kakampi hanggang matapos ang susunod na major round. Ang refund ay ibabalik sa pagtatapos ng susunod na major round at makakakuha ang may suot ng [Red Lotus] sa loob ng 2 round: Kapag inatake gamit ang aktibong skill, magdagdag ng [Karma Fire] sa umaatake sa loob ng 1 round. Pagkatapos matapos ang exclusive no-action state ng may suot (tingnan ang battle guide para sa detalye), tataas ang bilis ng $(26+(skillLevel-1)*2)% at tataas ang anger points ng $(90+(skillLevel-1)*15) at magiging immune sa isang damage. Ang Burning Devotion ay maaaring ma-activate ng kabuuang 2 beses sa buong laro (nakaipon sa single-player mode).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, kelajuan ditingkatkan sebanyak $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)% pada pusingan pertama (dua kali ganda bagi wira unsur api). Pemakai memberi kesan [Karma Fire] kepada tiga unit musuh secara rawak sebelum setiap pusingan selama 2 pusingan. [Karma Fire]: Pembakaran senyap, tidak boleh bertindih. Unit yang mempunyai Karma Fire menerima 8% kerosakan daripada HP maksimum sebelum bertindak. Burning Devotion: Selepas pemakai menggunakan kemahiran kecil, 20% HP awal akan ditolak dan 30% serangan berganda awal akan dipindahkan kepada rakan yang paling marah sehingga tamat pusingan besar seterusnya. Wang bayaran balik akan dikembalikan pada akhir pusingan besar seterusnya dan pemakai akan mendapat [Red Lotus] selama 2 pusingan: Apabila diserang oleh kemahiran aktif, tambah [Karma Fire] pada penyerang selama 1 pusingan. Selepas menamatkan status tidak bertindak eksklusif pemakai (rujuk panduan pertempuran untuk perincian), kelajuan meningkat sebanyak $(26+(skillLevel-1)*2)% dan mata kemarahan meningkat sebanyak $(90+(skillLevel-1)*15) serta kebal kepada satu serangan. Burning Devotion boleh diaktifkan sebanyak 2 kali sepanjang permainan (berkumulasi dalam mod pemain tunggal).',
		describe = 'In battle, speed is increased by $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)% during the first round (double for Fire-element heroes). The wearer applies the [Karma Fire] effect to three random enemy units before each round for 2 rounds. [Karma Fire]: Silent burn, cannot stack. Units with Karma Fire take 8% of their max HP as damage before acting. Burning Devotion: After the wearer uses a minor skill, 20% of initial HP is deducted and 30% of the initial dual attack is transferred to the angriest ally until the end of the next major round. Refunds will be returned at the end of the next major round and the wearer will gain [Red Lotus] for 2 rounds: When attacked by active skills, add [Karma Fire] to the attacker for 1 round. After ending the wearer\'s exclusive non-action state (see battle guide for details), speed increases by $(26+(skillLevel-1)*2)% and anger points increase by $(90+(skillLevel-1)*15), with immunity to one damage. Burning Devotion can be activated a total of 2 times throughout the entire game (cumulative in single-player mode).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520371}
	},
	[52041] = {
		id = 52041,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo dụng cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry tools #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_th = 'นำเครื่องมือมา #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_in = 'Bawa alat #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga kagamitan #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName_ma = 'Bawa alat #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		skillName = 'Carry tools #ma mau# #F x# #L x#',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, đòn tấn công kỹ năng chủ động của người đeo sẽ tăng phần thưởng hạn chế thuộc tính thêm $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Mỗi đòn tấn công sẽ gây thêm sát thương thực sự bằng $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% Sát Thương Phép Thuật của chính nó lên tất cả kẻ thù trong phạm vi tấn công. Sau lần tiêu diệt đầu tiên, tốc độ của chính nó sẽ tăng thêm $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%, kéo dài trong hai hiệp.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, the active skill attack of the wearer increases the reward of limited attributes by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Each attack deals additional true damage equal to $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% of its Magic Damage to all enemies within the attack range. After the first kill, its speed increases by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%, lasting for two turns.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ การโจมตีทักษะใช้งานของผู้สวมใส่จะเพิ่มรางวัลคุณสมบัติจำกัดขึ้นอีก $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% การโจมตีแต่ละครั้งจะสร้างความเสียหายจริงเพิ่มเติมเป็นจำนวน $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% ของความเสียหายเวทย์มนตร์ของตนเองแก่ศัตรูทั้งหมดในระยะโจมตี หลังจากการสังหารครั้งแรก ความเร็วของตนเองจะเพิ่มขึ้นอีก $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% ซึ่งมีผลติดต่อกันสองเทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, serangan skill aktif pemakai meningkatkan hadiah atribut terbatas sebesar $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Setiap serangan memberikan tambahan damage nyata sebesar $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% dari Damage Sihir-nya sendiri kepada semua musuh dalam jangkauan serangan. Setelah pembunuhan pertama, kecepatan dirinya meningkat sebesar $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%, berlangsung selama dua giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang aktibong skill attack ng nagsusuot ay nagpapataas ng gantimpala ng limitadong katangian ng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Bawat atake ay nagdudulot ng karagdagang totoong pinsala na katumbas ng $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% ng sariling Magic Damage nito sa lahat ng kalaban sa saklaw ng atake. Pagkatapos ng unang pagpatay, tataas ang bilis nito ng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%, tumatagal ito ng dalawang turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, serangan kemahiran aktif pemakai meningkatkan ganjaran atribut terhad sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Setiap serangan memberikan kerosakan benar tambahan sebanyak $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% daripada Kerosakan Sihir sendiri ke semua musuh dalam julat serangan. Selepas pembunuhan pertama, kelajuannya meningkat sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%, berlangsung selama dua pusingan.',
		describe = 'In battle, the active skill attack of the wearer increases the reward of limited attributes by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Each attack deals additional true damage equal to $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% of its Magic Damage to all enemies within the attack range. After the first kill, its speed increases by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%, lasting for two turns.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520411}
	},
	[52042] = {
		id = 52042,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong khi chiến đấu, người đeo sẽ giảm sát thương $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% khi đối mặt với các đòn tấn công kỹ năng chủ động hạn chế phi thuộc tính; khi tỷ lệ phần trăm máu của người mặc trên 50%, nó sẽ tăng gấp đôi $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%; khi dưới 50%, người đeo sẽ phục hồi $(5+skillLevel*0,8-0,8)$% lượng máu tối đa của mình sau mỗi hiệp hành động.',
		describe_en = 'While fighting, the wearer reduces damage by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% when facing active skill attacks that are limited to non-elemental; when the wearer\'s health percentage is above 50%, this effect doubles to $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%; when below 50%, the wearer recovers $(5+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$% of their maximum health after each action round.',
		describe_th = 'ในขณะต่อสู้ ผู้สวมใส่จะลดความเสียหายลง $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% เมื่อเผชิญกับการโจมตีจากสกิลแอคทีฟที่จำกัดเฉพาะที่ไม่ใช่องค์ประกอบ; เมื่อเปอร์เซ็นต์พลังชีวิตของผู้สวมใส่อยู่เหนือ 50% ผลนี้จะเพิ่มขึ้นเป็นสองเท่าเป็น $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%; เมื่อพลังชีวิตต่ำกว่า 50% ผู้สวมใส่จะฟื้นฟู $(5+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดหลังจากแต่ละรอบการกระทำ',
		describe_in = 'Saat bertarung, pemakai mengurangi kerusakan sebesar $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% ketika menghadapi serangan skill aktif yang dibatasi non-atribut; ketika persentase kesehatan pemakai di atas 50%, efek ini meningkat dua kali lipat menjadi $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%; ketika di bawah 50%, pemakai akan memulihkan $(5+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$% dari kesehatan maksimal mereka setelah setiap putaran aksi.',
		describe_ph = 'Habang nakikipaglaban, ang nagsusuot ay bumababa ang pinsala ng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% kapag hinaharap ang mga aktibong skill attack na limitado sa walang katangiang pag-atake; kapag ang porsyento ng buhay ng nagsusuot ay higit sa 50%, dumodoble ito sa $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%; kapag mas mababa sa 50%, ang nagsusuot ay nakakabawi ng $(5+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$% ng kanilang maximum na buhay pagkatapos ng bawat round ng aksyon.',
		describe_ma = 'Semasa bertarung, pemakai akan mengurangkan kerosakan sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% apabila menghadapi serangan kemahiran aktif yang terhad kepada bukan unsur; apabila peratusan kesihatan pemakai melebihi 50%, kesan ini akan berganda kepada $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%; apabila di bawah 50%, pemakai akan memulihkan $(5+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$% daripada jumlah kesihatan maksimum selepas setiap pusingan tindakan.',
		describe = 'While fighting, the wearer reduces damage by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% when facing active skill attacks that are limited to non-elemental; when the wearer\'s health percentage is above 50%, this effect doubles to $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%; when below 50%, the wearer recovers $(5+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$% of their maximum health after each action round.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520421}
	},
	[52043] = {
		id = 52043,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong khi chiến đấu, người đeo có $(50+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% cơ hội áp dụng hiệu ứng tiêu cực ngẫu nhiên (bao gồm bỏng/ngộ độc/chảy máu, debuff thuộc tính và giảm khả năng hồi máu) cho mục tiêu chính trong 2 hiệp và có 50% khả năng bị câm lặng hoặc choáng sau khi ứng dụng thành công. Mục tiêu chính là 1 vòng; vào cuối mỗi vòng lớn, nếu có hiệu ứng tiêu cực hoặc hiệu ứng kiểm soát trong trại địch, đòn tấn công kép của người đeo sẽ tăng thêm $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% và khả năng phòng thủ kép sẽ tăng thêm $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%, kéo dài trong 1 vòng lớn.',
		describe_en = 'While fighting, the wearer has a $(50+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% chance to apply a random negative effect (including burn/poison/bleed, attribute debuff, and healing reduction) to the main target for 2 turns and a 50% chance to be silenced or stunned after a successful application. The main target is 1 round; at the end of each major round, if there are negative effects or control effects in the enemy camp, the wearer\'s dual attack will increase by $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% and dual defense will increase by $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%, lasting for 1 major round.',
		describe_th = 'ในขณะต่อสู้ ผู้สวมใส่จะมีโอกาส $(50+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% ในการใช้เอฟเฟกต์ลบสุ่ม (รวมถึงการถูกไฟลวก/พิษ/เลือดไหล, การลดค่าสถานะ และลดความสามารถในการฟื้นฟู) กับเป้าหมายหลักเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น และมีโอกาส 50% ที่จะถูกปิดปากหรือมึนงงหลังจากการใช้งานที่สำเร็จ เป้าหมายหลักเป็น 1 รอบ; เมื่อสิ้นสุดแต่ละรอบใหญ่ หากมีเอฟเฟกต์ลบหรือเอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมในค่ายศัตรู การโจมตีคู่ของผู้สวมใส่จะเพิ่มขึ้น $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% และการป้องกันคู่จะเพิ่มขึ้น $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% เป็นเวลา 1 รอบใหญ่',
		describe_in = 'Saat bertarung, pemakai memiliki peluang $(50+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% untuk menerapkan efek negatif acak (termasuk terbakar/keracunan/pendarahan, debuff atribut, dan pengurangan kemampuan penyembuhan) pada target utama selama 2 giliran dan peluang 50% untuk mengalami bisu atau pingsan setelah penerapan berhasil. Target utama adalah 1 putaran; di akhir setiap putaran besar, jika ada efek negatif atau efek kontrol di kamp musuh, serangan ganda pemakai akan meningkat sebesar $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% dan pertahanan ganda akan meningkat sebesar $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%, berlangsung selama 1 putaran besar.',
		describe_ph = 'Habang nakikipaglaban, ang nagsusuot ay may $(50+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% na tsansa na maglagay ng random na negatibong epekto (kabilang ang paso/pagkalason/pagdurugo, debuff sa attribute at pagbaba ng kakayahan sa pagpapagaling) sa pangunahing target sa loob ng 2 turn at may 50% na tsansa na ma-silence o ma-stun pagkatapos ng matagumpay na paglalapat. Ang pangunahing target ay 1 round; sa pagtatapos ng bawat malaking round, kung may negatibong epekto o kontrol na epekto sa kampo ng kalaban, tataas ang dual attack ng nagsusuot ng $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% at tataas ang dual defense ng $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%, tatagal ito ng 1 malaking round.',
		describe_ma = 'Semasa bertempur, pemakai mempunyai peluang $(50+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% untuk menggunakan kesan negatif rawak (termasuk terbakar/beracun/pendarahan, debuff atribut dan pengurangan keupayaan penyembuhan) kepada sasaran utama selama 2 pusingan dan mempunyai 50% peluang untuk bisu atau pengsan selepas penggunaan berjaya. Sasaran utama ialah 1 pusingan; pada akhir setiap pusingan besar, jika terdapat kesan negatif atau kesan kawalan dalam kem musuh, serangan berganda pemakai akan meningkat sebanyak $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% dan pertahanan berganda akan meningkat sebanyak $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%, berlangsung selama 1 pusingan besar.',
		describe = 'While fighting, the wearer has a $(50+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% chance to apply a random negative effect (including burn/poison/bleed, attribute debuff, and healing reduction) to the main target for 2 turns and a 50% chance to be silenced or stunned after a successful application. The main target is 1 round; at the end of each major round, if there are negative effects or control effects in the enemy camp, the wearer\'s dual attack will increase by $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% and dual defense will increase by $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%, lasting for 1 major round.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520431}
	},
	[52051] = {
		id = 52051,
		skillName_vn = 'Đạo cụ mang màu đỏ',
		skillName_en = 'Red-colored item',
		skillName_th = 'ไอเท็มสีแดง',
		skillName_in = 'Item berwarna merah',
