		skillName_ma = 'Item berwarna merah',
		skillName = 'Red-colored item',
		describe_vn = '#L10#Quy tắc sáng tạo: #L0# Khi có 2 đồng đội trở lên có cùng thuộc tính với người mặc trong đội, 3 vòng đầu tiên sẽ bắt đầu tăng $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% đòn tấn công kép và tốc độ $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% của đội (các anh hùng có cùng thuộc tính sẽ được tăng thêm 50%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Sword Kaitianmen: #L0# Một thanh kiếm khổng lồ rơi $(2+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ một vòng lớn trước khi trận chiến bắt đầu. [Chém] Mục tiêu của kẻ địch có lượng máu cao nhất. [Chém]: trực tiếp cắt đứt 15% máu hiện tại của mục tiêu (giới hạn trên là 250% đòn đánh kép của bản thân). Hệ số cắt đối với mục tiêu có lượng máu cao hơn 50% được tăng lên 25%\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Hai thanh kiếm kết hợp: #L0# Khi đồng đội được trang bị Thanh kiếm bất tử cùng lúc, hai đồng đội có thể mời nhau tham chiến một lần trong cùng một vòng đấu. Lời mời này đi kèm với hiệu ứng [Chém] với 30% sát thương và được kích hoạt $(1+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ lần trong trường.',
		describe_en = '#L10# Creative Rules: #L0# When 2 or more teammates share the same attribute as the wearer in the team, the first 3 rounds will start increasing the team\'s dual attack by $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% and speed by $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% (heroes with the same attribute receive an additional 50%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Sword Kaitianmen: #L0# A giant sword falls $(2+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ large rounds before the battle begins. [Slash] Targets the enemy with the highest HP. [Slash]: directly cuts 15% of the target\'s current HP (capped at 250% of the user\'s dual attack). The cutting coefficient is increased to 25% for targets with more than 50% HP\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Twin Swords Combo: #L0# When teammates are equipped with the Immortal Sword simultaneously, both can invite each other to join the battle once during the same round. This invitation carries a [Slash] effect dealing 30% damage and can be triggered $(1+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ times in the field.',
		describe_th = '#L10# กฎการสร้างสรรค์: #L0# เมื่อมีเพื่อนร่วมทีม 2 คนขึ้นไปที่มีคุณสมบัติเดียวกันกับผู้สวมใส่ในทีม รอบแรก 3 รอบจะเริ่มเพิ่มการโจมตีคู่ $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% และความเร็ว $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% ของทีม (ฮีโร่ที่มีคุณสมบัติเดียวกันจะได้รับการเพิ่มอีก 50%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# ดาบ Kai Tianmen: #L0# ดาบยักษ์ตกลงมา $(2+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ รอบใหญ่ก่อนการต่อสู้เริ่มขึ้น [ฟัน] เป้าหมายของศัตรูที่มีพลังชีวิตสูงที่สุด [ฟัน]: ตัดเลือดปัจจุบันของเป้าหมายโดยตรง 15% (จำกัดสูงสุดที่ 250% การโจมตีคู่ของผู้ใช้) อัตราการตัดเพิ่มขึ้นเป็น 25% สำหรับเป้าหมายที่มีพลังชีวิตมากกว่า 50%\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# ดาบคู่ผสาน: #L0# เมื่อเพื่อนร่วมทีมสวมใส่ดาบอมตะพร้อมกัน ทั้งสองสามารถเชิญกันเข้าร่วมการต่อสู้ได้ครั้งละหนึ่งครั้งในรอบเดียวกัน การเชิญนี้มาพร้อมกับเอฟเฟกต์ [ฟัน] ที่สร้างความเสียหาย 30% และสามารถเปิดใช้งานได้ $(1+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ ครั้งในสนาม',
		describe_in = '#L10# Aturan Kreatif: #L0# Ketika 2 atau lebih rekan satu tim memiliki atribut yang sama dengan pemakai dalam tim, 3 ronde pertama akan mulai meningkatkan serangan ganda sebesar $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% dan kecepatan sebesar $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% dari tim (pahlawan yang memiliki atribut sama akan mendapatkan peningkatan tambahan 50%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Pedang Kaitianmen: #L0# Sebuah pedang raksasa jatuh $(2+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ ronde besar sebelum pertarungan dimulai. [Tebas] Menargetkan musuh dengan HP tertinggi. [Tebas]: langsung memotong 15% HP saat ini dari target (batas maksimal 250% serangan ganda pengguna). Koefisien pemotongan meningkat menjadi 25% untuk target dengan lebih dari 50% HP\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Kombinasi Dua Pedang: #L0# Ketika rekan satu tim dilengkapi dengan Pedang Abadi secara bersamaan, kedua rekan dapat saling mengundang bertarung sekali selama ronde yang sama. Undangan ini disertai efek [Tebas] dengan kerusakan 30% dan dapat diaktifkan $(1+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ kali di medan.',
		describe_ph = '#L10# Mga Panuntunan sa Paglikha: #L0# Kapag may 2 o higit pa na mga kasamahan sa koponan na may parehong katangian ng nagsusuot sa koponan, ang unang 3 round ay magsisimulang dagdagan ang dual attack ng koponan ng $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% at bilis ng $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% (ang mga bayani na may parehong katangian ay makakatanggap ng karagdagang 50%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Sword Kaitianmen: #L0# Isang higanteng espada ang babagsak ng $(2+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ malaking round bago magsimula ang laban. [Hiwa] Tinatawag ang kalaban na may pinakamataas na HP. [Hiwa]: direktang pumuputol ng 15% ng kasalukuyang HP ng target (limitado sa 250% ng dual attack ng gumagamit). Ang koepisyent ng pagputol ay tumataas sa 25% para sa mga target na may higit sa 50% HP\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Dalawang Pinagsamang Espada: #L0# Kapag sinusuotan ng mga kasamahan ang Immortal Sword nang sabay, maaari nilang imbitahan ang isa\'t isa para sumali sa laban ng isang beses sa parehong round. Ang imbitasyong ito ay may kasamang epekto na [Hiwa] na may 30% damage at maaaring ma-activate ng $(1+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ beses sa field.',
		describe_ma = '#L10# Peraturan Kreatif: #L0# Apabila 2 atau lebih rakan sepasukan mempunyai atribut yang sama dengan pemakai dalam pasukan, 3 pusingan pertama akan mula meningkatkan serangan berganda pasukan sebanyak $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% dan kelajuan sebanyak $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% (wira dengan atribut yang sama akan menerima peningkatan tambahan 50%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Pedang Kaitianmen: #L0# Sebilah pedang gergasi jatuh $(2+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ pusingan besar sebelum pertempuran bermula. [Celah] Menyasarkan musuh dengan HP tertinggi. [Celah]: terus memotong 15% HP semasa sasaran (had atas adalah 250% serangan berganda pengguna). Pekali pemotongan dinaikkan kepada 25% untuk sasaran dengan lebih daripada 50% HP\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Gabungan Dua Pedang: #L0# Apabila rakan sepasukan memakai Pedang Abadi serentak, kedua-duanya boleh menjemput satu sama lain untuk bertempur sekali dalam pusingan yang sama. Jemputan ini lengkap dengan kesan [Celah] dengan 30% kerosakan dan boleh diaktifkan $(1+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ kali di medan.',
		describe = '#L10# Creative Rules: #L0# When 2 or more teammates share the same attribute as the wearer in the team, the first 3 rounds will start increasing the team\'s dual attack by $(8+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% and speed by $(4+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% (heroes with the same attribute receive an additional 50%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Sword Kaitianmen: #L0# A giant sword falls $(2+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ large rounds before the battle begins. [Slash] Targets the enemy with the highest HP. [Slash]: directly cuts 15% of the target\'s current HP (capped at 250% of the user\'s dual attack). The cutting coefficient is increased to 25% for targets with more than 50% HP\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Twin Swords Combo: #L0# When teammates are equipped with the Immortal Sword simultaneously, both can invite each other to join the battle once during the same round. This invitation carries a [Slash] effect dealing 30% damage and can be triggered $(1+math.floor(skillLevel/4)*1)$ times in the field.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 1,
		passiveTriggerArg = 1,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {520511}
	},
	[52101] = {
		id = 52101,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, giới hạn trên của máu cơ bản sẽ tăng thêm $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% khi bắt đầu (hiệu ứng sẽ tăng gấp đôi đối với những anh hùng có giá trị sức khỏe và chủng tộc ≥120). Nếu người đeo là đơn vị có lượng máu ban đầu cao nhất trong đội, hiệu ứng khống chế không chiếm ưu thế gắn với kỹ năng chủ động sẽ được bù đắp (làm mát trong 3 hiệp sau khi kích hoạt). Khi người mặc chết, 10% máu tối đa của người mặc sẽ gây sát thương cho tất cả kẻ thù\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Năng lượng gen: #L0# Nếu người mặc biến thành dạng sắp chết (xem hướng dẫn chiến đấu để biết chi tiết), nó sẽ vĩnh viễn giảm giới hạn máu trên của tất cả kẻ thù xuống $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% (có thể được kích hoạt 2 lần trên toàn khu vực) và giảm tốc độ thêm $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% trong 2 lượt, không thể xếp chồng lên nhau (nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội, chỉ có hai trang bị có thể phát huy tác dụng)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, the upper limit of base health increases by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% at the start (effect doubles for heroes with health value and race ≥120). If the wearer has the highest initial health in the team, the dominant control effect linked to the active skill will be compensated (cooldown for 3 turns after activation). When the wearer dies, 10% of the wearer\'s max health will deal damage to all enemies. Gen energy: #L0# If the wearer enters a near-death state (see battle guide for details), it will permanently reduce all enemies\' maximum health limit by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% (can be triggered twice in the entire area) and additionally reduce speed by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% for 2 turns, cannot stack (if multiple equipment exist in the team, only two can take effect).',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ ขีดจำกัดสูงสุดของพลังชีวิตพื้นฐานจะเพิ่มขึ้น $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% เมื่อเริ่มต้น (เอฟเฟกต์จะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่าสำหรับฮีโร่ที่มีค่าพลังชีวิตและเผ่าพันธุ์ ≥120) หากผู้สวมใส่เป็นยูนิตที่มีพลังชีวิตเริ่มต้นสูงสุดในทีม เอฟเฟกต์ควบคุมที่โดดเด่นซึ่งเชื่อมโยงกับสกิลแอคทีฟจะถูกชดเชย (คูลดาวน์ 3 เทิร์นหลังเปิดใช้งาน) เมื่อผู้สวมใส่ตาย จะสร้างความเสียหายเท่ากับ 10% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของผู้สวมใส่กับศัตรูทั้งหมด พลังงานเจน: #L0# หากผู้สวมใส่เข้าสู่โหมดใกล้ตาย (ดูคำแนะนำการต่อสู้เพื่อรายละเอียด) จะลดขีดจำกัดพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของศัตรูทั้งหมดถาวรลง $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% (สามารถเปิดใช้งานได้สองครั้งทั่วทั้งพื้นที่) และลดความเร็วเพิ่ม $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% ใน 2 เทิร์น ไม่สามารถซ้อนทับได้ (ถ้ามีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีม จะมีเพียงสองชิ้นที่สามารถออกฤทธิ์ได้).',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, batas atas darah dasar akan meningkat sebesar $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% saat mulai (efek akan meningkat dua kali lipat untuk pahlawan dengan nilai kesehatan dan ras ≥120). Jika pemakai adalah unit dengan darah awal tertinggi dalam tim, efek kontrol dominan yang terkait dengan skill aktif akan dikompensasi (cooldown selama 3 giliran setelah aktivasi). Ketika pemakai mati, 10% dari darah maksimum pemakai akan memberikan damage kepada semua musuh. Energi gen: #L0# Jika pemakai berubah menjadi bentuk hampir mati (lihat panduan pertempuran untuk detail), itu akan secara permanen mengurangi batas darah maksimum semua musuh sebesar $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% (dapat diaktifkan 2 kali di seluruh area) dan mengurangi kecepatan tambahan sebesar $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% selama 2 giliran, tidak dapat ditumpuk (jika ada beberapa perlengkapan dalam tim, hanya dua perlengkapan yang dapat berfungsi).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, tataas ang pinakamataas na limitasyon ng pangunahing buhay ng $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% sa simula (doble ang epekto para sa mga bayani na may health value at lahi ≥120). Kung ang nagsusuot ay ang yunit na may pinakamataas na paunang buhay sa koponan, ang dominanteng epekto ng kontrol na kaugnay ng aktibong kasanayan ay babawiin (cooldown sa loob ng 3 rounds pagkatapos ma-activate). Kapag namatay ang nagsusuot, 10% ng max na buhay ng nagsusuot ay magdudulot ng pinsala sa lahat ng kalaban. Enerhiya ng gen: #L0# Kung ang nagsusuot ay nasa near-death form (tingnan ang battle guide para sa detalye), permanente nitong babawasan ang maximum health limit ng lahat ng kalaban ng $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% (maaaring ma-activate nang dalawang beses sa buong lugar) at babawasan ang bilis ng karagdagan ng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% sa loob ng 2 rounds, hindi maaaring pag-ugnayin (kung maraming equipment sa koponan, dalawa lamang ang epektibo).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, had atas darah asas akan meningkat sebanyak $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% pada permulaan (kesan akan berganda bagi wira yang mempunyai nilai kesihatan dan bangsa ≥120). Jika pemakai ialah unit dengan darah awal tertinggi dalam pasukan, kesan kawalan dominan yang berkaitan dengan kemahiran aktif akan diberi pampasan (masa sejuk selama 3 giliran selepas pengaktifan). Apabila pemakai mati, 10% daripada darah maksimum pemakai akan menyebabkan kerosakan kepada semua musuh. Tenaga gen: #L0# Jika pemakai berubah menjadi bentuk hampir mati (rujuk panduan pertempuran untuk maklumat lanjut), ia akan secara kekal mengurangkan had darah maksimum semua musuh sebanyak $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% (boleh diaktifkan 2 kali di seluruh kawasan) dan mengurangkan kelajuan tambahan sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% selama 2 giliran, tidak boleh bertindih (jika terdapat beberapa peralatan dalam pasukan, hanya dua peralatan yang boleh berfungsi).',
		describe = 'In battle, the upper limit of base health increases by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% at the start (effect doubles for heroes with health value and race ≥120). If the wearer has the highest initial health in the team, the dominant control effect linked to the active skill will be compensated (cooldown for 3 turns after activation). When the wearer dies, 10% of the wearer\'s max health will deal damage to all enemies. Gen energy: #L0# If the wearer enters a near-death state (see battle guide for details), it will permanently reduce all enemies\' maximum health limit by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% (can be triggered twice in the entire area) and additionally reduce speed by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% for 2 turns, cannot stack (if multiple equipment exist in the team, only two can take effect).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {521011}
	},
	[52102] = {
		id = 52102,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, nếu người mặc không hành động trong lượt của mình, anh ta sẽ nhận được 1 lớp dấu [Tấn công lén lút]. Sau khi đồng đội chủ động tấn công, người mặc sẽ sử dụng đòn tấn công thông thường để tấn công mục tiêu chính một lần và tiêu hao 1 lớp dấu [Tấn công lén lút]. Chỉ có thể nhận được 4 điểm trong toàn bộ trò chơi (anh hùng chiến đấu sẽ nhận được thêm 2 điểm)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Đòn tấn công lén lút bằng tay ma: #L0# Khi mỗi đòn tấn công của người đeo không dẫn đến tiêu diệt, sẽ có $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% khả năng đánh cắp 20 điểm thịnh nộ từ mục tiêu; cứ sau 5 đòn tấn công, đòn tấn công tiếp theo sẽ gây thêm Sát Thương Vật Lý $(5+(skillLevel-1)*0,5)$% giới hạn mạng sống tối đa của mục tiêu.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, if the wearer does not act on their turn, they will gain 1 stack of [Sneak Attack]. After an ally initiates an attack, the wearer will use a normal attack to strike the main target once and consume 1 stack of [Sneak Attack]. A maximum of 4 stacks can be gained throughout the entire game (combat heroes will receive an additional 2 stacks).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Sneak attack with shadow hands: #L0# When each attack by the wearer does not result in a kill, there is a $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% chance to steal 20 rage points from the target; every 5 attacks, the next attack will deal additional Physical Damage equal to $(5+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% of the target\'s max HP.',
		describe_th = 'ในระหว่างการต่อสู้ หากผู้สวมใส่ไม่ทำการใด ๆ ในตาของตน เขาจะได้รับ 1 ชั้นของ [การโจมตีลอบโจมตี] หลังจากที่เพื่อนร่วมทีมเริ่มโจมตี ผู้สวมใส่จะใช้การโจมตีปกติเพื่อโจมตีเป้าหมายหลัก 1 ครั้งและใช้ 1 ชั้นของ [การโจมตีลอบโจมตี] สามารถรับได้สูงสุด 4 ชั้นตลอดทั้งเกม (ฮีโร่ในการต่อสู้จะได้รับเพิ่มอีก 2 ชั้น)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#การโจมตีลอบด้วยมือเงา: #L0# เมื่อการโจมตีแต่ละครั้งของผู้สวมใส่ไม่ทำให้เป้าหมายตาย จะมีโอกาส $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% ที่จะขโมย 20 แต้มความโกรธจากเป้าหมาย; ทุก ๆ 5 ครั้งที่โจมตี ครั้งต่อไปจะก่อให้เกิดความเสียหายทางกายภาพเพิ่มขึ้น $(5+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของเป้าหมาย',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, jika pemakai tidak bertindak pada gilirannya, dia akan mendapatkan 1 lapis tanda [Serangan Siluman]. Setelah teman setim secara aktif menyerang, pemakai akan menggunakan serangan biasa untuk menyerang target utama satu kali dan menghabiskan 1 lapis tanda [Serangan Siluman]. Hanya dapat memperoleh 4 poin sepanjang permainan (pahlawan bertarung akan mendapat tambahan 2 poin).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Serangan siluman dengan tangan bayangan: #L0# Ketika setiap serangan pemakai tidak menyebabkan pembunuhan, ada kemungkinan $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% untuk mencuri 20 poin kemarahan dari target; setiap 5 serangan, serangan berikutnya akan memberikan Kerusakan Fisik tambahan sebesar $(5+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% dari maksimum HP target.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa labanan, kung ang tagasuot ay hindi kumilos sa kanilang turn, makakatanggap siya ng 1 layer ng tanda [Sneak Attack]. Pagkatapos ng kasamahang aktibong umatake, gagamitin ng tagasuot ang karaniwang atake upang tamaan ang pangunahing target ng isang beses at gagastusin ang 1 layer ng tanda [Sneak Attack]. Maaari lamang makakuha ng 4 puntos sa buong laro (ang mga bayani sa labanan ay makakakuha ng dagdag na 2 puntos).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Sneak attack gamit ang mga aninong kamay: #L0# Sa bawat pag-atake ng tagasuot na hindi nagdulot ng pagkamatay, mayroong $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% na pagkakataon na nakawin ang 20 puntos ng galit mula sa target; bawat ika-5 atake, ang susunod na atake ay magdudulot ng karagdagang Pisikal na Pinsala na katumbas ng $(5+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% ng maximum na HP ng target.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, jika pemakai tidak bertindak pada giliran mereka, dia akan menerima 1 lapisan tanda [Serangan Siluman]. Selepas rakan sepasukan memulakan serangan, pemakai akan menggunakan serangan biasa untuk menyerang sasaran utama sekali dan menggunakan 1 lapisan tanda [Serangan Siluman]. Hanya boleh mendapat 4 mata sepanjang permainan (wira bertempur akan mendapat tambahan 2 mata).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Serangan siluman dengan tangan bayangan: #L0# Apabila setiap serangan pemakai tidak menyebabkan pembunuhan, ada peluang $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% untuk mencuri 20 mata kemarahan daripada sasaran; setiap 5 serangan, serangan seterusnya akan menyebabkan Kerosakan Fizikal tambahan sebanyak $(5+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% daripada had HP maksimum sasaran.',
		describe = 'In battle, if the wearer does not act on their turn, they will gain 1 stack of [Sneak Attack]. After an ally initiates an attack, the wearer will use a normal attack to strike the main target once and consume 1 stack of [Sneak Attack]. A maximum of 4 stacks can be gained throughout the entire game (combat heroes will receive an additional 2 stacks).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Sneak attack with shadow hands: #L0# When each attack by the wearer does not result in a kill, there is a $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% chance to steal 20 rage points from the target; every 5 attacks, the next attack will deal additional Physical Damage equal to $(5+(skillLevel-1)*0.5)$% of the target\'s max HP.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {521021}
	},
	[52103] = {
		id = 52103,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, khi người đeo tấn công, anh ta sẽ triệu hồi Magikarp để bơi về phía mục tiêu ngẫu nhiên của kẻ địch, khiến đơn vị đó [Cá] trong 2 lượt; cứ mỗi 2 Magikarp được triệu hồi, Magikarp được triệu hồi tiếp theo sẽ tiến hóa thành Gyarados, gây thêm 300% sát thương phép của người đeo lên hàng kẻ địch và 30% khiến kẻ địch bối rối (hiệu ứng này có thể được kích hoạt tối đa 2 lần) #F20# #F40##L10# Chạm Cá: #L0# Tỷ lệ trúng đòn chí mạng và tỷ lệ né tránh giảm đi bởi $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$%\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Thanh lọc cá muối: #L0# Mỗi lần hiệu ứng bất thường của người đeo bị xua tan, người đeo sẽ tăng khả năng giảm sát thương của bản thân và hai đơn vị ngẫu nhiên khác thêm 4%, kéo dài trong 2 hiệp, với tối đa 5 lớp\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Triệu hồi sức mạnh: #L0# Thần Kiếm Cá Muối tăng thuộc tính của tất cả các triệu hồi nước lên $(8+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$%',
		describe_en = 'In battle, when the wearer attacks, he will summon Magikarp to swim towards a random enemy target, causing that unit to be [Fish] for 2 turns; for every 2 Magikarp summoned, the next Magikarp summoned will evolve into Gyarados, dealing an additional 300% magic damage from the wearer to the enemy row and causing 30% confusion to enemies (this effect can be triggered up to 2 times). #F20# #F40##L10# Fish Touch: #L0# Critical hit rate and dodge rate are reduced by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Salt Fish Purification: #L0# Each time the wearer\'s abnormal effect is dispelled, the wearer increases damage reduction for themselves and two other random units by 4%, lasting for 2 rounds, up to 5 stacks \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Summon Power: #L0# Salt Sword God increases the attributes of all water summons by $(8+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$%',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ เมื่อผู้สวมใส่โจมตี เขาจะเรียก Magikarp ว่ายไปยังเป้าหมายศัตรูแบบสุ่ม ทำให้หน่วยนั้นเป็น [ปลา] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น; ทุก ๆ การเรียก Magikarp สองตัว ตัวถัดไปจะพัฒนาเป็น Gyarados สร้างความเสียหายเวทย์เพิ่มเติม 300% ของผู้สวมใส่ต่อแถวศัตรู และทำให้ศัตรูสับสน 30% (เอฟเฟกต์นี้สามารถถูกเปิดใช้งานได้สูงสุด 2 ครั้ง) #F20# #F40##L10# สัมผัสปลา: #L0# อัตราคริติคอลและอัตราหลบหลีกลดลง $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# การชำระล้างปลาเค็ม: #L0# ทุกครั้งที่เอฟเฟกต์ผิดปกติของผู้สวมใส่ถูกขจัด ผู้สวมใส่จะเพิ่มการลดความเสียหายให้กับตัวเองและหน่วยสุ่มอีกสองหน่วยเพิ่มขึ้น 4% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น สูงสุด 5 ชั้น \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# เรียกพลัง: #L0# เทพกระบี่ปลาเค็มเพิ่มคุณสมบัติของการเรียกน้ำทุกตัวขึ้น $(8+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$%',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, saat pemakai menyerang, ia akan memanggil Magikarp untuk berenang menuju target musuh acak, menyebabkan unit tersebut menjadi [Ikan] selama 2 giliran; setiap 2 Magikarp yang dipanggil, Magikarp berikutnya akan berevolusi menjadi Gyarados, memberikan tambahan 300% kerusakan sihir dari pemakai ke barisan musuh dan menyebabkan kebingungan 30% pada musuh (efek ini dapat diaktifkan maksimal 2 kali). #F20# #F40##L10# Sentuhan Ikan: #L0# Tingkat serangan kritis dan tingkat menghindar berkurang sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Pemurnian Ikan Asin: #L0# Setiap kali efek abnormal pada pemakai dihilangkan, pemakai meningkatkan pengurangan kerusakan untuk dirinya sendiri dan dua unit acak lainnya sebesar 4%, bertahan selama 2 giliran, hingga maksimal 5 tumpukan \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Panggilan Kekuatan: #L0# Dewa Pedang Ikan Asin meningkatkan atribut semua summon air sebesar $(8+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$%',
		describe_ph = 'Sa labanan, kapag umatake ang nagsusuot, siya ay magpatawag ng Magikarp upang lumangoy patungo sa isang random na target na kalaban, na nagiging sanhi sa yunit na iyon na maging [Isda] sa loob ng 2 turn; sa bawat 2 Magikarp na natatawag, ang susunod na Magikarp ay mag-evolve bilang Gyarados, na nagdudulot ng dagdag na 300% magic damage mula sa nagsusuot papunta sa hanay ng kalaban at 30% na nagdudulot ng confusion sa kalaban (ang effect na ito ay maaaring ma-activate hanggang 2 beses). #F20# #F40##L10# Touch Fish: #L0# Mababa ang chance ng critical hit at evasion ng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Salt Fish Purification: #L0# Sa bawat beses na natatanggal ang abnormal effect ng nagsusuot, tataas ang damage reduction ng nagsusuot at dalawang random na yunit ng 4%, tumatagal ng 2 turn, hanggang sa 5 stacks \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Summon Power: #L0# Pinapataas ng Salt Sword God ang mga attribute ng lahat ng water summons ng $(8+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$%',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, apabila pemakai menyerang, dia akan memanggil Magikarp untuk berenang ke arah sasaran musuh secara rawak, menyebabkan unit tersebut menjadi [Ikan] selama 2 giliran; setiap 2 Magikarp yang dipanggil, Magikarp yang berikutnya akan berevolusi menjadi Gyarados, menyebabkan tambahan 300% kerosakan sihir pemakai ke barisan musuh dan 30% mengelirukan musuh (kesan ini boleh diaktifkan maksimum 2 kali). #F20# #F40##L10# Sentuhan Ikan: #L0# Kadar serangan kritikal dan kadar elak dikurangkan sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Penulenan Ikan Masin: #L0# Setiap kali kesan luar biasa pemakai dibersihkan, pemakai akan meningkatkan pengurangan kerosakan untuk dirinya dan dua unit rawak lain sebanyak 4%, bertahan selama 2 giliran, dengan maksimum 5 lapisan \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Panggilan Kuasa: #L0# Dewa Pedang Ikan Masin meningkatkan atribut semua summon air sebanyak $(8+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$%',
		describe = 'In battle, when the wearer attacks, he will summon Magikarp to swim towards a random enemy target, causing that unit to be [Fish] for 2 turns; for every 2 Magikarp summoned, the next Magikarp summoned will evolve into Gyarados, dealing an additional 300% magic damage from the wearer to the enemy row and causing 30% confusion to enemies (this effect can be triggered up to 2 times). #F20# #F40##L10# Fish Touch: #L0# Critical hit rate and dodge rate are reduced by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Salt Fish Purification: #L0# Each time the wearer\'s abnormal effect is dispelled, the wearer increases damage reduction for themselves and two other random units by 4%, lasting for 2 rounds, up to 5 stacks \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Summon Power: #L0# Salt Sword God increases the attributes of all water summons by $(8+skillLevel*0.8-0.8)$%',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {521031}
	},
	[52104] = {
		id = 52104,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, ba hiệp chính đầu tiên sẽ kích hoạt các hiệu ứng sau: #F10# #F40# Khi người đeo bị tấn công bởi các kỹ năng chủ động, anh ta sẽ phản công kẻ thù bằng đòn đánh thường. Cứ sau ba đòn phản công tích lũy sẽ tăng 60% phòng thủ vật lý trong 1 hiệp #F10# #F40# Khi kích hoạt hiệu ứng phản công trong trang bị này, có xác suất $(40+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (nó phải được kích hoạt lần đầu tiên bởi chủ sở hữu trang bị loại quỷ) để mời một đồng đội có một số hành động đặc biệt nhất định (hợp tác, phản công, tấn công phủ đầu) sử dụng các đòn tấn công thông thường để gây sát thương cho mục tiêu nguồn #F10# #F40# Mỗi khi người mặc tăng khả năng phòng thủ vật lý cơ bản lên 50%, anh ta có thể nhận được khiên sức khỏe $(14+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (gấp đôi số lượng khiên mà anh hùng loại quỷ có được). Nó không thể được xếp chồng lên nhau và tồn tại trong 2 hiệp (hiệu ứng này được kích hoạt hai lần trên toàn trường và số lần kích hoạt cho các nhân vật cơ học là +1). Nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội thì chỉ một trang bị có thể phát huy tác dụng.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, the first three main rounds will activate the following effects: #F10# #F40# When the wearer is attacked by active skills, they will counterattack the enemy with a normal strike. After every three accumulated counterattacks, physical defense increases by 60% for one round. #F10# #F40# When the counterattack effect in this equipment is triggered, there is a $(40+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% chance (it must be triggered first by the owner of the demon-type equipment) to invite a teammate with certain special actions (cooperate, counterattack, preemptive strike) to use normal attacks to deal damage to the source target. #F10# #F40# Each time the wearer increases their base physical defense by 50%, they receive a health shield equal to $(14+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (double the shield amount granted by demon-type heroes). It cannot stack and lasts for 2 rounds (this effect is triggered twice on the entire field and the number of activations for mechanical characters is +1). If there are multiple pieces of this equipment in the team, only one can take effect.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ รอบหลักสามรอบแรกจะเปิดใช้งานผลต่อไปนี้: #F10# #F40# เมื่อผู้สวมใส่ถูกโจมตีด้วยทักษะที่ใช้งาน จะตอบโต้ศัตรูด้วยการโจมตีปกติ ทุกครั้งที่สะสมการตอบโต้ครบสามครั้ง จะเพิ่มการป้องกันทางกายภาพขึ้น 60% เป็นเวลา 1 รอบ #F10# #F40# เมื่อเปิดใช้งานเอฟเฟกต์ตอบโต้ในอุปกรณ์ชิ้นนี้ จะมีโอกาส $(40+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (ต้องถูกเปิดใช้งานครั้งแรกโดยเจ้าของอุปกรณ์ประเภทปีศาจ) เพื่อเชิญเพื่อนร่วมทีมที่มีการกระทำพิเศษบางอย่าง (ร่วมมือ, ตอบโต้, โจมตีล่วงหน้า) ใช้การโจมตีปกติเพื่อสร้างความเสียหายต่อเป้าหมายต้นทาง #F10# #F40# ทุกครั้งที่ผู้สวมใส่เพิ่มการป้องกันทางกายภาพพื้นฐานขึ้น 50% จะได้รับโล่สุขภาพเท่ากับ $(14+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (สองเท่าของจำนวนโล่ที่ฮีโร่ประเภทปีศาจได้รับ) โล่นี้ไม่สามารถทับซ้อนกันได้และคงอยู่เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ (เอฟเฟกต์นี้ถูกเปิดใช้งานสองครั้งทั่วสนามและจำนวนครั้งการเปิดใช้งานสำหรับตัวละครกลไกเพิ่มขึ้น 1) หากมีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้นในทีม จะมีเพียงชิ้นเดียวเท่านั้นที่มีผล',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, tiga ronde utama pertama akan mengaktifkan efek berikut: #F10# #F40# Ketika pemakai diserang oleh skill aktif, ia akan melakukan serangan balik pada musuh dengan serangan biasa. Setiap tiga serangan balik yang terkumpul akan meningkatkan pertahanan fisik sebesar 60% selama satu ronde. #F10# #F40# Ketika efek serangan balik pada perlengkapan ini diaktifkan, ada peluang $(40+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (harus diaktifkan pertama kali oleh pemilik perlengkapan tipe iblis) untuk mengundang rekan tim dengan beberapa aksi khusus tertentu (berkerjasama, serangan balik, serangan pendahuluan) untuk menggunakan serangan biasa yang menyerang sumber target. #F10# #F40# Setiap kali pemakai meningkatkan pertahanan fisik dasar sebesar 50%, dia dapat memperoleh perisai kesehatan sebanyak $(14+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (dua kali lipat jumlah perisai yang diperoleh pahlawan tipe iblis). Perisai ini tidak dapat ditumpuk dan bertahan selama 2 ronde (efek ini diaktifkan dua kali di seluruh arena dan jumlah aktivasi untuk karakter mekanik adalah +1). Jika ada beberapa perlengkapan dalam tim, hanya satu perlengkapan yang bisa berfungsi.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang unang tatlong pangunahing round ay magpapagana ng mga sumusunod na epekto: #F10# #F40# Kapag ang nagsusuot ay inatake ng mga aktibong kasanayan, siya ay gaganti ng normal na pag-atake laban sa kalaban. Sa tuwing makakabuo ng tatlong counterattack, tataas ang pisikal na depensa ng 60% sa loob ng isang round. #F10# #F40# Kapag na-trigger ang epekto ng counterattack sa kagamitang ito, mayroong $(40+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% na tsansa (ito ay kailangang ma-trigger unang beses ng may-ari ng demon-type na kagamitan) upang anyayahan ang isang kasamahan sa koponan na may ilang partikular na espesyal na aksyon (cooperate, counterattack, preemptive attack) na gumamit ng normal na mga pag-atake upang makapinsala sa pinagmumulan ng target. #F10# #F40# Sa tuwing tataas ng suot ang pangunahing pisikal na depensa ng 50%, maaari siyang makatanggap ng health shield na $(14+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (doble ng dami ng shield na natatanggap ng demon-type na bayani). Hindi ito maaaring ma-stack at tatagal ng 2 round (ang epektong ito ay mai-trigger nang dalawang beses sa buong laban at ang bilang ng pag-trigger para sa mga mekanikal na karakter ay +1). Kung maraming kagamitan sa koponan, isang kagamitan lamang ang maaaring magkaroon ng epekto.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, tiga pusingan utama pertama akan mengaktifkan kesan berikut: #F10# #F40# Apabila pemakai diserang oleh kemahiran aktif, dia akan menyerang balas musuh dengan serangan biasa. Setiap tiga serangan balas terkumpul akan meningkatkan pertahanan fizikal sebanyak 60% selama satu pusingan. #F10# #F40# Apabila kesan serangan balas dalam peralatan ini diaktifkan, terdapat peluang $(40+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% (ia mesti diaktifkan pertama kali oleh pemilik peralatan jenis syaitan) untuk menjemput rakan sepasukan yang mempunyai beberapa tindakan khas tertentu (bekerjasama, serang balas, serang pendahuluan) menggunakan serangan biasa untuk menyebabkan kerosakan kepada sasaran sumber. #F10# #F40# Setiap kali pemakai meningkatkan pertahanan fizikal asas sebanyak 50%, dia boleh menerima perisai kesihatan sebanyak $(14+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (dua kali ganda jumlah perisai yang diperoleh wira jenis syaitan). Ia tidak boleh ditindih dan wujud selama 2 pusingan (kesan ini diaktifkan dua kali di seluruh medan dan bilangan pengaktifan untuk watak mekanikal adalah +1). Jika terdapat beberapa peralatan dalam pasukan, hanya satu peralatan boleh berfungsi.',
		describe = 'In battle, the first three main rounds will activate the following effects: #F10# #F40# When the wearer is attacked by active skills, they will counterattack the enemy with a normal strike. After every three accumulated counterattacks, physical defense increases by 60% for one round. #F10# #F40# When the counterattack effect in this equipment is triggered, there is a $(40+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% chance (it must be triggered first by the owner of the demon-type equipment) to invite a teammate with certain special actions (cooperate, counterattack, preemptive strike) to use normal attacks to deal damage to the source target. #F10# #F40# Each time the wearer increases their base physical defense by 50%, they receive a health shield equal to $(14+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% (double the shield amount granted by demon-type heroes). It cannot stack and lasts for 2 rounds (this effect is triggered twice on the entire field and the number of activations for mechanical characters is +1). If there are multiple pieces of this equipment in the team, only one can take effect.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {521041, 521042}
	},
	[52105] = {
		id = 52105,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, người đeo có thể triển khai #L10# [Bẫy ảo giác] #L0# ở lượt vào đầu tiên và khi chủ động tấn công. Bẫy này có thể được triển khai 5 lần trên chiến trường\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#[Bẫy ảo giác]#L0#: Bẫy này được kích hoạt trước khi kẻ địch tấn công người đeo. Có xác suất $(30+(skillLevel-1)*4)$% (gấp đôi xác suất khi được trang bị trang bị Ninja) để thêm #L10 cho kẻ tấn công. #Enchanted#L0# trong 1 hiệp và thêm #L10# vào kẻ địch xung quanh để kích nổ#L0#: Trước khi hành động, nó sẽ khiến người đeo $(40+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% sát thương bẫy tấn công ma thuật và xóa bỏ 1 hiệu ứng buff. Nó sẽ hết hạn sau khi được kích hoạt một lần. #F10# #F40# Nhận được #L10# sau khi tái chế #F40# Thiết bị hệ thống cơ khí đi kèm với #L10# Bảo vệ tiên tri #L0#: Trước khi kích hoạt #L10# [Bẫy ảo giác] #L0#, 10% máu tối đa của kẻ địch (tối đa không thể vượt quá 30% tổng số đòn tấn công kép của người đeo) ​​sẽ được chuyển thành lá chắn tướng cơ khí ngẫu nhiên ở hàng đầu của chính bạn.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, the wearer can deploy #L10# [Illusion Trap] #L0# on their first turn and when attacking proactively. This trap can be deployed 5 times on the battlefield. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#[Illusion Trap]#L0#: This trap activates before the enemy attacks the wearer. There is a $(30+(skillLevel-1)*4)$% chance (double the chance when equipped with Ninja equipment) to add #L10 to the attacker. #Enchanted#L0# for one turn and add #L10 to surrounding enemies to detonate#L0#: Before acting, it causes the wearer to take $(40+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% magic trap damage and removes one buff effect. It expires after triggering once. #F10# #F40# Gain #L10# after recycling #F40# Mechanical system device equipped with #L10# Prophetic Protection #L0#: Before activating #L10# [Illusion Trap] #L0#, 10% of the enemy\'s max HP (not exceeding 30% of the wearer\'s total dual attacks) will be converted into a mechanical shield randomly placed on your frontline hero.',
		describe_th = 'ในสนามรบ ผู้สวมใส่สามารถติดตั้ง #L10# [กับดักลวงตา] #L0# ในเทิร์นแรกและเมื่อโจมตีเชิงรุก กับดักนี้สามารถติดตั้งได้ 5 ครั้งบนสนามรบ \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#[กับดักลวงตา]#L0#: กับดักนี้จะทำงานก่อนที่ศัตรูจะโจมตีผู้สวมใส่ มีโอกาส $(30+(skillLevel-1)*4)$% (เป็นสองเท่าของโอกาสเมื่อสวมใส่อุปกรณ์นินจา) ที่จะเพิ่ม #L10 ให้กับผู้โจมตี #Enchanted#L0# เป็นหนึ่งเทิร์นและเพิ่ม #L10 ให้ศัตรูรอบข้างเพื่อระเบิด#L0#: ก่อนจะทำการกระทำ มันจะทำให้ผู้สวมใส่ได้รับความเสียหายจากกับดักเวทย์ $(40+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% และลบล้างบัพหนึ่งรายการ มันจะหมดอายุหลังจากถูกทริกเกอร์หนึ่งครั้ง #F10# #F40# ได้รับ #L10# หลังจากรีไซเคิล #F40# อุปกรณ์ระบบกลไกที่ติดตั้งด้วย #L10# การป้องกันล่วงหน้า #L0#: ก่อนจะเปิดใช้งาน #L10# [กับดักลวงตา] #L0# จะเปลี่ยน 10% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดศัตรู (ไม่เกิน 30% ของการโจมตีคู่ทั้งหมดของผู้สวมใส่) ให้กลายเป็นโล่กลไกลในแนวหน้าแบบสุ่มของฮีโร่ของคุณ',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, pemakai dapat memasang #L10# [Perangkap Ilusi] #L0# pada giliran pertama dan saat menyerang secara aktif. Perangkap ini dapat dipasang 5 kali di medan perang \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#[Perangkap Ilusi]#L0#: Perangkap ini aktif sebelum musuh menyerang pemakai. Ada peluang $(30+(skillLevel-1)*4)$% (dua kali lipat peluang saat dilengkapi dengan perlengkapan Ninja) untuk menambahkan #L10 pada penyerang. #Enchanted#L0# selama satu giliran dan menambahkan #L10 pada musuh di sekitar untuk meledakkan#L0#: Sebelum bertindak, perangkap ini menyebabkan pemakai menerima $(40+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% kerusakan perangkap sihir dan menghapus satu efek buff. Perangkap ini akan kadaluwarsa setelah dipicu sekali. #F10# #F40# Mendapatkan #L10# setelah mendaur ulang #F40# Perangkat sistem mekanik yang dilengkapi dengan #L10# Perlindungan Ramalan #L0#: Sebelum mengaktifkan #L10# [Perangkap Ilusi] #L0#, 10% dari HP maksimal musuh (tidak melebihi 30% dari total serangan ganda pemakai) akan diubah menjadi perisai mekanik yang dipasang secara acak di garis depan pahlawan Anda.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa panahon ng laban, maaaring mag-deploy ng tagasuot ng #L10# [Illusion Trap] #L0# sa unang turn at kapag aktibong umaatake. Maaaring ma-deploy ang trap na ito ng 5 beses sa battlefield \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#[Illusion Trap]#L0#: Ang trap na ito ay nag-a-activate bago atakehin ng kalaban ang tagasuot. Mayroong $(30+(skillLevel-1)*4)$% na tsansa (doble ng tsansa kapag may suot na Ninja equipment) na magdagdag ng #L10 sa umaatake. #Enchanted#L0# sa loob ng isang turn at magdagdag ng #L10 sa mga kalaban sa paligid para mag-trigger ng pagsabog#L0#: Bago gawin ang aksyon, magdudulot ito sa tagasuot ng $(40+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% magic trap damage at tatanggalin ang isang buff effect. Mag-e-expire ito pagkatapos ma-trigger ng isang beses. #F10# #F40# Makakakuha ng #L10 pagkatapos ma-recycle ang #F40# Mechanical system device na may kasamang #L10# Prophetic Protection #L0#: Bago i-activate ang #L10# [Illusion Trap] #L0#, 10% ng max HP ng kalaban (hindi lalampas sa 30% ng kabuuang dual attacks ng tagasuot) ay iko-convert bilang mechanical shield na random na inilalagay sa frontline ng iyong bayani.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, pemakai boleh mengatur #L10# [Perangkap Ilusi] #L0# pada pusingan pertama dan ketika menyerang secara aktif. Perangkap ini boleh digunakan 5 kali di medan pertempuran \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#[Perangkap Ilusi]#L0#: Perangkap ini akan aktif sebelum musuh menyerang pemakai. Terdapat peluang $(30+(skillLevel-1)*4)$% (dua kali ganda peluang apabila memakai peralatan Ninja) untuk menambah #L10 pada penyerang. #Enchanted#L0# selama satu pusingan dan menambah #L10 pada musuh sekeliling bagi mencetuskan letupan#L0#: Sebelum bertindak, ia menyebabkan pemakai menerima $(40+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% kerosakan perangkap sihir dan membuang 1 efek buff. Ia akan tamat selepas dicetuskan sekali. #F10# #F40# Mendapat #L10# selepas mengitar semula #F40# Peranti sistem mekanikal yang dilengkapi dengan #L10# Perlindungan Ramalan #L0#: Sebelum mengaktifkan #L10# [Perangkap Ilusi] #L0#, 10% daripada HP maks musuh (tidak melebihi 30% jumlah serangan berganda pemakai) akan ditukar menjadi perisai mekanikal rawak di barisan hadapan wira anda.',
		describe = 'In battle, the wearer can deploy #L10# [Illusion Trap] #L0# on their first turn and when attacking proactively. This trap can be deployed 5 times on the battlefield. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#[Illusion Trap]#L0#: This trap activates before the enemy attacks the wearer. There is a $(30+(skillLevel-1)*4)$% chance (double the chance when equipped with Ninja equipment) to add #L10 to the attacker. #Enchanted#L0# for one turn and add #L10 to surrounding enemies to detonate#L0#: Before acting, it causes the wearer to take $(40+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% magic trap damage and removes one buff effect. It expires after triggering once. #F10# #F40# Gain #L10# after recycling #F40# Mechanical system device equipped with #L10# Prophetic Protection #L0#: Before activating #L10# [Illusion Trap] #L0#, 10% of the enemy\'s max HP (not exceeding 30% of the wearer\'s total dual attacks) will be converted into a mechanical shield randomly placed on your frontline hero.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {521051}
	},
	[52106] = {
		id = 52106,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, tăng $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% sát thương kỹ năng toàn khu vực và $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% sát thương nước và lửa toàn khu vực. Đồng đội có cùng thuộc tính với người mặc sẽ nhận được 40% tiền thưởng (không áp dụng được)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Kích nổ nguyên tố: #L0#Nếu đơn vị địch phải chịu 2 sát thương thuộc tính nguyên tố trở lên, 10% của tất cả thuộc tính sẽ được thêm vào điểm yếu và phát nổ, gây sát thương nguyên tố bằng 80% Sát Thương Phép Thuật của người đeo (hạ nhiệt trong 1 hiệp sau kích hoạt, thuộc tính tự nhiên của người đeo đáp ứng yêu cầu sát thương nguyên tố để kích hoạt, xem hướng dẫn chiến đấu để biết chi tiết)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Đánh bom thứ hai: #L0# Mỗi khi đội của bạn sử dụng kỹ năng toàn diện 3 lần (bao gồm các hành động phụ và hành động pháo đài, không bao gồm hành động triệu hồi), nó sẽ gây sát thương nguyên tố bằng 200% Sát Thương Phép Thuật của người dùng lên tất cả kẻ thù (có thể kích hoạt 2 lần trên toàn khu vực). Nếu có nhiều trang bị trong đội thì chỉ có hai trang bị có tác dụng.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, increase AoE skill damage by $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% and AoE Hydro and Pyro damage by $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%. Teammates sharing the wearer\'s element receive a 40% bonus (not applicable).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Elemental Detonation: #L0#If an enemy unit takes damage from 2 or more elemental types, 10% of all elemental attributes will be added to weaknesses and detonate, dealing elemental damage equal to 80% of the wearer\'s Magic Damage (cooldown 1 turn after activation; the wearer\'s innate element meets the requirement of elemental damage to activate; see combat guide for details).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Second Explosion: #L0# Each time your team uses 3 AoE skills (including auxiliary actions and fortress actions, excluding summon actions), it triggers elemental damage equal to 200% of the user\'s Magic Damage to all enemies (can trigger twice per AoE). If there are multiple equipments in the team, only two will have effects.',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ เพิ่มความเสียหายสกิล AoE ขึ้น $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% และความเสียหายธาตุน้ำและธาตุไฟ AoE ขึ้น $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$% เพื่อนร่วมทีมที่มีธาตุเดียวกับผู้สวมใส่จะได้รับโบนัส 40% (ไม่สามารถใช้ได้)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#การระเบิดธาตุ: #L0#หากศัตรูได้รับความเสียหายจากธาตุมากกว่า 2 ธาตุขึ้นไป จะเพิ่ม 10% ของทุกธาตุเข้าสู่จุดอ่อนและระเบิด สร้างความเสียหายธาตุเท่ากับ 80% ของพลังเวทของผู้สวมใส่ (คูลดาวน์ 1 เทิร์นหลังใช้งาน; ธาตุธรรมชาติของผู้สวมใส่ตรงตามเงื่อนไขความเสียหายธาตุเพื่อเปิดใช้งาน; ดูรายละเอียดในคู่มือการต่อสู้)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#การระเบิดครั้งที่สอง: #L0#ทุกครั้งที่ทีมของคุณใช้สกิล AoE ครบ 3 ครั้ง (รวมถึงการกระทำเสริมและการกระทำป้อมปราการ ไม่รวมการเรียกสัตว์) จะทำให้เกิดความเสียหายธาตุเท่ากับ 200% ของพลังเวทของผู้ใช้กับศัตรูทั้งหมด (สามารถเปิดใช้งานได้ 2 ครั้งต่อ AoE) หากในทีมมีอุปกรณ์หลายชิ้น มีเพียง 2 ชิ้นเท่านั้นที่มีผล',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, tingkatkan damage skill AoE sebesar $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan damage elemen Hydro dan Pyro AoE sebesar $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%. Rekan tim dengan elemen yang sama dengan pemakai akan menerima bonus 40% (tidak berlaku).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Detonasi Elemen: #L0#Jika unit musuh menerima damage dari 2 atau lebih elemen, 10% dari semua atribut elemen akan ditambahkan ke kelemahan dan meledak, menyebabkan damage elemen sebesar 80% dari Magic Damage pemakai (cooldown 1 giliran setelah aktif; elemen alami pemakai memenuhi syarat untuk aktivasi; lihat panduan bertarung untuk detail).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Ledakan Kedua: #L0# Setiap kali timmu menggunakan 3 skill AoE (termasuk aksi tambahan dan aksi benteng, tidak termasuk aksi summon), akan menyebabkan damage elemen sebesar 200% Magic Damage pengguna ke semua musuh (bisa aktif 2 kali per AoE). Jika ada beberapa perlengkapan dalam tim, hanya dua yang berpengaruh.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa panahon ng laban, dagdagan ang AoE skill damage ng $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% at AoE Hydro at Pyro damage ng $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%. Makakatanggap ang mga ka-team na may parehong elemento ng suot ng 40% na bonus (hindi nalalapat).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Elemental Detonation: #L0#Kung ang isang kalaban ay makakatanggap ng damage mula sa 2 o higit pang elemental na uri, idaragdag ang 10% ng lahat ng elemental attributes sa kahinaan at magdudulot ng pagsabog, na nagdudulot ng elemental damage na katumbas ng 80% ng Magic Damage ng nagsusuot (cooldown ng 1 turn pagkatapos ma-activate; ang likas na elemento ng nagsusuot ay kailangan upang ma-activate; tingnan ang combat guide para sa detalye).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Ikalawang Pagsabog: #L0# Tuwing gagamit ang iyong koponan ng 3 AoE skills (kasama ang auxiliary at fortress actions, hindi kasama ang summon actions), magdudulot ito ng elemental damage na katumbas ng 200% ng Magic Damage ng gumagamit sa lahat ng kaaway (maaaring mag-activate ng 2 beses kada AoE). Kung maraming kagamitan sa koponan, dalawang kagamitan lang ang magkakaroon ng epekto.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, tingkatkan kerosakan kemahiran AoE sebanyak $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan kerosakan elemen Air dan Api AoE sebanyak $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%. Rakan sepasukan yang berkongsi elemen dengan pemakai akan menerima bonus 40% (tidak terpakai).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Letupan Elemen: #L0# Jika musuh menerima kerosakan dari 2 atau lebih jenis elemen, 10% daripada semua atribut elemen akan ditambah ke kelemahan dan meletup, menyebabkan kerosakan elemen bersamaan 80% Kerosakan Sihir pemakai (masa sejuk 1 pusingan selepas diaktifkan; elemen semula jadi pemakai memenuhi syarat kerosakan elemen untuk diaktifkan; lihat panduan pertarungan untuk maklumat lanjut).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Letupan Kedua: #L0# Setiap kali pasukan anda menggunakan kemahiran AoE sebanyak 3 kali (termasuk tindakan sampingan dan tindakan kubu, tidak termasuk tindakan summon), ia akan menyebabkan kerosakan elemen bersamaan 200% Kerosakan Sihir pengguna ke semua musuh (boleh diaktifkan 2 kali setiap AoE). Jika terdapat beberapa peralatan dalam pasukan, hanya dua peralatan sahaja yang berkesan.',
		describe = 'In battle, increase AoE skill damage by $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% and AoE Hydro and Pyro damage by $(30+(skillLevel-1)*3)$%. Teammates sharing the wearer\'s element receive a 40% bonus (not applicable).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Elemental Detonation: #L0#If an enemy unit takes damage from 2 or more elemental types, 10% of all elemental attributes will be added to weaknesses and detonate, dealing elemental damage equal to 80% of the wearer\'s Magic Damage (cooldown 1 turn after activation; the wearer\'s innate element meets the requirement of elemental damage to activate; see combat guide for details).\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Second Explosion: #L0# Each time your team uses 3 AoE skills (including auxiliary actions and fortress actions, excluding summon actions), it triggers elemental damage equal to 200% of the user\'s Magic Damage to all enemies (can trigger twice per AoE). If there are multiple equipments in the team, only two will have effects.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {521061}
	},
	[52107] = {
		id = 52107,
		skillName_vn = 'Đạo cụ mang theo',
		skillName_en = 'Carried prop',
		skillName_th = 'อุปกรณ์ที่พกติดตัว',
		skillName_in = 'Properti yang dibawa',
		skillName_ph = 'Dinadala na gamit',
		skillName_ma = 'Alatan dibawa',
		skillName = 'Carried prop',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, người đeo nhận được hiệu ứng [Thức tỉnh bóng tối]: sau khi hồi sinh, giới hạn trên về lượng máu cơ bản của bản thân và đồng đội có đòn tấn công cao nhất sẽ tăng vĩnh viễn 15% trong 2 lượt. Nếu đồng đội thuộc loại ma, sát thương cộng thêm sẽ tăng thêm 20% trong 2 lượt\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Spirit of the Realm: #L0# Tăng tỷ lệ chí mạng của tướng của bạn ở trạng thái [Tàng hình] thêm $(15+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Soul Sonata: #L0# Bản tình ca đầu tiên hai kỹ năng chủ động được người vận chuyển sử dụng trong mỗi vòng sẽ thêm hiệu ứng [Dark Note] cho mục tiêu chính trong phạm vi tấn công trong 2 hiệp: hiệu ứng tiêu cực, giảm mục tiêu $(20+(skill lLevel-1)*2)$% tốc độ hồi phục cơn thịnh nộ và $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% tiền thưởng sát thương. Khi hiệu ứng kết thúc, cơn thịnh nộ của mục tiêu sẽ giảm đi $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$ điểm. #F10# #F40#Nếu đội mang theo nhiều hơn một, chỉ một có hiệu lực.',
		describe_en = 'In battle, the wearer receives the effect [Dark Awakening]: after revival, the upper limit of the base HP of themselves and the teammate with the highest attack will permanently increase by 15% for 2 turns. If the teammate is of demon type, additional damage will increase by 20% for 2 turns. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Spirit of the Realm: #L0# Increases the critical rate of your generals in [Invisible] state by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Soul Sonata: #L0# The first two active skills used by the carrier each round will add the effect [Dark Note] to the main target within attack range for 2 turns: negative effect, reducing the target\'s rage recovery speed by $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% and bonus damage by $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. When the effect ends, the target\'s rage will decrease by $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$ points. #F10# #F40#If the team carries more than one, only one takes effect.',
		describe_th = 'ในสนามรบ ผู้สวมใส่จะได้รับเอฟเฟกต์ [การตื่นรู้แห่งความมืด]: หลังฟื้นคืนชีพ ขีดจำกัดสูงสุดของพลังชีวิตพื้นฐานของตนเองและเพื่อนร่วมทีมที่มีการโจมตีสูงสุดจะเพิ่มขึ้นถาวร 15% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น หากเพื่อนร่วมทีมเป็นประเภทปีศาจ ความเสียหายเพิ่มเติมจะเพิ่มขึ้น 20% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# วิญญาณแห่งดินแดน: #L0# เพิ่มอัตราคริติคอลของนายทัพของคุณในสถานะ [ล่องหน] เพิ่ม $(15+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# โซล โซนาต้า: #L0# สกิลแอคทีฟสองสกิลแรกที่คนถือใช้ในแต่ละรอบจะเพิ่มเอฟเฟกต์ [โน้ตมืด] ให้กับเป้าหมายหลักในระยะโจมตีเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น: เอฟเฟกต์ลบ ลดความเร็วการฟื้นฟูความโกรธของเป้าหมาย $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% และโบนัสความเสียหาย $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$% เมื่อเอฟเฟกต์สิ้นสุดลง ความโกรธของเป้าหมายจะลดลง $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$ แต้ม #F10# #F40#ถ้าทีมมีมากกว่าหนึ่ง จะมีผลเพียงอันเดียว',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertempuran, pemakai menerima efek [Kebangkitan Gelap]: setelah bangkit kembali, batas atas dari jumlah HP dasar dirinya dan rekan satu tim dengan serangan tertinggi akan meningkat secara permanen sebesar 15% selama 2 giliran. Jika rekan satu tim bertipe iblis, tambahan kerusakan akan meningkat sebesar 20% selama 2 giliran \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Spirit of the Realm: #L0# Meningkatkan tingkat kritis jenderal Anda dalam keadaan [Menyamar] sebesar $(15+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Soul Sonata: #L0# Dua skill aktif pertama yang digunakan oleh pembawa setiap ronde akan menambahkan efek [Dark Note] pada target utama dalam jangkauan serangan selama 2 giliran: efek negatif, mengurangi kecepatan pemulihan amarah target sebesar $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan bonus kerusakan sebesar $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Saat efek berakhir, amarah target akan berkurang sebanyak $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$ poin. #F10# #F40#Jika tim membawa lebih dari satu, hanya satu yang berlaku.',
		describe_ph = 'Sa panahon ng laban, ang nagsusuot ay tumatanggap ng epekto na [Pagmulat ng Kadiliman]: pagkatapos mabuhay muli, ang pinakamataas na limitasyon ng pangunahing HP ng sarili at ng kasamang may pinakamataas na atake ay permanenteng tataas ng 15% sa loob ng 2 turn. Kung ang kasamahan ay uri ng demonyo, ang karagdagang pinsala ay tataas ng 20% sa loob ng 2 turn \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Spirit of the Realm: #L0# Pinapataas ang kritikal na tsansa ng iyong mga heneral sa estado ng [Nagtatago] ng $(15+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Soul Sonata: #L0# Ang unang dalawang aktibong kasanayan na ginamit ng tagadala bawat round ay magdadagdag ng epekto na [Dark Note] sa pangunahing target sa saklaw ng atake ng 2 turn: negatibong epekto, nagpapababa ng bilis ng pagbawi ng galit ng target ng $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% at bonus na pinsala ng $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Kapag natapos ang epekto, ang galit ng target ay bababa ng $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$ puntos. #F10# #F40#Kung ang koponan ay may higit sa isa, isa lamang ang epektibo.',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, pemakai menerima kesan [Kebangkitan Kegelapan]: selepas kebangkitan, had atas jumlah darah asas diri sendiri dan rakan sepasukan dengan serangan tertinggi akan meningkat kekal sebanyak 15% selama 2 pusingan. Jika rakan sepasukan jenis syaitan, kerosakan tambahan akan meningkat sebanyak 20% selama 2 pusingan \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Roh Alam: #L0# Meningkatkan kadar kritikal panglima anda dalam keadaan [Hilang] sebanyak $(15+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Sonata Jiwa: #L0# Dua kemahiran aktif pertama yang digunakan oleh pembawa dalam setiap pusingan akan menambah kesan [Nota Gelap] pada sasaran utama dalam lingkungan serangan selama 2 pusingan: kesan negatif, mengurangkan kadar pemulihan kemarahan sasaran sebanyak $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% dan bonus kerosakan sebanyak $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. Apabila kesan tamat, kemarahan sasaran akan dikurangkan sebanyak $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$ mata. #F10# #F40#Jika pasukan membawa lebih dari satu, hanya satu yang berkuat kuasa.',
		describe = 'In battle, the wearer receives the effect [Dark Awakening]: after revival, the upper limit of the base HP of themselves and the teammate with the highest attack will permanently increase by 15% for 2 turns. If the teammate is of demon type, additional damage will increase by 20% for 2 turns. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Spirit of the Realm: #L0# Increases the critical rate of your generals in [Invisible] state by $(15+(skillLevel-1)*2)$%. \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Soul Sonata: #L0# The first two active skills used by the carrier each round will add the effect [Dark Note] to the main target within attack range for 2 turns: negative effect, reducing the target\'s rage recovery speed by $(20+(skillLevel-1)*2)$% and bonus damage by $(12+(skillLevel-1)*1.5)$%. When the effect ends, the target\'s rage will decrease by $(24+(skillLevel-1)*3)$ points. #F10# #F40#If the team carries more than one, only one takes effect.',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
		passiveTriggerType = 7,
		posChoose = 5,
		skillProcess = {521071}
	},
	[52108] = {
		id = 52108,
		skillName_vn = 'Mang theo đạo cụ',
		skillName_en = 'Carry props',
		skillName_th = 'พกอุปกรณ์',
		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, đòn tấn công sẽ phải chịu thêm 50% sát thương nguyên tố độc của Sát Thương Phép Thuật. Nếu người mặc thuộc loại ma/độc, một lớp [Độc] bổ sung sẽ được thêm vào mục tiêu chính (xem kỹ năng Flash Super Gengar để biết chi tiết)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Chaos attack: #L0# Sau khi người mặc tung ra chiêu thức đặc biệt hoặc kỹ năng nhỏ đầu tiên, nó sẽ hấp thụ $(150+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ điểm tức giận từ mục tiêu chính (nếu người mặc nằm trong hai người đứng đầu) vị trí về phía mình, hấp thụ thêm 200 cơn thịnh nộ) và thêm hiệu ứng [chất độc thị giác] trong 1 hiệp (xem kỹ năng Flash Super Gengar để biết chi tiết)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Magic Cube Xoay vòng: #L0# Khi cơn giận tích lũy mà trại của bạn hấp thụ đạt 800 điểm, chủ sở hữu trang bị sẽ đạt được trạng thái [Shadow Hidden] trong 1 hiệp (xem kỹ năng Flash Super Gengar để biết chi tiết, được kích hoạt 2 lần trong toàn bộ vòng field) #F10# #F40# (Chỉ một trong nhiều trang bị có hiệu lực)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, attacks will suffer an additional 50% elemental poison damage from Magical Damage. If the wearer is of demon/poison type, an additional [Poison] layer will be applied to the main target (see Flash Super Gengar skill for details) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Chaos attack: #L0# After the wearer uses a special move or the first small skill, it will absorb $(150+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ rage points from the main target (if the wearer is among the top two), pulling the target closer, absorbing an additional 200 rage points, and adding the [visual poison] effect for 1 turn (see Flash Super Gengar skill for details) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Magic Cube Rotation: #L0# When your camp absorbs 800 rage points, the equipment owner will gain the [Shadow Hidden] state for 1 turn (see Flash Super Gengar skill for details, can be activated twice during the entire field round) #F10# #F40# (Only one piece of equipment is effective among many)',
		describe_th = 'ในสนามรบ การโจมตีจะได้รับความเสียหายธาตุพิษเพิ่มขึ้นอีก 50% จากความเสียหายเวทมนตร์ หากผู้สวมใส่เป็นประเภทปีศาจ/พิษ จะมีชั้น [พิษ] เสริมเพิ่มไปยังเป้าหมายหลัก (ดูรายละเอียดที่สกิล Flash Super Gengar) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#การโจมตีแห่งความอลหม่าน: #L0# หลังจากผู้สวมใส่ใช้ท่าไม้ตายหรือสกิลเล็กครั้งแรก จะดูดพลังโกรธ $(150+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ จากเป้าหมายหลัก (ถ้าผู้สวมอยู่ในสองอันดับแรก) ดึงเป้าหมายเข้าหาตัว พร้อมดูดพลังโกรธเพิ่มอีก 200 และเพิ่มเอฟเฟกต์ [พิษทางสายตา] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (ดูรายละเอียดที่สกิล Flash Super Gengar) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#ลูกบาศก์เวทหมุน: #L0# เมื่อค่ายของคุณสะสมพลังโกรธได้ 800 แต้ม เจ้าของอุปกรณ์จะได้รับสถานะ [ซ่อนเงา] เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น (ดูรายละเอียดที่สกิล Flash Super Gengar, เปิดใช้งานได้สองครั้งในสนาม) #F10# #F40# (อุปกรณ์ชิ้นเดียวเท่านั้นที่จะมีผล)',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, serangan akan menanggung tambahan 50% kerusakan elemen racun dari Magical Damage. Jika pemakai adalah tipe iblis/racun, sebuah lapisan [Racun] tambahan akan diterapkan pada target utama (lihat skill Flash Super Gengar untuk detail) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Serangan Chaos: #L0# Setelah pemakai melancarkan gerakan khusus atau skill kecil pertama, ia akan menyerap $(150+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ poin kemarahan dari target utama (jika pemakai berada di dua posisi teratas), menarik target ke arahnya, menyerap tambahan 200 kemarahan dan menambahkan efek [racun visual] selama 1 giliran (lihat skill Flash Super Gengar untuk detail) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Rotasi Magic Cube: #L0# Ketika kamp Anda menyerap 800 poin kemarahan, pemilik peralatan akan mendapatkan status [Shadow Hidden] selama 1 giliran (lihat skill Flash Super Gengar untuk detail, dapat diaktifkan 2 kali selama seluruh ronde field) #F10# #F40# (Hanya satu dari banyak peralatan yang efektif)',
		describe_ph = 'Sa labanan, ang pag-atake ay tatanggap ng karagdagang 50% elemental na lasong pinsala mula sa Magical Damage. Kung ang nagsusuot ay uri ng demonyo/lason, isang karagdagang [Poison] layer ang idaragdag sa pangunahing target (tingnan ang skill na Flash Super Gengar para sa mga detalye) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Chaos attack: #L0# Pagkatapos gamitin ng nagsusuot ang espesyal na galaw o unang maliit na kasanayan, ito ay sumisipsip ng $(150+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ puntos ng galit mula sa pangunahing target (kung ang nagsusuot ay nasa nangungunang dalawang posisyon), hinihikayat ang target na lumapit, sumisipsip ng karagdagang 200 galit at nagdaragdag ng epekto na [visual poison] sa loob ng 1 turn (tingnan ang skill na Flash Super Gengar para sa mga detalye) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Magic Cube Paikot: #L0# Kapag ang inyong kampo ay nakasipsip ng 800 puntos ng galit, ang tagapagmay-ari ng kagamitan ay makakamit ang estado ng [Shadow Hidden] sa loob ng 1 turn (tingnan ang skill na Flash Super Gengar para sa mga detalye, maaaring ma-activate nang dalawang beses sa buong field round) #F10# #F40# (Isa lamang sa maraming kagamitan ang aktibo)',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, serangan akan menanggung tambahan 50% kerosakan elemen racun daripada Magical Damage. Jika pemakai adalah jenis syaitan/racun, satu lapisan [Racun] tambahan akan ditambah ke sasaran utama (rujuk kemahiran Flash Super Gengar untuk butiran) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Serangan Chaos: #L0# Selepas pemakai melancarkan gerakan khas atau kemahiran kecil pertama, ia akan menyerap $(150+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ mata kemarahan daripada sasaran utama (jika pemakai berada dalam dua kedudukan teratas), menarik sasaran ke arahnya, menyerap tambahan 200 kemarahan dan menambah kesan [racun visual] selama 1 pusingan (rujuk kemahiran Flash Super Gengar untuk butiran) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Putaran Magic Cube: #L0# Apabila kem tentera anda menyerap 800 mata kemarahan, pemilik peralatan akan mendapat keadaan [Shadow Hidden] selama 1 pusingan (rujuk kemahiran Flash Super Gengar untuk butiran, boleh diaktifkan 2 kali sepanjang pusingan medan) #F10# #F40# (Hanya satu antara banyak peralatan yang berkuatkuasa)',
		describe = 'In battle, attacks will suffer an additional 50% elemental poison damage from Magical Damage. If the wearer is of demon/poison type, an additional [Poison] layer will be applied to the main target (see Flash Super Gengar skill for details) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Chaos attack: #L0# After the wearer uses a special move or the first small skill, it will absorb $(150+(skillLevel-1)*15)$ rage points from the main target (if the wearer is among the top two), pulling the target closer, absorbing an additional 200 rage points, and adding the [visual poison] effect for 1 turn (see Flash Super Gengar skill for details) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Magic Cube Rotation: #L0# When your camp absorbs 800 rage points, the equipment owner will gain the [Shadow Hidden] state for 1 turn (see Flash Super Gengar skill for details, can be activated twice during the entire field round) #F10# #F40# (Only one piece of equipment is effective among many)',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
		skillType = 3,
