		skillName_in = 'Membawa properti',
		skillName_ph = 'Magdala ng mga props',
		skillName_ma = 'Membawa alat',
		skillName = 'Carry props',
		describe_vn = 'Trong trận chiến, sát thương kết hợp tăng thêm $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$%. Sát thương của mỗi đòn tấn công thông thường của chủ sở hữu trang bị loại chiến đấu trong một hiệp lớn tăng thêm 10% (giới hạn trên: 30%)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10#Chém liên tục: #L0#Mỗi đòn tấn công chủ động có 100% xác suất thực hiện combo với đòn tấn công thông thường. Mỗi lần nó được kích hoạt, xác suất tiếp theo giảm đi một nửa (kích hoạt 3 lần trên toàn sân)\n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Ba thanh kiếm liên tiếp: #L0# Nếu người chơi trang bị hệ nước đạt được 3 đòn tấn công cơ bản trong một hiệp, nó sẽ ngay lập tức gây sát thương $(60+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% phép thuật tấn công nguyên tố nước lên mục tiêu chính và môi trường xung quanh (kích hoạt 3 lần trên toàn sân)',
		describe_en = 'In battle, combined damage increases by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$%. Damage from each normal attack of the equipment owner in a major round increases by 10% (cap: 30%). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Continuous Slash: #L0# Each active attack has a 100% chance to perform a combo with a normal attack. Each time it activates, the next chance is halved (activates 3 times per arena). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Three consecutive swords: #L0# If a player equipped with the Water element lands 3 basic attacks in one round, it immediately deals $(60+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% elemental Water magic damage to the main target and surrounding environment (activates 3 times per arena).',
		describe_th = 'ในการต่อสู้ ความเสียหายรวมเพิ่มขึ้น $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$% ความเสียหายจากการโจมตีปกติแต่ละครั้งของผู้ครอบครองอุปกรณ์ในรอบใหญ่จะเพิ่มขึ้น 10% (สูงสุด: 30%) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# ฟันอย่างต่อเนื่อง: #L0# การโจมตีแบบแอคทีฟแต่ละครั้งมีโอกาส 100% ที่จะทำคอมโบกับการโจมตีปกติ แต่ละครั้งที่เปิดใช้งาน โอกาสครั้งต่อไปจะลดลงครึ่งหนึ่ง (เปิดใช้งาน 3 ครั้งในสนามทั้งหมด) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# ดาบสามเล่มติดต่อกัน: #L0# หากผู้เล่นที่สวมใส่ธาตุน้ำทำการโจมตีเบื้องต้น 3 ครั้งในรอบเดียว จะสร้างความเสียหายเวทน้ำธาตุ $(60+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% แก่เป้าหมายหลักและสภาพแวดล้อมรอบข้างทันที (เปิดใช้งาน 3 ครั้งในสนามทั้งหมด)',
		describe_in = 'Dalam pertarungan, damage gabungan meningkat sebesar $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$%. Damage dari setiap serangan normal pemilik peralatan dalam satu ronde besar meningkat 10% (batas atas: 30%) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Serangan Beruntun: #L0# Setiap serangan aktif memiliki peluang 100% untuk melakukan combo dengan serangan normal. Setiap kali diaktifkan, peluang berikutnya berkurang setengah (aktif 3 kali di seluruh arena). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tiga Pedang Berturut-turut: #L0# Jika pemain yang dilengkapi unsur Air melakukan 3 serangan dasar dalam satu ronde, segera memberikan damage sihir elemen Air sebesar $(60+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% kepada target utama dan lingkungan sekitar (aktif 3 kali di arena).',
		describe_ph = 'Sa laban, ang pinagsamang pinsala ay tumataas ng $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$%. Ang pinsala ng bawat normal na atake ng may-ari ng kagamitan sa isang malaking yugto ay tumataas ng 10% (pinakamataas na limitasyon: 30%) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tuloy-tuloy na Pagsuntok: #L0# Bawat aktibong pag-atake ay may 100% na pagkakataon na magsagawa ng combo sa isang normal na pag-atake. Sa bawat activation, ang susunod na pagkakataon ay mababawasan sa kalahati (active ng 3 beses sa buong arena). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tatlong sunod-sunod na espada: #L0# Kung ang manlalaro na may suot na elementong Tubig ay makapagsagawa ng 3 pangunahing pag-atake sa isang yugto, agad nitong gagawin ang $(60+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% na elementong magic damage ng Tubig sa pangunahing target at kapaligiran (active ng 3 beses sa buong arena).',
		describe_ma = 'Dalam pertempuran, kerosakan gabungan meningkat sebanyak $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$%. Kerosakan daripada setiap serangan biasa pemilik peralatan dalam satu pusingan besar meningkat sebanyak 10% (had atas: 30%) \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tebasan Berterusan: #L0# Setiap serangan aktif mempunyai peluang 100% untuk melaksanakan kombo dengan serangan biasa. Setiap kali ia diaktifkan, peluang seterusnya berkurangan separuh (diaktifkan 3 kali dalam arena). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Tiga Pedang Berturut-turut: #L0# Jika pemain yang dilengkapi unsur Air mencapai 3 serangan asas dalam satu pusingan, ia akan segera menyebabkan kerosakan sihir elemen Air sebanyak $(60+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% kepada sasaran utama dan persekitaran sekitar (diaktifkan 3 kali dalam arena).',
		describe = 'In battle, combined damage increases by $(10+(skillLevel-1)*1)$%. Damage from each normal attack of the equipment owner in a major round increases by 10% (cap: 30%). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Continuous Slash: #L0# Each active attack has a 100% chance to perform a combo with a normal attack. Each time it activates, the next chance is halved (activates 3 times per arena). \n#F10# \n#F40##L10# Three consecutive swords: #L0# If a player equipped with the Water element lands 3 basic attacks in one round, it immediately deals $(60+(skillLevel-1)*5)$% elemental Water magic damage to the main target and surrounding environment (activates 3 times per arena).',
		alwaysEffective = true,
		passivePriority = 3,
