		skillName_in = 'Pasif',
		skillName_ph = 'Passive',
		skillName_ma = 'Pasif',
		skillName = 'Passive',
		describe_vn = 'Khi Giratio bước vào hiện trường, anh ta sẽ nhận được số lượng hồn ma của các anh hùng trong trại của mình ngoài chính mình (giới hạn trên của số lượng ma: 5 điểm, không thể xua tan hoặc bỏ qua), và mỗi hồn ma có thể giảm số lượng hồn ma của mình #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B# Sát thương cuối cùng nhận được sẽ giảm 1 hồn ma mỗi khi trúng đòn. Khi bóng ma giảm đi, 80 điểm thịnh nộ sẽ được phục hồi\n#F20# \n#F40#Khi bắt đầu mỗi vòng lớn, bạn và anh hùng có phần trăm máu thấp nhất ở hàng sau trong đội của bạn sẽ nhận được [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: lượng khiên bằng 15% máu tối đa của Giratina. , không thể chồng lên, mục tiêu tấn công khiên ma sẽ yếu: đòn tấn công kép giảm 15% trong 2 lượt); khi chuyển sang dạng gốc, 30% lượng HP đã mất có thể được phục hồi (không bị ảnh hưởng bởi phương pháp điều trị bị cấm) và bản thân sẽ không tái sinh khi tấn công ở dạng gốc.',
		describe_en = 'When Giratio enters the battlefield, he will receive a number of phantoms of the heroes in his camp excluding himself (maximum phantom limit: 5 points, cannot be dispelled or ignored), and each phantom can reduce his own number of phantoms by #C0x5c9970#$(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. The final damage received will reduce one phantom each time he is hit. When a phantom is lost, 80 rage points will be restored \n#F20# \n#F40#. At the start of each major round, you and the hero with the lowest health percentage in the back row of your team will receive [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: a shield equal to 15% of Giratio\'s maximum health, cannot be stacked, the target attacking the ghost shield will be weakened: dual attacks reduced by 15% for 2 turns); when switching to original form, 30% of lost HP can be recovered (not affected by banned healing methods) and Giratio will not resurrect when attacking in original form.',
		describe_th = 'เมื่อ Giratio เข้าสู่สนามรบ เขาจะได้รับจำนวนภูตผีของฮีโร่ในค่ายของเขายกเว้นตัวเอง (จำกัดสูงสุดของภูตผี: 5 ตัว ไม่สามารถขจัดหรือมองข้ามได้) และภูตผีแต่ละตัวจะลดจำนวนภูตผีของตัวเองได้ #C0x5c9970#$(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)$%#C0x5B545B# ความเสียหายสุดท้ายที่ได้รับจะลดภูตผีหนึ่งตัวทุกครั้งที่ถูกโจมตี เมื่อภูตผีลดลง จะฟื้นฟูความโกรธ 80 คะแนน \n#F20# \n#F40# เมื่อเริ่มรอบใหญ่แต่ละครั้ง คุณและฮีโร่ที่มีเปอร์เซ็นต์พลังชีวิตต่ำที่สุดในแถวหลังของทีมจะได้รับ [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: โล่เท่ากับ 15% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของ Giratio ไม่สามารถซ้อนทับได้ เป้าหมายที่โจมตีโล่ผีจะถูกทำให้ลดความรุนแรง: การโจมตีคู่ลดลง 15% เป็นเวลา 2 รอบ); เมื่่อแปลงร่างกลับสู่รูปแบบเดิม ฟื้นฟู HP ที่เสียไป 30% (ไม่ถูกผลกระทบจากวิธีการรักษาที่ถูกแบน) และตัวเองจะไม่เกิดใหม่เมื่อตีในรูปแบบเดิม',
		describe_in = 'Ketika Giratio memasuki medan pertempuran, dia akan menerima sejumlah hantu para pahlawan di perkemahannya selain dirinya sendiri (batas maksimal jumlah hantu: 5 poin, tidak dapat dibersihkan atau diabaikan), dan setiap hantu dapat mengurangi jumlah hantunya sendiri sebesar #C0x5c9970#$(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. Kerusakan terakhir yang diterima akan mengurangi satu hantu setiap kali terkena serangan. Ketika hantu berkurang, 80 poin kemarahan akan dipulihkan \n#F20# \n#F40#. Pada awal setiap ronde besar, kamu dan pahlawan dengan persentase HP terendah di barisan belakang timmu akan menerima [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: sebuah perisai sebesar 15% dari HP maksimum Giratio, tidak dapat bertumpuk, target yang menyerang perisai hantu akan melemah: serangan ganda berkurang 15% selama 2 giliran); saat beralih ke bentuk asli, 30% HP yang hilang dapat dipulihkan (tidak terpengaruh oleh metode penyembuhan yang dilarang) dan dirinya tidak akan bangkit kembali saat menyerang dalam bentuk asli.',
		describe_ph = 'Kapag pumasok si Giratio sa battlefield, makakatanggap siya ng bilang ng mga multo ng mga bayani sa kanyang kampo maliban sa kanyang sarili (sobra-sobrang limit ng mga multo: 5 puntos, hindi maaaring alisin o balewalain), at bawat multo ay maaaring bawasan ang kanyang sariling bilang ng mga multo ng #C0x5c9970#$(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. Ang huling natanggap na pinsala ay magbabawas ng isang multo tuwing siya ay tamaan. Kapag nabawas ang multo, 80 puntos ng galit ang mare-recover \n#F20# \n#F40#. Sa simula ng bawat malaking round, ikaw at ang bayani na may pinakamababang porsyento ng HP sa likurang hanay ng iyong koponan ay makakatanggap ng [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: isang shield na katumbas ng 15% ng maximum HP ni Giratio, hindi pwedeng i-stack, ang target na tumatama sa ghost shield ay humihina: ang double attack ay nababawasan ng 15% sa loob ng 2 rounds); kapag lumipat sa orihinal na anyo, 30% ng nawalang HP ay maaaring maibalik (hindi naaapektuhan ng mga ipinagbabawal na paraan ng paggaling) at hindi siya muling babangon kapag umaatake sa orihinal na anyo.',
		describe_ma = 'Apabila Giratio memasuki medan pertempuran, dia akan menerima bilangan hantu wira-wira dalam kemahnya selain dirinya sendiri (had atas bilangan hantu: 5 titik, tidak boleh dibersihkan atau diabaikan), dan setiap hantu boleh mengurangkan jumlah hantunya sendiri sebanyak #C0x5c9970#$(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. Kerosakan akhir yang diterima akan mengurangkan satu hantu setiap kali terkena serangan. Apabila hantu berkurangan, 80 mata kemarahan akan dipulihkan \n#F20# \n#F40#. Pada permulaan setiap pusingan besar, kamu dan wira dengan peratusan darah paling rendah di barisan belakang dalam pasukan kamu akan menerima [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: perisai bersamaan 15% darah maksimum Giratio, tidak boleh bertindih, sasaran yang menyerang perisai hantu akan dilemahkan: serangan berganda dikurangkan sebanyak 15% selama 2 pusingan); apabila bertukar kepada bentuk asal, 30% daripada HP yang hilang boleh dipulihkan (tidak terjejas oleh kaedah rawatan yang diharamkan) dan dia tidak akan hidup semula apabila menyerang dalam bentuk asal.',
		describe = 'When Giratio enters the battlefield, he will receive a number of phantoms of the heroes in his camp excluding himself (maximum phantom limit: 5 points, cannot be dispelled or ignored), and each phantom can reduce his own number of phantoms by #C0x5c9970#$(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. The final damage received will reduce one phantom each time he is hit. When a phantom is lost, 80 rage points will be restored \n#F20# \n#F40#. At the start of each major round, you and the hero with the lowest health percentage in the back row of your team will receive [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: a shield equal to 15% of Giratio\'s maximum health, cannot be stacked, the target attacking the ghost shield will be weakened: dual attacks reduced by 15% for 2 turns); when switching to original form, 30% of lost HP can be recovered (not affected by banned healing methods) and Giratio will not resurrect when attacking in original form.',
