		skillName = 'Passive',
		describe_vn = 'Khi Giratio bước vào hiện trường, anh ta sẽ nhận được số lượng hồn ma của các anh hùng trong trại của mình ngoài chính mình (giới hạn trên của số lượng ma: 5 điểm, không thể xua tan hoặc bỏ qua), và mỗi hồn ma có thể giảm số lượng hồn ma của mình #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B# Sát thương cuối cùng nhận được sẽ giảm 1 hồn ma mỗi khi trúng đòn. Khi bóng ma giảm đi, 80 điểm thịnh nộ sẽ được phục hồi\n#F20# \n#F40#Khi bắt đầu mỗi vòng lớn, bạn và anh hùng có phần trăm máu thấp nhất ở hàng sau trong đội của bạn sẽ nhận được [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: lượng khiên bằng 15% máu tối đa của Giratina. , không thể chồng lên, mục tiêu tấn công khiên ma sẽ yếu: đòn tấn công kép giảm 15% trong 2 lượt); khi chuyển sang dạng gốc, 30% lượng HP đã mất có thể được phục hồi (không bị ảnh hưởng bởi phương pháp điều trị bị cấm) và bản thân sẽ không tái sinh khi tấn công ở dạng gốc.',
		describe_en = 'When Giratio enters the battlefield, he will receive the number of spirits of the heroes in his camp besides himself (maximum limit of spirits: 5, cannot be dispelled or ignored), and each spirit can reduce the number of his own spirits by #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. The final damage received will reduce one spirit each time he is hit. When spirits decrease, 80 rage points will be restored \n#F20# \n#F40#. At the beginning of each major round, you and the hero with the lowest percentage HP in the back row of your team will receive [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: a shield equal to 15% of Giratina\'s maximum HP, cannot stack, targets attacking the ghost shield will be weakened: double attacks reduced by 15% for 2 turns); when switching to original form, 30% of lost HP can be restored (not affected by forbidden healing methods) and he will not resurrect when attacking in original form.',
		describe_th = 'เมื่อ Giratio เข้าสู่สนามรบ เขาจะได้รับจำนวนวิญญาณของฮีโร่ในค่ายของเขานอกเหนือจากตัวเขาเอง (จำกัดสูงสุดของวิญญาณ: 5 ไม่สามารถขจัดหรือมองข้ามได้) และวิญญาณแต่ละดวงสามารถลดจำนวนวิญญาณของเขาเองได้ #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. ความเสียหายสุดท้ายที่ได้รับจะลดวิญญาณหนึ่งดวงทุกครั้งที่ถูกโจมตี เมื่อวิญญาณลดลง จะฟื้นฟู 80 คะแนนความโกรธ \n#F20# \n#F40#. ในช่วงเริ่มต้นของแต่ละรอบใหญ่ คุณและฮีโร่ที่มีเปอร์เซ็นต์ HP ต่ำที่สุดในแถวหลังของทีมจะได้รับ [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: โล่เท่ากับ 15% ของ HP สูงสุดของ Giratina, ไม่สามารถซ้อนกันได้, เป้าหมายที่โจมตีโล่มารจะอ่อนแอลง: การโจมตีคู่ลดลง 15% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น); เมื่อเปลี่ยนเป็นรูปแบบดั้งเดิม จะสามารถฟื้นฟู HP ที่สูญเสียไป 30% (ไม่ถูกผลกระทบจากวิธีการรักษาที่ถูกห้าม) และเขาจะไม่ฟื้นคืนชีพเมื่อโจมตีในรูปแบบดั้งเดิม',
		describe_in = 'Saat Giratio memasuki medan perang, dia akan menerima jumlah roh para pahlawan di perkemahannya selain dirinya sendiri (batas maksimum roh: 5, tidak dapat dihapus atau diabaikan), dan setiap roh dapat mengurangi jumlah rohnya sendiri sebesar #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. Kerusakan akhir yang diterima akan mengurangi satu roh setiap kali terkena serangan. Saat roh berkurang, 80 poin kemarahan akan dipulihkan \n#F20# \n#F40#. Pada awal setiap putaran besar, kamu dan pahlawan dengan persentase HP terendah di barisan belakang timmu akan menerima [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: perisai sebesar 15% dari HP maksimum Giratina, tidak dapat menumpuk, target yang menyerang perisai roh akan melemah: serangan ganda berkurang 15% selama 2 giliran); saat beralih ke bentuk asli, 30% dari HP yang hilang dapat dipulihkan (tidak terpengaruh oleh metode penyembuhan terlarang) dan dia tidak akan bangkit kembali saat menyerang dalam bentuk asli.',
		describe_ph = 'Kapag pumasok si Giratio sa battlefield, tatanggap siya ng bilang ng mga espiritu ng mga bayani sa kampo niya maliban sa kanyang sarili (maximum na limit ng espiritu: 5, hindi maaaring matanggal o balewalain), at bawat espiritu ay maaaring bawasan ang bilang ng sarili niyang mga espiritu ng #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. Ang huling natanggap na damage ay magbabawas ng isang espiritu tuwing tatamaan. Kapag bumaba ang espiritu, 80 rage points ang maibabalik \n#F20# \n#F40#. Sa simula ng bawat malaking round, ikaw at ang bayani na may pinakamababang porsyento ng HP sa back row ng iyong team ay tatanggap ng [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: shield na katumbas ng 15% ng maximum HP ni Giratina, hindi pwedeng ipatong, ang target na tutugon sa ghost shield ay magiging mahina: double attacks ay mababawasan ng 15% sa loob ng 2 turns); kapag lumipat sa orihinal na anyo, 30% ng nawalang HP ay maaaring mabawi (hindi apektado ng mga ipinagbabawal na paraan ng pagpapagaling) at hindi siya muling mabubuhay kapag umaatake sa orihinal na anyo.',
		describe_ma = 'Apabila Giratio memasuki medan pertempuran, dia akan menerima bilangan roh hero dalam kemahnya selain dirinya sendiri (had maksimum roh: 5, tidak boleh dihilangkan atau diabaikan), dan setiap roh boleh mengurangkan bilangan roh dirinya sendiri sebanyak #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. Kerosakan akhir diterima akan mengurangkan satu roh setiap kali terkena serangan. Apabila roh berkurangan, 80 mata kemarahan akan dipulihkan \n#F20# \n#F40#. Pada permulaan setiap pusingan besar, awak dan hero dengan peratusan HP terendah di barisan belakang dalam pasukan awak akan menerima [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: perisai bersamaan 15% HP maksimum Giratina, tidak boleh bertindih, sasaran melawan perisai hantu akan menjadi lemah: serangan berganda berkurang 15% selama 2 pusingan); apabila beralih ke bentuk asal, 30% daripada HP yang hilang boleh dipulihkan (tidak terjejas oleh kaedah rawatan terlarang) dan dirinya tidak akan bangkit semula apabila menyerang dalam bentuk asal.',
		describe = 'When Giratio enters the battlefield, he will receive the number of spirits of the heroes in his camp besides himself (maximum limit of spirits: 5, cannot be dispelled or ignored), and each spirit can reduce the number of his own spirits by #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B#. The final damage received will reduce one spirit each time he is hit. When spirits decrease, 80 rage points will be restored \n#F20# \n#F40#. At the beginning of each major round, you and the hero with the lowest percentage HP in the back row of your team will receive [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: a shield equal to 15% of Giratina\'s maximum HP, cannot stack, targets attacking the ghost shield will be weakened: double attacks reduced by 15% for 2 turns); when switching to original form, 30% of lost HP can be restored (not affected by forbidden healing methods) and he will not resurrect when attacking in original form.',
		starEffect = __data_t__starEffect[210327],
		-- {8}
		starEffectDesc_vn = 'Hiệu ứng Quỷ khiên nâng cấp: tăng 5% lượng khiên, mỗi lượt lớn kết thúc bản thân nhận 1 điểm Quỷ ảnh',
		starEffectDesc = 'Demon Shield Upgrade Effect: increases shield amount by 5%, at the end of each big turn, gain 1 Demon Shadow point',
		starEffectDesc_en = 'Demon Shield Upgrade Effect: increases shield amount by 5%, at the end of each big turn, gain 1 Demon Shadow point',
		starEffectDesc_th = 'เอฟเฟกต์การอัปเกรดโล่ปีศาจ: เพิ่มปริมาณโล่ 5% เมื่อสิ้นสุดแต่ละเทิร์นใหญ่ รับ 1 คะแนนเงาปีศาจ',
		starEffectDesc_in = 'Efek Peningkatan Perisai Setan: meningkatkan jumlah perisai sebesar 5%, pada akhir setiap giliran besar, menerima 1 poin Bayangan Setan',
		starEffectDesc_ph = 'Epekto ng Pag-upgrade ng Demon Shield: nagdaragdag ng 5% sa dami ng shield, sa pagtatapos ng bawat malaking turn ay tumatanggap ng 1 Demon Shadow point',
		starEffectDesc_ma = 'Kesan Naik Taraf Perisai Iblis: meningkatkan jumlah perisai sebanyak 5%, pada akhir setiap giliran besar, menerima 1 mata Bayangan Iblis',
		changeUnitTrigger = true,
		skillType = 3,
		skillType2 = 3,
