		describe_vn = 'Khi Giratio bước vào hiện trường, anh ta sẽ nhận được số lượng hồn ma của các anh hùng trong trại của mình ngoài chính mình (giới hạn trên của số lượng ma: 5 điểm, không thể xua tan hoặc bỏ qua), và mỗi hồn ma có thể giảm số lượng hồn ma của mình #C0x5c9970#$(4+s killLevel*0.04-0.04)$%#C0x5B545B# Sát thương cuối cùng nhận được sẽ giảm 1 hồn ma mỗi khi trúng đòn. Khi bóng ma giảm đi, 80 điểm thịnh nộ sẽ được phục hồi\n#F20# \n#F40#Khi bắt đầu mỗi vòng lớn, bạn và anh hùng có phần trăm máu thấp nhất ở hàng sau trong đội của bạn sẽ nhận được [#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#] ([#L10#Ghost Shield#L0#]: lượng khiên bằng 15% máu tối đa của Giratina. , không thể chồng lên, mục tiêu tấn công khiên ma sẽ yếu: đòn tấn công kép giảm 15% trong 2 lượt); khi chuyển sang dạng gốc, 30% lượng HP đã mất có thể được phục hồi (không bị ảnh hưởng bởi phương pháp điều trị bị cấm) và bản thân sẽ không tái sinh khi tấn công ở dạng gốc.',
		describe_en = 'When Giratio enters the battlefield, he will receive the number of ghosts of the heroes in his camp excluding himself (maximum ghost count: 5, cannot be dispelled or ignored), and each ghost can reduce his own ghost count by #(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)%#. The final damage received will reduce one ghost each time he takes a hit. When the ghosts decrease, 80 rage points will be restored. At the start of each major round, you and the hero with the lowest health percentage in the back row of your team will receive [Ghost Shield] (Ghost Shield: shield amount equal to 15% of Giratio\'s max HP, cannot stack, targets hit by the ghost shield are weakened: double strikes deal 15% less damage for 2 turns). When switching to the original form, 30% of the lost HP can be recovered (not affected by banned healing methods) and the user will not resurrect when attacking in original form.',
		describe_th = 'เมื่อ Giratio เข้าสู่สนามรบ เขาจะได้รับจำนวนผีของฮีโร่ในค่ายของเขานอกจากตัวเอง (จำนวนผีสูงสุด: 5 ตัว ไม่สามารถขจัดหรือมองข้ามได้) และผีแต่ละตัวสามารถลดจำนวนผีของเขาเองลงโดย #(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)%#. ความเสียหายสุดท้ายที่ได้รับจะลดผี 1 ตัวทุกครั้งที่ถูกโจมตี เมื่อผีลดลงจะได้รับการฟื้นฟู 80 คะแนนความโกรธ ต้นทุกครั้งที่เริ่มรอบใหญ่ คุณและฮีโร่ที่มีเปอร์เซ็นต์เลือดต่ำที่สุดในแถวหลังของทีมจะได้รับ [โล่ผี] (โล่ผี: เกราะเท่ากับ 15% ของพลังชีวิตสูงสุดของ Giratio ไม่สามารถซ้อนกันได้ เป้าหมายที่ถูกโจมตีโดยโล่ผีจะอ่อนแอลง: โจมตีสองครั้งลดลง 15% เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น) เมื่อตัวละครเปลี่ยนเป็นรูปแบบเดิมจะฟื้นฟู HP ที่เสียไป 30% (ไม่ถูกผลกระทบจากวิธีการรักษาที่ถูกห้าม) และตัวเองจะไม่ฟื้นคืนชีพเมื่อต่อสู้ในรูปแบบเดิม',
		describe_in = 'Saat Giratio memasuki medan perang, dia akan menerima jumlah roh para pahlawan di perkemahannya selain dirinya sendiri (batas atas jumlah roh: 5, tidak dapat disingkirkan atau diabaikan), dan setiap roh dapat mengurangi jumlah rohnya sendiri sebanyak #(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)%#. Kerusakan akhir yang diterima akan mengurangi satu roh setiap kali terkena serangan. Ketika jumlah roh berkurang, 80 poin amarah akan dipulihkan. Pada awal setiap babak besar, kamu dan pahlawan dengan persentase HP terendah di barisan belakang timmu akan menerima [Perisai Hantu] (Perisai Hantu: jumlah perisai sama dengan 15% HP maksimum Giratio, tidak dapat ditumpuk, target yang diserang oleh perisai hantu akan melemah: serangan ganda berkurang 15% selama 2 giliran). Saat beralih ke bentuk asli, 30% HP yang hilang dapat dipulihkan (tidak terpengaruh oleh metode penyembuhan terlarang) dan dia tidak akan bangkit kembali saat menyerang dalam bentuk asli.',
		describe_ph = 'Kapag pumasok si Giratio sa larangan ng digmaan, matatanggap niya ang bilang ng mga multo ng mga bayani sa kanyang kampo maliban sa kanyang sarili (pinakamataas na bilang ng multo: 5, hindi maaaring tanggalin o balewalain), at bawat multo ay maaaring bawasan ang kanyang sariling bilang ng mga multo ng #(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)%#. Ang huling natanggap na pinsala ay magbabawas ng isang multo sa tuwing matatamaan. Kapag nababawasan ang mga multo, mababawi ang 80 puntos ng galit. Sa simula ng bawat malaking round, ikaw at ang bayani na may pinakamababang porsyento ng HP sa likurang hanay ng iyong koponan ay makakatanggap ng [Ghost Shield] (Ghost Shield: halaga ng kalasag na katumbas ng 15% ng maximum na HP ni Giratio, hindi maaaring mag-stacking, ang target na tinamaan ng ghost shield ay mahina: doble ang pag-atake ay bumababa ng 15% sa loob ng 2 turn). Kapag lumipat sa orihinal na anyo, maaaring maibalik ang 30% ng nawalang HP (hindi naapektuhan ng ipinagbabawal na paraan ng paggamot) at hindi siya muling mabubuhay kapag umaatake sa orihinal na anyo.',
		describe_ma = 'Apabila Giratio memasuki medan pertempuran, dia akan menerima jumlah roh hantu wira di kemahnya selain dirinya sendiri (had atas jumlah hantu: 5, tidak boleh dihapus atau diabaikan), dan setiap roh hantu boleh mengurangkan jumlah roh hantu dirinya sebanyak #(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)%#. Kerosakan terakhir diterima akan mengurangkan satu roh hantu setiap kali terkena serangan. Apabila roh hantu berkurangan, 80 mata kemarahan akan dipulihkan. Pada permulaan setiap pusingan besar, anda dan wira dengan peratusan kesihatan terendah di barisan belakang pasukan anda akan menerima [Perisai Hantu] (Perisai Hantu: jumlah perisai sama dengan 15% kesihatan maksimum Giratio, tidak boleh bertindih, sasaran yang diserang dengan perisai hantu akan menjadi lemah: serangan berganda dikurangkan 15% selama 2 pusingan). Apabila bertukar ke bentuk asal, 30% jumlah HP yang hilang boleh dipulihkan (tidak terkesan oleh kaedah rawatan yang dilarang) dan dia tidak akan bangkit semula apabila menyerang dalam bentuk asal.',
		describe = 'When Giratio enters the battlefield, he will receive the number of ghosts of the heroes in his camp excluding himself (maximum ghost count: 5, cannot be dispelled or ignored), and each ghost can reduce his own ghost count by #(4 + s killLevel * 0.04 - 0.04)%#. The final damage received will reduce one ghost each time he takes a hit. When the ghosts decrease, 80 rage points will be restored. At the start of each major round, you and the hero with the lowest health percentage in the back row of your team will receive [Ghost Shield] (Ghost Shield: shield amount equal to 15% of Giratio\'s max HP, cannot stack, targets hit by the ghost shield are weakened: double strikes deal 15% less damage for 2 turns). When switching to the original form, 30% of the lost HP can be recovered (not affected by banned healing methods) and the user will not resurrect when attacking in original form.',
