		skillName_ma = 'Tanah Kematian',
		skillName = 'Land of Death',
		describe_vn = 'Trường tử thần của Skeleton Lich King hoàn toàn mở, triệu hồi một trận bão tuyết gây ra lượng lớn #C0xF13B54# sát thương phép #C0x5B545B# cho tất cả mục tiêu địch và có xác suất 80%-100% khiến mục tiêu rơi vào [Ngủ] trong 2 hiệp và thôi miên mục tiêu có sức tấn công cao nhất trong 3 hiệp.',
		describe_en = 'The Death Field of the Skeleton Lich King fully opens, summoning a blizzard that deals massive #C0xF13B54# magic damage #C0x5B545B# to all enemy targets and has an 80%-100% chance to put targets into [Sleep] for 2 turns and hypnotizes the enemy with the highest attack for 3 turns.',
		describe_th = 'สนามมรณะของ Skeleton Lich King เปิดเต็มที่ เรียกพายุหิมะที่สร้างความเสียหายเวทมนตร์จำนวนมาก #C0xF13B54# #C0x5B545B# แก่เป้าหมายศัตรูทั้งหมด และมีโอกาส 80%-100% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมายติดสถานะ [หลับ] เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น และสะกดจิตเป้าหมายที่มีพลังโจมตีสูงสุดเป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Lapangan Kematian Skeleton Lich King sepenuhnya terbuka, memanggil badai salju yang menyebabkan kerusakan sihir besar #C0xF13B54# #C0x5B545B# kepada semua target musuh dan memiliki peluang 80%-100% untuk membuat target tertidur [Sleep] selama 2 giliran serta menghipnotis musuh dengan serangan tertinggi selama 3 giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Ganap na nagbukas ang Death Field ng Skeleton Lich King, na nag-summon ng bagyong niyebe na nagdudulot ng malaking #C0xF13B54# magic damage #C0x5B545B# sa lahat ng mga kaaway na target at may 80%-100% na tsansa na mapatulog ang target sa [Sleep] sa loob ng 2 turn at mahipnotismo ang target na may pinakamataas na atake sa loob ng 3 turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Medan Kematian Skeleton Lich King terbuka sepenuhnya, memanggil ribut salji yang menyebabkan kerosakan sihir besar #C0xF13B54# #C0x5B545B# kepada semua sasaran musuh dan memiliki peluang 80%-100% untuk menyebabkan sasaran tertidur [Sleep] selama 2 pusingan serta menghipnotis sasaran dengan serangan tertinggi selama 3 pusingan.',
		describe = 'The Death Field of the Skeleton Lich King fully opens, summoning a blizzard that deals massive #C0xF13B54# magic damage #C0x5B545B# to all enemy targets and has an 80%-100% chance to put targets into [Sleep] for 2 turns and hypnotizes the enemy with the highest attack for 3 turns.',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
