		skillName_ma = 'Memadamkan Api Dunia',
		skillName = 'Extinguish the World Flame',
		describe_vn = 'Dark Serpent xoắn sức mạnh bóng tối và phóng ra ngọn lửa hủy diệt thế giới để nuốt chửng tất cả mục tiêu của kẻ địch, gây ra một lượng lớn #C0xF13B54# sát thương phép #C0x5B545B#, đồng thời có xác suất 30%-70% khiến mục tiêu rơi vào trạng thái [Sợ hãi] trong 3 lượt (Sợ hãi: Giảm đòn tấn công của mục tiêu bằng phòng thủ của nó), sức tấn công càng thấp thì xác suất sợ hãi càng cao. Mục tiêu ở hàng sau có thêm 30% xác suất. Hiệu ứng sợ hãi có thể được xua tan. Nếu bạn đang trong trạng thái tức giận hoàn toàn trước khi bắt đầu lượt của mình, nỗi sợ hãi sẽ tự động bị xua tan). Khi Dark Serpent tung ra chiêu thức đặc biệt của mình hai lần, mỗi lần tung chiêu thức đặc biệt của mình, nó sẽ thêm 1 lớp [đầu độc] cho tất cả kẻ thù.',
		describe_en = 'Dark Serpent coils the power of darkness and unleashes a world-destroying flame to engulf all enemy targets, dealing a large amount of #C0xF13B54# magic damage #C0x5B545B#. It also has a 30%-70% chance to cause targets to fall into a [Fear] state for 3 turns (Fear: Reduces the target\'s attack by its defense). The lower the attack power, the higher the probability of fear. Targets in the back row have an additional 30% chance. Fear effects can be dispelled. If you are in a full rage state before starting your turn, fear will be automatically dispelled. When Dark Serpent unleashes its special move twice, each special move will add 1 stack of [Poison] to all enemies.',
		describe_th = 'Dark Serpent ม้วนพลังแห่งความมืดและปล่อยเปลวไฟทำลายล้างโลกเพือกลืนเป้าหมายศัตรูทั้งหมด ก่อให้เกิดความเสียหายเวทมนตร์จำนวนมาก #C0xF13B54# #C0x5B545B# พร้อมกับมีโอกาส 30%-70% ที่จะทำให้เป้าหมายตกอยู่ในสถานะ [กลัว] เป็นเวลา 3 ตา (กลัว: ลดพลังโจมตีของเป้าหมายโดยใช้พลังป้องกันของมัน) เมื่อพลังโจมตียิ่งต่ำ โอกาสเกิดสถานะกลัวยิ่งสูง เป้าหมายแถวหลังจะมีโอกาสเพิ่มขึ้น 30% สถานะกลัวสามารถถูกขจัดได้ หากคุณอยู่ในสถานะโกรธเต็มที่ก่อนเริ่มรอบของคุณ ความกลัวจะถูกขจัดโดยอัตโนมัติ เมื่อ Dark Serpent ใช้ท่าสกิลพิเศษสองครั้ง แต่ละครั้งจะเพิ่ม 1 เลเยอร์ [พิษ] ให้กับศัตรูทั้งหมด',
		describe_in = 'Dark Serpent menggulung kekuatan kegelapan dan meluncurkan api penghancur dunia untuk menelan semua target musuh, menyebabkan kerusakan sihir besar #C0xF13B54# #C0x5B545B#. Ini juga memiliki peluang 30%-70% untuk membuat target masuk ke status [Takut] selama 3 giliran (Takut: Mengurangi serangan target berdasarkan pertahanannya). Semakin rendah serangan, semakin tinggi kemungkinan takut. Target di barisan belakang mendapatkan tambahan peluang 30%. Efek takut dapat dihapus. Jika Anda berada dalam keadaan marah penuh sebelum giliran dimulai, takut akan otomatis hilang. Ketika Dark Serpent meluncurkan teknik spesialnya dua kali, setiap penggunaan teknik spesial akan menambahkan 1 lapisan [Racun] ke semua musuh.',
		describe_ph = 'Dark Serpent ayusin ang kapangyarihan ng kadiliman at magpapalabas ng apoy na sumisira sa mundo upang lamunin ang lahat ng target ng kalaban, na nagdudulot ng malaking #C0xF13B54# magic damage #C0x5B545B#. Mayroon din itong 30%-70% na tsansa na maipapasok ang target sa estado ng [Takot] sa loob ng 3 turn (Takot: Binabawasan ang atake ng target gamit ang depensa nito). Mas mababa ang atake, mas mataas ang tsansa ng takot. Ang mga target sa likurang hanay ay may karagdagang 30% na tsansa. Ang epekto ng takot ay maaaring ma-disperse. Kung ikaw ay ganap na galit bago magsimula ang iyong turn, ang takot ay awtomatikong mawawala. Kapag dalawang beses ginamit ni Dark Serpent ang espesyal na galaw nito, bawat paggamit ng espesyal na galaw ay magdadagdag ng 1 layer ng [Pagkalason] sa lahat ng mga kalaban.',
		describe_ma = 'Dark Serpent menggulung kekuatan kegelapan dan melepaskan api pemusnah dunia untuk menelan semua sasaran musuh, menyebabkan kerosakan sihir yang besar #C0xF13B54# #C0x5B545B#. Ia juga mempunyai kebarangkalian 30%-70% untuk menyebabkan sasaran jatuh ke dalam keadaan [Takut] selama 3 pusingan (Takut: Mengurangkan serangan sasaran berdasarkan pertahanannya). Semakin rendah serangan, semakin tinggi kebarangkalian takut. Sasaran di barisan belakang mendapat tambahan 30% kebarangkalian. Kesan takut boleh dibersihkan. Jika anda berada dalam keadaan marah sepenuhnya sebelum memulakan pusingan anda, takut akan hilang secara automatik. Apabila Dark Serpent menggunakan teknik khasnya dua kali, setiap kali menggunakan teknik khas itu, ia akan menambah 1 lapisan [Racun] kepada semua musuh.',
		describe = 'Dark Serpent coils the power of darkness and unleashes a world-destroying flame to engulf all enemy targets, dealing a large amount of #C0xF13B54# magic damage #C0x5B545B#. It also has a 30%-70% chance to cause targets to fall into a [Fear] state for 3 turns (Fear: Reduces the target\'s attack by its defense). The lower the attack power, the higher the probability of fear. Targets in the back row have an additional 30% chance. Fear effects can be dispelled. If you are in a full rage state before starting your turn, fear will be automatically dispelled. When Dark Serpent unleashes its special move twice, each special move will add 1 stack of [Poison] to all enemies.',
		iconRes = 'ICON/skill/skill/001gqs_skill2.png',
		skillType2 = 2,
		skillDamageType = 1,
		skillNatureType = 16,
		posChoose = 5,
