		skillName_ma = 'Lempar ke bumi',
		skillName = 'Throw down to earth',
		describe_vn = 'Ném đơn vị kẻ địch lên không trung, gây #C0x3D8A99#150% Phép Công#C0x5B545B#+$( skillLevel *24)$ sát thương #C0x8A5C99#phép thuật#C0x5B545B#, và thêm hiệu ứng đốt cháy (hiệu ứng đốt cháy có thể cộng dồn tối đa 5 tầng, mỗi tầng gây #C0x3D8A99#50% Phép Công#C0x5B545B# sát thương thực, kéo dài 2 lượt), đồng thời giảm 10% phòng thủ vật lý và pháp lý của mục tiêu, kéo dài 1 lượt',
		describe_en = 'Throw the enemy unit into the air, dealing #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B# + $( skillLevel *24)$ #C0x8A5C99#magic#C0x5B545B# damage, and applying a burn effect (burn effect can stack up to 5 layers, each layer deals #C0x3D8A99#50% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B# true damage, lasting 2 turns), while reducing the target\'s physical and magical defense by 10%, lasting 1 turn.',
		describe_th = 'ขว้างหน่วยศัตรูขึ้นสู่อากาศ สร้างความเสียหาย #C0x3D8A99#150% พลังโจมตีเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# + $( skillLevel *24)$ #C0x8A5C99#เวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# และเพิ่มเอฟเฟกต์ไฟเผา (เอฟเฟกต์ไฟเผาสะสมได้สูงสุด 5 ชั้น แต่ละชั้นสร้างความเสียหายจริง #C0x3D8A99#50% พลังโจมตีเวทมนตร์#C0x5B545B# เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น) พร้อมลดพลังป้องกันกายภาพและเวทมนตร์ของเป้าหมายลง 10% เป็นเวลา 1 เทิร์น',
		describe_in = 'Melempar unit musuh ke udara, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#150% Serangan Sihir#C0x5B545B# + $( skillLevel *24)$ kerusakan #C0x8A5C99#sihir#C0x5B545B#, dan menambahkan efek terbakar (efek terbakar dapat menumpuk hingga 5 tumpukan, setiap tumpukan memberikan #C0x3D8A99#50% Serangan Sihir#C0x5B545B# damage nyata, berlangsung selama 2 giliran), serta mengurangi pertahanan fisik dan sihir target sebesar 10%, berlangsung selama 1 giliran.',
		describe_ph = 'Itapon ang yunit ng kalaban sa hangin, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B# + $( skillLevel *24)$ na #C0x8A5C99#magic#C0x5B545B# na pinsala, at nagdaragdag ng burn effect (ang burn effect ay maaaring maipon hanggang sa 5 na layer, bawat layer ay nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#50% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B# na totoong pinsala, tumatagal ng 2 turn), kasabay ng pagbawas ng 10% sa pisikal at mahikal na depensa ng target, tumatagal ng 1 turn.',
		describe_ma = 'Lempar unit musuh ke udara, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#150% Serangan Sihir#C0x5B545B# + $( skillLevel *24)$ kerosakan #C0x8A5C99#sihir#C0x5B545B#, dan menambah kesan terbakar (kesan terbakar boleh bertindih sehingga 5 lapisan, setiap lapisan menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#50% Serangan Sihir#C0x5B545B# kerosakan sebenar, berlangsung selama 2 pusingan), serta mengurangkan pertahanan fizikal dan sihir sasaran sebanyak 10%, berlangsung selama 1 pusingan.',
		describe = 'Throw the enemy unit into the air, dealing #C0x3D8A99#150% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B# + $( skillLevel *24)$ #C0x8A5C99#magic#C0x5B545B# damage, and applying a burn effect (burn effect can stack up to 5 layers, each layer deals #C0x3D8A99#50% Magic Attack#C0x5B545B# true damage, lasting 2 turns), while reducing the target\'s physical and magical defense by 10%, lasting 1 turn.',
