		skillName = 'Stab straight',
		describe_vn = 'Steelix chui xuống đất rồi bất ngờ trồi lên tấn công mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ địch, gây Sát Thương Vật Lý với #C0xE69900#150% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, có 100% xác suất thêm trạng thái [Sợ hãi] cho kẻ địch trong 2 lượt. (Sát thương giảm 10%, nếu tấn công anh hùng hệ cơ khí, sát thương giảm 30%).',
		describe_en = 'Steelix burrows underground and suddenly erupts to attack a single enemy target, dealing Physical Damage of #C0xE69900#150% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, with a 100% chance to inflict [Fear] status on the enemy for 2 turns. (Damage is reduced by 10%; if attacking a mechanical-type hero, damage is reduced by 30%).',
		describe_th = 'Steelix ขุดลงใต้ดินแล้วโผล่ขึ้นมาโจมตีเป้าหมายศัตรูทีละตัว สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#150% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# โดยมีโอกาส 100% ที่จะเพิ่มสถานะ [กลัว] ให้ศัตรูเป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (ความเสียหายลดลง 10% หากโจมตีฮีโร่ประเภทเครื่องจักร ความเสียหายลดลง 30%)',
		describe_in = 'Steelix merayap ke bawah tanah lalu tiba-tiba muncul untuk menyerang satu target musuh, memberikan Kerusakan Fisik sebesar #C0xE69900#150% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerusakan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, dengan peluang 100% untuk menimbulkan status [Takut] pada musuh selama 2 giliran. (Kerusakan berkurang 10%, jika menyerang pahlawan tipe mekanik, kerusakan berkurang 30%).',
		describe_ph = 'Si Steelix ay bumababa sa lupa at biglang sumulpot para atakihin ang isang target na kalaban, na nagdudulot ng Pisikal na Pinsala ng #C0xE69900#150% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#, may 100% pagkakataon na magdulot ng [Takot] na estado sa kalaban sa loob ng 2 turn. (Ang pinsala ay nababawasan ng 10%, kung umatake sa mekanikal na uri ng bayani, bumababa ang pinsala ng 30%).',
		describe_ma = 'Steelix menyusup ke bawah tanah kemudian tiba-tiba muncul menyerang sasaran musuh tunggal, memberikan Kerosakan Fizikal sebanyak #C0xE69900#150% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, dengan 100% peluang untuk memberikan status [Takut] kepada musuh selama 2 pusingan. (Kerosakan dikurangkan 10%, jika menyerang wira jenis mekanikal, kerosakan dikurangkan 30%).',
		describe = 'Steelix burrows underground and suddenly erupts to attack a single enemy target, dealing Physical Damage of #C0xE69900#150% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*36)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, with a 100% chance to inflict [Fear] status on the enemy for 2 turns. (Damage is reduced by 10%; if attacking a mechanical-type hero, damage is reduced by 30%).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Đại Thép Xà đào xuống mặt đất rồi bất ngờ trồi lên tấn công mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ thù, khiến nó [sợ hãi].',
