		skillName_ph = 'Dakilang Batong Kanyon',
		skillName_ma = 'Meriam Batu Hebat',
		skillName = 'Great Rock Cannon',
		describe_vn = 'Rhyperior bắn ra đạn đá tấn công mục tiêu hàng trước của kẻ địch, gây Sát Thương Vật Lý với #C0xE69900#245% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*42)$ #C0xF13B54# Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, gây thêm Sát Thương Vật Lý bằng 150% phòng thủ vật lý. Nếu phòng thủ vật lý lớn hơn mục tiêu, mỗi 1% vượt qua mục tiêu sẽ tăng 1% sát thương lần này, tối đa là 30%.',
		describe_en = 'Rhyperior fires a rock bullet to attack the front row enemy target, dealing Physical Damage of #C0xE69900#245% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*42)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, additionally causing Physical Damage equal to 150% of physical defense. If physical defense is higher than the target\'s, each 1% exceeding the target increases this damage by 1%, up to a maximum of 30%.',
		describe_th = 'Rhyperior ยิงกระสุนหินโจมตีเป้าหมายแถวหน้าของศัตรู สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#245% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*42)$ #C0xF13B54# ความเสียหายทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B# สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพเพิ่มเติมเท่ากับ 150% ของพลังป้องกันทางกายภาพ หากพลังป้องกันทางกายภาพสูงกว่าเป้าหมาย ทุกๆ 1% ที่เกินเป้าหมายจะเพิ่มความเสียหายครั้งนี้ขึ้น 1% สูงสุดไม่เกิน 30%',
		describe_in = 'Rhyperior menembakkan peluru batu untuk menyerang target barisan depan musuh, memberikan Serangan Fisik sebesar #C0xE69900#245% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*42)$ #C0xF13B54# Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#, serta memberikan Serangan Fisik tambahan sebesar 150% pertahanan fisik. Jika pertahanan fisik lebih tinggi dari target, setiap 1% keunggulan akan menambah 1% kerusakan kali ini, maksimal 30%.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Rhyperior ay nagpapaputok ng bato na bala upang atakihin ang target sa unahang hanay ng kalaban, nagdudulot ng Pisikal na Pinsala na #C0xE69900#245% Pisikal na Atake#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*42)$ #C0xF13B54# Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B#, nagdudulot ng karagdagang Pisikal na Pinsala na katumbas ng 150% ng pisikal na depensa. Kung ang pisikal na depensa ay mas mataas kaysa sa target, bawat 1% na lumalampas sa target ay magpapataas ng 1% sa pinsalang ito, hanggang sa pinakamataas na 30%.',
		describe_ma = 'Rhyperior menembak peluru batu untuk menyerang sasaran barisan hadapan musuh, menyebabkan Kerosakan Fizikal sebanyak #C0xE69900#245% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*42)$ #C0xF13B54# Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, serta menyebabkan Kerosakan Fizikal tambahan sebanyak 150% pertahanan fizikal. Jika pertahanan fizikal lebih tinggi daripada sasaran, setiap 1% melebihi sasaran akan menambah 1% kerosakan kali ini, maksimum 30%.',
		describe = 'Rhyperior fires a rock bullet to attack the front row enemy target, dealing Physical Damage of #C0xE69900#245% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*42)$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, additionally causing Physical Damage equal to 150% of physical defense. If physical defense is higher than the target\'s, each 1% exceeding the target increases this damage by 1%, up to a maximum of 30%.',
