		describe = 'Leap powerfully into the air, then use your fiery body to attack the enemy target, losing 10% of your current HP, dealing Physical Damage #C0xE69900#200% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$( skillLevel *24)$ with #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#.',
