		describe_vn = 'Song phủ chiến long nhảy toàn thân lên và tung ra một cú đánh mạnh mẽ kiểu chiến phủ vào mục tiêu đơn lẻ của kẻ địch, gây Sát Thương Vật Lý #C0xE69900#160% Công Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ với #C0xF13B54#Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B#, khóa mục tiêu (khóa: miễn là mục tiêu còn sống, sẽ buộc phải chọn mục tiêu này để tấn công, vẫn bị ảnh hưởng bởi khiêu khích), và tăng 20% xác suất truy kích trong lần tấn công tiếp theo.',
		describe_en = 'The Twin Mansion War Dragon leaps with its whole body and unleashes a powerful War Mansion strike on a single enemy target, dealing Physical Damage #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ with #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, locking the target (lock: as long as the target is alive, it must be chosen for attack, still affected by taunt), and increases the chance of follow-up attack by 20% on the next strike.',
		describe_th = 'ดราก้อนสองเรือนกระโดดขึ้นด้วยทั้งร่างและปล่อยการโจมตีแบบเรือนสงครามที่ทรงพลังไปยังเป้าหมายศัตรูเดี่ยว สร้างความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xE69900#160% พลังโจมตีทางกายภาพ#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ พร้อมความเสียหายทางกายภาพ #C0xF13B54# และล็อกเป้าหมาย (ล็อก: ตราบใดที่เป้าหมายยังมีชีวิตอยู่ จะต้องเลือกเป้าหมายนั้นในการโจมตี ยังคงได้รับผลของการยั่วยุ) และเพิ่มโอกาสในการโจมตีต่อเนื่องขึ้น 20% ในการโจมตีครั้งถัดไป',
		describe_in = 'Naga Perang Kembar melompat dengan seluruh tubuh dan melancarkan serangan War Mansion yang kuat ke target musuh tunggal, memberikan Damage Fisik #C0xE69900#160% Serangan Fisik#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ dengan #C0xF13B54#Damage Fisik#C0x5B545B#, mengunci target (kunci: selama target masih hidup, harus memilih target ini untuk menyerang, tetap dipengaruhi oleh tantangan), dan meningkatkan kemungkinan serangan lanjutan sebesar 20% pada serangan berikutnya.',
		describe_ph = 'Ang Twin Mansion War Dragon ay tumatalon ng buong katawan at nagpapalabas ng isang malakas na War Mansion strike sa isang solong target ng kalaban, nagdudulot ng Physical Damage #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ na may #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, nakakandado ng target (kandado: hangga\'t buhay pa ang target, kailangang piliin ang target na ito para atakihin, apektado pa rin ng taunt), at nagpapataas ng 20% na tsansa ng follow-up attack sa susunod na atake.',
		describe_ma = 'Naga Perang Warga Kembar melompat seluruh tubuh dan melancarkan serangan Warga Perang yang kuat ke sasaran musuh tunggal, menyebabkan Kerosakan Fizikal #C0xE69900#160% Serangan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ dengan #C0xF13B54#Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B#, mengunci sasaran (kunci: selama sasaran masih hidup, mesti dipilih untuk diserang, masih terpengaruh oleh provokasi), dan meningkatkan peluang serangan susulan sebanyak 20% pada serangan berikutnya.',
		describe = 'The Twin Mansion War Dragon leaps with its whole body and unleashes a powerful War Mansion strike on a single enemy target, dealing Physical Damage #C0xE69900#160% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B#+$(skillLevel*4*48)$ with #C0xF13B54#Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#, locking the target (lock: as long as the target is alive, it must be chosen for attack, still affected by taunt), and increases the chance of follow-up attack by 20% on the next strike.',
		simDesc_vn = 'Đôi Pháp Chiến Long nhảy lên toàn thân, phát ra một đòn tấn công mạnh mẽ kiểu rìu chiến vào một kẻ thù đơn lẻ.',
		simDesc_en = 'The Battle Dragon Gauntlets leap up the entire body, unleashing a powerful axe-style attack on a single enemy.',
