		describe_en = 'Greninja uses Water Clone, then leaps into the air and condenses shurikens to attack enemy targets, dealing #C0xE69900#470% Physical Attack#C0x5B545B# + $( skillLevel * 75 )$ #C0xF13B54# Physical Damage#C0x5B545B#. This attack increases critical hit rate by 30% and critical damage by 20%; at the same time, 50% of the damage dealt is converted into health recovery for itself.',
