		describe_en = 'Little Ding happily dances at the center of the stage, dealing #C0x3D8A99#130% Magic Power#C0x5B545B# + $(skillLevel*4*30)$ #C0xF13B54# Magic Damage #C0x5B545B# to all enemy targets, with a 40% chance to put 3 random enemy units to [sleep] for 1 turn.',
