		skillName_ma = 'Serangan Kilat',
		skillName = 'Nhất Tức Thiên Lý',
		describe_vn = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu xuất hiện như một tia chớp xé toạc màn đêm, tung một cú chém tốc độ cao xuyên thẳng qua mục tiêu, gây #C0x3D8A99#180% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B# và #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Sát Thương Sét tăng theo cấp kỹ năng. Nếu Zenitsu đang ở trạng thái <Ngủ Chiến Đấu>, kỹ năng này được cường hóa, gây thêm 60% sát thương lan lên các mục tiêu kẻ địch trong hàng ngang.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Tia Chớp Vô Ảnh: #L0# Khi gây chí mạng bằng Nhất Tức Thiên Lý, có 50% xác suất khiến mục tiêu bị <Tê Liệt> trong 2 lượt (không thể hành động) và giảm 15% Kháng Phép của mục tiêu trong lượt tiếp theo(tối đa 2 lần cộng dồn).',
		describe_en = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu appears like a lightning bolt tearing through the night, performing a high-speed slash straight through the target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# and #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage scaling with skill level. If Zenitsu is in <Combat Sleep> state, this skill is enhanced, dealing an additional 60% splash damage to enemy targets in the same row.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Invisible Lightning: #L0# When scoring a critical hit with One Instant Thunder, there is a 50% chance to inflict <Paralyze> on the target for 2 turns (cannot act) and reduce the target’s Magic Resistance by 15% in the next turn (stackable up to 2 times).',
		describe_th = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu ปรากฏตัวเหมือนฟ้าผ่าฉีกกลางคืน ฟันด้วยความเร็วสูงตรงผ่านเป้าหมาย สร้างความเสียหาย #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# และ #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage ตามระดับสกิล หาก Zenitsu อยู่ในสถานะ <Combat Sleep> ทักษะนี้จะถูกเสริมพลัง สร้างความเสียหายลุกลามเพิ่มอีก 60% ให้เป้าหมายศัตรูในแถวเดียวกัน \n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Invisible Lightning: #L0# เมื่อโจมตีวิกฤติด้วย One Instant Thunder มีโอกาส 50% ทำให้เป้าหมายติดสถานะ <Paralyze> เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (ไม่สามารถทำอะไรได้) และลด Magic Resistance ของเป้าหมาย 15% ในเทิร์นถัดไป (สะสมได้สูงสุด 2 ครั้ง)',
		describe_in = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu muncul seperti kilat yang membelah malam, melakukan serangan cepat lurus menembus target, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# dan #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage sesuai level skill. Jika Zenitsu berada dalam keadaan <Combat Sleep>, skill ini diperkuat, memberikan tambahan 60% damage area ke target musuh di barisan yang sama.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Invisible Lightning: #L0# Saat melakukan critical hit dengan One Instant Thunder, ada 50% kemungkinan membuat target <Paralyze> selama 2 giliran (tidak bisa bertindak) dan mengurangi Magic Resistance target sebesar 15% pada giliran berikutnya (maksimal stack 2 kali).',
		describe_ph = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu ay lumilitaw na parang kidlat na pumuputol sa gabi, nagsasagawa ng mabilis na hiwa diretso sa target, na nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# at #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage na tumataas sa level ng skill. Kung si Zenitsu ay nasa <Combat Sleep> state, ang skill ay pinapalakas, nagdudulot ng karagdagang 60% splash damage sa mga kaaway sa parehong row.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Invisible Lightning: #L0# Kapag nakapagtamo ng critical hit gamit ang One Instant Thunder, may 50% chance na ma-paralyze ang target sa loob ng 2 turn (hindi makakilos) at mababawasan ang Magic Resistance ng target ng 15% sa susunod na turn (puwedeng ma-stack hanggang 2 beses).',
		describe_ma = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu muncul seperti kilat yang membelah malam, melancarkan serangan pantas lurus menembusi sasaran, menyebabkan #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# dan #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage mengikut tahap skill. Jika Zenitsu berada dalam keadaan <Combat Sleep>, kemahiran ini diperkuat, memberikan 60% tambahan damage percikan ke musuh dalam barisan yang sama.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Invisible Lightning: #L0# Apabila menyerang secara critical menggunakan One Instant Thunder, terdapat 50% kemungkinan menyebabkan sasaran <Paralyze> selama 2 giliran (tidak dapat bertindak) dan mengurangkan Magic Resistance sasaran sebanyak 15% pada giliran berikutnya (boleh bertindih sehingga 2 kali).',
		describe = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu appears like a lightning bolt tearing through the night, performing a high-speed slash straight through the target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# and #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage scaling with skill level. If Zenitsu is in <Combat Sleep> state, this skill is enhanced, dealing an additional 60% splash damage to enemy targets in the same row.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Invisible Lightning: #L0# When scoring a critical hit with One Instant Thunder, there is a 50% chance to inflict <Paralyze> on the target for 2 turns (cannot act) and reduce the target’s Magic Resistance by 15% in the next turn (stackable up to 2 times).',
		simDesc_vn = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu xuất hiện như một tia chớp xé toạc màn đêm, tung một cú chém tốc độ cao xuyên thẳng qua mục tiêu, gây #C0x3D8A99#180% Sát Thương Vật Lý#C0x5B545B# và #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Sát Thương Sét tăng theo cấp kỹ năng. Nếu Zenitsu đang ở trạng thái <Ngủ Chiến Đấu>, kỹ năng này được cường hóa, gây thêm 60% sát thương lan lên các mục tiêu kẻ địch trong hàng ngang.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Tia Chớp Vô Ảnh: #L0# Khi gây chí mạng bằng Nhất Tức Thiên Lý, có 50% xác suất khiến mục tiêu bị <Tê Liệt> trong 2 lượt (không thể hành động) và giảm 15% Kháng Phép của mục tiêu trong lượt tiếp theo(tối đa 2 lần cộng dồn).',
		simDesc_en = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu appears like a lightning bolt tearing through the night, unleashing a high-speed slash that pierces the target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# and #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage scaling with skill level. If Zenitsu is in <Battle Sleep> state, this skill is enhanced, dealing an additional 60% splash damage to enemy targets in the same row.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Shadowless Thunderbolt: #L0# When landing a critical hit with First Form: Thunderclap and Flash, there is a 50% chance to inflict <Paralysis> on the target for 2 turns (unable to act) and reduce the target’s Magic Resistance by 15% on the next turn (stackable up to 2 times).',
		simDesc_th = 'อากัตสึมะ เซนิตสึปรากฏตัวดุจสายฟ้าที่ผ่าแหวกค่ำคืน ฟันด้วยความเร็วสูงทะลุผ่านเป้าหมาย สร้างความเสียหาย #C0x3D8A99#180% กายภาพ#C0x5B545B# และ #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# ความเสียหายสายฟ้าที่เพิ่มขึ้นตามเลเวลสกิล หากเซนิตสึอยู่ในสถานะ <การนอนต่อสู้> สกิลนี้จะถูกเสริมพลัง สร้างความเสียหายกระจายเพิ่มอีก 60% ให้กับศัตรูในแถวเดียวกัน\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# สายฟ้าไร้เงา: #L0# เมื่อโจมตีคริติคอลด้วยท่า "หนึ่งลมหายใจ ฟ้าผ่าและแล่น" มีโอกาส 50% ทำให้เป้าหมาย <อัมพาต> เป็นเวลา 2 เทิร์น (ไม่สามารถเคลื่อนไหวได้) และลดต้านทานเวทของเป้าหมาย 15% ในเทิร์นถัดไป (สะสมได้สูงสุด 2 ครั้ง)',
		simDesc_in = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu muncul bagaikan kilat yang membelah malam, melancarkan tebasan berkecepatan tinggi yang menembus target, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#180% Damage Fisik#C0x5B545B# dan #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Damage Petir yang meningkat sesuai level skill. Jika Zenitsu berada dalam status <Tidur Bertarung>, skill ini diperkuat, memberikan 60% damage tambahan yang menyebar ke musuh di baris yang sama.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Petir Tanpa Bayangan: #L0# Saat menghasilkan serangan kritikal dengan Serangan Pertama: Kilatan Petir, ada 50% peluang membuat target <Terlumpuh> selama 2 giliran (tidak dapat bergerak) dan mengurangi 15% Resistensi Sihir target pada giliran berikutnya (maksimal 2 tumpukan).',
		simDesc_ph = 'Si Agatsuma Zenitsu ay lumilitaw na parang kidlat na bumibiyak sa gabi, naglalabas ng isang high-speed slash na tumatagos sa target, nagdudulot ng #C0x3D8A99#180% Pisikal na Pinsala#C0x5B545B# at #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Kidlat na Pinsala na tumataas ayon sa antas ng kasanayan. Kung si Zenitsu ay nasa estado ng <Battle Sleep>, ang kasanayang ito ay pinalakas, nagdudulot ng karagdagang 60% splash damage sa lahat ng kalaban sa parehong hilera.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Kidlat na Walang Anino: #L0# Kapag nakapag-critical gamit ang First Form: Thunderclap and Flash, may 50% tsansa na gawing <Paralisado> ang target sa loob ng 2 turn (hindi makakakilos) at bawasan ang Magic Resistance ng target ng 15% sa susunod na turn (stackable hanggang 2 beses).',
		simDesc_ma = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu muncul bagaikan kilat yang membelah malam, melancarkan tebasan berkelajuan tinggi menembusi sasaran, memberikan #C0x3D8A99#180% Kerosakan Fizikal#C0x5B545B# dan #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Kerosakan Petir yang meningkat mengikut tahap kemahiran. Jika Zenitsu berada dalam status <Tidur Pertempuran>, kemahiran ini dipertingkatkan, memberikan 60% kerosakan tambahan yang merebak kepada musuh di barisan yang sama.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Halilintar Tanpa Bayang: #L0# Apabila berjaya melakukan serangan kritikal dengan Bentuk Pertama: Petir Sambar dan Kilat, terdapat 50% peluang untuk menyebabkan sasaran menjadi <Lumpuh> selama 2 pusingan (tidak boleh bertindak) serta mengurangkan 15% Rintangan Sihir sasaran pada giliran seterusnya (maksimum 2 lapisan).',
		simDesc = 'Agatsuma Zenitsu appears like a lightning bolt tearing through the night, unleashing a high-speed slash that pierces the target, dealing #C0x3D8A99#180% Physical Damage#C0x5B545B# and #C0xF13B54#+$(skillLevel*4*24)$#C0x5B545B# Lightning Damage scaling with skill level. If Zenitsu is in <Battle Sleep> state, this skill is enhanced, dealing an additional 60% splash damage to enemy targets in the same row.\n#F10#\n#F40##L10# Shadowless Thunderbolt: #L0# When landing a critical hit with First Form: Thunderclap and Flash, there is a 50% chance to inflict <Paralysis> on the target for 2 turns (unable to act) and reduce the target’s Magic Resistance by 15% on the next turn (stackable up to 2 times).',
		zawakeEffect = __data_t__zawakeEffect[8006001],
