		skillName = 'Sprout',
		describe_vn = 'Nhận sát thương sau khi bị tấn công và hồi phục #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# sinh lực pháp thuật;\nKết thúc lượt của bản thân, thêm [Hạt giống ký sinh] cho một anh hùng ngẫu nhiên của đội mình trong 3 lượt (Hạt giống ký sinh: hồi phục #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# sinh lực pháp thuật của Siêu Mewtwo mỗi lượt trước)',
		describe_en = 'Receive damage after being attacked and recover #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# magical life; \n At the end of your turn, add [Parasitic Seed] to a random hero on your team for 3 turns (Parasitic Seed: restores #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# magical life of Super Mewtwo at the start of each turn).',
		describe_th = 'รับความเสียหายหลังถูกโจมตีและฟื้นฟู #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# ชีวิตเวทมนตร์; \n สิ้นสุดเทิร์นของตัวเอง เพิ่ม [เมล็ดพืชปรสิต] ให้กับฮีโร่สุ่มหนึ่งตัวในทีมของคุณเป็นเวลา 3 เทิร์น (เมล็ดพืชปรสิต: ฟื้นฟู #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# ชีวิตเวทมนตร์ของซูเปอร์มิวทูในแต่ละเทิร์นก่อนเริ่ม).',
		describe_in = 'Menerima kerusakan setelah diserang dan pulih #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# kehidupan magis; \n Di akhir giliran sendiri, tambahkan [Benih Parasit] ke pahlawan acak di timmu selama 3 giliran (Benih Parasit: memulihkan #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# kehidupan magis Super Mewtwo di awal setiap giliran).',
		describe_ph = 'Tumanggap ng pinsala pagkatapos atakihin at magpagaling ng #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# buhay na mahiwaga; \n Sa pagtatapos ng iyong turn, magdagdag ng [Parasitic Seed] sa isang random na bayani ng iyong koponan sa loob ng 3 turn (Parasitic Seed: nagpapagaling ng #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# mahiwagang buhay ni Super Mewtwo sa simula ng bawat turn).',
		describe_ma = 'Menerima kerosakan selepas diserang dan pulih #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# nyawa magik; \n Pada penghujung giliran sendiri, tambah [Benih Perosak] kepada wira rawak dalam pasukan anda selama 3 giliran (Benih Perosak: memulihkan #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# nyawa magik Super Mewtwo pada permulaan setiap giliran).',
		describe = 'Receive damage after being attacked and recover #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# magical life; \n At the end of your turn, add [Parasitic Seed] to a random hero on your team for 3 turns (Parasitic Seed: restores #C0x5c9970#$(30+skillLevel*0.2-0.2)$%#C0x5B545B# magical life of Super Mewtwo at the start of each turn).',
