		describe_en = 'Attack with [Ice Trap] (Ice Trap: After the target acts, reduces the target\'s physical defense by #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# for 1 turn, and has a #C0x5c9970#$(20+skillLevel*0.1-0.1)$%#C0x5B545B# chance to [freeze] the target for 1 turn)',
